window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2001,"title":"Chapter 2001 - This clone of Senior White feels different","paragraphs":["Is Senior White’s clone finally here?","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword was the first to notice that Sage Monarch White, who was still handsome as always, was not wearing any shoes. It seemed that the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation was so intense that Sage Monarch White had lost even his shoes.","Senior White jumped off the flying sword and looked at the withered Song Shuhang. “You look horrible.”","Song Shuhang nodded weakly. His neck was stiff and brittle. If he nodded his head too vigorously, it might actually break.","Senior White put his hand on Song Shuhang’s body and then, similar to Sister White Dragon earlier, cast over ten magical techniques in quick succession. From healing techniques to cleansing techniques, as well as purification techniques, energy restoration techniques, and more.","After the set of magical techniques took effect, Song Shuhang’s head and wooden body returned to normal again.","This time, the wooden body not only grew green leaves, but even flower buds; his entire body exuded the breath of spring.","But after a few seconds, the flowers withered, the leaves dried up, and the wooden body became covered in cracks.","Senior White asked curiously, “You’re in quite the troublesome state. What’s going on?”","Song Shuhang opened his mouth, but his throat was so dry that he could not make a sound.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword replied in his stead, “He’s been fighting big shots nonstop.”","Senior White nodded understandingly. He then stretched out his hand and patted Song Shuhang before saying, “Take it easy in the future. While I was having fun transcending the tribulation, how many times did you fight a big shot? If you do it too often, it won’t be good for your health. ”","Song Shuhang’s eyes teared up. This clone of Senior White seemed the type that cared about others.","Sister White Dragon asked, “Does Fellow Daoist White have a way to help Song Shuhang?”","Senior White pinched his chin and thought.","At this time, Senior Turtle next to him said, “Actually, I have an idea to help Shuhang. We don’t have to look for a cure immediately as we can just deal with his dehydration first. We can take one step at a time and cure him slowly.”","“What are your thoughts on the matter, Fellow Daoist Turtle?” asked Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Senior Turtle smiled and said, “I was thinking of a moisturizing mask! Since his body is lacking water, we just need to keep him hydrated.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","At this moment, Senior Turtle looked exactly like a salesman.","“But it’s not just his face that’s dehydrated; his entire body is dehydrated,” said Sister White Dragon.","“Then put a moisturizing film over his whole body,” Senior Turtle said happily. “That way, his entire body would be moisturized, and his skin would become smooth and elastic.”","Song Shuhang could not help but imagine himself putting a moisturizing film over his entire body, giving a thumbs up, and saying, “Stay hydrated!”","Definitely not! I’d rather stay dry and withered like I am now!","“I like the idea.” Lady Onion nodded and praised Senior Turtle’s idea. She and Senior Turtle had entered a turtle-onion alliance. For this reason, she was usually on Senior Turtle’s side.","“Sounds like a good idea.” Pavilion Master Chu, who was far away in the living spring, joined the conversation.","She had been following the conversation the entire time.","Senior White said, “If you only want to keep him hydrated, I may have something that can come in handy. Shuhang, open a passage that leads outside your Inner World. I’m going to look for something in my treasure vault. However, I’m not sure if I’ll be able to find it.”","Song Shuhang opened a dedicated VIP passage for Senior White.","Then, Senior White began to rummage through his vast treasure vault.","After a few minutes.","“Oh, I found this thing,” said Senior White. He stretched out his hand, revealing several crimson fruits.","These fruits appeared to be very hot, as if there was a thousand-year-old flame sealed inside each of them.","Song Shuhang instinctively took a few steps back.","If he, who was already dehydrated, ate this thing, would he not be set on fire? directly Would there even be anything left of him but cinders?","Sixteen asked curiously, “Can this thing hydrate Song Shuhang?”","The fruits that Senior White had brought out were clearly a fire-type treasure. Could it be that Senior White wanted to fight poison with poison, so that Song Shuhang could turn negative into positive?","“These are millenium cherries,” Senior White explained. “When I was closed up and Shuhang and Doudou came to pick me up, I promised Doudou that I would give him some millenium cherries. I kept on forgetting to do so, but I can send him some right now.”","Senior White took out a disposable flying sword, loaded some millenium cherries onto it, then wrote a note saying “For Doudou” which he stuck onto the flying sword.","“Since I found some, I’ll send them to Doudou right away. I have a hunch that he’ll like these cherries quite a bit.” Senior White took out his phone and sent a message to Doudou. [Doudou, I’m sending you a flying sword package. You can pick up the package at Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain’s Sword Washing Station. Don’t forget about it.]","After he finished sending the message, Senior White used a sword art.","The disposable flying sword soared into the sky along with the package and flew toward the location of the Sword Washing Station at Venerable Yellow Mountain’s place.","After sending out the flying sword package, Senior White gave some millenium cherries to the other fellow daoists present and said, “The millenium cherries turned out to be quite tasty this time, and there were a lot of them as well.”","Just as he was about to give some to Song Shuhang, Senior White fell into thought and took back the millenium cherry. “Shuhang, you aren’t in the best state to have a millenium cherry at the moment.”","Song Shuhang’s eyes teared up again—this was the only bit of moisture he had left.","Senior White searched through his vast treasury again.","After going through it for some time, he suddenly took out a bunch of dragon scales that were burning with flames.","Senior White said, “Right, these are the fire dragon scales that I promised I would give to Fellow Daoist Phoenix Slayer.”","He sent out another disposable flying sword, this time loaded with the package of scales, along with a note saying “For Young Master Phoenix Slayer”.","Senior White pondered for a moment and then gave some fire dragon scales to Sixteen and Lady Onion as well.","“This thing is useless to me, and it just takes up space. I’ll just give them to you,” said Senior White before he looked at Song Shuhang again.","Song Shuhang looked at the fire dragon scales, unable to say a word.","“Shuhang, I’m afraid you can’t use this thing.” After saying that, Senior White stored the fire dragon scales away again.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky. He had kind of expected it.","Afterward...","Senior White sent out two more packages, one to True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon and another to Cave Lord Snow Wolf.","When he came out of seclusion this time, Cave Lord Snow Wolf helped him create various documents. Senior White had long since prepared a gift for him.","As for the package meant for True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon, it was actually for Yu Jiaojiao.","It was worth mentioning that all of the gifts that Senior White sent were of the fire attribute.","Cave Lord Snow Wolf specializes in ice-type techniques, so why did he need fire-type treasures?","After seeing Senior White send those four packages, Song Shuhang felt like he was missing out.","It was like a big brother giving candy and gifts to their younger siblings and everyone had a share except for the one little brother.","Song Shuhang said, “Senior White, this clone of yours feels a lot different from the previous ones.”","Although the previous clones all had different personalities, the current clone felt especially different.","“Oh? So you noticed?” Senior White nodded slightly and said, “Because this time, my upper body is my real upper body.”","Song Shuhang: Σ(っ°Д°;)っ"]},{"number":2002,"title":"Chapter 2002 - Perhaps they could rise from the","paragraphs":["What do you mean by saying that your upper body is your real upper body?","Only half of your main body came over? Are you saying that the other half is still fooling around in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm?","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “No wonder Fellow Daoist White isn’t wearing shoes this time.”","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, you’re focusing on the wrong point,” Song Shuhang said using group voice transmission. “If your upper body is your real upper body, then what’s your lower body?”","Senior White replied, “It’s a clone.”","Sixteen’s eyes widened.","So, the Senior White in front of us is a combination made up of half of his real body and half of his clone’s body?","“Shuhang had his head cut off, and that’s all he’s left now. Meanwhile, Fellow Daoist White has cut himself in half. Did you two agree to do this beforehand or something?” Sister White Dragon found herself between laughter and tears when she thought of the situation.","Song Shuhang: “...”","I didn’t voluntarily get my head cut off. I’m different from that big shot who was willing to cut off his little brother to paint himself gold!","Also, isn’t Senior White’s new clone too miserable? It was cut in half as soon as it appeared. That clone of Senior White that had facial paralysis really did him dirty.","Senior White replied, “It’s because I wanted to leave the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, but did not want to stop the experience halfway. As such, I used a body-separation magical treasure to cut myself and my clone in half. Then, I combined them before heading out.”","The magical treasure he used was the same magical treasure he used to cut off Song Shuhang’s arm back then.","Senior White had a great time playing in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm with Song Shuhang’s arm and came back with a lot of heavenly tribulation nuclear bombs.","Song Shuhang asked in confusion, “But isn’t that magical treasure very small? How did you fit an entire half of your body inside it?”","Back then, he had thought of becoming a “headless horseman,” but he found out that the box was too small to fit his head.","Speaking of which, his wish had come true in a different way.","He had now become a bodiless horseman, being someone with only a head and no body.","Senior White said, “I opened the box and brought it all the way to my waist before cutting myself in half.”","Everyone’s eyes fell on Sage White’s waist.","They had not noticed it before, but Sage White’s waist was really slender.","Song Shuhang said, “So, the upper body of your clone and the lower body of your real body are still transcending the tribulation in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm?”","“That’s right. I’ll just switch back when the clone is at its limit.” Senior White was chatting with everyone while searching through his huge treasure vault.","After a few breaths.","“I found it.” Senior White reached out and took out two beads.","“Are those eyeballs?” Song Shuhang asked subconsciously. Recently, whenever he saw small round beads, his immediate thought was that they were eyeballs.","Senior White replied, “No, these are jade beads that I refined when I practiced the ?Jade Bead Invocation?. Because I was fond of them, I kept them with me.”","“The ?Jade Bead Invocation?? From what I remember, it should be a water-type illusory magic technique,” said Senior Turtle. However, it did not remember needing jade beads to practice the ?Jade Bead Invocation?.","Although it was called ?Jade Bead Invocation?, it was only the name of the cultivation technique. When this water-based illusion was cast, the image of jade beads would appear. Afterward, the enemy would fall into an illusion that was extremely difficult to extricate themself from.","However, the beads were just illusory, not real.","Senior White replied, “Yes, it’s a water-type illusory technique. However, it does not suit me very well. Perhaps it’s because my main attribute is the earth attribute.”","“How do you use these two jade beads?” As soon as Song Shuhang took the beads, he could feel that they were moisturizing his body and head.","He felt as if he had just been blessed with rain after a long drought.","So refreshing~","Senior White replied, “Wear one on your body, and find a way to keep the other attached to your head.”","Song Shuhang said while pinching the jade beads, “It’s quite easy to wear it on my body. For that, I can just make a necklace and hang it on my neck. But how am I supposed to attach it to my head?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword saw an opportunity to rend his heart and said, “How about gouging out your right eye and replacing it with the jade bead?”","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, your suggestion is pretty good.” Song Shuhang laughed.","He used his psychic energy and transformed his hair into twenty little hands, which he then simultaneously placed on Scarlet Heaven Sword—?Saber-Nurturing Technique? × 20.","“Ahhhhh~” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword screamed and fell silent.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Finally, with the assistance of Sixteen and Senior Turtle, Song Shuhang successfully wore the two jade beads.","One was made into an earring, and he wore it on his left ear.","While the other was turned into a necklace.","With the two beads constantly moisturizing his body, Song Shuhang’s head and body did not wither. Other than the fact that new leaves would pop up from time to time on his body, there were no other major problems.","Shuhang moved his body around and said, “Let’s go, but before we leave, let’s say goodbye to Senior Eternal Fire.”","After leaving the scholarly faction, he would contact Fairy Blue Phoenix. Then, after getting ready, he would make a trip to the Beast Realm.","He wanted to create a new body for himself as soon as possible.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","An exit that led out of the Inner World opened.","It was already late at night outside, but the scholarly faction was brightly lit.","When Song Shuhang and the others stepped out of the Inner World, some disciples of the scholarly faction who happened to be patrolling saw them.","These scholarly faction disciples were dressed in linen clothes.","Their eyes lit up when they saw Song Shuhang.","“It’s Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!”","A few days ago, none of the scholarly faction disciples dared to look directly at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","But now, rumors that Song Shuhang was the Scholarly Sage’s reincarnation had spread throughout the scholarly faction. After all, most of the disciples had seen Profound Sage Tyrannical Song transform into the Sage and fight against a peerless big shot.","“Good evening, Senior Tyrannical Song.” The disciples took the initiative to greet him.","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “Good evening. Where is Senior Eternal Fire?”","One of the disciples said, “True Monarch Eternal Fire is in the world of the golden lotus. He told us to take you there immediately if we were to meet you.”","His companion then added, “Tonight, we’re having a funeral ceremony for the four bodies of the Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders we retrieved.”","The bodies of the Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders they exchanged for from the Heavenly Emperor were to be buried in the world of the golden lotus tonight.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, Sage Monarch White, and all other seniors, please follow us.” The three scholarly faction disciples led the way to the world of the golden lotus.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Inside the world of the golden lotus.","The funeral ceremony was already coming to an end.","The bodies of the four Tribulation Transcenders were placed in coffins and buried in the center of the world of the golden lotus.","When Song Shuhang was brought into the world of the golden lotus, he saw them lowering the coffins.","The scholarly faction did not cremate the bodies of the Tribulation Transcenders as they could not cremate them even if they wanted to.","The lids of the coffins were not sealed and were only closed shut.","Perhaps deep in their hearts, they hoped that the four Tribulation Transcenders could one day rise from the dead and leave their coffins."]},{"number":2003,"title":"Chapter 2003 - If you feel presumptuous, wave your hands 3","paragraphs":["After the bodies of the four Tribulation Transcenders were buried, True Monarch Eternal Fire and several other leaders of the scholarly faction approached Song Shuhang.","True Monarch Eternal Fire looked at Song Shuhang and asked worriedly, “Little fr... Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, what’s the matter with you?”","At this moment, there were branches and leaves growing on Song Shuhang’s body, as well as some flowers blooming occasionally.","When did little friend change his path to that of Western Druids?","“I’m fine. Lost my body, but my head is still fine. Don’t worry, though. Soon enough, I’ll create another body for myself, one that is even stronger than before.” Song Shuhang patted his chest and added, “Senior Eternal Fire, you can just call me the Bodiless Knight Tyrannical Song from now on.”","What the hell is a ‘bodiless knight’? ?True Monarch Eternal Fire nodded despite his confusion. Then, he looked at Senior White and said with a smile, “Long time no see, Fellow Daoist White. Hmm? You look quite strange today. Is this your real body?”","Although Senior White had always been different from others, he was especially strange today. However, Eternal Fire could not pinpoint what exactly was strange about him.","“You might be feeling that something is off because only my upper body is my real body,” Senior White said.","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “Senior White is now a Legless Knight.”","Just as he said that, his wooden body suddenly lost its footing. Song Shuhang fell to the ground face-first.","True Monarch Eternal Fire looked confused. He turned to look at Sixteen and asked, “Sixteen, are you okay?”","Sixteen said calmly, “Don’t worry, Senior Eternal Fire. There’s nothing wrong with me.”","Finally, someone normal. ?True Monarch Eternal Fire let out a breath of relief when he saw that Sixteen was perfectly normal.","Senior Turtle looked at True Monarch Eternal Fire’s face and quickly guessed his thoughts through his mannerism.","[You’re too naive, Little Fellow Daoist Eternal Fire!] Senior Turtle revealed a mysterious turtle smile.","While Sixteen might look like the most normal among the bunch, she was not normal, either. She was currently undertaking the special trial of the Spirit River Su Clan. Every once in a while, she would meet another Sixteen, and there would be a fierce battle between them.","One day, could the number of dead Sixteens inside the special space reach the number of Skylark’s body parts?","I wonder if those dead Sixteens can be transformed into clones of some sort.","If thousands of Sixteens were to come out at once, it would be very interesting.","I wonder what little friend Song Shuhang would do if that day were to come?","Senior Turtle said, “It’s something worth looking forward to.”","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia drilled out of Shuhang’s body and helped him up.","True Monarch Eternal Fire said earnestly, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, if you need the scholarly faction’s help, feel free to call us anytime.”","Song Shuhang smiled slightly. He looked at True Monarch Eternal Fire and said, “Senior Eternal Fire, is there a need for so much courtesy between us?”","As he spoke, a large flower bloomed behind him, making it seem as if he had applied a low-quality filter.","It was heart-breakingly beautiful.","True Monarch Eternal Fire wanted to laugh, but he felt that it would be rude of him. As such, he held back his laughter and tried to appear calm.","At this time, one of the leaders of the scholarly faction behind the True Monarch Eternal Fire thought for a moment and said to Song Shuhang, “Senior Tyrannical Song, I have a presumptuous request. I wonder if...”","Before he could finish, Fairy Creation, who was behind Song Shuhang, sang, “If you feel presumptuous~ Wave your hands~ Wave your hands~ Don’t talk~ Don’t talk~”","The scholarly faction leader was stunned, and he was left with his mouth agape.","“Fairy Creation, stop causing trouble.” Song Shuhang held down Fairy Creation’s head and returned her behind his back. “If you have a request,do tell. However, you can also see my current state. I might not be able to help you at the moment.”","“No, I was not going to ask Senior Tyrannical Song for help.” The leader of the scholarly faction gestured with his hand and said, “I just wanted to make a request regarding the Sage’s eye...”","“No~ No~” Fairy Creation hurriedly sang. She lay on Song Shuhang’s back, reached out to gouge his eye, and stored the Sage’s eye away.","She then leaped gracefully into Song Shuhang’s head, disappearing.","The virtuous lamia did not waste time and put back Song Shuhang’s right eye into its socket.","The two fairies cooperated tacitly, and the whole process was extremely smooth.","Song Shuhang did not know whether to laugh or cry.","Song Shuhang said, “Fairy, can you stop messing around? And aren’t you also from the scholarly faction?”","It seemed the scholarly faction wanted to take the Sage’s eye back. It was completely reasonable of them. After all, the Sage’s eye was way more important to the scholarly faction than the Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders. If he were in their shoes, no matter how much he would have to pay, he would be willing to do so if it meant getting the Sage’s eye back.","The scholarly faction leader hurried to say, “Fairy, Senior Tyrannical Song, you’ve misunderstood. I did not have any intention of asking for you to give us the Sage’s eye.”","If it were a month ago, there might still have been people in the scholarly faction who would have thought of spending a lot of money to try and get back the Sage’s eye from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","But now, it was different.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had saved the scholarly faction from certain death. The favor that they owed him was something that the scholarly faction could not even repay.","In addition, many of them believed that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of the Sage.","After all, there were many similarities between Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and the Sage.","For example, they were both very cool!","There was no need to describe how cool the Scholarly Sage was, and as for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, he was the only man who had managed to show his divinity thrice.","There was nobody who had done so in the past, and there would be no one who would do so in the future!","The scholarly faction leader said, “I was just wondering if it was possible to have the Sage’s eye look at the four Tribulation Transcenders one last time.”","Towards the end of the funeral, they noticed Profound Sage Tyrannical Song standing in the distance.","They had the thought that it would be nice to have the Sage’s eye look at the bodies of the Tribulation Transcenders one last time.","Song Shuhang paused slightly.","Then, he nodded.","He called out softly, “Fairy.”","However, Fairy Creation did not come out.","Song Shuhang said softly, “If you don’t want to come out,you can just give me the eye. You can stay inside and watch from there.”","After a few seconds, two of Fairy Creation’s fingers popped out from between Song Shuhang’s eyebrows.","Between her fingers was the Sage’s eye.","“Three-eye mode?” Lady Onion blinked.","Senior Turtle said, “It looks like the eye is sandwiched between two fingers and nailed between Song Shuhang’s eyebrows.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","The virtuous lamia attached herself to Song Shuhang’s back. Then, she stretched out her hands, took the Sage’s eye from Fairy Creation’s fingers, and held it up with both hands.","Song Shuhang walked forward until he came to the place where the bodies of the four Tribulation Transcenders were buried.","The virtuous lamia brought her hands forward.","The Sage’s eye looked at the burial place of the four Tribulation Transcenders."]},{"number":2004,"title":"Chapter 2004 - Have you ever felt your heart being twisted?","paragraphs":["Because of the serious atmosphere, Song Shuhang made sure to not let his thoughts go wild.","He was especially careful not to use the Expert’s Appraisal on the bodies of the Tribulation Transcenders; he was very serious in paying homage to the fallen Tribulation Transcenders.","Nevertheless, even if a tree did not want to move, the wind would still blow through and cause its branches to sway.","When he was paying homage, branches and flowers continued to emerge on Song Shuhang’s wooden body, swaying with the wind. No matter how serious the atmosphere was, its solemnity would be greatly diminished by the blooming flowers.","The fragrance of the flowers drifted through the world of the golden lotus, and their pollen seemed to have a hallucinogenic effect.","This hallucinogenic effect did not harm the human body and was very weak, so nobody really cared much.","However, as the fragrance of the flowers grew stronger and stronger, many of the disciples began having hallucinations.","The disciples saw righteous qi condense at the burial place of the Tribulation Transcenders.","Afterward, four men, which corresponded to the four Tribulation Transcenders, appeared","The four men held scriptures and zithers in their hands, practiced with their swords, or played the flute.","Together, they played music, recited poetry, danced, and discussed the way.","In addition, there were the phantoms of nine other figures with them.","“Is this an illusion?” True Monarch Eternal Fire rubbed his eyes.","He was infinitely close to the Venerable Realm, and he was even the administrator of the world of the golden lotus, yet he was not immune to this illusion.","If it’s an illusion, why does it feel so real?","Moreover, the contents of the discussion of the four Tribulation Transcenders seemed to be clear and sensible.","The eyes of the disciples were blurred. As they listened to the contents of the Tribulation Transcender’s discussion, there were many doubts in their hearts that were cleared. The parts of their cultivation techniques that they had difficulty comprehending were inexplicably cleared up, and they suddenly came to understand them.","All the disciples who participated in the funeral had entered a strange state. Their eyes were blurred, but their hearts were clear. Their brains were operating at high speeds, and their understanding of scholarly cultivation techniques, as well as their understanding of the human mind, rapidly improved.","This state lasted for about half an hour.","Suddenly, another gust of wind blew through the world of the golden lotus, and the pollen was blown away.","As the pollen dispersed, the images of the four scholarly men floating above the burial place also disappeared.","The virtuous lamia gently retracted the Sage’s eye, quietly returning to Song Shuhang’s body.","At the same time, Song Shuhang heard a soft whimpering sound coming from inside his body.","Is it Fairy Creation?","It was the same Fairy Creation who was usually very cheerful.","Her cries are filled with so much sorrow...","Song Shuhang looked at the burial place of the four Tribulation Transcenders, which had returned to its previous state.","Was that scene just now merely an illusion?","Or was it some message left by the Tribulation Transcenders’ bodies that had been activated and took form as a projection?","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The funeral concluded.","Those that were present burst into tears, and the entire area was filled with sorrow.","Lady Onion was affected as well, and she cried uncontrollably.","Song Shuhang was not quite used to this kind of scene, so he quietly exited the world of the golden lotus with Senior White, Sixteen, and Senior Turtle.","This sad atmosphere, for some reason, touched his heart.","At times, he felt as if he were really a member of the scholarly faction, and at the loss of an important senior, he’d feel as if his heart was being twisted.","This was despite something like this never happening to him. Everyone around him was still alive and well.","But this feeling came from the depths of his heart, and he could not keep it from rising up and showing through.","When Sixteen saw that he was in low spirits, she flew to his side and stroked his head gently.","Song Shuhang closed his eyes and enjoyed the feeling.","Song Shuhang said, “Senior White, Sixteen, Sister White Dragon.”","Senior White turned his head curiously. “Hmm?”","“When are we going to study the heavenly tribulation?” Song Shuhang said with determination. “Let’s research the heavenly tribulation thoroughly to make sure that all the seniors in the Nine Provinces Number One Group can transcend their tribulation safely.”","“Okay,” Senior White replied. “We should still have a lot of those nuclear bombs I collected in stock. Next time we have the chance, let’s find a place where we can detonate them and study them carefully. After exiting my seclusion this time, I found the heavenly tribulation to be a lot more interesting. At the very least, it doesn’t seem as old-fashioned and static as before.”","Sixteen also smiled and nodded.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The sky grew darker, and the night completely set in.","Song Shuhang, Sixteen, and Senior Turtle floated in the sky above the scholarly faction.","Song Shuhang said, “Let’s go.”","He did not feel like saying goodbye to Senior Eternal Fire at this time. With the sorrowful atmosphere in the scholarly faction, it was quite difficult to say goodbye.","He decided that he would just give Senior Eternal Fire a call later.","He planned to leave the scholarly faction quietly and find a place with a good signal. Then, he would contact Fairy Blue Phoenix, who was in the Beast Realm.","“Shuhang, you haven’t collected your payment from the scholarly faction yet.” Lady Onion wiped her tears and said. After all, it was something that affected her future salary.","Shuhang was a pauper with no money. As a part-time worker who worked for him, she naturally felt anxious.","At that time, if her boss did not have the money to pay her wages, could she sell some of the goods inside the Inner World to make up for her lost money?","“Next time.” Song Shuhang smiled warmly and said, “I have a close relationship with the scholarly faction, so we’ll have many chances to ask for the payment. Moreover, it isn’t a great time to ask for payment.”","Anyhow, after receiving spirit stones, he would immediately have to pay the repair costs to Senior Ruler of Shadows.","But if the spirit stones were not received... Then the scholarly faction would always owe him spirit stones. In other words, he would have a considerable sum of money in his account! Theoretically speaking, he would not be penniless!","Song Shuhang gestured with his hand dashingly, and a small fruit grew out from a flower on his wooden body, letting out a fragrant smell.","Senior White sniffed, then his eyes became as sharp as a leopard’s on a hunt as they landed on Song Shuhang’s body.","Song Shuhang subconsciously wanted to escape on his saber.","“Little friend Shuhang~ Little friend Shuhang~ Wait!” At this moment, True Monarch Eternal Fire’s voice sounded from afar.","Behind True Monarch Eternal Fire, there was a group of disciples who were carrying large boxes.","Each large box exuded the fragrance of spirit stones.","Despite being something common, they felt very special to Shuhang’s eyes.","True Monarch Eternal Fire had carefully prepared these gifts for Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang subconsciously wanted to run faster. Once the scholarly faction paid back the money, all the spirit stones in his account would be gone.","Still, it would be too unreasonable for him to run at this time.","Song Shuhang turned around and faced True Monarch Eternal Fire. “Senior Eternal Fire, there’s no need to hurry. I don’t lack...”","When he was halfway through his words, the rest got stuck in his throat.","He just could not bear to say the words “I don’t lack spirit stones,” even if only to show a front.","He simply did not have the confidence to do so.","True Monarch Eternal Fire said, “It’s nothing much. No need to be shy.”","He clapped his hands and sent the boxes of spirit stones to Song Shuhang.","At the same time, True Monarch Eternal Fire took out his phone and said to Song Shuhang, “There, Shuhang. Take those boxes, and I’ll also send you a file. The file is relatively large, it’s 2 GB. It contains the ?Saber Controlling Technique?. I know that it’s something you’re lacking.”","Song Shuhang had learned a saber flying technique and a long-distance saber attack from Sixteen, but he did not have a saber controlling technique.","True Monarch Eternal Fire had given it much thought while preparing these gifts."]},{"number":2005,"title":"Chapter 2005 - The bigger the heart, the bigger","paragraphs":["“2 GB? How come it’s that big?” Song Shuhang took out his phone and tapped on the receive button.","True Monarch Eternal Fire explained, “This is a Sixth Stage saber controlling technique, and it has a relatively large number of forms. In addition, in order to facilitate your practice of the technique, there are some notes of some seniors who practiced the technique that you can refer to. So it’s normal that its size is around 2 GB.”","It seemed that True Monarch Eternal Fire was quite the meticulous senior.","“It’s only 2 GB. It’s not that big,” Senior Turtle said cheerfully. “Some Eighth or Ninth Stage cultivation techniques have tables of contents that are as thick as several full dictionaries stacked on top of each other. You’ll need 2 GB just to contain the table of contents and notes on those techniques!”","Song Shuhang: “...”","If just the table of contents of a cultivation technique were to be 2 GB in size, how is it supposed to be practiced?","Won’t the one practicing it have a meltdown while trying to learn it?","He was definitely not suitable for practicing such a tedious cultivation technique!","While he was still in the middle of receiving the file, Song Shuhang took a look at the file name.","Saber Controlling Technique—Savage Saber?","Its name sounded quite cool.","Techniques to operate sabers and swords were usually divided into two types, one to manipulate the weapon while the other one to launch long-range attacks.","Song Shuhang had already mastered the ?Tyrannical Saber Flight?, ?Moonlight Saber Control?, and ?Blade Dragging Technique?.","Among them, the ?Moonlight Saber Control? was a saber technique developed by Su Clan’s Seven. When the saber light headed for an enemy, it would transform into moonlight. When the enemy noticed the moonlight, the flying saber would have already cut through their body.","The ?Moonlight Saber Control? was a basic technique for controlling the saber. On the other hand, this ?Savage Saber? was an advanced saber controlling technique.","Senior Eternal Fire explained, “The ?Savage Saber? was a part of the collection of the scholarly faction. It’s very, very old, and its origins can no longer be traced. However, it is undoubtedly a very powerful saber controlling technique.”","The ?Savage Saber? was divided into Savage Moon, Savage Blade, and Savage Man.","Before the saber was unleashed, it would be hidden inside the body. It was both deceptive and brutal, befitting a savage man. Also, Savage Moon matched Song Shuhang’s ?Moonlight Saber Control?.","It could be said that True Monarch Eternal Fire carefully selected the most suitable saber controlling technique for Song Shuhang from the scholarly faction’s collection.","True Monarch Eternal Fire continued, “Furthermore, this saber technique is a dual saber technique. I recall that little friend Shuhang has more than a single saber.”","Song Shuhang nodded. In his Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, there were the Tyrant Cuttlefish’s Twin Blades. In addition, Lady Onion had the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, which he could borrow and use at any time. Besides those, there was also his first treasured saber, Broken Tyrant, which has been tempered by tribulation lightning and was of decent quality. Lastly, there was his invisible saber insect.","“It was only after a lot of consideration that I decided to give you this set of saber techniques,” True Monarch Eternal Fire smiled and said. “While this saber technique is only capable of guiding you on how to control two sabers at the beginning, it can allow you to control many more when you practice it to a higher level. Eventually, with your ten fingers, you can control ten sabers. According to the notes of some seniors, this saber controlling technique is related to the number of a cultivator’s fingers. There was someone who practiced it who had twelve fingers and they could control twelve sabers at once. Each of their sabers could perform a specific form of the ?Savage Saber?; it was very impressive.”","Sixteen asked curiously, “Isn’t this a saber controlling technique? Why is it related to fingers?”","For most saber controlling techniques, one only needed to make a hand sign and they would be able to control the saber or sabers with their mind. It was quite odd for a saber controlling technique to be controlled through one’s fingers.","True Monarch Eternal Fire explained, “I’m not too sure about that. There should be some hidden conditions in the saber controlling technique.”","He was not a saber cultivator, so he did not understand the saber technique that well.","“If it has something to do with fingers...” Song Shuhang pondered for a while, and his hair curled up into twenty little hands, which then fluttered behind his head. “Then do the fingers of my hair-hands count as well?”","While he said that, his twenty hands made of hair flexibly waved their fingers around, making various complex gestures.","“I... don’t think so?” True Monarch Eternal Fire was not sure.","If these twenty little hands also counted for the number of fingers, then would Song Shuhang be able to control 110 sabers all by himself?","This was very different from formations like the ?Myriad Sword Art? and the ?Myriad Saber Art?. Each saber made use of an exquisite saber technique, and each saber was equivalent to a Sixth Stage cultivator attacking with their saber.","“Interesting,” Senior White, who had been staring at the fruit on Song Shuhang’s back, said all of a sudden. “Shuhang, let’s study the ?Savage Saber? in a bit. Try learning it as quickly as you can.”","“Eh? Is Fellow Daoist White interested in this technique?” True Monarch Eternal Fire pinched his chin and fell into thought.? If Fellow Daoist White is interested in this technique, then will Song Shuhang succeed?","At that time, will he really be able to control 110 sabers and use the ?Savage Saber? with each of them?","There would simply be no way for the enemy to survive.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The file transfer was going to take quite a while, so Song Shuhang put away his phone and cupped his fists at True Monarch Eternal Fire. “Alright, Senior Eternal Fire, see you next time.”","“Don’t be in a rush.” True Monarch Eternal Fire smiled and said, “In fact, I prepared another magical technique for you. I specially purchased it for you from Fellow Daoist Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue.”","“What technique?” Song Shuhang looked puzzled.","True Monarch Eternal Fire took out a USB flash drive and handed it to Song Shuhang, “It’s the ?Flame Substitution Technique?. Although it’s a Fifth Stage magical technique, it’s very useful. Little friend Shuhang, it should be something that you’d like.”","“It’s that technique!” Song Shuhang finally remembered which technique it was.","It was a life-saving technique used by that Red-Haired Spiritual Emperor who could use the ?Blade Dragging Technique?.","This substitution technique was very useful. If one used it well, they could save a lot of resurrection magical treasures!","At that time, in order to save his life, the Red-Haired Spiritual Emperor handed over both the ?Blade Dragging Technique? and the ?Flame Substitution Technique? to Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue.","“This magical technique is very suitable for little friend Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Thrice Reckless,” True Monarch Eternal Fire said. “Practice it well. It’s an auxiliary magical technique that can be used in many cases.”","Song Shuhang took the USB drive and said, “Thank you, Senior Eternal Fire.”","Senior Eternal Fire was very attentive.","He and Senior Yellow Mountain were very similar in some aspects.","Perhaps seniors who liked the “is very tired and wants to retire” title all had a mother-like heart.","True Monarch Eternal Fire said, “Little friend Shuhang, goodbye for now. When you have time in the future, you can come to the scholarly faction, and we’ll be sure to treat you well.”","Fortunately, Senior Eternal Fire did not have a face-reading technique.","“No problem!” Song Shuhang cupped his fists again.","Before he returned to the scholarly faction in the future, he would first make sure to get an insurance ticket from the Almighty Merchant.","Speaking of the Almighty Merchant, before leaving, he had given four insurance tickets to Sixteen.","However, he was more cautious this time, and he made it so that those insurance tickets could only be used by Sixteen."]},{"number":2006,"title":"Chapter 2006 - An embarrassment to little bugs","paragraphs":["The Almighty Merchant even thought of putting the words [Unusable by Tyrannical Song] on the insurance tickets.","However, he felt that it would be too obvious and deliberate if he were to do that, so he just made an agreement with Sixteen that only she was allowed to use the insurance tickets, which would allow him to avoid being exploited by Song Shuhang.","Sixteen had taken these four insurance tickets under Song Shuhang’s suggestion.","When Song Shuhang had given Sixteen this suggestion, he had not given it much thought as he only wanted Sixteen to have some insurance tickets of her own. That single insurance ticket she was going to receive had turned into four tickets, so Song Shuhang was naturally very happy.","Song Shuhang waved his hand and said, “Alright, we’ll be taking our leave then.”","The boxes of spirit stones were stored inside the Inner World, forming a beautiful scenery.","Every time he scanned the boxes of spirit stones with his divine sense, Song Shuhang felt joyous.","Senior White asked, “Where are we going?”","Song Shuhang replied, “Just outside the scholarly faction. I don’t want to be blocked by their defensive formation.”","?????","Song Shuhang used the ?Blade Dragging Technique? to quickly fly out of the scholarly faction’s area.","Senior White flew right beside him, while Senior Turtle shrunk to the size of a fist and lay on his back.","Sixteen was also sitting on Song Shuhang’s back, pruning the branches and buds for Song Shuhang with her treasured saber.","The effect of Senior White’s two jade beads was too powerful, and branches and flower buds kept on growing on Song Shuhang’s body. If they were not pruned, his entire body would quickly become shrouded in flowers and leaves, affecting his movements.","The pruned branches were all put into a cosmos bag by Sixteen. These branches could be handed over to Senior White and used as materials for his disposable flying swords. It was a good way to recycle the branches.","When Sixteen was pruning the branches, she said in reminder, “Shuhang, the fruits are ripe.”","Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at a couple of red fruits on his back with a stifled heart. However, the fruits looked quite delicious.","“Just cut them off.” He sighed and said.","“Pffft~” Senior Turtle could not help but laugh out loud.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Please use the word ‘pluck’.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","What kind of nonsense are you two thinking about?","Sixteen giggled and plucked all the strange fruits.","“Can I eat one of them?” Senior White’s eyes were focused on the fruits.","Song Shuhang asked, “How about I let someone else try it first?” His Inner World still had a couple of prisoners.","“Let me try one of them. Don’t waste them,” insisted Senior White. He then swiftly took one of the strange fruits from Sixteen’s hands, wiped it, and took a bite.","Song Shuhang did not know why, but his eyelids could not help but twitch when he saw Senior White eat the fruit.","Senior White commented, “It tastes pretty good. There aren’t any problems with the fruit, and it can be eaten directly. However, probably due to the short time it took to grow, the amount of spiritual energy inside is very small. If it were allowed to grow naturally, it would definitely grow into a precious spirit fruit.”","Sixteen gave the majority of the fruits to Senior White, and gave Senior Turtle and Lady Onion one fruit each. Then, she took a bite out of one of the fruits herself.","It did taste quite good, and it had Shuhang’s scent.","“Shuhang, do you want to have a try?” Sixteen grabbed one of the fruits and handed it to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang opened his mouth and bit down.","It tasted better than he thought it would.","Song Shuhang chewed on the fruit and said while flying, “I feel that I might really become an immortal chef in the future.”","“Apart from the Braised Heavenly Tribulation, what else can you cook?” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword took this opportunity to rend his heart.","Song Shuhang said triumphantly, “I still have the Lotus Blossoming Tongue, a living spring in my Inner World, strange fruits growing on my wooden body, and other dishes from the Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet. In the future, when my inner demon materializes, it would be equivalent to carrying ‘Inner Demon Sashimi Slices’ with me all the time. I would literally have a pantry with me all the time.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","Are you sure that you aren’t going to be an ingredient supplier instead?","?????","After flying away outside the scholarly faction and leaving the defensive formation, Song Shuhang and the others found a lake at random and landed.","Song Shuhang took out the metal disc Fairy Blue Phoenix had given him and poured spiritual energy into it to activate it.","Senior White, who held several fruits in his arms, squatted beside him, and asked, “Do you want to go to the Beast Realm?”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “There’s a way for me to create a new body on a holy mountain in the Beast Realm, and I am determined to do it!”","“Can I go with you?” asked Senior White. His interest was suddenly piqued when he heard the word “holy mountain”.","Song Shuhang replied, “There is only one slot, but maybe I can open my Inner World when I’m there. Hmm, I’ll ask Fairy Blue Phoenix if I can get more slots.”","After a short while, a light flashed on the metal disc as it had connected to a receiver.","Song Shuhang said, “Good evening.”","From the metal disc, a deep male voice echoed. “Who is this?”","Eh? It isn’t Fairy Blue Phoenix who answered the call.","Song Shuhang immediately changed his tone to a serious one and said, “I’m looking for Fairy Blue Phoenix. I need to talk to her.”","“You’re looking for Blue Phoenix?” After a moment of silence, the man on the other end said suddenly, “Listen here, no matter who you are, stop harassing Blue Phoenix! I don’t care how you got Blue Phoenix’s contact info, but you’d better erase it from your head this instant. Don’t even think about harassing her again. Otherwise, don’t blame me for crawling out of the metal disc and beating you up!”","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","Did I say something wrong?","How am I harassing Fairy Blue Phoenix?","The tone when I spoke just now was very serious!","Could the guy on the other end be sick in the head? Did he get jealous of me even though he doesn’t know who I am? Isn’t he afraid that the person who contacted Fairy Blue Phoenix is ??a big shot and that he might’ve offended them?","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword exclaimed happily, “Come on, come over and fight me!”","As an inner demon, it was its job to stir up trouble.","As it saw a perfect opportunity to incite trouble just now, it made its move.","Not wanting to be outdone, Senior Turtle replied loudly, “Come here if you’ve got the balls. You’ve got no balls if you don’t come over!”","“Okay, so do you really dare challenge me?! Let’s see who’s got the balls! However, tell me your name first! I won’t beat some nameless person.” The man could be heard gnashing his teeth on the other side.","Song Shuhang opened his mouth and was about to reply.","The virtuous lamia rushed out and said, “I am Tyrannical Song, 18 years old, please guide me.”","“If I have offended you~” Fairy Creation sang with a tear-jerking voice.","“You can come over and fight me!” The black-skinned Soft Feather appeared at just the right time and finished the line.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Boom~”","At this moment, a violent explosion sounded from the metal disc.","[Is that guy really going to crawl out of the metal disco to fight me?] Song Shuhang swiftly switched to battle mode and got his hair ready.","Fairy Blue Phoenix’s voice suddenly sounded from the metal disc, “Sorry, is it Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song on the other side? I just had to smack a bug over here.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Was the explosion just now from a bug getting smacked?","Did that little bug get obliterated instantly?","That guy has brought embarrassment to all little bugs!","How can you call yourself a little bug when you aren’t even difficult to pinch to death?","This guy should leave the little bug clan!","Fairy Blue Phoenix said, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I will make sure to punish him harshly this time and disqualify him from entering the Holy Mountain. I’ll just transfer his qualifications to someone else.”","“Transfer his qualifications to someone else, eh? How about you just give us his slot?” Senior White spat out the seed of the fruit and said. After all, he wanted to go and have some fun in the Beast Realm.","Fairy Blue Phoenix asked, “Who are you, Fellow Daoist?”","Song Shuhang introduced, “It’s Sage Monarch White.”","Fairy Blue Phoenix pondered and said, “If it’s Sage Monarch White, then sure. I can transfer the slot for the Holy Mountain to him.”","Senior White nodded in satisfaction."]},{"number":2007,"title":"Chapter 2007 - Good news!","paragraphs":["“I got a quota.” Senior White looked at Song Shuhang and Sixteen and made a peace sign with his fingers.","Sister White Dragon and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword were staring in shock the entire time, not knowing what words to use to express their feelings.","Sixteen smiled slightly.? As expected of Senior White’s real body, he’s really lucky.","However, Senior White’s luck was sometimes risky. Therefore, every time Senior White was especially lucky, people around him needed to pay attention to their safety.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin, thinking about whether to ask Fairy Blue Phoenix for another slot so that Sixteen could also have fun with them on Garre Holy Mountain.","“Anyway, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, were you looking for me?” Fairy Blue Phoenix asked.","Song Shuhang replied, “I just wanted to ask Fairy Blue Phoenix when Garre Holy Mountain will open.”","Fairy Blue Phoenix asked curiously, “Huh? Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, have you already mastered the other content of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique??”","“Yup, I’ve already mastered it. Something happened to my body, and I need the last chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? to restore my physical state.” Song Shuhang turned on the metal disc’s video function to project his appearance for Fairy Blue Phoenix to see.","During this latest trip to the scholarly faction, Song Shuhang was possessed by the Indestructible Lord’s obsession and then by the Scholarly Sage’s obsession. Also, he was in close contact with the bone of eternity.","During this time when the two big shots had made use of his body, Song Shuhang had gained the benefits of an enhanced CPU. All of his cultivation techniques, magical techniques, and saber techniques were dissected and re-analyzed.","Among them, he received the most benefits for the two top-tier body-tempering techniques, the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and the ?Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha?.","When the Scholarly Sage’s obsession attached itself to his body, the number of transparent Holy Apes behind Song Shuhang had even exceeded four digits.","As the power of the Sage’s obsession dissipated, these transparent Holy Apes gradually disappeared. However, the experience still left a solid foundation for Song Shuhang’s practice of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","When the video function was turned on, Song Shuhang also saw a projection of Fairy Blue Phoenix.","Fairy Blue Phoenix saw Song Shuhang’s projection and was slightly taken aback. “Tyrannical Song, did you grow taller?”","Judging from the projection, Song Shuhang’s height this time was close to two meters. It was just that the proportion between his head and his body was slightly off.","“No, it’s not that. My body met with an accident,” said Song Shuhang as he lifted his head off of his neck.","Between his neck and his body, there were strands of blood formed by the Sage’s blood that connected the two sides.","Fairy Blue Phoenix blushed and said, “I thought that there was something wrong with your practice of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? that caused your body to swell.”","She was not surprised about Song Shuhang’s head and body being able to separate from one another. After all, she was a veteran Profound Sage with a lot of experience.","“This body is not mine. My body was destroyed when I fought with a big shot,” said Song Shuhang as he put his head back on his neck. “This is why I wanted to ask about when Garre Holy Mountain will open. I need the final chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? to restore my body.”","“So that’s the case.” Fairy Blue Phoenix nodded. The General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? did indeed bestow the miraculous effect of self-healing and regrowth of severed limbs. As long as some powerful medicines and self-healing techniques were combined with it, it would not be difficult to grow an entire body back.","While they were talking, a flower bud grew on Song Shuhang’s back, and it kept growing until it reached the top of Song Shuhang’s head. When it peeked above his head, a flower bloomed, and it looked like a small flower had grown on the top of Song Shuhang’s head.","Fairy Blue Phoenix could not help but laugh and say, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s new body is very cute.”","“It seems I’ve made quite a joke of myself.” Song Shuhang sighed. A fruit ripened on his shoulder, and he grabbed it and bit it.","Fairy Blue Phoenix asked curiously, “You can eat them?”","Song Shuhang replied, “This wooden body itself is a spirit plant, so the fruit it bears can be regarded as a spirit fruit.”","“It looks delicious.” Fairy Blue Phoenix blushed slightly. “Anyway, I’ll go confirm when Garre Holy Mountain will open for you, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.”","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “I’ll trouble you then, Fairy Blue Phoenix.”","Fairy Blue Phoenix added, “Actually, we can only determine an approximate window for when the holy mountain might open. Therefore, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song can consider coming to the Beast Realm in advance and wait here.”","Song Shuhang turned to look at Senior White and Sixteen and asked them, “Senior White, Sixteen, what do you two think?”","Senior White thought for a moment and said, “I think it’s best to have an approximate date before heading there.”","“I’m fine with anything.” Sixteen’s gaze was directed at Song Shuhang’s waist.","There was a fruit that was different from the others there.","The other fruits ripened very quickly, but this one was only the size of a walnut even after a while, which made it different from the rest.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, please wait a moment. I’ll go confirm it for you,” said Fairy Blue Phoenix before she ended the call.","Song Shuhang put away the metal disc and said, “I guess we can only wait for Fairy Blue Phoenix’s news then.”","Senior White said suddenly, “Mm-hm, it would be nice if the holy mountain could open earlier.”","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “It’s fine, Senior White. You don’t have to worry about me. Although this wooden body has various minor problems, I can still endure it.”","Senior White looked puzzled.","He just thought that it would be boring if it would take a few months before the holy mountain opened, so he hoped that it would open sooner.","Little friend Shuhang’s imagination has become much stronger recently.","But if I were to tell him what I was really thinking, it would be awkward for the both of us.","As such, Senior White went with the flow and put on a gentle smile. “That’s good to hear.”","Senior White’s emotional transformation appeared very natural.","His gentle smile even had a calming effect on other people’s minds.","However, Senior Turtle and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword had already guessed the truth.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword got ready to perform its duties as an inner demon and poke at Song Shuhang’s fragile little heart so that it could allow him to realize the cruelty of reality.","However, when White revealed that warm smile, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword felt that its mind had been purified. It realized how mean it was being. In the end, it threw away the thought of hurting Song Shuhang’s fragile heart.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“Ring, ring, ring~”","On the metal disc, a call from Fairy Blue Phoenix came.","Song Shuhang answered the call.","“Good news, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” Fairy Blue Phoenix smiled and said. “I was informed that the holy mountain entered an active state today. It is very likely that it will open the day after tomorrow!”"]},{"number":2008,"title":"Chapter 2008 - I can cut my body for fun","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang looked at Senior White’s smiling face.","Senior White had the greatest face in the universe. It seemed that even Garre Holy Mountain in the Beast Realm had to give him face!","With Senior White’s real body—well, half of it—having come out of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, their luck value had skyrocketed.","Fairy Blue Phoenix said expectantly, “So, when is Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song coming to the Beast Realm? I can prepare a residence for you in advance.”","In her eyes, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song was a great force in the battle against the evil energy of the Netherworld.","Although the Beast Realm already had a formula that could treat the symptoms caused by the evil energy of the Netherworld, there were simply too many patients. Some of them were seriously ill, and it was difficult to eradicate the evil energy inside them with just the medicine.","Therefore, if Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song were to come to the Beast Realm in advance, it would be a blessing.","She could prepare a spacious residence for him so that patients could visit him and get treated. She also had to consider what gifts to give him. If gifts were prepared, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song would be a lot more willing to treat patients.","Song Shuhang said, “We’ll head over to the Beast Realm tomorrow.”","It was late already. Moreover, he had fought several big shots in the scholarly faction today. He was both physically and mentally exhausted and needed a good night’s rest.","“It’s settled then. I’ll go and prepare a place for you.” Fairy Blue Phoenix smiled with delight.","After the two parties finished deciding on the arrangements, Fairy Blue Phoenix happily hung up the call.","Song Shuhang put away the metal disc and said with a smile, “Senior White, Sixteen, we’re leaving tomorrow!”","With Senior White coming with them to Garre Holy Mountain, it was already guaranteed that he would be able to get the final chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?!","After getting the chapter, with his ?Cheng Lin Self-Healing Technique?, he would surely be able to create a new body.","Hehe! When I get my hands on that technique, I’ll no longer have to worry about my body being destroyed by big shots! It wouldn’t even be a problem if I wanted to cut my body for fun!","Limb regeneration was an indispensable ability for cultivators.","“Sure.” Sixteen nodded slightly.","Senior White said, “All right. Actually, I’m fine with it even if we were to head over there right now.”","Song Shuhang took his head off, swept away the leaves from his hair, put his head back on again, and replied, “Let’s just rest for tonight. My body really can’t handle any more stress for today. My mind, especially, needs a rest.”","“Alright, let’s rest then.” Senior White nodded and added, “Right, let me show you a new invention of mine.”","After saying that, Senior White took out a metal block.","Song Shuhang asked curiously, “What is it?”","“This is something I researched and created while I was bored according to the memory of my last clone. I haven’t thought up a name for it yet,” said Senior White. He then extended his hand and tossed the metal block.","The metal block changed rapidly like a Transformer.","In the blink of an eye, it had transformed into a steel villa.","“Besides transforming into a house, it can take on the form of an immortal boat, battle armor, and a spiritual energy cannon,” Senior White said. “Let’s rest inside it for tonight.”","Song Shuhang pinched his chin.? A battle armor, huh?","Could I use something like that? If I did not have this wooden body and only had my head, my head should be able to perfectly fit into the steel armor...","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The steel villa floated quietly on the lake.","Song Shuhang was mentally exhausted. He quickly found a room in the villa, fell on the bed, and shut his eyes.","Ah, wait, I forgot to ask Fairy Blue Phoenix for another slot for the holy mountain. ?Song Shuhang suddenly remembered before falling asleep.","He struggled to open his eyes, clicked on the notepad app on his phone, and entered a string of words: After waking up, ask Fairy Blue Phoenix for another slot for the holy mountain for Sixteen.","After finishing inputting that in the notepad, he set the phone aside and fell asleep without locking his screen.","Outside the steel villa.","Fairy Creation sat at the door of the villa in a daze, with her feet soaked in the water.","The virtuous lamia swiftly moved back and forth across the lake on the virtuous fat whale.","The black-skinned Soft Feather was holding a rope, whose other end was tied to the tail of the virtuous fat whale, and was surfing on the lake. As an inner demon, if she were to directly hold onto the whale’s tail, she would get harmed.","As she could not find a surfboard, they temporarily had Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword take on the role of a surfboard.","Senior Turtle floated on the surface of the lake, paddling from time to time.","Surprisingly, Lady Onion was sitting beside Senior White and asking him about cultivation.","It seemed that there was something that had stimulated Lady Onion to be diligent today.","Sixteen said, “Sister White Dragon, you should go play too.”","Sister White Dragon scratched her chin with her small claws, smiled slightly, and then rose into the air. She flew toward the virtuous lamia.","Sixteen stretched herself, then walked into the villa. She walked gently so as to avoid disturbing anyone.","She came to Song Shuhang’s room and gently pushed the door open.","Inside the room, Shuhang had already fallen asleep.","He had consumed too much of his energy today. He was so exhausted that he did not even notice Sixteen’s arrival.","Sixteen took out a blanket from her cosmos bag and covered Song Shuhang with it.","While covering Song Shuhuang with the blanket, she saw that his phone screen was unlocked. She reached out and took the phone, planning on turning off the screen.","When she went to turn off the phone, she saw the contents of Song Shuhang’s note.","Sixteen smiled sweetly and locked Song Shuhang’s phone before gently placing it beside him.","“Good night, Shuhang.” She whispered before leaving the room.","Her mood had suddenly changed for the better.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","After Sixteen left the room, an illusory figure emerged from Song Shuhang’s body.","It was his ghost spirit, who had a very low sense of presence.","After the small ghost spirit exited Shuhang’s body, both of her hands grabbed at the air as if it were grabbing something.","Then, this small spirit ghost started nibbling. She seemed to be enjoying whatever she was eating.","After the fat ball’s blood sacrifice formation was dealt with, it still left a curse on Song Shuhang’s body.","Now, this delicious curse was being held by the spirit ghost and nibbled bit by bit.","After eating the curse for a while, the ghost spirit let out a burp.","As the curse was a curse from the ruler of the Netherworld, even if it was merely a curse that came after the blood sacrifice formation, it carried immense energy. Because of that, the ghost spirit could not eat it all in one go. Even after eating it for a long time, she had only managed to nibble off a small portion of the curse.","For a ghost spirit, there was no happier matter than this.","After eating, the ghost spirit returned to Song Shuhang’s body to digest the portion of the curse that she had just eaten and turn it into her own power. During this process, some spiritual energy would also be fed back to the host, Song Shuhang.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","After Song Shuhang slept through half of the night, his mental state recovered significantly.","[Hm, why does it feel like there’s something I forgot to do?] In his sleep, Song Shuhang remembered that he seemed to have an important matter that he had yet to deal with.","He felt that there was something else he needed to do besides asking for a slot for Sixteen.","[Ah right, I wanted to go to the world of the black lotus and check on how Senior White Two is doing.] Song Shuhang suddenly remembered."]},{"number":2009,"title":"Chapter 2009 - Like riding a boat against the current","paragraphs":["Senior White Two had fallen victim to the schemes of the fat ball and had been sealed with a fake bone of eternity.","According to the fat ball, the seal would last for at least 5,000 years. That was why it had tried to pull Song Shuhang to its side.","“I wonder how Senior White Two is doing...” Song Shuhang’s consciousness entered the Inner World. Then, he stepped into the world of the black lotus through the passage that connected the two worlds.","When his consciousness entered the world of the black lotus, it was automatically given a soul-like body.","However, only his head was able to enter, so he looked like a severed head at the moment.","Song Shuhang twisted his neck and said, “Why is it only my head that got inside? Does this mean that my wooden body doesn’t have a head now? It probably looks like there was murder back in the room.”","A young man’s headless body was lying on the bed, but his head was nowhere to be found. There was no blood at the scene, no murder weapon. How did the young man’s head disappear? Who was the murderer who killed him? Find out in the next issue!","Song Shuhang cleared his throat and looked at the world of the black lotus.","As he looked around, he discovered that the world of the black lotus had changed greatly.","The wasteland from before was now filled with plants from the Netherworld.","However, it could be seen that when Senior White Two planted these plants, he did not put much thought into it. They weren’t arranged neatly.","In addition, every few steps that Song Shuhang’s consciousness took, he saw some precious-looking treasures lying around the world of the black lotus.","Unfortunately, he did not see any spirit stones.","Senior White Two needs a Black Lotus World Assistant to help him manage and organize the world of the black lotus! ?Song Shuhang thought to himself.","“Roar, which rascal dares to break into my master’s territory? Come over here and accept your fate!” At this moment, a tiger’s roar echoed in Song Shuhang’s ears.","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw an ugly tiger baring its teeth and claws in the distance.","“Yo, long time no see.” Song Shuhang waved at the ugly tiger.","“Damn... It’s Tyrannical Song.” After the ugly tiger saw that it was Song Shuhang, it waved with its paw. Then, its long body twisted into a U-like shape as it asked, “How come you have time to visit the world of the black lotus today? I thought that someone had finally dared to force their way into my master’s world, giving me the chance to show off my skills. I didn’t expect it to be you. You’re really ruining the fun for me.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Shuhang felt that unless people were impatient to die, they would not break into the personal world of Senior White, a ruler of the Netherworld.","“Where is Senior White now?” Song Shuhang asked. “I heard that he was tricked by the fat ball. Let me take a look at how he’s doing. I might be able to help him.”","Perhaps he could use the Pay-To-Win Strike to sacrifice the fat ball’s pseudo bone like he did last time and break the seal.","“My master is at the very center of the world of the black lotus. There is a very beautiful lair there, which is my master’s trophy. Now my lord lives there.” The ugly tiger licked its paws and pointed in the direction where the lair was.","“Thank you.” Song Shuhang waved back at the ugly tiger, and his consciousness flew toward the center of the world of the black lotus world.","As he got closer to the center, he caught sight of the fat ball’s old home.","It was the loot Senior White Two obtained after tricking the fat ball. Speaking of which, could Senior White getting tricked have something to do with this old lair of the fat ball?","Song Shuhang came to the entrance of the fat ball’s old lair.","He searched for a long time but could not find the doorbell.","So, he could only shout at the top of his lungs, “Senior White! I’m here! Can you open the door for me?”","He then shouted a few more times because he was worried that Senior White Two might not have heard him.","After a while, the entrance to the lair, which was a metal door, opened up.","“No—Tyrannical—Song!! There is a path to heaven, yet you don’t walk it; there’s no door to hell, yet you forced your way in! Take this attack!” The demonic hamster rushed out of the metal door.","It jumped, and the sword at its waist flew out of its own accord.","“Otherworldly—Flying—Demon!!”","A fight right as we meet?","Song Shuhang exclaimed, “Come at me!”","This was a scene that he had visualized in his mind many times.","[A night where a full moon hung in the sky while he was standing on the summit of the forbidden city...]","Anyway, No Hamster jumped up, its sword like a shooting star as it slashed at him with the Otherworldly Flying Demon Technique.","As for him, he just so happened to have a powerful move he wanted to test out.","Although it was not a night of a full moon nor were they at the top of the forbidden city, it did not affect Song Shuhang’s mood.","His long hair fluttered, and he instantly condensed twenty fists out of his hair.","Among them, six fists performed the ?Basic Buddhist Fist Technique?, each using one of the six different forms.","Two other fists performed the two forms of the ?Demon Subduing Buddhist Fist Technique?.","One fist performed the ?Buddha’s Giant Palm of Punishment?.","Two palms acted as sabers and performed the ?Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique? and... the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","As for the remaining nine fists, the index, middle, and ring fingers were all curled up with the thumbs, while the little fingers all stood straight to form the shape of the number “6”. Then, they all swayed vigorously.","[666, 666, 666!]","An excellent person did not need others to cheer for them, they could cheer for themselves.","Behind Song Shuhang, a total of 66 Holy Apes appeared.","The large Holy Ape at the lead looked at Song Shuhang’s nine cheering palms and fell into deep thought.","It seemed that the competition was becoming greater as time passed by. It was like riding a boat against the current; if they did not advance, they would be pushed back.","If they did not keep pace with the times, they would be abandoned.","As such, the big Holy Ape opened up its Scholarly Scripture with its left hand and began chanting in a deep voice. At the same time, its right hand made a “6” gesture and swayed vigorously.","The 65 smaller Holy Apes in the back quickly followed the lead of their boss.","In various languages, they began to sing the content of the scriptures.","The 66 Holy Apes raised 66 arms and chanted “666” with deep voices.","The ?Otherworldly Flying Demon Technique? VS Song Shuhang’s ?Basic Buddhist Fist Technique? + ?Demon Subduing Buddhist Fist Technique? + ?Buddha’s Giant Palm of Punishment? + ?Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique?.","Poor No Hamster was beaten dumb.","Its body hit the metal wall of the fat ball’s lair, then bounced back and landed in front of Song Shuhang again.","Song Shuhang’s last ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?, which had been gathering momentum for a long time, mercilessly slammed onto the demonic hamster’s body.","“Aahhh~” The demonic hamster let out a scream and did not move again.","Song Shuhang caught it with one hand. “Do you accept defeat?”","The 66 Holy Ape Projections, suspended in the air, formed a circle around the demonic hamster and stared at it intently.","The demonic hamster gritted its teeth and said, “When I ascend to the Sixth Stage... I will definitely beat you.”","“Sure. I’ll be cheering for you.” Song Shuhang smiled slightly, his hair fluttering wildly.","“Go in. My master is waiting for you.” The demonic hamster closed its eyes. When the 66 Holy Apes were staring at it from all directions, it felt great pressure.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Inside the lair.","Song Shuhang called out, “Senior White, I’ve come to visit.”","Senior White Two’s voice sounded, “Shuhang, you came just in time. Come here and gather your light of virtue and holy light. Help me suppress this Ancient Nether Will Fragment.”"]},{"number":2010,"title":"Chapter 2010 - Hahaha~ Ahhh!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang asked, “A fragment of the Netherworld’s Will? Is it a fragment of the fat ball?”","He had used the secret appraisal technique to identify those pseudo bones of eternity, so he knew that the fat ball had mixed part of its body in the bones.","It seemed that the fat ball had gone for wool but came home shorn.","Not only did it fail to seal Senior White Two, but the part of its body that was in the bone had been extracted and was now being suppressed by Senior White Two.","Song Shuhang felt energized when he heard that he was going to fight the fat ball. “I’m coming. How do I seal this piece of the fat ball?”","His entire being was filled with courage.","With Senior White Two right behind him as he fought the fat ball, he had nothing to fear!","Senior White Two said, “Who told you that it’s the fragment of a ruler of the Netherworld? In fact, it’s a fragment of the Ancient Nether’s Will.”","“A fragment of the Ancient Nether’s Will...” When Song Shuhang heard that it was not the fat ball, he lost his interest, and the energy that had just filled his body vanished.","Speaking of the Ancient Nether’s Will...","“Are you talking about Ming-Yin-Ka-Po?” Song Shuhang asked. He was referring to the materialized form of the will of the Ancient Nether World back in the Black Dragon World.","Song Shuhang had turned that fragment of Ming-Yin-Ka-Po’s karmic spear into a saber of karma. By relying on that, he then summoned Senior White, Senior White Two, Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon, the two Pavilion Master Chus and the mysterious figure behind them, the Scholarly Sage’s eye, the power of the Dragon Network’s Will, and launched an absolutely terrifying attack at Demon Emperor Hezhi.","“Wait, Senior White. Did you not fall for the fat ball’s trap and get sealed in the world of the black lotus?” Song Shuhang looked confused.","If he were sealed, how did he have the time to get the Ancient Nether Will Fragment and bring it to the world of the black lotus?","Was Senior White Two actually fine?","Senior White Two replied with a smile, “I did fall for the fat ball’s trap for the first time in a while. Not only my clone, but my main body can’t move either.”","He had been fighting the fat ball for years, so it was normal to win and lose.","It was not that they had never tricked each other before.","This was just the daily life of the two rulers of the Netherworld.","While speaking, Senior White Two’s true body appeared.","At this time, his real body was trapped inside a crystal pillar.","The crystal pillar was hollow, and Senior White Two’s body floated up and down inside it. This trap had been carefully set by the fat ball boss, and it was not easy to deal with.","The one responsible for suppressing the Ancient Nether Will Fragment was a clone of Senior White Two. It was the same clone who often wandered around the main world.","However, this clone also had half of its body suppressed under the crystal pillar, and only its upper body was able to move around.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin. He discovered that the Senior White of the main world and the Senior White of the Netherworld seemed to always be in sync.","The main world’s Senior White had cut himself in half, while the Netherworld’s Senior White Two had half of his clone sealed.","“Also, if you keep saying ‘White Rabbit’ in your head, I don’t mind turning you into a little bug, an actual bug,” Senior White Two added.","“No, Senior White, I’ve leveled up,” Song Shuhang said solemnly. “Previously, the fat ball did not call me a little bug. I’ve become a little rat now.”","Ever since Shuhang had lost his guts, his mouth had become more straightforward. His brain operated a lot faster now that he only had his head left.","The corner of Senior White Two’s mouth twitched.","Why are you so proud of being a little rat?","“And the next time I encounter the fat ball, I might evolve and become even harder to deal with. With your help, Senior White, it’ll be even harder to crush me.” Song Shuhang tried to flatter Senior White.","Although he was a lot more straightforward now, his brain was still present. He knew that after seeking death, he should try to make amends.","The corners of Senior White Two’s mouth twitched again. Truth be told, he did not know how he should evaluate the current Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang asked curiously, “Senior White, since both your main body and your clone are sealed, where did this Ancient Nether Will Fragment come from?”","Senior White Two said calmly, “It’s because I did quite a few things back in the Ancient Nether World.”","The Ancient Nether World was his new territory.","Although he did not have much time to manage the Ancient Nether World and may have to return it to the Ancient Nether Will in the future, he liked this new territory very much for now.","“Stop wasting time and help me. Envelop the Ancient Nether Will Fragment with your holy light. I’m still sealed by the fat ball and can’t use my energy.” Senior White Two’s clone lifted his hand slightly.","Song Shuhang took a few steps forward, his hair fluttering. He summoned the Defiant Whale Warrior’s Glove, and with his mind, he utilized the holy light energy of the big-eyed planet inside the glove to cover the Ancient Nether Will Fragment.","The pure-white holy light shone brightly, warming people’s hearts.","The demonic hamster shouted, “Squeak!”","Then, it rolled away. Its roll was a textbook roll, and after rolling for a while, it finally escaped from the range of the holy light.","Senior White Two’s main body said, “Bleugh~ The smell of holy light is disgusting.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior White Two continued, “Continue expanding the range of your holy light. It would be even better if you could release your power of virtue as well.”","Song Shuhang nodded and increased the output of his holy light.","As for his light of virtue, the virtuous lamia was still busy surfing...","Nonetheless, the cold holy light from the big-eyes planet exhibited amazing effects.","The originally restless Ancient Nether Will Fragment became calm and motionless.","Senior White Two took this opportunity to create ten seals, and together with the seal formation disc that he had already prepared, he sealed the Ancient Nether Will Fragment.","“It’s done. It seems that there really are times when holy light comes in handy,” Senior White Two said with satisfaction.","Song Shuhang looked at the Ancient Nether Will Fragment, which had been reduced to the size of a small bead, and asked, “Senior White, why go through all this trouble for this Ancient Nether Will Fragment?”","Senior White Two said solemnly, “I want to use it as a base to create an Ancient Nether Clone, which I would then use to play around in Ancient Nether World in the place of my real body... Ahem, I mean, to manage the Ancient Nether World in my place.”","His body continued to rise and fall inside the crystal pillar, but his posture had changed. Now, his head was below while his feet were above.","His long hair hung down toward the ground, revealing his slightly pointed ears. Senior White Two’s ears were a little more pointed than the main world’s Senior White.","When his hair was dancing around, Senior White Two looked extremely charming. But when it was Song Shuhang’s hair that was dancing around, it looked like nothing more than a mess. They really did have two completely different styles.","Song Shuhang asked curiously, “How are you going to create this clone?”","He had always been interested in this topic.","Senior White Two squeezed his chin and said, “Right now, I’m still considering which functions to give to this Ancient Nether Clone.”","Song Shuhang thought for a while and suggested, “Senior White, how about you try copying the program of the Inner World Assistant and use that for this Ancient Nether Clone?”","“Inner World Assistant?” Senior White Two looked at Song Shuhang in puzzlement.","Song Shuhang smiled slightly and said, “Hehe. Senior White, don’t you think that the world of the black lotus is a bit too messy? I honestly did not know that you were this sloppy. Hahaha~ Ahhh!”"]},{"number":2011,"title":"Chapter 2011 - Entering its good graces","paragraphs":["Huh? What happened?","Song Shuhang sat up in a daze. He stretched out his hand and scratched his head. Then, he discovered that he was in a strange state. His head was still normal, but his body had become translucent and soul-like.","“You’re awake, No Tyrannical Song.” A gentle voice came from nearby.","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw a beautiful face and a big colorful tree.","The beautiful face was growing on the big tree, and the branches around her were fanning gently.","“Oh, it’s you, Shushu,” Song Shuhang said. This beautiful colorful tree was Senior White Two’s Pet No. 4. She had been caught in the forbidden area of the Palace of Winter together with the ugly tiger, and her name was Shushu.","In some ways, the two Senior Whites really did seem to maintain a certain level of synchronization.","Senior White Two had this colorful and beautiful monster tree as a pet, while the main world’s Senior White had a monster willow.","If both Senior White’s pets were supposed to match one another’s, then what were the equivalent of Little Sun You’re Busy T233, the demonic hamster, and the Orangutan General?","“Right, I should be in Senior White Two’s world of the black lotus!” Song Shuhang realized.","He remembered that he had gone to see Senior White Two and had helped him suppress the Ancient Nether Will Fragment.","But why did he suddenly fall asleep?","Song Shuhang looked up and found that Senior White Two was still floating up and down inside his crystal pillar. His head was still pointing downward while his feet were pointing upward, and he was smiling at him.","“Oh right, Senior White,” Song Shuhang pointed at the crystal pillar and said, “would you like me to try to break the fat ball’s seal?”","Senior White Two turned his body over and asked, “And how do you plan to deal with this seal?”","Song Shuhang explained, “The last time I fought against the fat ball, it tried using a pseudo bone of eternity to seal me. However, I used the Pay-To-Win Strike to sacrifice the bone.”","Curiosity flashed in Senior White Two’s eyes. He said, “Okay, you can give it a try.”","Song Shuhang approached the crystal pillar. Then, he stretched out the hand of his soul-like body and placed it on the crystal pillar.","“Bzzz~”","An electric shock traveled through the palm of his hand. Song Shuhang felt the shock reach his brain, and he quickly let go.","“This crystal pillar is a seal devised by the fat ball,” Senior White Two said. “Since it’s a seal, if you touch it directly, you will definitely be subjected to the seal’s backlash.”","“Senior White, since you knew, you should have told me.” Song Shuhang did not know whether to laugh or cry.","Senior White Two sighed. “Isn’t this basic knowledge a cultivator should have? As the first Sage in a thousand years, even if you’re a fake, you should at least know the basics.”","“Actually, whenever I have time, I do use it to study,” said Song Shuhang.","It was just that he did not have much time...","Reading and studying were his hobbies. If he was given the time, he could sit and read books for days and nights without end. He found learning to be quite fun.","Song Shuhang stretched out his left hand again and placed it on the seal. This time, he was prepared.","The feeling of being electrocuted came again, but since Song Shuhang was prepared for it, he clenched his teeth and continued to keep his hand on the pillar.","Song Shuhang said softly, “Very good. Now that I’m in direct contact with it, it’s time to use the... Divine Strike!”","As his left hand was pressed against the crystal pillar, a dot of light condensed in his right hand.","[I want to sacrifice this crystal pillar, but Senior White Two, who is inside it, should not be sacrificed. Come on, Pay-To-Win Strike!]","“Buzz~”","In the next moment, the dot of light above Song Shuhang’s right fingertip shattered.","He had failed to cast the Pay-To-Win Strike.","The crystal pillar was not a treasure that could be sacrificed. It was no longer a pseudo bone of eternity but was rather a complete seal.","While the pseudo bones of eternity were treasures, the “seal” formed after they were used was no longer one.","Senior White Two asked, “Did it fail?”","Song Shuhang retracted his left hand and sighed. “It failed. It appears that I was too optimistic.”","Senior White Two said happily, “It’s alright. It’s good for people to be a little optimistic.”","Senior White Two was trapped in this crystal pillar, but he did not feel anxious in the slightest.","For him, this crystal pillar and the giant cocoon had about the same purpose. It was comfortable inside, so he’d have no trouble sleeping in them.","Speaking of sleep, Senior White Two suddenly felt sleepy, and his eyelids drooped down.","“Senior White, can’t you break the seal of the fat ball on your own?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yes, of course I can break this seal.” Senior White Two nodded and said, “In 5000 years at most, I’ll be out.”","For Senior White Two, 5000 years was the same as taking a short nap.","“Is it really going to take 5000 years?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","It looked like the fat ball was not bragging. The seal that it used this time could really seal Senior White Two for 5000 years.","Song Shuhang asked, “Do you have no way to come out earlier?”","“I can just sleep through it.” Senior White Two waved his hand. “Also, I got the Ancient Nether Will Fragment in here with me. It can be put to good use while I’m asleep.”","Song Shuhang said, “How about I try again?”","Shuhang used his hair as a hand and pressed it against the crystal pillar once more.","He then performed the secret appraisal technique, hoping to get some clues.","The secret appraisal technique was activated.","The price paid for the appraisal this time was very low. The only price that Song Shuhang had to pay was a small scratch on his face.","Afterward, the results of the appraisal appeared in his mind.","[A powerful seal with an effective duration of 6,666 years. Even if it’s affected by a powerful external force, it will still take thousands of years to break.]","There was no more information after that.","It truly was a troublesome seal.","Shuhang retracted his palm made of hair.","However, when he was taking back his hair, he suddenly had an idea., and he brushed his palm against the pillar, using the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","The ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? was like the almighty spiritual energy to Song Shuhang now.","When cultivators encountered something strange, they liked to use their spiritual energy to figure out what it was or what it could do. When Song Shuhang encounters something that he did not know how to deal with, he liked using the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","“Hum~”","The ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? fell on the crystal pillar.","However, there was no response.","The only change that Song Shuhang felt was that he had become slightly more bonded with this crystal pillar. At the very least, when his palm pressed against the crystal pillar, the electric shock had become much weaker.","It was as if his favorability had gone up by 1.","And so, Song Shuhang tried to brush the pillar with his hair a couple more times.","The light of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? shone again and again.","After a couple of minutes, when Song Shuhang’s hand pressed against the crystal pillar, he no longer felt an electric shock.","“What have you been doing to the fat ball’s seal?” asked Senior White Two.","Song Shuhang replied, “I’m trying to enter its good graces. I’m wondering if it will eventually give me face and open a back door for me when my favorability has gotten high enough.”","Senior White Two looked puzzled."]},{"number":2012,"title":"Chapter 2012 - Did the resurrection fail?","paragraphs":["“Is it working?” asked Senior White Two.","“When I touched the crystal pillar just now, I didn’t get electrocuted,” said Song Shuhang. He retracted his arm made of hair and pressed it against the pillar again to show Senior White Two the effects of his work.","In the next moment...","“Aahhh~” Song Shuhang screamed.","He was electrocuted once more and fell to the ground.","No Hamster, who was in the distance, said, “Looks like it didn’t work.”","Song Shuhang sat up from the ground, still trembling.","As expected of the seal of the fat ball, as soon as he retracted his arm, it stopped recognizing him.","Song Shuhang said solemnly, “From the looks of it, it seems that I can’t let go of the pillar while currying favor with it. Once I let go, the favorability level will return to the initial value. Separating from the pillar even for an instant will cause the value to reset.”","Senior White asked calmly, “Do you want to keep trying?”","Song Shuhang slowly recovered from the electric shock. He shook his head and said, “Maybe next time. I’ll wait until after I return to my original state.”","He was not afraid of the pain from the electric shock. However, if he wanted to max out the favorability value in one go, it was definitely not something he would be able to do in a short time. It might take a couple of days and nights, perhaps even longer.","As he was to head to the Beast Realm at dawn, it was better for him to wait until after he had his new body. At that time, his 20 hair-arms and his left and right hands could work together. Under the effects of the 22 instances of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? every second, the sealing crystal pillar would definitely be converted much faster.","Song Shuhang said, “I’ll try again after I come back from the Beast Realm.”","Senior White Two’s eyes, which had gradually closed from drowsiness, opened slowly when he heard the words “Beast Realm”. He asked, “Are you going to the Beast Realm?”","Song Shuhang replied, “Yeah. As soon as the sun rises, I’ll be heading to the Beast Realm. Garre Holy Mountain will be opening the day after tomorrow.”","Senior White Two nodded slightly and said, “It seems you’re quite lucky. The holy mountain is opening at such a good time for you.”","Song Shuhang smiled slightly and said, “It’s thanks to Senior White.”","Senior White Two said, “Stop flattering me. I did not help you in this matter.”","Song Shuhang kept smiling because he could not let Senior White Two read his inner thoughts through his face.","Damn, I seem to have accidentally called him White Two in my mind just now... White, White, White, White!","Senior White Two yawned and said, “Since you’re going to Garre Holy Mountain in the Beast Realm, it just so happens that there’s something I need your help with.”","Song Shuhang replied with a smile, “Senior White, please do tell.”","Senior White Two said, “A long, long time ago, a phoenix from the Beast Realm borrowed a stone tablet from me. Later, that stone tablet was left in Garre Holy Mountain. From how long it’s been since then, it should be about time for the stone table to be returned.”","“A phoenix from the Beast Realm went to the Netherworld Realm to borrow a stone tablet from you, Senior White?” Song Shuhang admired that phoenix. It had actually dared to go deep into the Netherworld Realm to borrow something from the ruler of the Netherworld!","“You’re overthinking it. It was from before I ascended,” Senior White Two said slowly. “Back then, I made a deal with that phoenix. She borrowed the stone tablet and I got to learn the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? in exchange.”","Senior White’s clone pointed with its hand, and a small ray of light shot between Song Shuhang’s eyebrows.","In the next moment, a chant for manipulating a magical treasure appeared in Song Shuhang’s mind.","It was the chant used to control the stone tablet.","“I see. When I enter Garre Holy Mountain, I’ll look for that stone tablet for Senior White and recover it,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Mm-hm.” As Senior White Two nodded, sleepiness surged up inside him, and his body began floating up and down inside the crystal pillar.","Song Shuhang seriously began questioning whether the sealing crystal pillar of the fat ball had functions such as causing the one inside it to fall asleep in comfort and let them have sweet dreams, similar to the giant cocoon. When Senior White Two had stayed inside the cocoon, he had slept very soundly, and he had been reluctant to come out.","The demonic hamster nearby placed its small paw under its chin and said, “No Tyrannical Song, have you found a spare body?”","No Tyrannical Song is going to explore Garre Holy Mountain in the Beast Realm, and it’s impossible that he’s going to do so with his head alone.","Song Shuhang replied, “Heh, I got a nice wooden body. I have no trouble moving around.”","No Hamster said disdainfully, “That’s a pity. I still wanted to see the scene of you flying to the Beast Realm with just your head.”","“Hehe, you’re destined to be disappointed.” Song Shuhang stood up and said to Senior White Two, “Senior White, I’ve been here for quite some time. I’ll be heading back.”","“Mm.” After Senior White Two responded, no other sound came from him.","Song Shuhang waved at the demonic hamster and the beautiful tree, then he got up and walked out of the steel lair.","After taking a few steps, he suddenly remembered something.","He turned his head back toward Senior White Two and shouted, “Senior White, your world of the black lotus is a little messy. Would you like to copy my Inner World Assistant and have the copy manage the world of the black lotus for you?”","In the crystal pillar, Senior White Two opened his eyes slightly. “How do I copy it?”","Song Shuhang replied, “We can make a copy of the assistant of the Dragon Network’s Will in the Black Dragon World. My Inner World Assistant is a clone of the Dragon Network Assistant.”","Senior White Two replied, “It’s too troublesome to make a trip to the Black Dragon World. Just ask your Inner World Assistant to come to the world of the black lotus. I’ll see if I can make an assistant similar to it.”","“Okay. After I return to the Inner World, I’ll have it come to the world of the black lotus.” Song Shuhang then added, “Senior White, please don’t tear it apart.”","“I’m not like your main world’s Senior White, and I don’t have the habit of tearing things apart.” Senior White Two yawned and said, “Also, everything I dismantle can be perfectly reassembled. I’ve never made a mistake in this regard.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","After Song Shuhang left, a projection of Little Sun T233 appeared beside the crystal pillar that Senior White Two was in.","Senior White Two asked aloud, “Did the resurrection fail?”","Little Sun T233 replied, “The resurrection was a success. I confirmed that the formation Master prepared has been activated. It is also confirmed that No Tyrannical Song has resurrected successfully.”","No Hamster said, “That is to say, when Tyrannical Song resurrected this time, his body did not make it and only his head was restored.”","Senior White Two said, “The Heavenly Punishment is no joke.”","His original plan was to revive Song Shuhang and restore his body, which had been annihilated during the Heavenly Punishment. Unexpectedly, while Song Shuhang did manage to resurrect, only his head remained.","While they were talking, outside the door of the steel lair, there was a new guest.","It was the Inner World Assistant. It had come to meet Senior White Two as per Song Shuhang’s order."]},{"number":2013,"title":"Chapter 2013 - Don’t praise Shuhang or his ego will skyrocket","paragraphs":["When Song Shuhang’s consciousness left the Inner World, it was already the beginning of a new day.","The sunlight entered the room through a window and fell on the bed.","The tender shoots of the wooden body stretched out and faced the sun.","“It’s dawn.” Song Shuhang reached out to grab his phone and unlocked it.","November 22nd, 7:33 a.m.","Song Shuhang said, “I didn’t think it was already this late. I need to get up.”","His wooden body climbed out of bed. He then grabbed his head and went to the washroom.","Senior White’s steel villa was basically the same as a modern villa.","After carefully washing his head, he put it back on the wooden body’s neck.","Song Shuhang then followed Senior White’s and Sixteen’s auras and went downstairs.","When he arrived in the living room on the first floor, he saw that Senior White was writing and drawing on a small blackboard, talking about some of his knowledge on cultivation.","In front of him, Lady Onion, Sixteen, and the black-skinned Soft Feather were sitting upright and following the lesson with great attention.","Song Shuhang rubbed his eyes in disbelief.","He opened his eyes... And Lady Onion was still there!","Moreover, she was seriously taking notes!","Song Shuhang quickly looked up at the sun in the sky.","Did the sun rise from the west today?","Or did Lady Onion get possessed by someone?","At this moment, Senior White finished his lecture.","Sixteen turned her head and smiled, “Shuhang, you’re awake. Did you sleep well?”","Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “I did have a great sleep, and I’m full of energy. I feel as if I’ve been reborn. Also, I feel that the aftereffects of the blood sacrifice have disappeared completely.”","Shuhang noticed that his head was no longer exhibiting any signs of “drought,” and he felt that he was in excellent condition. Perhaps tomorrow or the day after tomorrow, even without Senior White’s jade bead, his head would be able to remain perfectly healthy.","Senior White asked, “Are we leaving yet?”","Song Shuhang replied, “Mm-hm, we can go now.”","When he said that, he thought of another problem.","How are we supposed to go to the Beast Realm?","Is there a guide to go there?","“Senior White, do you know how to get to the Beast Realm?” Song Shuhang asked. If they really had no way to get there, Fairy Blue Phoenix could probably pick them up through a teleportation formation.","Senior White nodded and said, “I roughly do.”","Lady Onion put away her notebook and said, “Are we directly heading there with Senior White’s spatial abilities?”","“No, let’s head there with a vehicle,” Senior White smiled and said. “I have the urge to drive today rather than use spatial abilities.”","As he spoke, the entire steel villa began to transform. In the blink of an eye, the villa had turned into a giant flying sword.","On both sides of the giant flying sword were doors and windows.","When the transformation was complete, the virtuous lamia, the black-skinned Soft Feather, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, and Fairy Creation swooped in through the windows.","Immediately afterward, the doors and windows of the giant flying sword closed themselves shut.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword reminded, “Lock the doors so that nobody gets thrown out.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","For some reason, he felt a little nervous now.","At this time, a strand of Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stretched out from the top of Shuhang’s head and asked Senior White, “Fellow Daoist White, which way are you going?”","Senior White thought for a while and said, “I don’t think it really matters. I remember that regardless of which direction we go, there should be a spatial passage that leads to the Beast Realm.”","“If that’s the case, then let’s head to the Jiangnan area first,” Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","Song Shuhang asked, “Senior Chu, do you have something to do in the Jiangnan area?”","“There is a little fellow daoist who is about to transcend his tribulation there. Have you forgotten about it already?” Pavilion Master Chu replied. “Before heading to prepare for his tribulation, he even came to pay his respects to you.”","Song Shuhang patted his forehead lightly. “Oh, right. I remember now. It’s that little fellow daoist named Ding Gan. I remember that there was an inner demon lurking inside him.”","The virtuous lamia smiled and said, “How impolite.”","Fairy Creation added, “Not little fellow daoist, but big brother.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather opened her mouth, but she did not know what to say as there were no lines left to say.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior White said, “Okay, then we’ll head to the Jiangnan area first.”","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","In the Jiangnan area, a young cultivator was carefully examining his tribulation-transcending formation.","He was a disciple of the Drifting Starlight Sect, and his daoist name was Ding Gan. He was getting ready to transcend his heavenly tribulation of the Third Stage.","“Senior Sisters, Master, there doesn’t seem to be any problems with the tribulation-transcending formation,” Ding Gan said.","One of Ding Gan’s two senior sisters replied, “Great. We’ll be watching over you from out here while you transcend your formation.”","“Check the illusory formation outside again. It’s best to always be sure.” A calm voice sounded in Ding Gan’s ear. It was his master, Ding Qingyun.","The illusory formation was a barrier to shroud the tribulation when cultivators were transcending their tribulation. It was also their last resort.","Ding Gan replied, “Yes, Master.”","He reached out and lightly grabbed a pouch from his pocket.","In this pouch, there was a strand of long hair that came from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. This strand of hair could help him through the inner demon tribulation that might come his way. It was his harvest from visiting and paying his respects to Senior Tyrannical Song the last time.","To his surprise, Senior Tyrannical Song was a lot more approachable than he thought. In addition, he was not as frightening as when he was delivering a lecture to all the beings of the universe.","“I will definitely succeed.” Ding Gan lightly patted the pouch, full of confidence.","With Senior Tyrannical Song’s protection, I will definitely be able to transcend this tribulation!","After checking the formations, magical treasures, spirit stones, and medicinal herbs one last time, Ding Gan began to draw the Third Stage heavenly tribulation over.","In the sky of the Jiangnan area, tribulation clouds condensed, and loud claps of thunder boomed.","“It’s thundering again!” The people in the Jiangnan area raised their heads to look at the sky.","Recently, the weather in the Jiangnan area had been rather abnormal.","One second, the sky was as clear as it could be, yet in the next second, it suddenly became covered with dark clouds.","The staff of the Meteorological Station in the Jiangnan area really wanted to cry.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Meanwhile, in a private room of a restaurant in the Jiangnan area.","Song Shuhang’s parents were having a meal with some of their friends.","The couple had been going around having fun in the Jiangnan area lately. Today, they had a get-together with a couple of friends and planned to give Shuhang a surprise visit afterward. After visiting Song Shuhang, they would then leave the city.","In Papa Song’s and Mama Song’s age group, besides chatting about stocks, hobbies, beauty, and health care, their chats tended to revolve around their children.","While they were chatting, the topic of conversation became “Song Shuhang” at some point.","“Old Song, that son of yours seems to be doing really well lately,” an old friend of Papa Song said with a smile. “Not long ago, that kid of yours participated in a very popular movie. I watched that movie several times.”","“Right! He played Senior Brother Gao Sheng in ?Apocalypse War?. He really managed to make that character come to life.”","Senior Brother Gao Sheng had to die!","“Oh, him! I also remember that kid from Old Song’s family. His grades were very good, right? I seem to recall that he was even admitted to Jiangnan University.”","Papa Song said modestly, “Shuhang, that kid is very competitive. However, he can’t stand being praised. If he’s praised too much, his ego might just skyrocket. Hahaha...”","“Boom~”","A muffled thunder interrupted Papa Song’s modest display."]},{"number":2014,"title":"Chapter 2014 - Does your Shuhang have a girlfriend yet?","paragraphs":["Papa Song was taken aback by the thunder.","He could sense that it was different from the usual thunder. However, he could not pinpoint what the difference was.","Regardless, this thunder was very strange!","It was not only him, as Mama Song felt the same way.","The couple looked at each other, and they both noticed the surprise in the other’s eyes. Then, they both smiled, quietly moving their gazes away from each other.","“Recently, it has always been like this in the Jiangnan area; inexplicable claps of thunder just come by every now and then. However, there’s no need to worry. It should be over soon,” Papa Song’s friend explained. In recent months, sudden thunderstorms like this had been appearing quite frequently. Everyone who was from the area had already gotten used to it.","Sure enough, just like Papa Song’s friend said, the thunder stopped after a few seconds.","The several friends who had not been together for a long time resumed their chatting.","As they talked and talked, the topic went back to their children.","This was the price of age. After reaching a certain age, children often became an important part of one’s life. So when they chatted, they would often come back to this topic.","A few of Papa Song and Mama Song’s good friends had children who were a few years older than Song Shuhang, so they had already reached the stage of discussing marriage.","As such, the topic went to that of their children’s marriages.","“Old Song, does your Shuhang have a girlfriend yet?” at the table, someone asked all of a sudden. “You were quite wild and got married when you were still in college. Your son shouldn’t be much different than you in this regard, right?”","“Hahaha... Probably?” Papa Song himself was not sure.","Song Shuhang had brought several girls to their home as guests, but neither he nor Mama Song knew which one of them was Shuhang’s girlfriend or if any of them was actually his girlfriend.","“What do you mean by ‘probably’? Does he not have a girlfriend yet?” Someone laughed and said, “If he doesn’t, then why don’t we become in-laws?”","“Didn’t your eldest daughter get married long ago? And your youngest is still in middle school.” Papa Song laughed as he added, “Wouldn’t that be a crime?”","The group of friends kept chatting, and they changed topics every now and then.","During this time, someone had come by the window of their room and opened it to vent the air.","“Huh?” When the window was opened, this friend of Papa Song curiously looked at the sky in the distance.","In the sky, there was a dense group of dark clouds, and it looked like a thunderstorm was coming. There was lightning flashing amidst the dark clouds... but strangely, there was not a single clap of thunder.","Then, in the blink of an eye, the dark clouds in the sky disappeared. The sky outside was bright and clear again.","“What’s going on? I didn’t drink that much...” The man rubbed his eyes and looked out the window again.","Suddenly, the sky was filled with dark clouds again, and there were bright flashes of lightning.","In the next moment, the sky was bright and the sun was shining down on the earth again.","The two contrasting scenes seemed to be repeatedly switching with one another.","He quickly took out his phone and began taking a video of the sky.","However, what appeared in the phone’s video recording was just an ordinary scene of a blue sky and white clouds.","“How much did I drink?” Papa Song’s friend turned his head and asked.","“About three glasses,” Papa Song replied.","The friend said, “That’s strange. That means I shouldn’t be drunk. All of you, come here and have a look.”","“What’s there to see?” The people in the room got up one by one and crowded the small window.","“I don’t see anything special. Isn’t it just an ordinary blue sky and white clouds?”","“Blue sky and white clouds? Wait a minute, what I see from here are dark thunderclouds...”","“I also see a blue sky and white clouds. There doesn’t seem to be anything unusual.”","“Wait, I blinked and the view changed!”","Papa Song and Mama Song also leaned over and looked up at the sky.","After trying several angles, Mama Song said, “It seems to be an angle issue. When viewed from certain angles, it will look like there are dense thunderclouds in the sky; from some other angles, it looks like the sky is blue and littered with white clouds; while from some other angles, it looks like the view outside is switching between two scenes.”","“Is it a mirage?”","“Could it be a large projection?”","No matter how one looked at it, this was not normal.","Papa Song also took out his camera and pointed it at the sky to record a video. However, the only thing that appeared on the phone’s screen was a blue sky with white clouds.","Papa Song frowned slightly.","“They’re getting closer. Those dark clouds are getting closer to us!”","“Should we try to avoid it? It feels like something bad will happen if it reaches us.”","“Wait, is there someone underneath the dark clouds? Am I seeing things?”","Papa Song put down the phone and looked at the sky directly.","Sure enough, under the strange dark clouds, there was a figure running wildly in the air. The figure was wearing a strange pair of shoes that appeared to be constantly spewing air.","It looked like it was those shoes that allowed the figure to fly in the air.","The dark clouds locked onto the figure wearing the strange shoes, following him like a shadow.","“Is it some new technology?”","“Are those jet shoes?”","“The dark clouds are getting closer... Oh, that guy is quite cool.”","Lightning kept on flashing in the dark clouds, but there was no thunder. It was completely silent for them. It was as if the lightning had turned on silent mode.","The young man moved in the air deftly, allowing the lightning to speed past him. After dodging one bolt of lightning, he would continue running wildly in the sky.","This scene looked like something straight out of a sci-fi movie.","The strange thing was that no matter whether it was a mobile phone, a video camera, or some other kind of video recording equipment, none of them could capture the figure in the sky. The only thing their equipment captured was a blue sky.","The guy avoided eight lightning strikes in a row but was struck by the ninth.","The ninth lightning strike hit his body directly.","After getting struck by the lightning, the young man fell from the sky.","At this moment, another figure rose up into the sky. He stretched out his hand toward the air and took the man who had been struck by the lightning away from the downtown area.","Papa Song and Mama Song’s eyes widened.","“Old Song, was that your son in the sky?”","“Ah... Yeah, it looked like him.” Papa Song was confused.","The figure that had risen into the sky was indeed Song Shuhang.","He was obviously very far away, and none of them could see his face clearly. However, when they watched him rise into the sky, everyone in the room, for some reason, was certain that this figure was Song Shuhang.","None of them had praised Shuhang that much, so why did he literally skyrocket?","?????","In the sky, Song Shuhang jumped up and said, “Senior Chu, are you ready?”","“Yup. We only need to add some new hypnotic effects to the illusory formation in place to achieve the desired effect. It is very simple and should not have much impact on the people below.” Pavilion Master Chu’s voice sounded from her strand of hair, which swayed lightly in the air.","Then, small bits of light scattered from the strand of hair.","All of those who were paying attention to the “sky” saw these tiny dots of light.","In the next moment, in the area where the dark clouds were, cameras, fly rigging systems, smoke machines, and so on appeared.","“Oh, it turns out that they’re shooting a movie.” This thought emerged in everyone’s minds.","When Pavilion Master Chu, an Immortal-level powerhouse, took action, the resulting hypnotic effect was especially effective."]},{"number":2015,"title":"Chapter 2015 - The man who made the heavenly","paragraphs":["Although Pavilion Master Chu’s illusion was very rough and illogical, with her being an Immortal, all of those who saw the scene would ignore these unreasonable factors.","People’s brains would take the initiative to fill up those holes on their own.","This was the benefit of being powerful. They did not need to rely on intricate designs when setting up illusions; they could simply rely on their strength.","With the strength of an Immortal, even if it was just some random illusion, for ordinary people, it could last for a hundred years or even longer.","And a hundred years was a lifetime for ordinary human beings.","Perhaps there would be some long-lived people who would eventually recall what they saw today when they got much older. After the influence of the illusion dissipated, they would remember the unreasonable factors in the scene. But at that point, it would not really matter.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","In the sky.","“Sorry for troubling you, Senior Chu,” said Song Shuhang with a smile. He then mobilized his psychic energy to gently control Fellow Daoist Ding Gan’s body and move toward the outskirts of the Jiangnan area.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair swirled around, and she replied, “It’s just a small illusion, nothing much.”","“Speaking of which, Senior Chu, did we intervene in his tribulation?” Song Shuhang said.","Pavilion Master Chu chuckled, and then she said gently, “I don’t know if you’ve interfered with his tribulation, but I’m certain that I did not.”","In the end, the only thing she did was set up some illusions; she did not interfere with the tribulation in any way.","As for Song Shuhang, it was hard to say.","He appeared just as Ding Gan’s Master took action to scatter the heavenly tribulation. Afterward, Song Shuhang used his psychic energy to pick up Ding Gan and moved him to the outskirts of the Jiangnan area.","Normally, when the heavenly tribulation was scattered and had to gather itself again, Song Shuhang’s action of moving Ding Gan to another location would not have been considered interfering with the process.","However, the heavenly tribulation had been changing with each passing day, and they were unsure if the method used to determine if someone was interfering had changed.","The thing was that Song Shuhang had quite the relationship with the heavenly tribulation, so there was a chance that the tribulation would become happy just from seeing him and involve him forcibly.","After a moment of silence, Song Shuhang raised his head and looked into the distance. “I hope everything goes well.”","In the suburbs, a giant flying sword was suspended in the air.","Senior White and Sixteen were lying by a window, waving at him.","Song Shuhang’s spirit was bolstered.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“Thank you for your help, Senior Tyrannical Song.” At this time, Ding Gan’s Master also arrived; he bowed to Song Shuhang from a distance.","Song Shuhang said, “We can’t relax just yet. Although the tribulation clouds have been scattered, it is not over yet. With the changes that have happened to the heavenly tribulation, even if it’s been dispersed, it can still regather very quickly.”","Ding Gan had been struck by a bolt of lightning, and his entire body was charred black.","What was even worse was that the inner demon inside his body was getting restless and could give rise to an inner demon tribulation at any moment.","The reason Song Shuhang and the others had appeared directly in the area where Ding Gan was transcending his tribulation was the inner demon in his body.","After Ding Gan and his senior sister visited Song Shuhang last time, Pavilion Master Chu took a strand of Song Shuhang’s hair and gave it to Ding Gan. At that time, she had also placed a mark through the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? on Song Shuhang’s hair. With that, she could sense Ding Gan’s state at any time.","After sensing the changes in Ding Gan’s inner demon, Pavilion Master Chu told Song Shuhang and Senior White about it.","After obtaining White’s consent, Pavilion Master Chu used the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? mark on Song Shuhang’s hair and had the giant flying sword traverse space to reach the Jiangnan area.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","After taking a medicinal pill, Ding Gan slowly recovered.","He sat up and smiled wryly as he looked at the almost intact tribulation-transcending formation beside him.","When his heavenly tribulation descended, his inner demon took advantage of that moment to affect him.","Although he had taken precautions, he failed to resist it as he was focused on resisting the heavenly tribulation.","Under the influence of his inner demon, Ding Gan left behind the intact tribulation-transcending formation and ran all the way to the downtown Jiangnan area.","If Song Shuhang and his Master had not acted in time, he might have died already.","This clearly showed the importance of having guardians stand by and watch when a person was transcending their tribulation.","Loose cultivators suffered from the lack of such protective figures, so the rate of mortality when they transcended the tribulation was much higher.","“Senior Tyrannical Song,” Ding Gan looked at Song Shuhang and said, “my inner demon is stronger than I thought. I...”","“Don’t worry, you can do it,” Song Shuhang encouraged him. At the same time, he secretly transmitted his voice, [Do you see Sage Monarch White over there? Your heavenly tribulation will regather soon. Before that happens, pray to Sage Monarch White. Trust me, if you do that, you will have absolutely no problem transcending your tribulation. The more sincere your prayers, the better.]","Ding Gan was slightly taken aback.","After thinking for a moment, he bowed solemnly toward Sage Monarch White.","[I pray to Sage White, please let me transcend this tribulation safely... I beg Sage White to protect me!]","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The heavenly tribulation of the Third Stage condensed above Ding Gan’s head once again.","As Ding Gan had hardly used his tribulation-transcending formation during the last wave, the formation was nearly intact. All he needed to do was to supply it with some spirit stones.","Ding Gan stood in the tribulation-transcending formation, slightly nervous.","He was faced with both internal and external troubles.","There was the heavenly tribulation descending on the outside, and there was an inner demon lurking on the inside. There was also Senior Tyrannical Song’s pair of eyes, which made him extremely nervous as they stared at him.","“Boom~”","Tribulation lightning condensed, and a probing lightning bolt descended.","Not far away, Song Shuhang looked at the Third Stage heavenly tribulation while drooling.","“Pay attention to your image! You’re Profound Sage Tyrannical Song right now. Don’t lose face in front of others.” Pavilion Master Chu reminded him.","If he kept drooling while looking at the heavenly tribulation, it would look as if he had been shocked silly.","“What a pity Ding Gan did not use the tribulation-transcending formation I gave him. Otherwise, the Third Stage lightning tribulation would’ve been bounced away, allowing us to seal it and preserve it. I just can’t help but recall the taste of the ?Braised Heavenly Tribulation?. That taste, that rich aroma...” Song Shuhang licked his lips as he spoke.","He felt hungry now.","The longer he looked at the tribulation lightning, the more hungry he felt.","This was not only the case for Song Shuhang but for Senior White as well. He lay by the window of the giant flying sword with shining eyes.","His clone had transmitted back the information on the taste of the ?Braised Heavenly Tribulation?, but his real body had yet to taste the dish.","Three pairs of hungry eyes stared at the tribulation clouds.","One pair was from Senior White, while the other two pairs were from Song Shuhang as he was now a man with four eyes.","“Rumble~” The probing lightning bolt descended.","At the same time, the next wave began brewing inside the tribulation clouds.","But suddenly, a snow-like dot of light appeared within the tribulation clouds, reminding one of a computer screen.","Was the Third Stage heavenly tribulation mutating?","Every time the heavenly tribulation descended, different versions of the lightning tribulation would be released according to the cultivator’s strength, experience, luck, karma, and other data.","The lightning tribulation that Ding Gan was facing seemed to be recalculating the power it should use.","After a while, the heavenly tribulation descended again.","“Rumble~”","This time, there was no lightning, but only sonic booms.","Had the lightning tribulation become a sound tribulation?"]},{"number":2016,"title":"Chapter 2016 - This mouth of mine!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang’s drool disappeared in an instant.","How am I supposed to eat a sound tribulation?","What he wanted to eat was a braised lightning tribulation and not a sound tribulation, so there was a sudden sense of loss in his heart. However, after recalling Pavilion Master Chu’s words that he should maintain his image as the first Sage in a thousand years, Shuhang arduously kept a smile on his face.","Sonic booms echoed in the sky.","In addition to the classic five elements, there were many other kinds of heavenly tribulation, and the sound tribulation was one of the relatively special ones.","The sound tribulation was invisible and difficult to guard against, but in terms of pure offensive power, it was much weaker than that of a lightning tribulation of the same level.","When the sonic booms ended, Ding Gan was covered in blood, with blood oozing out of his eye sockets and ears.","The tribulation-transcending formations of cultivators that were transcending their Third Stage heavenly tribulation were usually meant to defend against lightning bolts. They were not prepared for sound tribulations. This sound tribulation could be said to be rather mean with how it had sucker-punched Ding Gan.","It was as if you were told that you were going to have a math exam that day, but were then forced to take a Russian exam that you were completely unprepared for.","It would make you feel really vexed.","This was how Ding Gan felt right now.","The attack method the sound tribulation used was relatively simple. It mainly attacked through shock waves, occasionally mixing some illusory sound attacks in it.","Nevertheless, it was fortunate that it was only a Third Stage heavenly tribulation. If it was a Sixth Stage sound tribulation, with how the heavenly tribulation was behaving recently, perhaps it would’ve mimicked a concert of Dharma King Creation, one without Fairy Creation’s blessings to it.","After suffering three waves of the sound tribulation, Ding Gan began to adapt to the attack pattern.","By using defensive techniques, along with the strengthening effect of the tribulation-transcending formation on his body, he was barely able to withstand the attacks of the sound tribulation.","As long as there was no sudden mishap, he should be able to hold out until the end of the Third Stage heavenly tribulation.","Flashes of lightning could be seen among the tribulation clouds, but no lightning struck down.","Wave after wave of the sound tribulation kept on coming, shaking Ding Gan to the core.","Ding Gan was completely covered in blood by now, and his limbs had become numb. However, due to the sound tribulation’s lack of lethality, his overall state was actually not that bad. He just looked very miserable.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said, “This is the last wave.”","She had been paying attention to the tribulation clouds the entire time.","The next wave should be the last wave of this heavenly tribulation.","If Ding Gan survived, then he would ascend to the Third Stage Realm. But if he failed, he might die.","“Rumble~”","During the last wave, a lightning bolt descended.","Inside the tribulation-transcending formation, Ding Gan’s eyes lit up.","[Thank you, Sage Monarch White!]","He was now almost certain that he’d be able to transcend this Third Stage heavenly tribulation.","His tribulation-transcending formation had been devised to deal with a lightning tribulation. Unfortunately, the previous waves of the tribulation had all been sound attacks.","With the almost intact tribulation-transcending formation and the relatively decent state of his body, he could resist this last wave of the tribulation!","Song Shuhang’s and Senior White’s eyes also shone.","The lightning tribulation had finally come!","The unfortunate thing was that there was only one wave of lightning tribulation...","“Boom~” The last wave of the tribulation violently crashed down onto the tribulation-transcending formation.","“Formation arts—lightning protection formation, lightning governing formation, heavenly dragon formation, lightning reduction formation...” Ding Gan, who was covered in blood, shouted aloud.","In one breath, he activated all of the formations within the tribulation-transcending formation to contend against the lightning.","All in all, there were about 20 formations, and it felt great when he unleashed them all.","It was as if you had a royal flush in poker, and you were able to last until you finally managed to bring it out.","The might of the lightning tribulation was vast, but after crashing down on the formation, the lightning bounced back.","The 20 formations working together produced a wonderful effect.","After the lightning tribulation was bounced back, with no surprise, it shot straight toward Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “Hahaha, I knew things would turn out like this!”","As soon as the tribulation lightning landed, he had such a feeling in his heart. The heavenly tribulation had some fate with him, and it would definitely jump towards him in the end.","There was no basis for this feeling. It was simply a cultivator’s intuition.","Therefore, he had already secretly prepared for this.","Sure enough, his intuition turned out to be right!","As the bolt of lightning shot toward him, his wooden body stretched out its hand and worked together with his head to mobilize a vast amount of psychic energy.","The lightning tribulation was forced to halt in mid-air.","Song Shuhang started rubbing his hands, and the huge bolt of lightning seemed as if it was sandwiched by two invisible hands and rubbed non-stop.","Sparks flew everywhere, and electricity crackled.","The majestic lightning tribulation was rubbed into a cylindrical shape under the watchful eyes of the onlookers.","Ding Gan could not help but gulp. Without the help of the tribulation-transcending formation, this single bolt of tribulation lightning would have seriously injured him or killed him directly.","Yet, this terrifying bolt of lightning was rubbed and flattened in the hands of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song; it could not resist at all.","“Senior White!” Song Shuhang exclaimed after rubbing the tribulation lightning into its current form.","Senior White crossed through space and arrived beside the lightning tribulation. He stretched out his hand, and a sealing rune appeared and wrapped around the lightning tribulation, instantly sealing it.","“It’s done.” Song Shuhang snapped his fingers and transferred the sealed lightning tribulation into his Inner World.","Ding Gan, his two senior sisters, and his master all stared at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and Sage Monarch White in shock.","These two Sage Monarchs could actually use spatial power!","Sage Monarch White teleported, while Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s snapped his fingers to transfer the lightning tribulation without the use of a cosmos bag.","The Profound Sages nowadays were truly terrifying!","After Song Shuhang put away the lightning tribulation, he smiled at Senior White and said, “Senior White, let’s have a nice meal tonight.”","“Okay.” Senior White smiled back.","However, his smile lasted only for a moment.","The main reason was that only half of his real body was here, and the control he had over his charm was not as perfect as before. If he were to smile for too long, he could affect the beings around him.","Song Shuhang paused slightly. He then glanced at his wooden body and nodded in satisfaction.","Then, he looked at Ding Gan again. “Congratulations, Little Fellow Daoist Ding Gan.”","When the virtuous lamia heard his words, she jumped out, wanting to speak out her line. But before she could speak, she was wrapped up by Pavilion Master Chu’s hair and sent back into Song Shuhang’s body.","Half of the virtuous lamia’s small head stuck out from Song Shuhang’s back, her eyes full of grievances.","Ding Gan cupped his fists and said, “Thank you for your help, Senior Tyrannical Song.”","“There’s no need to be so polite.” Song Shuhang waved his hand and said, “This time, your inner demon did not give rise to an inner demon tribulation. When you go home, you should strengthen your will and let your inner demon transform... F*ck, this mouth of mine!”","Inside the tribulation-transcending formation, Ding Gan curled up in pain.","Behind him, there was a cluster of distorted, love-type inner demons. Through the power of the heavenly tribulation, they had materialized into an inner demon tribulation."]},{"number":2017,"title":"Chapter 2017 - Have you ever truly loved someone?","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang received a slap in the face before he could even finish speaking. Now, his heart felt stifled.","The heavenly tribulation had just ended, so he did not expect the inner demon inside Ding Gan’s body to act up at this time, increasing the difficulty of the tribulation again.","As for whether it was lucky or unlucky for Ding Gan to have been made to face an inner demon tribulation when he was transcending his Third Stage heavenly tribulation, it was honestly unclear.","“This is why you should not be too quick to speak sometimes, or you might just end up getting slapped in the face,” Pavilion Master Chu said earnestly. “Next time, make sure to think carefully about your words before speaking.”","Song Shuhang sighed softly. “I wanted to do it...”","But sometimes, I just can’t control myself.","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","While they were discussing, the inner demon inside Ding Gan’s body transformed.","The cluster of tentacles wriggled, and some of them formed tight knots. The state of the wriggling tentacles was changing nonstop, until the cluster turned into an inner demon tribulation.","The main difference was that they had evolved from raw materials that only the Ruler of Shadows could enjoy into an ingredient that could be used in the ?Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet?.","Ding Gan’s body was covered in tentacles, and the scene looked like something straight out of a hentai.","Song Shuhang recalled that Pavilion Master Chu had once mentioned that Ding Gan’s inner demon was related to love.","Love was something that afflicted all intelligent creatures.","Even though the various large forces of the world of cultivation had psychological counseling classes for their young disciples to strengthen their understanding of love, every time their disciples had inner demons, most of them were still related to love.","Love was something special. Even if one understood its nature, they could never control it completely.","Even if one was a cultivator who practiced the severing of emotions, they would become crazier than anyone else once they fell in love, and the consequences they’d suffer would be even more terrifying.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“By the way, how did Ding Gan end up getting entangled by a love-type inner demon?” Song Shuhang was quite curious.","Previously, Ding Gan assured them that he had never had any problems with his relationships. He said that he had a daoist partner who loved him just as much as he loved her, and their relationship was very good.","Whether it was his family or his friends, he had no problems with them, so how did this twisted love come about?","Song Shuhang looked at Ding Gan’s two senior sisters and his master.","He had previously reminded Ding Gan to pay attention to this matter regarding his inner demon.","During this period of time, he should have at least recalled the reason behind the birth of his inner demon and taken some precautions, right?","In the distance, Ding Gan’s two senior sisters shook their heads.","After visiting Senior Tyrannical Song last time, Ding Gan had thought hard about this matter, but unfortunately, he still failed to figure out why the inner demon had been born.","Whether it was love, family, or friendship, he could not find any problems anywhere.","“Senior White, what do you think?” Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at Senior White.","Senior White shook his head. “I don’t know much about love, either.”","“Huh? Senior White, you don’t know much about love?” Song Shuhang exclaimed. “But back then, someone clearly said... Cough, cough, nevermind!”","Senior White looked puzzled.","“It’s nothing, Senior White. I think I might have a sore throat... Anyway, I remembered Senior White Crane just now,” Song Shuhang said.","He recalled Pavilion Master Chu’s advice, so he thought about the words he was about to say carefully. Luckily, he managed to slam on the brakes, saving his poor life by shifting the attention to Senior White Crane.","“White Crane doesn’t ‘love’ me. It simply wants to repay me,” Senior White explained. “If it really did love me, then its gender would have become fixed by now.”","Sixteen asked curiously, “Are you saying that Senior White Crane must find a partner before it can have a set gender?”","“Once it truly falls in love, its gender will become fixed. Determining its relationship with this person is of secondary importance,” Senior White said slowly. “This is how it works for those of White Crane’s race.”","“It really wasn’t easy for Senior White Crane’s race to survive until now.” Song Shuhang sighed.","“Then, Senior White, is there someone who you’ve truly loved?” asked Lady Onion all of a sudden.","She was very curious. What kind of person could make someone like Senior White fall in love?","How perfect was the person or creature that could grab Senior White’s attention?","Lady Onion asked the question that everyone wanted to ask but subconsciously did not dare to ask.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword glanced at Lady Onion and sighed inwardly. ?As expected of someone who has the potential to become a Wielder of the Heaven’s Will!","“Someone I’ve truly loved?” Senior White pinched his chin and fell into thought.","Song Shuhang, Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu, Senior Turtle, and even the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation all pricked up their ears, looking forward to hearing Senior White’s answer.","Even the inner demon tribulation entangling Ding Gan stopped moving and calmed down.","Similarly, Ding Gan’s senior sisters and master also pricked up their ears.","In the entire world, there was only silence.","Everyone held their breath, waiting for Senior White’s answer.","“Hmm...” White thought hard and finally said, “No, I don’t think so.”","This answer was expected, but it still made everyone feel a sense of regret.","Everyone had been looking forward to learning of someone who Senior White might have loved.","But at the same time, they felt afraid of knowing the answer to this question.","It was a very contradictory feeling.","Everyone took a deep breath and continued with what they were doing.","The tentacles covering Ding Gan’s body began wriggling again.","“Then Senior White, what kind of person do you think you might fall in love with? What qualities would you look for?” Lady Onion’s eyes lit up and she asked another question.","It appeared that Lady Onion was in quite the bold state today. Just as if possessed, she kept inquiring about this topic.","“I’ve never really given it much thought.” Senior White shook his head and continued, “At the very least, they can’t be someone I loathe. We have to be able to get along with each other. So far, the fellow daoists who I’ve been able to hit it off with are those of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. If you’re really wondering, then I’d say they have to at least reach the standard of the fellow daoists of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.”","Senior White’s answer felt rather vague.","It felt as if he was not really getting to the point, or as if he was avoiding answering the question.","“Anyway, enough about love. I can’t help you much in regards to this subject.” Senior White smiled and stretched out his hand to touch the top of Lady Onion’s head. “As far as I’m concerned, love is just something that can make a person happy.”","In the meantime, Ding Gan pressed his hands against the ground and slowly got up.","“Yes, senior, love makes people happy.” He roared with all his strength, “I feel very happy!”"]},{"number":2018,"title":"Chapter 2018 - Song Shuhang’s heart freezes","paragraphs":["Ding Gan wanted to let everybody know that he was very happy.","His daoist partner had not come with him this time, so he roared loudly in hopes that his love would reach her ears through the recount of his master and senior sisters.","He wanted to take this opportunity to tell her how much he loved her.","His love was genuine and had absolutely no relation to inner demons!","Moreover, there was absolutely no problem with his love for her; it was pure and not twisted in the slightest.","“I’m very happy!” Ding Gan exclaimed. “Are you happy too?”","“No, my surname is Song.” Song Shuhang could not help but crack a dad joke out of instinct.","Ding Gan’s momentum was suddenly cut off.","“My surname is Su.” Sixteen chuckled.","“My surname is... Onion, I guess?” Lady Onion mused while pointing to herself.","“I... No, nevermind.” Senior Turtle stopped halfway, seemingly unable to speak out its true name.","Ding Gan was frozen in place for a good few seconds.","After a while, he calmly brushed aside Senior Tyrannical Song and the others’ teasing.","“Senior Sage White, thanks to what you said, I realized that my love is genuine. Now, I feel as if I’m overflowing with power. No matter how twisted the love of this inner demon is, it won’t be able to affect me,” Ding Gan roared loudly once more.","Roaring could enhance one’s spirits and boost one’s confidence.","The louder one roared, the greater the effect on one’s confidence.","“The inner demon that resides in me, regardless of why it was born, is doomed to be obliterated! It cannot shake my heart!” Ding Gan then yelled at the inner demon tribulation attached to him, “Get off of me! Get out!”","Behind him, the wriggling tentacles continued to struggle.","But the more they struggled, the more the tentacles knotted themselves together, until there were thousands of knots.","In the sky, Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said while in thought, “Is this... The power of love?”","“Sigh, the power of love...” Senior Turtle stroked its chin with its forelegs. “I now understand ‘psychology’ a little bit more.”","“Fellow Daoist Turtle, I feel that ‘love’ may have only played a part in Little Fellow Daoist Ding Gan’s sudden increase of power. Rather, do you also feel that this Little Fellow Daoist is showing the symptoms of a hen-pecked man? “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said happily.","It suspected that being a hen-pecked man may be one of the reasons for the formation of Ding Gan’s inner demon.","But interestingly enough, it was also what enabled him to expel his inner demon.","Of course, this was only the black Scarlet Heaven Sword’s guess. It did not actually have any hard evidence to support its claims.","It was merely food for thought.","Amidst the constant roars of Ding Gan, the inner demon that was attached to his body was slowly but surely being expelled.","However, no inner demon tribulation was easy to deal with.","The inner demon hung on to a thread, continuing to survive despite Ding Gan’s arduous efforts to expel it.","The two sides had entered a game of tug of war.","It caused those who were watching to be on edge.","When it came to dealing with something like an inner demon tribulation, it was unfortunately very difficult for outsiders to lend a helping hand.","The inner demon tribulation was also a part of the heavenly tribulation, so it was not easy for outsiders to intervene in such a thing.","“Fairy Creation?” Song Shuhang tried to summon her.","After all, her singing had the power to weaken inner demons.","Half of Fairy Creation’s head popped out of Song Shuhang’s body and she glanced at Ding Gan. “Song~ Dumb~”","Then, Fairy Creation went back into his body, showing a clear lack of interest in the matter. “Song~, Bazaar~ Hey~”","Song Shuhang: “...”","It seemed that Fairy Creation would not be lending any help this time.","“Senior White,” Shuhang called out.","Senior White turned his head curiously. “Hmm?”","Song Shuhang said, “Do you want to try eating this inner demon tribulation? After all, none of us have gotten to taste it yet.”","When he heard this, Senior White’s eyes flashed with intrigue.","Song Shuhang continued, “According to the Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet, the level of the Inner Demon Tribulation Sashimi Slices dish is even higher than that of the Braised Heavenly Tribulation.”","Senior White’s eyes shone even brighter after hearing this.","There seemed to be hidden the splendor of the sun and moon within his eyes. They shone with their own brilliance, a brilliance that was simply dazzling.","In the sky, the tribulation clouds dispersed.","A beam of sunlight shone on the body of Ding Gan’s inner demon tribulation through the gradually clearing tribulation clouds.","This beam was like a light straight from the heavens, welcoming the return of a lost soul.","Under this light, Ding Gan’s inner demon tribulation began to separate from his body and slowly rose into the sky.","Song Shuhang said, “Is it ascending to the heavens? Or is it being retrived?”","Sixteen said, “Speaking of which, will an inner demon tribulation disappear once it’s expelled?”","Senior White said, “Inner demons are ever-changing, so no matter what happens to an inner demon tribulation, you should not be surprised. Didn’t Fellow Daoist Northern River even have a relationship with his inner demon for many years?”","In other words, it was quite normal for an inner demon that was expelled from a cultivator’s body to still be alive and kicking, or even go back from where it had come from.","It should not come as any surprise if there were even more bizarre events.","Song Shuhang said, “However, Ding Gan’s heavenly tribulation has already come to an end, right?”","Pavilion Master Chu said, “Yes, it’s over. He has ascended from the Second Stage Realm to the Third Stage Realm, and the first of his four mysterious meridians have begun to open.”","“That means...” Song Shuhang took out a glove and put it on.","The Ancestral Witch’s Blessing allowed the user to perform short-distance spatial teleportation within a range of 500 meters.","Song Shuhang’s figure appeared directly above the knotted tentacles.","The inner demon tribulation did not seem to notice Song Shuhang and continued its journey up into the sky.","Song Shuhang reached out and grabbed the inner demon tribulation tentacles. “I’ll be taking this inner demon tribulation.”","The squid-like tentacles, which were still wriggling around, let out a shrill cry.","However, the mass of tentacles could not invade Song Shuhang’s body as the black-skinned Soft Feather’s hands had already reached out and tightly grabbed onto its body.","Song Shuhang teleported again and reappeared next to Senior White. He handed Ding Gan’s inner demon tribulation to Senior White, wishing for him to seal it.","Senior White placed his hand on the inner demon tribulation and made more than ten hand seals in a row to seal the inner demon tribulation.","With that, Ding Gan’s heavenly tribulation had officially come to an end.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","In the middle of the sky, Song Shuhang silently took out his phone and unlocked the screen with his password.","He then opened the interface of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“Time to change my daoist name,” said Song Shuhang as he changed his daoist name to Tyrannical Saber Song One. After looking at his past experiences, every time he used this daoist name, he would be a little bit luckier.","Then, while Senior White was sealing the inner demon tribulation, he quickly typed a message into the chat box.","Tyrannical Saber Song One: “Seniors, quietly spread this piece of news. Senior White said that if he were to choose his other half, they must at least be as good as the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. In other words, if Senior White were to choose a partner, it is likely to come from this group<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/1f44d.svg\" alt=\"??\" />. So, all the fairies in the group, prepare yourselves well! PS: This message will be deleted in ten seconds.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “...”","I’m that little white crane at the edge of the Earth’s End: “What did you do to Senior White? Why did you talk about marriage with him?”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “Shuhang, have you lost your mind again?”","Song Shuhang smiled slightly.","After about ten seconds, as Senior White finished sealing the inner demon tribulation, Song Shuhang quickly tried to delete the message.","But then, the fingers of his wooden body became stiff.","A prompt had popped up—[Network Connection Error].","Song Shuhang’s heart froze."]},{"number":2019,"title":"Chapter 2019 - Song “Wish fulfilled” Shuhang","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang knew that luck was not on his side when he saw the [Network Connection Error] prompt.","His phone’s screen was showing that there were two bars of signal, yet there was no Internet connection.","Under normal circumstances, his heartbeat should accelerate when in this kind of situation, but his wooden body did not coordinate with him.","Someone once joked that these days, having an Internet connection was of the utmost importance for most people. Once they lost connection to the Internet, they would find it difficult to live their lives.","Song Shuhang had always felt that he was an exception to this.","How could the Internet possibly be so vital? It would be fine if it didn’t exist. If there was no Internet, he could still read books, and reading books for free in bookstores made him much happier than surfing the Internet.","But at this moment, he personally experienced what it was like for those who relied on the Internet a lot when they lost connection.","His fingers moved quickly, tapping all over his phone, but his phone would just not connect to the Internet. It was important to remember that this was a phone that had been magically modified, and it would be able to connect to the Internet even if it was in space!","At this time, Senior White finished sealing the inner demon tribulation, and he turned his head to look at Song Shuhang.","“Shuhang, it’s sealed.” White beckoned at Song Shuhang. “Come over here and take it.”","Song Shuhang replied, “Coming.”","At this time, he suddenly had an idea. He opened up his contacts list and looked for Senior Yellow Mountain’s name. He was planning on sending an SMS to Senior Yellow Mountain and asking him to delete the message that he had just sent with his group owner privileges.","Hah! I’m so witty!","Song Shuhang quickly tapped on the keyboard and soon finished writing the message, which was then successfully sent to Senior Yellow Mountain.","Although there was no Internet connection, his phone still had a signal.","Now, he just needed to stall for some time and keep Senior White occupied so that he wouldn’t look at his phone.","Song Shuhang finally managed to calm himself down a bit. He put away his phone and began taking small steps toward Senior White.","While he was walking toward Senior White... Senior White’s phone rang.","Senior White held the sealed inner demon tribulation in one hand and took out his phone with the other. He answered the call and put the phone to his ear. “Hello, White Crane, what’s the matter?”","Song Shuhang stopped in his tracks.","Sixteen covered her eyes with her hands.","“Senior White, I heard that you’re looking for a partner from among the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. Can I sign myself up?” True Monarch White Crane’s excited voice sounded from the other end.","A puzzled look appeared on Senior White’s face. “A partner?”","At the same time, Senior White subconsciously turned to look at Shuhang.","Shuhang looked as if he were doing a moonwalk. He was making the motions for walking forward, but he was actually moving further and further away from him.","“Hehe.” Senior White’s eyes narrowed, and a beautiful smile emerged on his face.","Senior White said with a smile, “Did Shuhang post something in the group chat?”","True Monarch White Crane did not forget its loyalty. “No, it’s not little friend Shuhang. I got this news from somewhere else.”","Senior White said, “Hm, okay, I see. I’ll talk to you later.”","Then, Senior White hung up the phone and waved to Song Shuhang in the distance.","Song Shuhang revealed an embarrassed smile.","Senior White said, “Come here, I won’t eat you. Take this sealed inner demon tribulation.”","Song Shuhang braced himself and moved closer to Senior White. Tremblingly, he extended his right hand.","At this moment, he looked like a poor native who had mispronounced the ?Three-Character Classic? and was about to taste Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman’s ruler.","Senior White smiled and handed the sealed inner demon tribulation to him, and Song Shuhang received it carefully.","There was no problem with the seal, and the inner demon tribulation did not suddenly break out of the seal and jump at him.","Song Shuhang let out a breath of relief. He immediately sent the inner demon tribulation into his Inner World, placing it together with the sealed tribulation lightning. Then, he glanced at Senior White again.","“Let’s go.” Senior White lifted Meteor Sword, turned around handsomely, and returned to the giant flying sword magical treasure.","Song Shuhang looked confused.","That’s it?","No coiling flight? No supersonic trip to outer space? No punishments?","Could Senior White have just forgiven me?","After being left stunned for a while, he suddenly thought of another possibility.","Maybe because he’s going to get to have a taste of the ?Braised Heavenly Tribulation? and the ?Inner Demon Tribulation Sashimi Slices? soon, Senior White is in a good mood. When a person is in a good mood, small mistakes can be ignored!","Song Shuhang finally understood how important it was to be a master at cooking.","“I’m coming, Senior White.” Song Shuhang smiled brightly, and he gestured to Sixteen. “Sixteen, Senior Turtle, let’s go.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “I bet that little friend Shuhang will not survive until tonight.”","Senior Turtle retorted in a righteous tone, “Don’t say such an unlucky thing. I bet that he... will at least live until this afternoon.”","Sixteen put down her hands which were covering her eyes, and a thoughtful expression appeared on her face.","Sister White Dragon whispered in her ear, [Sage White’s reaction is too weird. Could Sage White be really looking for a partner?]","Sixteen shook her head.","Afterward, she drove her treasured saber and followed Song Shuhang.","After all of them returned to the giant flying sword, the magical treasure started moving again and flew toward the passage that led to the Beast Realm.","As for the aftermath left by the tribulation, it was left to Ding Gan and his master to deal with.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Inside a restaurant in the Jiangnan area, Papa Song, Mama Song, and their friends sat down again and continued chatting amongst themselves.","Regarding what they had seen just now outside the window, all of them ignored it due to the influence of Pavilion Master Chu’s magical technique.","The only impression that was left in Papa Song’s and Mama Song’s minds was that Song Shuhang had “skyrocketed”.","Other than that, they also had a faint impression of the two beauties beside Song Shuhang.","Papa Song and Mama Song looked at each other tacitly.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The flying sword continued to fly through the sky rapidly.","Senior White had activated the autopilot, so that he did not need to manually operate the magical treasure to reach the Beast Realm.","With that, he could also rest.","Senior White folded his hands and propped up his chin, his eyes shining like stars in the night sky.","But if one were to look closely, they would be able to notice that he was distracted.","Inside the cabin of the flying sword, Senior Turtle was imparting some cultivation knowledge to Lady Onion.","Sixteen sat next to Song Shuhang and listened with him.","There was never a shortage of Tribulation Transcender and Immortal-level lectures when around Song Shuhang.","Whenever Senior Turtle lectured seriously, the content of its lecture was never a disappointment. It taught Lady Onion in the same way that the Great Northern Emperor had taught it.","Song Shuhang was mesmerized as he listened in.","Suddenly, a gust of sand drifted past him, and a hot wind blew against his face.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","In the next moment, he discovered that he had unknowingly appeared in a desert.","“This place...”","Isn’t this Senior White’s illusory reality?","“Did Senior White become distracted again?” Song Shuhang rubbed his temples in distress.","With the desert already here, the young man in green robes should be appearing soon, right?","“Jingle~”","He soon heard the jingling sound of a horse’s bell.","“Perfect,” said Song Shuhang. He had been looking for a chance to enter Senior White’s illusory reality. He did not expect to have his wish granted so soon!"]},{"number":2020,"title":"Chapter 2020 - New hidden plot?","paragraphs":["Not long ago, Song Shuhang had been thinking of asking Senior White to use his illusory reality again when he returned to the main world.","He did not expect his wish to be granted so quickly.","In the past, when he was still new to cultivation, he had been pulled into Senior White’s illusory reality by mistake. And when he was inside, he was abused repeatedly by the young man in green robes.","But now that his strength had reached the Sixth Stage True Monarch Realm, he felt that he would definitely be able to beat up the young man.","A part of his confidence came from Doudou’s speculations. Doudou had speculated that the young man in green robes inside the desert only possessed strength between the Second and Third Stage.","When Doudou, Song Shuhang, and Young Mistress Candy had been pulled into the illusory reality, Doudou also met the young man in green robes. At that time, Doudou, who was at the Fourth Stage Realm, only needed to assume his true form and lie still on the ground, and the young man in green robes could not do anything to him.","And now, if Shuhang, who was at the Sixth Stage, were placed against the young man who was around the Second or Third Stage Realm in strength, then... Hehehe!","?????","“Over here, young man!” Song Shuhang laughed heartily as he turned to look in the direction the sound was coming— Young man, let me teach you a lesson on fist techniques today!","“Jingle~” The horse bell’s ringing got closer and closer.","Soon enough, a young man in green robes and a white horse could be seen approaching Song Shuhang.","The young man looked handsome. He had red lips and white teeth, and his skin was as smooth as jade. He looked about fifteen or sixteen years old.","There’s no mistake, it’s him!","He was the exact same as he was six months ago. Nothing had changed about him.","When Song Shuhang saw the young man in green robes, the young man also saw him, and their eyes made contact.","“Now, the line I should be hearing next is [Little White, Little White, I finally found you]. This line was akin to a nightmare back then.” Song Shuhang replayed the plot of the illusory reality in his head.","While he was in thought, the young man in green robes and the white horse reached a small sand dune and stopped.","The young man held the horse’s reins as he looked at Song Shuhang from a distance. He made no further movement afterward.","Song Shuhang looked puzzled.","Why hasn’t he come over yet?","The young man in green robes left the horse alone.","Then, while standing on that little sand dune, he began throwing punches.","He first displayed a basic fist technique, which was the same fist technique he hammered into Song Shuhang’s mind and body back then.","After he finished performing this basic fist technique, he switched to a higher-level fist technique.","His fists were filled with energy, and along with his movements, the yellow sand flew up in the sky.","The scene looked majestic.","Song Shuhang scratched his head in confusion.","The plot seems to be playing out differently.","Could it be that I triggered some hidden plot?","The last hidden plot he triggered was the young man in green robes confessing to Little White.","Could it be something similar this time?","Song Shuhang was looking forward to what would happen next.","After a while, the young man finished performing three other sets of fist techniques. He then retracted his fists, exhaled, and led his horse away along with the sound of its ringing bell.","He walked away just like that...","And just like that, Song Shuhang was left alone and confused in the scorching hot desert.","Am I supposed to keep waiting for him under the scorching sun?","Is he not going to come up and beat me like last time?","“Don’t go!” Song Shuhang chased after the young man in green robes.","With his current speed, it was not difficult for him to catch up to the young man in green robes. However, before he could even take two steps, the young man and the white horse had disappeared.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky, speechless.","It doesn’t matter. The young man in green robes and the white horse will definitely come back soon.","Song Shuhang stopped in his tracks and found a place to sit in the desert.","If I see the young man in green robes again, I won’t say anything and I’ll immediately make a move!","At that time, the power of his fists and twenty hair-fists would be unleashed fully. He would let the young man in green robes know how powerful he was right now.","After about five or six minutes, the pleasant sound of a ringing bell could be heard again.","He’s back!","Song Shuhang jumped up from his spot and looked in the direction the ringing was coming from.","A young man and a horse appeared in his vision once more.","“Hehehe.” Song Shuhang clenched his fists and spread out his long hair, forming twenty fists. He was ready to go.","“Jingle~”","The young man in green robes and the white horse reached the sand dune once again.","As before, the young man paused when he saw Song Shuhang. Then, the two of them stared at each other.","The young man left his horse beside the dunes and began to practice a fist technique.","This time, Song Shuhang did not give him a chance to escape.","“Basic Buddhist Fist Technique, One!”","His punch shot forward as fast as a bullet and as heavy as an artillery shell. The power it carried was overwhelming!","The young man in green robes smiled when he saw Song Shuhang jump up.","“Little White, you aren’t angry, are you?” While he was speaking, he moved forward and raised his arm, easily receiving Song Shuhang’s punch.","“Bam~”","Song Shuhang’s punch was deflected with ease.","At the same time, the young man struck out with his other palm, launching it right at Shuhang’s chest.","Puzzled, Song Shuhang urged his psychic energy and forcibly lifted his body to avoid the palm.","At the same time, all twenty of his hair-fists locked onto the young man. The ?Basic Buddhist Fist Technique?, the ?Demon Subduing Buddhist Fist Technique?, the ?Buddha’s Giant Palm of Punishment?, and the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?’s ?Huge Whale Spout? were used all at once.","The twenty fists smashed toward the young man in green robes in unison.","“Hehehe. Little White, you’re amazing, but I won’t lose to you.” The young man revealed a joyful smile. “Watch this secret technique of mine... Thousand-hands magical technique!”","The young man’s palms drew strange arcs in the air. Each of these palms carried the power of fate.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang saw a sea of ??palms—his vision was completely filled with the palms of the young man.","It was a despicable AOE attack!","Those palms that filled the sky not only neutralized all of Song Shuhang’s attacks but also forced him into a defensive stance.","This was not something a cultivator at the Second or Third Stage Realm could do.","Nobody in the Second or Third Stage Realm was this powerful.","Shuhang could no longer underestimate his opponent. He had to treat the young man in green robes as someone of the same realm as him.","Song Shuhang’s wooden body shook.","“Basic Buddhist Fist Technique, Two!” His two fists and his twenty hair-fists all performed the second form of the ?Basic Buddhist Fist Technique?.","Every single one of his fists was like a shooting star as they blasted out hundreds of supersonic attacks in an instant.","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","Song Shuhang and the young man in green robes fought at supersonic speed, attacking each other countless times.","Every time their fists and palms met, terrifying shock waves ensued, followed by a thunderous booming sound.","After thousands of collisions, a storm had formed in the desert.","The young man in green robes was on par with Song Shuhang.","“Heh.” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","While their fists and palms were about equal, he still had his eye techniques.","“Expert’s Appraisal!” Song Shuhang’s left eye lit up. This was a skill that only peerless powerhouses could resist. Now, it was time to see whether or not the young man in green robes was immune to it.","The Expert’s Appraisal, once released, was unavoidable.","“Neigh~” Just as Song Shuhang’s left eye lit up, a hoof came falling down from the sky and landed on his back, knocking him to the ground.","Song Shuhang: “???”","“Oh, time’s up. I have to go back.” The young man in green robes also stopped.","He jumped up, mounted the horse, and rode it into the distance. “Little White, you look so good with long hair.”"]},{"number":2021,"title":"Chapter 2021 - The longest road I’ve walked","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang’s hair fluttered in the wind, his mind in disarray.","At this moment, he realized that one of the reasons for the triggering of this hidden plot was his long hair!","It was likely that his long hair, along with some other factors he was currently unclear of, had triggered this new plot.","Now that he had figured out the cause, things had become a lot easier for him to resolve.","Song Shuhang reached out, and the Tyrant Cuttlefish’s Twin Blades from the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure appeared in his hands. He then raised the twin blades and cut his hair.","His long hair was cut and shortened.","Seeing this, Song Shuhang nodded with satisfaction.","Without his long hair, this hidden plot should no longer be triggered.","In a while, when the young man in green robes appears again, he should be back to his old self.","Hehehe!","Song Shuhang raised the twin blades and waited for the young man to appear again.","At the same time, he began to analyze the content of the hidden plot in his mind.","He felt that this new plot, in the timeline, must come after the part where the young man had spoken about waiting until Little White’s hair had grown until his waist.","Moreover, it seemed that the young man in green robes had accidentally angered Little White. Because of this, he did not approach Little White immediately when he appeared, and instead performed some fist techniques while keeping some distance. Then, before Little White lost his temper, he would finish his performance and leave.","Another thing to take note of was that Little White’s hair was growing.","Regardless of whether Little White’s long hair would reach his waist or not, it was indisputable that Little White was serious about growing his hair longer.","The corners of Song Shuhang’s mouth curled up as he felt as if he had grasped another part of Senior White’s dark history.","“Jingle~” While he was in thought, the jingling of a bell came from afar.","This time, the young man in green robes had reappeared at a faster pace.","This is it! This is the normal interval between the appearances of the young man in green robes, ?Song Shuhang thought to himself.","The young man who reduced him to tears multiple times would always reappear after a similar interval of time.","It’s time.","Song Shuhang turned his head and looked in the direction the jingling was coming.","A man and a white horse appeared in his field of vision, but this time, the young man was no more.","He had grown up.","He was still handsome, and his appearance was rather similar to the current Senior White.","Song Shuhang was stunned.? Did I trigger another hidden plot?","“Little White, you’ve cut your hair,” said the grown-up version of the young man in green robes. His voice was now deeper than before.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky, speechless.","Previously, his long hair triggered hidden plot 2. After cutting his long hair, he ended up triggering hidden plot 3.","He just wanted to see the original young man in green robes!","Forget it.","Whether he’s older or younger, he’s still the same person.","I’ll just destroy him!","Song Shuhang jumped up and stepped on a black lotus. The ?Virtuous Man’s Ten Thousand Mile Walk? was pushed to the limit.","At the same time, with a flick of his left hand, the left blade of the Tyrant Cuttlefish’s Twin Blades shot out.","Moonlight Saber Control!","The treasured saber turned into a beam of moonlight, slashing at the young man in green robes.","Shuhang then twirled his right wrist, and raging flames blazed on his blade. A powerful saber intent condensed; it was the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.","“Hahaha, Little White, you’re still the same as before.” The young man in green robes laughed.","Then he reached out and brought out a longsword.","Sword light flashed and blocked the Moonlight Saber Control.","“Go!” At the same time, another sword flew out from the young man’s waist, turning into a colorful sword light that shot toward Song Shuhang.","He used a sword technique to deal with Song Shuhang’s saber controlling technique, and then a sword controlling technique to fend off Song Shuhang’s Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.","A man and his sword against a treasured saber.","A man and his saber against a flying sword.","To keep things fair, Song Shuhang had to start using the ?Savage Saber?.","It was the saber controlling technique that Senior Eternal Fire had prepared for him.","He was learning it while he was using it.","Song Shuhang’s talent in the saber was indeed outstanding.","Some of the seniors had already commented on this quality of his in the past.","If talent in saber techniques were to be quantified, then ordinary geniuses who were talented in the saber path would have something along these lines: sword talent 1, saber talent 9—and some of the more extreme ones might have sword talent 0, saber talent 10.","However, Song Shuhang’s talent points were distributed in such a way that his sword talent was at -10, and his saber talent was at 20.","Anyway, while learning the saber technique, he was still able to keep up with the young man in green robes. But there was also a chance that the young man in green robes was just going along with him.","It was unknown how long the fight lasted, but Song Shuhang devoted himself to the battle wholeheartedly, obsessed with practicing the ?Savage Saber?.","Before he knew it, he performed the entire set of ?Savage Saber?, from beginning to end.","The young man in green robes said, “Not bad, Little White.”","After that, he pulled away.","“Neigh~” A familiar sound rang in Song Shuhang’s ears.","Then, a horse’s hoof stomped on him, knocking him to the ground.","Song Shuhang’s face was buried in the sand.","“Hahahaha.” The young man in green robes crouched beside Song Shuhang, reaching out and poking him.","Song Shuhang wanted to look up, but the young man pressed his hand on his head, pushing his face deeper into the sand.","How could someone be so mean?","The ugliness of human nature was revealed at this moment!","The young man in green robes suddenly said, “Little White, why do you think people die?”","Song Shuhang: “???”","Where is this hidden plot 3 headed?","Shuhang kept his head buried in the sand, waiting for the plot to unfold.","The young man in green robes continued, “Even if you are a cultivator, if you are killed, you die.”","No, if a cultivator is killed, they can resurrect. Just like I did several times. ?Song Shuhang thought to himself. However, he did not say anything so as to not disturb the development of the plot.","The young man in green robes suddenly said, “Oh, time’s up”","Then, he got up and jumped back onto the white horse.","The white horse ran away and disappeared far into the distance.","Song Shuhang looked confused.","What about the plot? What comes after?","Song Shuhang raised his head to look at the sky. “I waited for so long, but you did not show me a proper ending.”","“I haven’t finished making up the following story.” At this moment, a high-pitched voice sounded in Song Shuhang’s ear.","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw that “Little White” was sitting in the desert while hugging his knees. He was holding a branch and drawing in the sand.","“Little White?” Song Shuhang stared at the young Senior White.","“I’m Senior White.” Little White threw away the branch and clapped his hands in satisfaction. “I’ll let you see the rest of the plot after I finish editing it.”","“...” The corner of Song Shuhang’s mouth twitched. “Wait, Senior White, then what about the previous hidden plots 2 and 3?”","“Hm? Oh, I made them up just now,” said White with a nod. “I made them one scene at a time according to your fantasies.”","The longest road I’ve walked was scripted by Senior White."]},{"number":2022,"title":"Chapter 2022 - Different experiences, different visions","paragraphs":["Chapter 2022 Different experiences, different visions","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky, again speechless.","In the meantime, Little White was still crouching nearby, drawing on the sand.","Song Shuhang asked, “Were all the plots just now your doing, Senior White?”","When he thought about it, he felt that part of the plot was especially melodramatic.","Little White said, “Time’s up.”","That line again.","Song Shuhang wondered, “What does that mean?”","“We’ve arrived,” Little White replied.","Song Shuhang felt the world start spinning. The desert was gone, and he found himself back in the giant flying sword.","The illusory reality had been canceled.","He looked at Senior White, who was in the driver’s seat, and saw that he had fallen asleep; the flying sword magical treasure was flying on auto-pilot.","Song Shuhang looked at Senior White’s long hair.","His hair was longer than it was before, but it did not reach his waist yet. It reached his back, but it was still above his waist.","It looks like it will reach his waist soon... Song Shuhang pinched his chin and pondered.","“Eh? Shuhang, did you cut your hair?” asked Sixteen.","“Ahem. Due to certain factors beyond my control, I had to cut my hair.” Song Shuhang turned to Sixteen, Senior Turtle, and Lady Onion, and asked, “By the way, Sixteen, Lady Onion, did you also enter an illusory reality just now?”","Sixteen nodded, her face flushing slightly. Her slender fingers twirled her short hair around.","The bashful Sixteen looked especially beautiful.","If it was not for the fact that his body was made of wood at the moment, Song Shuhang’s heartbeat would have definitely sped up.","But the question was, why did she look so bashful?","Song Shuhang was confused.","Lady Onion giggled and said, “Shuhang, I entered your room and saw you sitting on the bed alone. You were saying random lines such as, ‘I’m by your side’ and ‘hit the brakes, there’s a cliff ahead!’ After that, you proposed to me. However, every time you proposed, you would die inexplicably and become a corpse. After spending some time in the illusory reality, half of the room was filled with your corpses. It was scary at first, but it became fun later on.”","Song Shuhang’s eyes widened.","Lady Onion’s experience in the illusory reality was clearly not the same as his.","What she entered should be Senior White’s second illusory reality, the unfinished one.","“Sixteen, were you also put in that version?” Song Shuhang asked, looking at Sixteen. Sixteen replied softly, “Mm-hm.”","“So Sixteen, in the illusory reality you were in, Song Shuhang also proposed to you?” Lady Onion giggled.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","Next to him, Senior Turtle suddenly gestured with its forelimbs and said in a childish tone, “Disgusting, I don’t know who they were, but they called me Little Tortoise! I’m a sea turtle, not a tortoise, and it’s impossible for me to grow long hair!”","“Huh, what? Little Tortoise?” Song Shuhang was so confused that he did not know what expression to show on his face.","It seemed that Senior White’s second illusory reality had changed. Moreover, if there was a proposal, then it should have been that line, right?","(Little White, when your hair reaches your waist, will you marry me?] But apparently, in Senior White’s second illusory reality, that line was changed.","When he saw Sixteen’s blushing face, Song Shuhang could almost imagine the scene.","I’m afraid that the line must have become something like (Sixteen, when your hair reaches your waist, will you marry me?]","For Lady Onion, the name was replaced with Lady Onion. And for Senior Turtle, it was replaced with “Little Tortoise.”","When he thought of this, Song Shuhang’s liver hurt.","With this being the case, if a man got pulled into Senior White’s illusory reality, wouldn’t Shuhang also propose to them?","For example, if a member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group was pulled into Senior White’s illusory reality, something like this would ensue, (Senior Yellow Mountain, when your hair reaches your waist, will you marry me?]","Heavens!","Song Shuhang patted his cheeks with both of his hands.","He did not want to continue thinking about this matter, or he would probably have nightmares.","Regardless, this second illusory reality of Senior White had become quite terrifying.","Next time, he had to watch out and make it so that Senior White did not use it lightly.","His honor was at stake!","Sister White Dragon’s voice sounded. “Shuhang, was that not the illusory reality you experienced?”.","Song Shuhang let out a long sigh. He nodded and said, “I entered the old version of Senior White’s illusory reality, the desert world, and got trampled by a horse’s hoof twice.”","Sister White Dragon said regretfully, “Huh, so you didn’t encounter the same illusion as us. I thought you had experienced the scene of you confessing to yourself.”","She thought that Song Shuhang had cut his long hair short because his other self proposed to him. Unexpectedly, that was not the case.","The corner of Song Shuhang’s mouth twitched.","Sister White Dragon was very kind in the past, and every move of hers carried the gentleness of an older sibling. Song Shuhang began to miss the original Sister White Dragon.","At that time, just hearing the gentle voice of Sister White Dragon would make people feel reinvigorated.","Sister White Dragon’s little claws stretched out. She covered her mouth and said with a giggle, “I was imagining a scene where a Song Shuhang appears out of nowhere and expresses his love to another Song Shuhang. That would definitely be a very interesting scene to witness.","Here, let me narrate it for you.","In the illusory reality, Song Shuhang sat on his bed and said to the other Song Shuhang, [Shuhang, when your hair reaches your waist, will you marry me?]","Then, the other Song Shuhang, who just so happened to have long hair, flung his hair backward and replied, [Okay.].”","Sixteen hurriedly called out, “Sister White Dragon!”","“What a horrible scene to behold!” said Song Shuhang. But suddenly, he paused.","Sister White Dragon winked at him.","“Haha, haha...” Song Shuhang scratched his head. At this time, he did not know what else he could do other than laugh.","At the same time, he could not help but think of the Su Clan’s annual meeting in December.","Senior Turtle raised its forelimbs to its chin. As an expert in psychology, it had guessed a lot from Song Shuhang’s and Sixteen’s expressions.","Lady Onion’s two little hands lay on its turtle shell; she was also in thought.","At this moment, the black-skinned Soft Feather appeared and shouted loudly, “A mountain, a mountain, a mountain!”","Song Shuhang turned his head in confusion.","“A mountain, a mountain! Senior White!” Song Shuhang shouted. He quickly rushed to Senior White’s side and reached out to pat him.","“Buzz-“","Around Senior White, a protective barrier flashed.","Then, Song Shuhang was sent flying away."]},{"number":2023,"title":"Chapter 2023 - The masks of Silver Trigram","paragraphs":["Chapter 2023 The masks of Silver Trigram","Powerful cultivators were all like this. Even if they were just taking a nap, the spiritual energy in their bodies would automatically protect them.","The power of the rebound was pretty big, and Song Shuhang rolled in the air several times as he was sent flying backward. The impact was so strong that even his head and body got separated.","The black-skinned Soft Feather exclaimed, “We’re going to crash into the mountain!”","Song Shuhang’s head screamed loudly, “Wake up, Senior White!”","“It’s too late!” Senior Turtle’s head and limbs shrank back into its shell. It took Lady Onion inside the shell with it as it shouted loudly, “Everyone, prepare for the impact!”","“Ah, my head!” Song Shuhang shouted as he subconsciously controlled his hair, turning them into fists.","But as soon as he did that, he realized that his hair was short now. The 20 fists he created were so tiny that they looked like toys.","They probably could not even hammer another person’s chest, and they were merely a decoration.","Sixteen trotted over to Song Shuhang, then bent over to pick up his head.","“Boom~”","The giant flying sword crashed into the mountain ahead of them with a deafening boom, inserting itself into the mountain.","Because the giant flying sword had been flying very fast, the impact was very strong.","Song Shuhang’s head was sent flying again, and Sixteen did not manage to catch it in time.","His head was hurled toward an iron wall. Yet, just as his face was about to smash against the wall, a black lotus flower bloomed, sandwiching itself between the iron wall and his face, acting as a buffer.","“Bang!”","However, Song Shuhang’s face smashed through the black lotus, crashing into the iron wall.","“Aahhh~” Song Shuhang screamed in agony. If he had not used his psychic energy and black lotus to reduce his speed, his face would have definitely become swollen from the impact.","Song Shuhang thought to himself, Fortunately, I still had some tricks I could","use...","While he was in thought, a huge turtle shell headed his way.","Song Shuhang’s eyes widened in horror. Senior Turtle!","“Bang!”","Senior Turtle’s shell smashed onto Song Shuhang’s head.","The hopelessness from the incoming impact caused Song Shuhang to close his eyes in despair.","Senior Turtle said, “Huh? The impact was not as bad as I thought.”","“Of course,” Song Shuhang said calmly. “That’s because there was a guy surnamed Song who acted as a buffer for you.”","Senior Turtle stuck out its head. It looked at Song Shuhang, who was crammed in between its shell and the wall, and said with a wry smile, “You must have suffered.”","“I’ll take this one for the team.” Song Shuhang sighed. “Senior Turtle, can you get off of me now? Your turtle shell is hurting my face. Even after using the <Scholarly","Indestructible Body of the Buddha), the (Steel Hands Technique), and the 【 Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) to strengthen my face, this is still uncomfortable.”","“Hahaha.” Senior Turtle stretched out its limbs and jumped away dexterously.","Song Shuhang’s head flew up and returned to his wooden body. “A lot of my branches are broken.”","“I’ll trim them for you.” Sixteen stepped forward and took out a knife, beginning to trim Song Shuhang’s broken branches.","As per old customs, she kept the branches as they might come in handy in the future.","“Senior White, Senior White!” The black-skinned Soft Feather was still calling Senior White’s name.","Senior White raised his head in a daze, and there was some drool at the corners of his","mouth.","The black-skinned Soft Feather turned her head immediately.","Senior White, who had just woken up, had yet to restrain his charm. Coupled with the confused appearance he had after just waking up, the charm he was letting out was especially terrifying-it was better not to look at him directly during times like this. “Oh, we’re here.” Senior White stretched himself and stood up.","Then, he turned his head and looked at Song","Shuhang and the others.","“Hm, Shuhang, the turtle shell tattoo on your face is quite nice.” Senior White nodded and said in praise after a slight pause.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky. “Thank you for the compliment, Senior White.”","It was indeed a unique turtle shell tattoo.","“Let’s go, get off the flying sword. We’ve reached the Beast Realm,” said Senior White. He then opened the hatch of the giant flying sword, stepped into the air, and walked toward the tip of the magical treasure.","Song Shuhang seemed to remember something and quickly said, “Let’s go. We need to keep up with Senior White.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather returned to Song Shuhang’s shadow. Then, the group followed Senior White to the position where the flying sword was inserted into the mountain.","As Song Shuhang had expected, Senior White was crouching before a small hole at this moment. His sleeves were pulled up, and he","was digging.","“Sure enough, Senior White’s luck is doing its work,” Song Shuhang explained. “Whenever this innate ability of Senior White is activated, people around him may be subjected to some misery, but as long as they survive the disaster, they’ll be rewarded for","it.”","“Was it really that bad? I don’t think so,” said Senior Turtle.","“Well, it was miserable for me.” Song Shuhang sighed.","Overall, though, the level of danger was quite modest this time around.","Consequently, the quality of the treasure should not be that high.","“Here it is.” Senior White reached out and","took out a small box.","There were two sealing strips on the small box.","On one of the strips was written: “Golden or silver trigrams, in the time it takes to say a word, I’ve already predicted a billion things!” On the other strip was written: “Divination after divination, I’ve become the Great Immortal Master of myriad divinatory","trigrams!”","Song Shuhang said, “These lines sound awfully familiar...’","He felt like he had encountered these lines somewhere before.","“Mm-mh.” Senior White nodded as well. He reached out and stroked the seals lightly. The","two seals fell off, revealing a pile of face masks inside the box.","“Face masks!” Senior Turtle’s eyes lit up. It was very fond of this kind of treasure. Senior White said slowly, “Masks.”","He reached out and grabbed a note from the small box.","On it was written a sentence in a scribble-like font.","Song Shuhang could not understand what was written on the note.","Senior White read aloud. “There are many forms of life. One face is one life; one life is one joy. Here are 20 different faces given to those who are fated to find this box-Celestial Silver Trigram.”","Sixteen looked at the mask-like objects. “Celestial Silver Trigram?”","Song Shuhang asked, “Could he be Senior Copper Trigram’s master? Someone in the line of the metal trigrams?”","The disciple of Immortal Master Copper","Trigram was named “Immortal Fortune Teller Iron Trigram”, so this Celestial Silver Trigram should be Copper Trigram’s master, and above him should be Golden Trigram... What’s above Golden Trigram, though? Song","Shuhang wondered.","“This should be a mask for disguise.” Senior White turned his head and thought for a moment. He then distributed the masks to","Song Shuhang, Sixteen, the black-skinned Soft Feather, Lady Onion, and Senior Turtle. Senior White said, “I’ll keep the rest for now. If you need them, just ask. If you have no","more use for them after returning to the main","world, give them to Fellow Daoist Copper Trigram.","Song Shuhang held the disguise mask. “Can we change our appearance by putting them","on?”","“That should be the case.” Senior White nodded and said, “It might be useful when we enter Garre Holy Mountain here in the Beast","Realm.”","Song Shuhang and the others stored away the","disguise masks.","Since Senior White said that they might be useful, then they would definitely be of some use when the time came."]},{"number":2024,"title":"Chapter 2024 - Senior Thrice Reckless pinging me","paragraphs":["Chapter 2024 Senior Thrice Reckless pinging me","Lady Onion looked around curiously and asked, “Is this the Beast Realm?”","“Yes, this is indeed the smell of the Beast Realm’s air,” replied Song Shuhang. The air of the Beast Realm was different from Earth, and if one smelled it carefully, they would notice that it smelled a bit like eggs. In some places where the temperature was relatively high, the smell would even match that of scrambled eggs.","When one was hungry, breathing in the Beast Realm’s air was akin to torture.","Song Shuhang took out the metal disc and said, “I’ll contact Fairy Blue Phoenix to confirm where we are. It’s about time for our meeting.”","Senior White replied, “Okay.”","Senior White then moved toward the giant flying sword. Due to the violent collision with the mountain, the tip of the magical treasure was severely damaged.","Sixteen asked, “Senior White, do you need to repair the flying sword?”","“No need for that,” Senior White smiled and said. He stretched out his hand slightly, and the giant flying sword shrank to the size of a metal bar.","Senior White replenished it with spirit stones and summoned it again.","“Fwoosh”","After a wave of sci-fi- like transformations, the small bar became a giant flying sword again.","The shining flying sword looked brand new, and the damage it had suffered before was gone.","This feature was simply too convenient.","With it, every time one summoned the flying sword again, they’d no longer have to worry about minor damages.","In the meantime, Song Shuhang’s metal disc connected with Fairy Blue Phoenix’s.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, have you arrived in the Beast Realm?” Fairy Blue Phoenix sounded expectant.","Song Shuhang said with a laugh, “Yes, Fairy Blue Phoenix. We have arrived at Beast Realm. Where should we meet?”","Fairy Blue Phoenix replied, “I’ll send the coordinates to Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. I’ve prepared a place for you and your friends. I’m just waiting for you to come over.”","She then sent Song Shuhang the coordinates through the metal disc. Both parties could use the metal disc like a navigator. It was very convenient.","Senior White leaned over to take a look, nodded, and said, “It’s not that far. Get on the flying sword. We’ll fly over.”","The giant flying sword was switched on, and it began flying toward the coordinates sent by Fairy Blue Phoenix.","This time, Song Shuhang kept his eyes on Senior White the whole time.","He was afraid of Senior White unknowingly getting distracted and unleashing his illusory reality again.","The flying sword flew steadily, and Senior White did not get distracted this time... probably because Song Shuhang was staring at him the whole time.","Song Shuhang let out a breath of relief.","Behind him, Lady Onion took out a phone and began watching movies online.","Song Shuhang turned his head and asked, “Huh? Lady Onion, how come you have a signal in the Beast Realm?”","Lady Onion was stunned for a moment. She patted the onion sprout above her head and said, “Right, this is the Beast Realm. Why can I surf the Internet?”","Song Shuhang was equally confused.","“I set up a special, mobile WiFi in this flying sword. As long as the spatial passage that connects it to Earth remains stable, the people inside can connect to Earth’s network,” Senior White said without turning his head. “It’s similar to when Song Shuhang had his neck in the ‘living spring’ of his Inner World and the rest of his head in the outside world. The origin of this WiFi is on Earth, but it can reach inside this magical treasure.”","“So that’s the case.” Song Shuhang nodded. This was a good method, but ordinary cultivators who had not mastered any spatial abilities could not accomplish this.","Senior White continued, “Actually, there are quite a number of other worlds in the universe that have stable spatial passages with Earth. People in the world of cultivation also sell packages of interworld mobile WiFi, but those ones transmit a signal through a spatial formation. They aren’t that good, and their price is on the high side.”","“Do we need a password to connect to the WiFi, Senior White?” Song Shuhang took out his phone and tried to connect to the WiFi inside the flying sword.","Senior White replied, “There isn’t a password. It would not really matter as the only way to connect to the WiFi is by being inside this magical treasure.”","Song Shuhang managed to connect to the network.","He habitually opened the Nine Provinces Number One Group, just in time to see that someone had tagged him.","It was Frice Reckless Mad Saber.","“Does Senior Thrice Reckless need me for something?” Song Shuhang had been swiping through the chat logs when he saw that Thrice Reckless Mad Saber had pinged him earlier.","It was about two minutes ago.","Song Shuhang thought to himself, What a coincidence. If I hadn’t connected to the Internet, I wouldn’t have seen Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s message.","In the chat.","Fice Reckless Mad Saber: “@Tyrannical Saber Song One, little friend Shuhang, I remember that you have Fengshou Express Delivery’s contact info. Give it to me so that I can send you a package as well.”","What is Senior Thrice Reckless going to send?","Song Shuhang scrolled up again and found another message from Senior Thrice Reckless.","To be precise, there were several messages.","Fice Reckless Mad Saber: “Tragic... Today was truly tragic. “","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was the first to reply to Thrice Reckless. “What happened?” Fice Reckless Mad Saber: “I finally managed to contact Fairy Skylark. She’s got something to do in the Beast Realm, so we decided to meet up there.”","Cute Doudou: “Screw you! It’s still broad daylight, why do you have to abuse us single dogs like this? How did we annoy you?”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “Don’t interrupt, Doudou. This is perfect food for single dogs. You should be happy and enjoy the feast.”","Fairy Lychee: “...”","Snow Wolf Cave Master: “I almost forgot that Phoenix Slayer used to snatch away Doudou’s food. For example, he was very fond of the special bones that Senior Yellow Mountain bought for Doudou. So, if you’re sending dog food, Phoenix Slayer will also enjoy the meal.”","Cute Doudou: “...”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “Stop changing the topic. I want to know what happened next. @Frice Reckless Mad Saber, then what?”","Fice Reckless Mad Saber: ” Because I arrived a bit early, Fairy Skylark wasn’t there yet, so I just started practicing on a cliff in the Beast Realm. After practicing for a while, I got a little bored, so I set up a high bar on the cliff. Then, I sealed my spiritual energy and began having fun. It was very exciting, and I strongly recommend everyone to try this. When I was holding onto the bar and saw the abyss in front of me, the excitement I felt was simply beyond words!”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “...Why were you practicing at the edge of a cliff?”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “Did your hand accidentally slip and cause you to fly off the cliff?”","“No, my hand did not slip. This is not the first time I’ve played around like this,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber retorted. “Anyway, I was having loads of fun and was in a better state than ever before. I even performed an extremely difficult acrobatic move. But just as I did that, a giant flying sword flew over from nowhere. It plunged into the mountain peak, blowing it away. This caused me to get thrown off the cliff. As a result, I fell into a valley and got seriously injured.”","Seeing this, Song Shuhang was left speechless."]},{"number":2025,"title":"Chapter 2025 - Bring the dragon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2025 Bring the dragon","What a coincidence!","The giant flying sword that Senior Thrice Reckless said came out of nowhere and struck the mountain was probably the same giant flying sword that they were riding right now.","For the sake of excitement, Senior Thrice Reckless sealed all of his spiritual energy when he was playing with the high bar on the cliff. Then when the mountain got hit, he fell off the cliff and got seriously injured.","The hand that Song Shuhang was using to hold the phone stiffened.","No wonder I felt that the danger was not that great despite Senior White’s luck entering into action. Was the majority of the suffering shouldered by Senior Thrice Reckless? he thought to himself.","Speaking of which, how should he explain what happened to Senior Thrice Reckless?","Sixteen asked in puzzlement, “What happened?”","Song Shuhang guessed, “When the giant flying sword hit the mountain, it might have hit... Senior Thrice Reckless.”","Senior White turned his head in confusion. “Eh?”","Sixteen exclaimed, “What?”","“When I connected to the Internet just now, I saw Senior Thrice Reckless’s messages in the group. Senior White, did you not sense Senior Thrice Reckless’ aura earlier?” Song Shuhang did not know whether to laugh or cry.","Senior White replied, “When I woke up, the flying sword had already hit the mountain. Afterward, I only sensed the aura of the treasure, not that of Fellow Daoist Thrice Reckless.”","Sixteen finished reading the messages and said, “Could it be due to Senior Thrice Reckless sealing his spiritual energy?” Sister White Dragon said, “Besides sealing his spiritual energy, he might have also had a magical treasure that was concealing his aura. This is the Beast Realm, and when human cultivators come here, they generally like wearing such magical treasure.”","Lady Onion said, “Then, should we go check how Senior Thrice Reckless is doing?”","Senior White said, “I’ll turn around.”","Song Shuhang said, “I’ll ask Senior Thrice Reckless if his injuries are serious.”","While saying that, he opened the chat interface.","Senior Thrice Reckless had pinged him and asked for Fengshou Express Delivery’s contact info. He said that there was something he wanted to give to the fellow daoists in the group.","He had just fallen off a cliff, yet he still had the mind to give everybody gifts?","Could it be that with the activation of Senior White’s luck, after Senior Thrice Reckless fell off the cliff, he got something good?","After the text was scrolled down, Song Shuhang saw the follow-up messages from Senior Thrice Reckless.","Fice Reckless Mad Saber: “I don’t know which big shot I offended today, but they struck me with a giant flying sword while I was minding my own business. The flying sword was gigantic, and it was extremely fierce. That big shot is really heartless. All of the spiritual energy in my body was sealed when I fell off the cliff, so my injuries are pretty serious.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “Who did you offend?”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “Do you have any healing medicine on you?” Fairy Lychee: “Is Senior Skylark there?”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said, “Fortunately, I had some medicine. @Northern River’s Loose Cultivator, I didn’t offend anyone, and I’ve been behaving well as of late. In order to make sure that my meeting with Fairy Skylark goes smoothly, I printed a hundred pictures of Senior White and gave them as presents to a hundred strangers!”","Seeing this, Song Shuhang silently looked up at the sky.","Senior Thrice Reckless, did you misunderstand the meaning of ‘behaving well’?","Fice Reckless Mad Saber: “Skylark has arrived and is healing me. In addition, when I fell off the cliff, I happened to land on a patch of Millennium Beast Ganoderma. It was thanks to these mushrooms that I managed to survive the fall. The patch of mushrooms was huge, and they were all over the ground. I picked a lot of them. When I return to the main world, I’ll give everyone some as souvenirs.”","That was why Thrice Reckless Mad Saber pinged Song Shuhang.","Afterward, there was a selfie of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber picking Beast Ganoderma.","It looked like he was still quite lively.","After some thought, Song Shuhang replied to Senior Thrice Reckless in the group. “@Frice Reckless Mad Saber, how are your injuries? We’re turning around to check on you.”","Frice Reckless Mad Saber: “? You’re turning around to check on me?”","Tyrannical Saber Song One: “We came to the Beast Realm today as I’m going to be participating in the trials over at Garre Holy Mountain. PS: Senior White was driving us to the Beast Realm, and he used his newly-made giant flying sword that combined science and cultivation technology. It looks like a flying sword on the outside, but it’s more like an airplane on the inside. Also, it has WiFi inside.”","Fice Reckless Mad Saber: “The more I read your message, the more I feel unsettled.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “.”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “","+1′′","Fairy Lychee: “","+2′′","The members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group sent a row of candles in the group chat.","Song Shuhang: “-5 While driving, Senior White fell asleep. After entering the Beast Realm, the flying sword accidentally crashed into a mountain peak and got stuck. What a coincidence.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “@”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber nearly burst into tears.” And here I was wondering why I encountered such a large number of treasures after this catastrophe.”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer said happily, “Fellow Daoist Thrice Reckless, don’t cry. Stand up and roar.”","Song Shuhang: “@Frice Reckless Mad Saber. We’ve turned around. We’re coming to check on you.” “No, don’t!” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber hurriedly said. “Don’t come over. Don’t let Senior White get close to me right now. I’m fine. I’m really fine. Senior Skylark is also by my side. There’s no need to worry about me.”","A sudden strong desire to survive and his intuition as a cultivator told Thrice Reckless that it was better not to let Senior White get close to him for the time being.","Afterward, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber added, “Actually, Skylark and I will be heading to Garre Holy Mountain in a while as well. We can meet again tomorrow or the day after, so let’s just meet there instead.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Are you sure?”","“Yup. I’m in excellent condition now,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said. “By the way, leave me Fengshou Express Delivery’s number. I’ll send you a batch of Millenium Beast Ganoderma later.”","Song Shuhang raised his head and passed on Senior Thrice Reckless’ message to Senior White.","Senior White pondered for some time, then turned the flying sword back around again.","However, before leaving, he took one of the twigs that Sixteen had trimmed off of Song Shuhang’s wooden body. He made the twig into a disposable flying sword and attached four masks to it. Then, he sent the disposable flying sword toward the mountain that they had previously crashed into.","Senior White was very fair when it came to dividing treasures.","Shortly after, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber sent Song Shuhang a private message, “Shuhang, why did Senior White send me these four face masks? I’m so flustered. Is Senior White planning to shave off my face?”","Song Shuhang did not know whether to laugh or cry. He replied, “Senior Thrice Reckless, those masks are just disguise masks.”","“Oh, I see. That’s good then,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied. “By the way, Shuhang, you’re going to Garre Holy Mountain for the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), right? Skylark asked me to tell you that if you are aiming for that inheritance, it would be best for you to bring the ‘dragon’ into the trial.”"]},{"number":2026,"title":"Chapter 2026 - Why are you so proud?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2026 Why are you so proud?","Bring the dragon?","Will the trial ground at Garre Holy Mountain allow me to bring in a dragon? Song Shuhang pinched his chin and thought.","From the name of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), it looked like it was a technique born from the combined power of holy apes and dragons.","However, ever since he began practicing this body-tempering technique, Shuhang had only ever seen apes, and he had never caught the glimpse of a dragon.","Judging from Senior Skylark’s hint, could it be that the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the cultivation technique has something to do with dragons?","Would the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) only be complete after combining it with draconic energy?","While he was in thought, he sent another message to Senior Thrice Reckless. “Besides the ‘dragon’, do I also need to bring in a holy","ape?”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied, “I didn’t expect you to be like this, Shuhang. Are you saying that I’m an ape? Little friend Shuhang, you’ve changed. I won’t talk to you anymore. The price of interworld Internet is very high. I’m going offline.”","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","What? That’s not what I meant! I simply thought that since you told me I take a dragon with me, maybe I would also need a holy ape!","Unfortunately, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s icon on his friend list had already dimmed, and it said that he was offline... He had really disconnected","Song Shuhang was not given any opportunity to explain himself.","He looked up at the sky and let out a long sigh.","“What did Thrice Reckless tell you?” Senior White asked while driving.","Song Shuhang replied, “Senior Thrice Reckless conveyed me a message from Senior Skylark. He said that when I enter Garre Holy Mountain for the trial, it would be best for me to take a ‘dragon’ with me.”","Senior White asked, “A dragon? Oh, the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique)... So you need to take a dragon with you, eh?”","“That should be the case,” said Song Shuhang. He then turned to look at Sixteen and Sister White Dragon.","Speaking of dragons...","Sixteen had awakened the dragon bloodline in her body, and Sister White Dragon was the Ancestral Golden Dragon of the Ancient Heavenly City, a supreme-level existence among dragons.","If the inheritance chapter of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) required the help of a dragon, then it should be enough for him to take them with him. And so, he decided that when he met up with Fairy Blue Phoenix, he would ask her for another slot so that he could bring Sixteen in with him.","Song Shuhang said, “Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds might block the Inner World. So, to be safe, I’ll ask Fairy Blue Phoenix for another slot.”","The trial grounds were ranked as a forbidden area.","For such places, locking the surrounding space was the bare minimum.","Therefore, it was not wise to rely on the Inner World to smuggle people in.","Having taken his decision, Song Shuhang contacted Fairy Blue Phoenix through the metal disc.","As the call connected, Song Shuhang went straight to the topic and asked, “Fairy Blue Phoenix, I wanted to ask you if you had any extra slots for Garre Holy Mountain.”","Fairy Blue Phoenix asked, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, is there another person you want to bring into the holy mountain?” Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “Yes.”","Fairy Blue Phoenix smiled wryly. “I’m sorry, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, but there’s not enough time. The holy mountain will be opening tomorrow, so I have no way to get another slot for you in such a short time.”","If it was still some time before the opening, she might be able to get a few more slots. However, it was really difficult for her to do so with the holy mountain opening so soon.","Senior White gestured to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “Alright. Thanks anyway, Fairy Blue Phoenix. I’ll just figure something out by myself.”","After ending the call with Fairy Blue Phoenix, Song Shuhang looked at Senior White.","Senior White smiled and said, “You can just use my small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword. You can have Sixteen stay in your Inner World and then have her fly to my coordinates when the time comes. After we enter the inheritance area, she should be able to regroup with us. No matter how strong the restrictions inside Garre Holy Mountain are, there is no way they surpass those in the Wielder’s small black room.”","“Great idea!” Song Shuhang gave a thumbs up.","Senior White’s real body is so reliable.","Senior White the almighty!","Senior White smiled slightly. Then, he turned his head and continued driving. “However, it would be better if we could get another slot. After all, if the trial were to require some kind of authentication token, then even if Sixteen gets inside, it would be useless with her not being able to access the trial.”","It was like hacking into a computer just to get stuck because you didn’t have a verified game account to play the game.","Song Shuhang said, “It would be great if another bug with a slot appeared at this time so that we could get an extra slot for Garre Holy Mountain.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword smiled and said, “Are you talking about yourself?”","After all, wasn’t Song Shuhang also a “bug” with a slot to enter the Garre Holy Mountain?","Lady Onion said, “Shuhang has evolved from a bug to a mouse.”","“Oh, you’re right.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword nodded.","While they were talking, Senior White braked. The giant flying sword, which had been flying at constant speed, stopped all of a sudden.","Song Shuhang stabilized himself—having learned from their previous crash, he braced himself for impact.","Sixteen asked, “What happened?”","The black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from Song Shuhang’s shadow and asked, “Are we going to crash into a mountain again?”","Senior White stopped the flying sword and looked into the distance. “There are two groups of people fighting ahead. If we continued on our current trajectory, we would have crashed into them.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Then, are we going to avoid them?”","Senior White said, “I’ll change our path, and just in case, I will strengthen the flying sword.”","Strengthen the flying sword? Senior White can’t be planning on running those people over, right?","Song Shuhang became a little worried.","At this time, ahead of Senior White’s giant flying sword.","There were a total of thirteen cultivators that were in battle. These thirteen were all beast cultivators, and each of them had distinctive racial features and tattoos.","After the two groups of people fought for a while, they put some distance between them.","There were seven people on the left and six people on the right.","They gnashed their teeth as they glared at those from the opposing group.","“ROAR!” The seven people on the left roared in unison.","Above their heads, Holy Ape appeared one after the other. Moreover, there were a lot of them. Each of them had at least 10 Holy Ape Projections—this meant that, among the seven people, the weakest was at the Fifth Stage Realm.","The beast cultivator that led this group was wearing a straw hat, and there were 41 Holy Apes above his head—this meant that his strength had already reached the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm. The beast cultivator with the straw hat sneered and said, “Daoist Turntable, my strength has already reached the level of 41 Holy Apes. Why do you still insist on fighting me?”","On the right side, one of the six beast cultivators of the tiger race who was carrying a turntable on his back sneered back and said, “Why are you so proud of having 41 Holy Apes?”","His body shook, and 42 Holy Ape Projections appeared behind him!"]},{"number":2027,"title":"Chapter 2027 - White’s Hometown","paragraphs":["Chapter 2027 White’s Hometown","“I’m going to show you today that I, Turntable, am stronger than you. Haah!” The tiger cultivator called Turntable swayed his arms backward, flexing his marble-like chest muscles.","On top of his head, the 42 Holy Apes mimicked his actions. Strong spiritual energy erupted from his body, generating shock waves visible to the naked eye.","“You only have one more Holy Ape than I do. In a true fight, it is still not certain who is going to win!” The beast cultivator with the straw hat did not show weakness and swayed his arms as well, displaying his huge chest muscles.","He was bigger than Daoist Turntable, and so were his muscles.","The 41 Holy Apes above his head similarly swayed their arms backward, raised their heads, and puffed out their chests","“HAAAH!” The spiritual energy in the bodies of the seven beast cultivators on the left erupted.","“HAAAH!” The six beast cultivators on the right did the same.","The shock waves resulting from their outbursts of power collided, creating a pillar that reached the clouds. As the waves of air continued to clash, the pillar almost turned into a tornado.","In the distance, the corners of Song Shuhang’s mouth twitched.","What’s going on?","Are they comparing their number of Holy Apes and roars?","“This is in line with the fighting style of the people in the Beast Realm.” Senior Turtle leaned its head against the window, gazing at the beast cultivators in the distance.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair also leaned in front of the window and looked at them. “All of them have practiced the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), which means that they’ve probably come here to participate in the trial taking place on Garre Holy Mountain.”","“Doesn’t this mean that they have the qualifications to enter Garre Holy Mountain?” Lady Onion’s eyes lit up.","Could they grab those qualifications for themselves? While they were talking, the two groups of beast cultivators engaged in a skirmish once again.","As both sides mainly practiced the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), all of them focused on cultivating their bodies. The resulting scene was comparable to a bodybuilder competition.","Senior White said, “Let’s slip away.”","The range of the brawl was growing larger and larger. If things were to continue this way, the giant flying sword would soon get involved in the battle.","Senior White turned the giant flying sword and prepared to fly past the beast cultivators.","But at that moment, a person wearing a helmet who was a part of the brawl was punched in the face by one of their opponents and sent flying into the air, slamming into their flying sword.","After she hit the flying sword, the helmet on the woman’s face fell off, revealing her pretty face.","She had short, shoulder-length hair. Her face was pretty even without makeup, and her eyebrows were well-trimmed.","“Sixteen?” Lady Onion could not help but call out.","This figure that had slammed into the flying sword was very similar to Sixteen in terms of appearance.","Song Shuhang’s heart thumped. Could this be another one of Sixteen’s clones?","He turned to look at Sixteen, who shook her head in reply.","If one looked closely, they would notice that this beast cultivator looked slightly different from Sixteen. For example, her body build was not the same.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “She seems to have passed out.”","Lady Onion asked, “Should we leave her alone?”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “What if she’s a relative of Sixteen?”","“Then, let’s take her away with us.” Senior White decided.","“Kachak-” The hatch of the flying sword opened while Senior White was turning the flying sword around.","The unconscious woman that looked like the grown-up version of Sixteen fell right into the hatch.","The hatch closed, and Senior White nodded with satisfaction, pleased with his skills. “Let’s go.”","“Should we notify her companions?” asked Sixteen. Perhaps because the other party looked quite a bit like her, she felt worried for her.","Senior White thought for a while and agreed. “Okay, Shuhang, send a group voice transmission to both sides. Tell them they can look for us when the fight is over if they want to retrieve the girl.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword added, “But be careful not to scare the little fellow daoists who are brawling. Remember, do not stare at them too much.”","Song Shuhang: “...” Shuhang opened the window, held his head outside the flying sword, and sent a group voice transmission to the beast cultivators.","[All of you, listen up. I’ll be taking one of your companions with me. After you are done fighting, come to Fairy Blue Phoenix if you wish to get her back!]","After saying that, Song Shuhang brought out his three Sage Seals.","The Sage Seals symbolizing Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, and Tyrannical Dragon appeared all at once.","After sending the message, he pulled his head back into the flying sword, placing it back on his neck.","“Let’s go.” Senior White accelerated, driving the flying sword past the two groups of beast cultivators. In a mere few seconds, they had left the battlefield behind.","seco","Before the beast cultivators could even react, the flying sword was gone.","Inside the flying sword.","Lady Onion looked at the unconscious beast cultivator and asked, “Should we give her some treatment?”","Sister White Dragon drilled out of Sixteen, raised her small claws, and used some healing techniques on the beast cultivator.","The beast cultivator opened her eyes slightly, glancing at Sixteen and then at Sister White Dragon.","After smiling strangely, her eyes shut once again.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Did she lose her mind?”","After a quick check, Sister White Dragon said, “It might be because that punch hit her too hard... Anyway, there’s no need to worry as she practices the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique). Coupled with the powerful physique of beast cultivators, she should be fine after some sleep.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested, “How about we have Shuhang use the (Saber-Nurturing Technique) on her?”","“Senior, the Saber-Nurturing Technique is not all-purpose!” reminded Song Shuhang.","In the meantime, the beast cultivators, who were in the middle of a brawl, paused once again.","Both sides had looks of confusion on their faces as they watched the giant flying sword fly into the distance.","None of them understood a single word of what Song Shuhang had said.","After all, not every member of the Beast Realm spoke foreign languages.","Regardless, even if they did not understand his words, they knew who the other party was after seeing the three dazzling Sage Seals that had appeared a few moments ago.","“Ty... Tyrannical Song!” “Ty... Tyrannical Scholar!” “Ty... Tyrannical Dragon!”","Why was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in the Beast Realm?","After being stunned for a while, the beast cultivator with the straw hat stared at Daoist Turntable again. Then, both of their chest muscles bulged, shock waves collided, and their Holy Apes raised their heads and released soundless roars.","And so, the third brawl began.","In the Beast Realm, on Garre Holy Mountain.","Fairy Blue Phoenix greeted Profound Sage Tyrannical Song with a bright smile on her face.","The giant flying sword slowly descended, and Song Shuhang and his party stepped out of it, gazing at the holy mountain. Garre Holy Mountain did not stand alone but was part of a mountain range.","On top of the holy mountain, there was a towering tree that pierced through the clouds in the sky.","Senior White looked at the holy mountain, deep in thought.","“Senior White?” Song Shuhang called out.","“This place... I came here soon after I left my hometown,” Senior White said suddenly. “I feel like it’s not too far from my hometown.”"]},{"number":2028,"title":"Chapter 2028 - Moving on their own","paragraphs":["Chapter 2028 Moving on their own","“Senior White’s hometown?” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","This was because he realized that if he could find Senior White’s hometown, he could get more information on Senior White’s origins!","In the past, the two Senior Whites would always end up avoiding each other due to various factors. That was, of course, until their first official meeting.","After the two Whites met, they shared some of the information they had with each other. One of the things they shared, for example, was that (Wielder of the Will White) had left a backup, and that backup was probably a little sister. Another thing they shared was the production method of the small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword.","Finally, the two Senior Whites tried to shed some light on their identities.","After all, there were too many similarities between the two, both in appearance and character.","Even their dark past was the same, as that line about long hair reaching the waist could provoke both Senior Whites.","However, that incident was remembered differently by the two of them.","From what the main world’s Senior White remembered, he was Little White.","Yet, according to Senior White Two’s memory, he was the young man pulling the white horse","—this part of his memory was shared by him and Wielder of the Will White.","Also, in Senior White Two’s memory, Little White was the embodiment of the desert, and he faced a problem one day. He could no longer maintain his existence and began to disappear. In order to keep Little White alive, White Two chose to refine the desert and fuse with him. He then abandoned his name and became “White.”","The memories of the two Senior Whites clashed.","This was why Song Shuhang, who had just swallowed a Rebirth Pill and was not afraid of death on that fateful day, rolled up his sleeves and with the consent of Senior White, used the secret appraisal technique on him to pry some information out of him.","After doing that, he finally got some useful information:","Senior White was a human.","Senior White was a unique existence in this world, and his origin was out of the ordinary.","He had to look for Senior White’s hometown if he wanted more information.","“Fellow Daoist White’s hometown? Is it near Garre Holy Mountain?” Fairy Blue Phoenix looked at Sage White curiously, now wondering if he was born in the Beast Realm.","Senior White replied, “I’m not quite sure myself. The memory I have of my ‘hometown’ is very vague. It might be because it has been too long, or it might be the aftereffect of some secret technique I used when I was younger.”","Song Shuhang looked at Garre Holy Mountain and smiled slightly. “My intuition tells me that after entering the holy mountain, we might shed some light on this matter.”","Half of Senior White’s true body had escaped from the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, choosing to adventure with him all the way to Garre Holy Mountain.","Senior White Two had a magical stone tablet, which was borrowed by a phoenix from the Beast Realm before he became the Wielder of the Will, that remained in the trial grounds of Garre Holy Mountain.","All paths related to the two Senior Whites led to Garre Holy Mountain.","Song Shuhang said boldly, “Let’s have a good rest and head to Garre Holy Mountain tomorrow!”","With Senior White by his side, he had nothing to fear!","“Then, I shall take everyone to the accommodation I have prepared for you so that you may have a good night’s rest.” Fairy Blue Phoenix blushed slightly before leading the way for Song Shuhang and others.","Song Shuhang was planning on having a good rest and preparing for tomorrow’s trials. However, he did not expect that not long after arriving at the place Fairy Blue Phoenix had arranged for him, he would get busy.","A group of patients who were severely infected by the evil energy of the Netherworld had come to him looking for treatment.","They looked pitiful, and their eyes were filled with an eagerness for salvation. Their hopeful expressions made Song Shuhang unable to have the heart to refuse them.","Although he had lost his actual heart, his wooden heart was also strangely soft.","In any case, despite his fierce reputation, Song Shuhang’s kind nature had not been lost —this was something the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group and the two Senior Whites really liked about him.","This batch of infected patients came prepared. It seemed they had been instructed by some expert before coming over.","As a result, after each patient was cured, Song Shuhang received a large number of forging materials, medicinal seeds, and spirit fruits which he sent into the Inner World.","Due to the rewards, Song Shuhang was finding it even harder to refuse those who came.","He was not one of those stubborn old people who would not accept gifts.","These rewards were exactly what he needed.","The Inner World was so big, and there were too many places where he could plant spirit plants. Having more kinds of plants was good for the development of the Inner World.","In addition, several of his disciples had yet to forge their life-bound magical treasure. As their master, he had to save materials for them and make it so that they could win the race of cultivation at the starting line.","And if he was going to attend the Su Clan’s annual meeting in December, he could not go empty-handed, could he?","Moreover, since he had made a trip to the Beast Realm, he had to bring back some souvenirs for the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. If Senior Thrice Reckless was going to give everyone some souvenirs, he had to bring something back as well.","as","As he was curing the patients, without him noticing, it had gotten quite late.","Another day had passed.","When he was about done treating all of the patients, Song Shuhang’s Inner World had gotten a free meal.","“Shuhang, are you done yet?” At this moment, Sixteen pushed open the door and entered the room. Behind her, a treasured saber was floating in the air. The grown-up version of Sixteen was lying on it.","The adult version of Sixteen had not woken up yet.","Sixteen had just entered the door when thousands of tentacles suddenly flew toward her.","These were the Inner World’s lotus roots.","The roots moved as fast as lightning, and before Sixteen could even react, they had inserted themselves into the body of her grown-up version.","Song Shuhang called out, “No, wait!”","Just now, he was focused on the things inside the Inner World as he was sorting out today’s harvest. As a result, the lotus roots seemed to regard the grown-up version of Sixteen as a patient and automatically pierced her body.","Sixteen was at a loss as to what to say.","Song Shuhang quickly issued an order to the roots, “Come back.”","As soon as he ordered them, the lotus roots rushed back.","Although they had been stopped by Song Shuhang in time, the roots had still absorbed some energy from the grown-up version of Sixteen when they had taken root in her body.","The unconscious woman frowned, groaning in pain.","“Fortunately, I didn’t drain her dry.” Song Shuhang snapped his fingers, and the lotus projection disappeared.","Sister White Dragon emerged from Sixteen’s body and asked curiously, “Your lotus projection roots can extract more than just the evil energy of the Netherworld?”","Song Shuhang nodded. “The Inner World is not a very picky eater.”","“Then, how about you try extracting some of Sixteen’s energy?” Sister White Dragon’s small claws stretched out, and she pinched her chin.","Song Shuhang’s eyes widened, his face confused.","Sister White Dragon said, “Don’t you practice the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique)? Since Skylark reminded you to take a dragon with you, and there is no slot for Sixteen, why don’t you just draw a portion of her energy and take it with you?”","Song Shuhang looked at Sixteen.","Should I stab her with my tentacles...?","After visualizing the scene in his mind for a bit, he realized how horrible it would look..."]},{"number":2029,"title":"Chapter 2029 - Then you must have expired","paragraphs":["Chapter 2029 Then you must have expired","“Sister White Dragon, there’s no need to worry about that.” Song Shuhang coughed lightly and continued, “Even if Sixteen does not have a slot, we can use Senior White’s small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword.”","Sixteen turned to look at Sister White Dragon and said, “And if he’s going to extract energy, shouldn’t he be drawing your energy?”","Song Shuhang nodded in agreement. “Yeah. After all, Sister White Dragon is an actual dragon.”","Sister White Dragon fell silent.","She lowered her head to look at Song Shuhang and stared at him for a good while.","In the end, she shook her head gently and sighed. “Sure enough, it’s very tiring to communicate with a young man like you who has sharpened his sword for ten years but has never actually used it. You’re given opportunities, but you can’t grasp them.”","I was trying to help you, but you want to stab me with your tentacles in return?!","Song Shuhang: “???” He kept on getting the feeling that Sister White Dragon was laughing at him.","“Creak-“","At this time, the door to his room was pushed open again.","“It’s already so late and you two still haven’t gone to sleep. Are you having trouble sleeping?” Senior White came in with an empty water bottle and handed it to Song Shuhang","After taking the empty water bottle, Song Shuhang teleported it to the living spring in his Inner World, filled it with water, and brought it back before handing it to Senior White. “I just finished working.”","Sixteen replied, “I saw that the lights in Shuhang’s room were still on, so I came over to take a look.”","Senior White smiled and said, “Since you haven’t slept yet, allow me to invite you to drink some tea. I bought some scented tea when I was shopping around the Beast Realm earlier. Drinking this tea can enhance the quality of one’s sleep. It’s pretty effective.”","In a small pavilion under the moonlight, Senior White began to boil water and make tea.","Senior Turtle, Lady Onion, Sixteen, and Song Shuhang lined up.","They did not know which ingredients Senior White used for the tea, but they had to admit that it smelled really good.","After having a drink, Shuhang felt his eyelids become heavy.","After another sip, he fell straight asleep.","In his sleep, Song Shuhang dreamed of a familiar scene.","He was in a world of pure white clouds.","Song Shuhang walked among the clouds, feeling as if he was walking on cotton.","In front of him, a figure was leading the way, and he followed.","They walked and walked until the figure suddenly turned around.","It was the Scholarly Sage!","The eyes of the Scholarly Sage lit up like the rising sun. Song Shuhang felt a dull pain in his lower back when he saw the familiar figure of the Sage. He had researched this subject in the past and knew that pregnancy was likely the cause of this back pain.","Anyway, what surprise was the Sage going to give him this time?","After studying spiders and learning to use three eyes with three pupils each, was the Sage going to start studying flies?","Unexpectedly, the Sage did not talk about eyes this time. Instead, he asked, “Do you know what a Nascent Soul is?”","Song Shuhang replied, “I do. During the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, the Lotus Formation births a Nascent Soul.”","“Wrong.” The Sage’s eyes shone, and he rebutted, “Without experiencing pregnancy, how can a Nascent Soul come to be?”","Song Shuhang: “...”","After taking a huge detour, the topic still returned to the Impregnating Gaze...","Some things never change, I guess.","“No pregnancy, no baby. Do you understand?” The Sage’s eyes shone brightly.","F*ck! It’s the Expert’s Appraisal!","Song Shuhang was startled. A chilling sensation filled his soul, and he woke up from his dream.","Song Shuhang murmured to himself, “It’s just a dream. It’s just a dream...”","While he was speaking, he discovered that his consciousness was still floating among the clouds.","Is the dream not over yet?","Could it be a series of dreams? Or a dream within a dream?","Do I have no option to log out of this dream?","Inside the dream.","His consciousness drifted among the clouds until he arrived at a familiar building. It was a building located in his old school, one of the teaching buildings of Wenzhou City’s No. 2 Middle School.","Inside this teaching building, the students listened carefully.","At the podium, there was a teacher who looked both familiar and unfamiliar to him, imparting the knowledge of life to the students.","This included: the process of conception and the birth of a baby.","In the end, everything still went back to pregnancy. Song Shuhang: “...”","Is this nightmare still not over?","A lovely voice said in dissatisfaction, [It’s not over yet? Why do you, a grown-up man, keep dreaming about pregnancy over and over again?!]","Song Shuhang: “???”","Who is that?","Is this person influencing my dreams?","I was wondering why I suddenly started having nightmares related to pregnancy. It turns out that someone was secretly messing with me...","Now that I know that someone is causing trouble, things have become a lot easier to resolve.","Dreams and the subconscious were among Song Shuhang’s strong points.","Even putting aside his innate ability to enter dreams, the virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, the black-skinned Soft Feather, and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword all had the ability to influence and resist abilities related to dreams.","“(True Self Meditation Scripture)!” Song Shuhang took the initiative to open up his “consciousness space”.","Speaking of which, I haven’t paid much attention to my true self recently. I wonder what my true self looks like now. Song Shuhang summoned his true self.","During the period of time in which he hadn’t checked his true self, he had been possessed by the Scholarly Sage, so he must have acquired a bit of scholarly temperament, right?","Soon, his true self emerged inside the consciousness space.","Song Shuhang guessed right this time. His true self had been influenced by the Scholarly Sage.","For example, on the top of his head, there was the typical hat of a Confucian scholar!","Looking further down... there was nothing.","The true self was a reflection of his main body, and there was nothing left of his body at the moment. There was only a head, which remained suspended in the air while giving off a pitch-black metallic luster.","Song Shuhang closed his eyes in pain, unable to keep looking at his true self.","Fairy Creation appeared. She reached out to touch Song Shuhang’s true self, and sang, “ISong- Dumb~ Use your tongue-“.","The virtuous lamia said, “In the sky, one stroke at a time.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather thought for a moment and added, “How about writing down the word miserable?”","“Miserable indeed.” Song Shuhang did not refute them.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Stop messing around. Anyway, who’s the fellow influencing your dreams?”","Despite being an inner demon, it had not sensed the person secretly affecting Song Shuhang’s dreams.","The virtuous lamia, a materialization of light of virtue, had also failed to detect any mental attack.","“Show yourself.” Song Shuhang turned his head.","Inside the consciousness space, a figure was forced out of its hidden state. The figure had shoulder-length hair, a pretty little face, and well-trimmed eyebrows.","It was the grown-up version of Sixteen.","“It’s you!” Song Shuhang’s eyes narrowed.","He did not expect that it was her who had affected his dreams.","The adult Sixteen looked back at Song Shuhang calmly.","“Tell me, who are you? And why were you influencing my dreams?” Song Shuhang flung his hair backward, and the symbol of his scholarly aura, the Confucian hat, was sent flying.","The adult version of Sixteen replied slowly, “I’m... Su Clan’s Six-“.","“She’s lying,” the black-skinned Soft Feather said.","“-teen.” The adult version of Sixteen waited for quite a while before spitting out the last syllable.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword stared at the adult Sixteen and said solemnly, “If you are Sixteen... then you must have expired.”"]},{"number":2030,"title":"Chapter 2030 - I’ll be taking your body!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2030 I’ll be taking your body!","As soon as Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword finished speaking, the atmosphere became awkward.","Song Shuhang stared at the adult Sixteen, and the adult Sixteen stared back at him.","Silence reigned supreme.","The black Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword broke the silence. “Didn’t I hit the nail on the head just now? Why are none of you talking? This is making me feel embarrassed!”","But just as before, the only response that Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword received was silence.","Finally, after a while, the black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Why can the adult Sixteen appear in Senior Song’s mind and affect his dreams?”","Song Shuhang thought for some time, and thought of a possible reason for this.","The virtuous lamia stretched out a small hand and matched his actions, tapping on her forehead as if to say, ‘I got it now!! Song Shuhang said, “Perhaps it’s because I accidentally stabbed this adult version of Sixteen with my lotus roots earlier.”","Shuhang had failed to stop the roots of the lotus projection in time, and they had drawn some energy from the adult Sixteen’s body.","Now, it seemed that that small portion of energy had affected his dreams.","Interesting","The adult Sixteen was only at the Fifth Stage Realm. In the brawl between the two groups of beast cultivators a while back, she had been punched right in the face by an enemy and had been sent slamming into Senior White’s giant flying sword, falling unconscious.","Despite her low realm, that small portion of energy that Song Shuhang had absorbed had been able to sneak past the senses of the virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, the black-skinned Soft Feather, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword, and the Inner World and affect his dreams...","What kind of innate ability is this?","“It looks like I’ll have to inspect you.” Song Shuhang’s long hair turned into a palm, darting toward the adult Sixteen. He was going to use the secret appraisal technique to figure out her origins.","The adult Sixteen did not move. She neither resisted nor tried to dodge, simply staring at Song Shuhang in silence. Before Song Shuhang’s hair reached her, she said, “Are you going to use those tentacles on me","again?”","Song Shuhang’s hair froze.","“These are not tentacles; it’s my hair! Look at it closely, it’s a hand made out of hair. Also, what stabbed into your body previously were not tentacles. Those were the roots of my lotus projection!” Song Shuhang retorted.","“Doesn’t matter. They look like tentacles anyway.” The adult Sixteen sneered.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Sometimes, words could hurt more than a physical attack!","Even if you’re great with words, it won’t stop me from appraising you!","The hand made of hair finally landed on the adult Sixteen’s body.","However, before Song Shuhang could initiate the secret appraisal technique, the adult Sixteen began to dissipate.","Her body first assumed the shape of a dragon.","Afterward, the dragon’s flesh broke down, leaving only bones behind.","Eventually, even the bones began to break down, turning into particles of light.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “Senior Song, you’re so amazing! How did you do that?”","Song Shuhang’s hair-hand froze in midair. “I didn’t do anything. I think the energy I extracted from her got used up.”","After thinking for a while, Song Shuhang said, “Let’s leave this consciousness space. The adult Sixteen’s body is still with Sixteen! I’ll appraise her body directly.”","Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","The sky was no longer dark; it was already the beginning of a new day.","Senior White’s voice sounded, “Good morning, Shuhang.”","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw Senior White holding a teacup, sipping tea.","“The night went by so quickly, eh?” Song Shuhang scratched his head.","After drinking that cup of tea, he had a few dreams and came in contact with the adult Sixteen in his consciousness. In the blink of an eye, it was already dawn.","Senior White smiled slightly. “This tea is pretty effective, isn’t it?”","Song Shuhang asked, “A little too effective if you ask me. By the way, what happened to the adult Sixteen?”","Sister White Dragon approached them. Her tail wrapped around Song Shuhang’s neck, and her little claws pointed toward the sky.","In the sky, there was the thunderous sound of fighting. Song Shuhang looked up and saw that Sixteen and the adult Sixteen were fighting. “We were mistaken earlier,” Sister White Dragon said solemnly. “This Sixteen is also a trial clone. It’s just that her state is very strange, completely different from the past trial clones. Moreover, the trial clones that Sixteen came into contact with previously only formed after she activated the Su Clan’s trial. However, this trial clone is different. She seems to have existed for a long time and has always been living here in the Beast Realm.”","Song Shuhang said, “Could it have something to do with me extracting her power?”","Shuhang then described what had happened in his dreams and how they had been influenced by the adult Sixteen. He also mentioned how the remnant energy of the adult Sixteen eventually turned into dragon bones before dissipating.","“Dragon bones? And she affected your dream?” Sister White Dragon mused.","Senior White put down his teacup and said, “Could she be a mirage dragon?”","The mirage dragons of the world of cultivation were different from those found in Chinese legends. They were not born from the interracial love between a snake and a pheasant but were rather a type of flood dragon.","When it came to illusions and manipulating dreams, mirage dragons were the most well-known among the dragons.","Mirage dragons had a very strange hobbythey like to be served as food and be eaten by other creatures. They generally would not die while being eaten and would parasitize the creature that ate them instead. They would then use their mirage ability to affect the host and create a mirage world where they fulfill the host’s wishes. In this state, the host would secrete a special type of energy that the mirage dragon could use for its practice.","However, if they were to encounter a big shot with a heaven-defying digestive ability, then the mirage dragon would likely die.","It was both an exciting and deadly hobby.","Mirage dragons had once appeared at Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s Immortal Feast. That was how Shuhang knew about them.","“Yeah, reminds me of my colorful waist,” Song Shuhang nodded and said-his colorful waist was related to mirage dragons.","Luckily, when his body was about to be destroyed by the Heavenly Punishment, the blood of the Scholarly Sage transferred all of the important treasures on his body to a safe place, minimizing his loss.","Sister White Dragon looked at the adult Sixteen, who was fighting Sixteen. “Maybe this trial clone used a method we don’t know about and fused with a mirage dragon, becoming whatever it is now.”","Song Shuhang said, “Then, does this mean that my lotus roots extracted the mirage dragon’s power from her body, causing her to reveal her true form?”","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the adult Sixteen.","This adult version of Sixteen is at the Fifth Stage Realm, can Sixteen beat her?","Song Shuhang was a little worried.","However, in Sixteen’s trial battles, no one else could intervene, and even Sister White Dragon could only watch from the sidelines.","All Song Shuhang could do was stare at the adult Sixteen, hoping to put pressure on her.","There were not many practitioners in the universe who could look Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in the eye and keep their calm.","The adult Sixteen felt extremely uncomfortable with Shuhang watching.","She then looked at Sixteen and said slowly, “One move to determine the outcome.”","“Okay.” Sixteen returned her saber to its sheathe while preparing to launch one final attack.","The adult Sixteen took a deep breath.","Then, she suddenly rushed toward Song Shuhang.","To be precise, she rushed toward Song Shuhang’s wooden body.","“Tyrannical Song.” The adult Sixteen smiled slightly. “I’ll be taking your body!”","Song Shuhang asked, “Can I defend myself?”","Fairy Creation drilled out of Song Shuhang’s back and sang, “Without experiencing pregnancy, how can a Nascent Soul come to be? Come on, join me and give birth to a Nascent Soul!”"]},{"number":2031,"title":"Chapter 2031 - 1 I’ll turn around for you!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2031 I’ll turn around for you!","After singing those lines, Fairy Creation put on a ferocious look.","She bared her teeth at the adult Sixteen, trying to intimidate her.","At this moment, Song Shuhang wished he could stuff Fairy Creation back into his body right away.","The adult Sixteen was not scared. She even dared to look Song Shuhang in the eye and came charging at him at incredible speed.","“Tsk.” Song Shuhang’s wooden body crossed its arms, and behind him, the two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure emerged.","At the same time, seven Life Wheels appeared. As long as Song Shuhang’s willed it, he could destroy the adult Sixteen in a single attack.","“Shuhang, don’t attack.” Sister White Dragon patted Song Shuhang with her claw. “Trust Sixteen. She is stronger than you think.”","In the air, Sixteen unsheathed her treasured saber.","The small dragon horns on her head drew lightning, and the air was instantly filled with water vapor that later turned into fog.","The lightning and fog at Sixteen’s feet formed a scene that resembled a cloud-filled landscape painting.","The adult Sixteen was also within the scope of this huge “painting”.","Saber light flashed.","Dozens of saber wounds appeared on the adult Sixteen’s body, and blood splattered everywhere.","The cloud-filled landscape was not just a pretty painting; it was part of Sixteen’s saber technique.","When Sixteen’s saber was unsheathed, the landscape revealed its sharp edges.","“This is Sixteen’s saber path.” Sister White Dragon was like a parent who was watching her child win an award. She said proudly, “This is her unique way of combining art and saber. She is a true genius when it comes to saber techniques.”","The adult Sixteen was in great pain. The serious injuries that her body just suffered instantly rendered her unable to move.","As a result, her body fell down from the sky.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and stopped her.","Using psychic energy, he supported the adult Sixteen’s body, allowing her to smoothly land back on the ground.","While lying on the ground, she turned her head and stared at Song Shuhang’s wooden body, her eyes full of nostalgia.","“Hiss!” Behind Song Shuhang, Fairy Creation continued to bare her teeth.","Sister White Dragon smiled slightly. “It’s over.”","Sixteen descended from the air. “Sister White Dragon, help me.”","“Sure.” Sister White Dragon loosened the grip on Song Shuhang’s neck and returned to Sixteen.","In the next moment, something similar to an illusory reality appeared behind Sixteen. In this space, there was a surging river.","Sister White Dragon’s claw made a grabbing motion, and a crystal coffin emerged from the spirit river.","Witnessing Sixteen’s trial ceremony again, Song Shuhang thought of Yu Jiaojiao, whom he had not seen for a long time, and her seabed cemetery.","If Sixteen took time to develop a Spirit River Crystal Coffin Service, perhaps it could compete with Yu Jiaojiao’s seabed cemetery business!","Sister White Dragon looked at Song Shuhang. “I’m getting the feeling that you’re thinking of something stupid.” When big shots were facing Song Shuhang, they would automatically get a face-reading ability.","Sister White Dragon said, “Stop thinking of nonsense. Move the adult Sixteen over here.”","Song Shuhang raised his finger, and his psychic energy picked up the adult Sixteen’s body, sending her over to Sixteen.","Sixteen stretched out her arms to catch the adult Sixteen and gently placed her inside the crystal coffin, covering it with a lid.","After placing the other Sixteen into the coffin, Sixteen let out a breath of relief.","Sister White Dragon’s voice sounded. “Don’t let your guard down. Before the ceremony is completed, you must remain cautious all the time.”","After saying that, she wrapped around Sixteen, setting up numerous defensive barriers around her.","At the same time, a beam of light shot out from a gap in the crystal coffin, hitting the defenses that Sister White Dragon had set up.","Sixteen said, “I was careless.”","The laser struck the defenses, failing to get past them.","However, the beam of light did not dissipate after its failed attack. Instead, just as if it had just been reflected by a mirror, it bounced toward Song Shuhang!","“Be careful, Shuhang!” Lady Onion shouted from afar.","However, it seemed like it was too late.","That laser landed on Song Shuhang’s body, getting under his skin.","Senior Turtle said slowly, “Since the very beginning, her target was Shuhang.”","After the beam of light penetrated Song Shuhang’s body, it was as if it had come to life; it started to move about in Song Shuhang’s body.","It was trying to take control of the wooden body!","Sixteen looked down at the crystal coffin. Her trial clone was still lying inside, motionless.","“Perhaps my previous guess was wrong,” Sister White Dragon said. “It seems that it was not Sixteen’s trial clone that absorbed a mirage dragon, but a guy with the power of mirage dragons who invaded Sixteen’s trial clone.”","Now, this fellow left the trial clone and found a new target to possess, Song Shuhang’s wooden body in this case.","“She wants to take Shuhang’s body? Then drive her out!” Lady Onion shouted. After all, Song Shuhang’s wooden body was more useful than his head!","This wooden body would bear delicious fruit, and the branches could also be used to make magical treasures.","If, in the future, the poor Song Shuhang could not pay her wages, she could sell the fruits and branches of his wooden body to cover for her wages!","Due to this, Lady Onion did not want to lose the wooden body.","“Don’t worry.” Senior Turtle chuckled.","“Shuhang’s body is not so easy to take over.” Sister White Dragon laughed at the same time.","Senior White held his teacup and took a nice sip.","Then, a big tree beside him shook, causing loud rustling sounds.","“Adult Sixteen, your performance was excellent. Let me turn around and face you!” Song Shuhang’s voice sounded, and the big tree turned around, revealing Song Shuhang’s face.","The beam of light that was trying to take over the body of “Song Shuhang” froze. If Song Shuhang was beside Sage White, then whose body was it trying to take over?","“Do you want to know what happened?” The corners of Song Shuhang’s mouth curled upward. He raised his right hand and made a hand seal and said, “Then allow me to clear your doubts.”","“Fwoosh~”","The “Song Shuhang” that had been invaded by the adult Sixteen turned into a flame.","“The (Flame Substituting Technique) is a very useful technique. As Senior Eternal Fire guessed, it does suit me well. After taking some time to study it, I managed to reach the beginner level.” Song Shuhang crossed his arms behind his back and said, “Now, it’s time for you to start your performance, adult Sixteen.”","When a beam of light that could take control of another creature’s body invaded someone’s substitute, what would happen?","If the person who created the substitute canceled the magical technique, what would happen to the beam of light?"]},{"number":2032,"title":"Chapter 2032 - What if her companions come looking for her?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2032 What if her companions come looking for her?","Song Shuhang crossed his arms over his chest, happily looking at his Flame Substitute and the light which occupied it.","Behind him, Fairy Creation imitated his movements, also crossing her arms as she towered over Shuhang.","Behind Fairy Creation was the virtuous lamia. Her arms were also crossed over her chest as she towered over Fairy Creation.","Behind them was the cute newbie, the black-skinned Soft Feather. Similar to her two seniors, the black-skinned Soft Feather had her arms crossed as she towered above the virtuous lamia.","Arranged like a ladder, they all simultaneously stared at the adult Sixteen.","Sixteen could no longer bear to look at Song Shuhang, and she covered her face with her hands.","“Shuhang is really hopeless.” Sister White Dragon sighed softly.","Song Shuhang, who was now at the Sixth Stage Realm, had good ears and clearly heard Sister White Dragon’s words.","You can’t blame me for this! I just crossed my arms!","“The adult Sixteen wants to escape from the Flame Substitute!” cried Lady Onion from Senior Turtle’s back.","Inside the Flame Substitute, the living light began to twist around, seemingly trying to escape from it.","But while it was easy to get in, the same could not be said for leaving.","Earlier, Song Shuhang’s Flame Substitute had let the light inside on purpose.","After two breaths of time, Song Shuhang’s Flame Substitute began changing, assuming a human form.","The Flame Substitute’s form had originally been modeled after Song Shuhang, but after being invaded by the adult Sixteen, its appearance began to change.","During the transformation, the Flame Substitute’s chest bulged slightly, its waist narrowed, and its overall frame shrunk. It was like a clay figurine taking shape.","After a few seconds, the Flame Substitute changed into the adult Sixteen’s appearance. In addition to having a more mature figure, the dragon horns on her head were different from Sixteen’s. On her head was a single small horn of a mirage dragon, which was different in shape and model from Sixteen’s.","Sister White Dragon said, “Interesting, it actually kept Sixteen’s appearance.”","With trembling hands, the adult Sixteen looked at Song Shuhang. It looked as if flames were shooting out from her eyes.","“Congratulations, Adult Sixteen.” Song Shuhang smiled slightly and said, “You took over my Flame Substitute. What do you think about it?”","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and readied it so that he could snap his fingers at any moment. “In addition, let me remind you of one thing. Although this Flame Substitute is under your control, it is still the result of a magical technique I used, and that has not changed. As long as I snap my fingers, this Flame Substitute will disappear.”","“The moment I,” Fairy Creation sang.","“Snap my fingers,” the virtuous lamia continued.","“You disappear!” The black-skinned Soft Feather added.","Fairy Creation raised her head, stared at the black-skinned Soft Feather, and sang, “You~ Are~ Gone!”","‘You disappear’ contained only two words instead of three!","The black-skinned Soft Feather stuck out her tongue.","Meanwhile, the adult Sixteen, who had taken over the Flame Substitute, grit her teeth.","That beam of light was still roaming inside her body. It now wanted to get out, but every time it tried to do so, it was suppressed and forced to stay inside.","Senior White took a sip of his tea and said, “It seems that her ‘invasion’ ability cannot be used repeatedly in quick succession.”","Senior Turtle said, “If this ‘invasion’ ability could be used continuously, it would be quite horrific.”","orners","“Now, begin your performance.” The corners of Song Shuhang’s mouth curled upward. “Tell me about you. Why were you parasitizing Sixteen’s trial clone, and why were you looking at my wooden body with such greed? As long as your performance is good, I can light you up.”","The adult Sixteen opened her mouth, letting out a whooshing sound.","The structure of the Flame Substitute was different from that of a living creature, and special skills were required to allow it to reproduce proper speech.","The adult Sixteen gritted her teeth and stretched out her hands, grabbing the mirage dragon horn on her head.","“Yaaa-” she yelled. Afterward, she pulled at the horn with all of her might.","This move of hers utterly shocked Song Shuhang. He felt pain just from watching what she was doing.","After forcefully pulling out the horn, the adult Sixteen used it to stab her body, creating a gaping hole in her body of flames.","Senior White held the teacup and said, “It seems she wants to escape from your Flame Substitute through death. Perhaps she can free herself after its host dies.”","Song Shuhang sighed","Then, he snapped his fingers.","“Snap!”","“Snap- Snap- Snap-“","Above his head, the three fairies snapped their fingers in unison.","Song Shuhang: “...”","If these three don’t go back into my body, my style is going to be trash forever. In front of them, the Flame Substitute disappeared.","Even if it had been taken over, the essence of the Flame Substitute had not changed. Whether it existed or not was still under Song Shuhang’s control.","Lady Onion asked, “Is the light still alive?” Senior Turtle said slowly, “It looks like it disappeared along with Song Shuhang’s Flame Substitute.”","Sister White Dragon looked around and said, “This time, it’s really over.”","Sixteen nodded and pushed the crystal coffin into the river behind her.","In the next moment, the Spirit River Realm closed. The ceremonial ritual was over.","Sixteen stretched herself. She got stronger again when the ceremony was completed.","She felt a dreamlike energy inside her, the power of the mirage dragon.","Immediately afterward, Sixteen looked down at her chest, and a joyful expression appeared on her face. It might be difficult to see with the naked eye, but cultivators were very much aware of any changes to their bodies.","As a result, Sixteen felt more confident about her future.","Sister White Dragon patted Sixteen gently.","At this time, Song Shuhang said, “Do you guys think the adult Sixteen had a slot to enter Garre Holy Mountain?”","Also, what if her companions came looking for her?","They could not just give them Sixteen in the adult Sixteen’s place, right?","In terms of appearance, Sixteen was still different from the adult Sixteen, and the difference in size was very obvious.","“Speaking of which, Senior Song,” the black-skinned Soft Feather said while towering over Shuhang, “how about you try creating another Flame Substitute?”","“What for?” asked Song Shuhang while stretching out his hand to make a hand seal. In the next moment, a new Flame Substitute was created.","Among the flames, a figure with a slender waist and a slightly bulging chest appeared in front of everyone.","The black-skinned Soft Feather giggled. “It’s exactly as I guessed.”","The new Flame Substitute and Song Shuhang stared at each other.","Song Shuhang: “...”"]},{"number":2033,"title":"Chapter 2033 - Sixteen, how did you become so small?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2033 Sixteen, how did you become so small?","“This makes no sense.” Song Shuhang scratched his head.","The Flame Substitute was different from the light of virtue and the steel manifestation. It was purely a substitution technique, and after such a technique was used and canceled, the substitute generated from the previous instance of the technique should not reappear again.","It was the same as a fireball.","After a mage used a fireball, the ball of fire could be seized by an enemy and changed forcefully. However, the fireball changing should not change how the original technique worked in any way.","So what in the world was going on here?","After the adult Sixteen reappeared, her first reaction was to stretch out her hand and pull out her mirage horn.","Afterward, she tightly held onto it and stabbed it into her own body. She had no intention of living, and her mind was dead-set on killing herself.","“It’s ruined,” Song Shuhang murmured to himself.","“What’s ruined?” Lady Onion looked at Song Shuhang in puzzlement.","Senior White took a sip of tea and explained, “His Flame Substitution Technique.”","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","The (Flame Substitution Technique) was a life-saving trump card that could perfectly replicate the appearance of the main body and die in its place.","But now, once his Flame Substitute was summoned, it would immediately take on the appearance of the adult Sixteen. Because of this, it was much less useful. At the very least, it could no longer be used to deceive big shots into attacking the substitute instead of his main body.","As if that wasn’t enough, the adult Sixteen would immediately pull out her mirage horn and stab herself to death after the technique was used.","In the future, whenever Song Shuhang used the (Flame Substitution Technique) while fighting an enemy, the adult Sixteen, who had taken over his Flame Substitute, would keep trying to pull out her horn and kill herself. What use did he have for that?","“Yaaaa!” Finally, the Flame Substitute exploded, and the adult Sixteen let out a joyful cry.","According to her previous experience, as soon as the host died, she would break free.","After the Flame Substitute exploded, it simply disappeared.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Senior Song, how about using the technique","again?”","Song Shuhang made a hand seal and cast the technique again.","A new Flame Substitute appeared, still taking on the adult Sixteen’s appearance, which meant that the (Flame Substitution Technique) had yet to return to normality. The flaming adult Sixteen stared at Song Shuhang again.","She stretched out her hand and prepared to pull out her mirage horn.","“Stop struggling,” Song Shuhang said. “It doesn’t matter how many times you die. The only thing that happens after you die is the Flame Substitute dissipating. If I create a new one, it will still be you.”","“Yaaaa!” The adult Sixteen’s voice was full of unwillingness.","Song Shuhang sighed and said, “Citing a famous saying of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, if you seek death, then you will die! If you don’t seek death, then you will not die!”","Senior White asked, “Who said that?”","Song Shuhang replied, “It’s something everyone says to Senior Thrice Reckless and Immortal Master Copper Trigram.” Senior White nodded and said to Song Shuhang, “If you don’t seek death, you won’t die.”","The black Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword also said to Song Shuhang, “If you seek death, you will die.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Why are you saying that to me?”","Senior White looked at him and smiled warmly.","This smile alone was enough to protect people for a thousand years.","Inside a small pavilion.","Senior White changed the tea leaves and brewed another jug of tea for everyone.","In the meantime, Song Shuhang began using his psychic energy to smooth out the potholes in the ground left behind from the battle between the adult Sixteen and Sixteen.","At this time, Fairy Blue Phoenix’s voice came from outside the residence, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you resting?” Lady Onion said, “Fairy Blue Phoenix is here.”","Song Shuhang replied, “We’re all awake, Fairy. Please feel free to come in.”","Fairy Blue Phoenix said, “I’ve brought a few more guests who want to meet Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.”","More patients?","Song Shuhang said, “Alright, come in.”","He honestly had no qualms about it. It was actually quite good timing. With another wave of evil energy of the Netherworld coming to his doors right before the trial at Garre Holy Mountain, his Inner World might upgrade by the time the trial began.","After a while, Fairy Blue Phoenix rushed over with five beast cultivators.","Other than the leader of the five beast cultivators, the other four looked very uneasy. After all, the man they were going to be meeting was the most terrifying existence in the past thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song","“Huh? Not patients?” Lady Onion said with disappointment in her tone-more patients meant more treasures. Although the treasures were not spirit stones and could not be used to pay her wages, they could still be sold in exchange for things that could be used to pay her!","When Song Shuhang saw the five beast cultivators, he quickly got rid of the Flame Substitute.","The five beast cultivators who had come were the companions of the adult Sixteen.","The one leading the group of five was Daoist Turntable, who had 42 Holy Apes.","The group of five followed closely behind Fairy Blue Phoenix. At the furthest back was a female beast cultivator who was hugging her stomach tightly. She suffered from a disease that had only recently come into existence, a disease that went by the name of Tyrannical Song Speech Sequela and had spread across the universe wildly. While this disease did not affect one’s daily life, hearing the name of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, seeing pictures or images of him, or hearing his voice, could lead to a relapse.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, Fellow Daoist Sage White, you should get ready. Garre Holy Mountain will be opening soon. Let me bring you over.” While saying that, Fairy Blue Phoenix took out a small seal, and motioned for Song Shuhang and Senior White to stretch their hands out.","Senior White and Song Shuhang held out their arms toward her.","Fairy Blue Phoenix first stamped the seal on Senior White’s wrist. The seal stamp shone faintly, and then disappeared.","Then, she faced Song Shuhang and got ready to stamp down on his arm.","“Wait a minute, Fairy Blue Phoenix.” Song Shuhang suddenly thought of something and said, “My body below the neck is not my real body. So, if the seal were to be stamped on my arm, when we enter Garre Holy Mountain, won’t my head be left out while the rest of my body enters?”","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s concerns are reasonable.” Fairy Blue Phoenix nodded. After saying that, she raised her hand and stamped the seal on Song Shuhang’s face.","It was important not to stamp the other party’s forehead. This was because there were many practitioners across the universe who possessed things like a third eye, or simply used their foreheads to release all kinds of attacks.","If that were the case, the effect of the seal might be affected.","This was why Fairy Blue Phoenix placed the stamp on Song Shuhang’s face.","After stamping the seal onto his face, Fairy Blue Phoenix took a few steps back, her cheeks flushed red.","Lady Onion blinked. “Song ‘Face Tattoo’ Shuhang.”","Song Shuhang retorted, “It’s a seal, not a face tattoo!”","Afterward, he looked at the tiger cultivator Daoist Turntable.","Daoist Turntable stepped forward and calmly said, “Senior Tyrannical Song, we have come to take back our companion as we agreed previously.”","After saying that, he looked at Sixteen.","“Huh? Sixteen, how did you become so small?” Daoist Turntable wondered, “Especially your... No, wait. Your whole body got smaller.”","Sixteen: “...”","Fairy Blue Phoenix was a little confused. The fairy beside Tyrannical Song is actually Daoist Turntable’s companion?"]},{"number":2034,"title":"Chapter 2034 - Human head and dragon body, dragon head and human body","paragraphs":["Chapter 2034 Human head and dragon body, dragon head and human body","Fairy Blue Phoenix had met Sixteen back when she had gone to Earth. Because of that, she found herself confused as to when Sixteen had become Daoist Turntable’s companion.","Sister White Dragon stretched out her claw and patted Sixteen’s head lightly, as if comforting a child.","Behind Daoist Turntable, a young beast cultivator kicked his calf and said, “Master, don’t make trouble.”","“Senior Tyrannical Song, thank you for taking care of our injured companion,” said Daoist Turntable with a cough. He stretched out his hand and pushed forward a gift box, extending it toward Song Shuhang.","Those of the Beast Realm were especially diligent when it came to gift-giving.","Daoist Turntable continued, “As agreed, we’ve come over to take Sixteen back.”","Song Shuhang smiled slightly, pushed the gift back, and said, “She is not your Sixteen, but my Sixteen.”","He was planning on clarifying the matter regarding the adult Sixteen to these cultivators from the Beast Realm.","“Huh?” Daoist Turntable was bewildered. In just one night, Sixteen has become Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s?","Is the charm of the first Sage in a thousand years that terrifying?","While he was in thought, the corner of his eyes suddenly caught sight of the picturesque Sage White sitting in the pavilion.","Daoist Turntable frowned. If it were Sage White’s charm, I can understand how Sixteen might have fallen in love overnight. However, I don’t get how that would happen for Senior Tyrannical Song...","Unless...","Sixteen secretly fell in love with Sage White, but wanted to take a detour, so she confessed to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in order to stay by Sage White’s side!","Daoist Turntable’s mind was filled with all kinds of thoughts, and he instantly thought up the plot of a bitter love drama.","Just as he was unable to extricate himself from his thoughts, the trembling beast cultivator behind him mustered up the courage to say, “Se... Senior Tyrannical Song, even if everyone has already become pregnant with your child, you can’t use that matter to force Little Sister Sixteen to become your daoist companion. Although Little Sister Sixteen once said that she would only get together with a single daoist companion in her life, that does not mean that you can become her daoist companion just because of what you did during your speech!”","Song Shuhang retorted, “Fairy, don’t speak such misleading words. That’s called experiencing the process of pregnancy, and it’s a part of the ‘maternal love chapter’ of the Scholarly Sage’s teaching. It’s a very serious subject.”","Daoist Turntable coughed lightly and looked at Sixteen. “Sixteen, what’s going on here?”","He and the beast cultivators behind him all looked at Sixteen.","Sixteen pinched her chin and fell into thought.","Song Shuhang found himself quite curiousthere was a rather large difference in size and temperament between the adult Sixteen and Sixteen, yet Daoist Turntable and his companions seemed to have decided that they were one and the same.","From beginning to end, they did not seem to have thought of the possibility that the Sixteen in front of them was not their companion.","[That’s because the ceremony has been completed.] Sister White Dragon used the secret sound transmission technique to transmit her voice to Song Shuhang’s ears. (After the ceremony was completed, the adult Sixteen became Sixteen. Even some of the adult Sixteen’s memories can be viewed by Sixteen. Therefore, it is normal for these beast cultivators to regard Sixteen as their companion.]","Sixteen once said to Song Shuhang that even if the trial fails, “she” would not disappear, and this was the very principle she was referring to.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky. I didn’t even ask it out loud and just thought about it in my mind. Despite that, Sister White Dragon answered my inner doubts!","Sixteen said to Daoist Turntable, “I’ll go with you to participate in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial.”","The adult Sixteen had practiced a formation with these five beast cultivators to pass the outer trials of Garre Holy Mountain. Without the adult Sixteen, the formation would be missing a very important piece, which would be disastrous for Daoist Turntable and his party.","As such, she decided to take the place of the adult Sixteen and sever the karma in this way.","Furthermore, she needed a slot that would allow her to enter Garre Holy Mountain.","After passing the outer trials of Garre Holy Mountain, she could join Song Shuhang.","“Senior White, can you do me a favor?” Sixteen looked at Senior White.","Senior White nodded and asked, “What is it?”","“Can you cut Sister White Dragon and me into two halves? Like what you did to yourself?” Sixteen asked.","Sister White Dragon almost fainted from fright.","“No problem,” replied Senior White.","Sixteen giggled. “Thank you, Senior White.”","She lifted her clothes, revealing her slender waist.","Senior White summoned out a box-shaped magical treasure and moved it toward her waist.","Under everyone’s terrified gazes, Sixteen’s body was cut apart.","However, there was no blood coming out of the incision, and Sixteen was still alive and well.","Song Shuhang took a step back and gently embraced Sixteen’s upper body.","At the same time, Senior White summoned the magical treasure and gestured at Sister White Dragon.","Sister White Dragon asked, “Can we not?”","Everyone fell silent.","Sister White Dragon sighed. “Alright. Just be careful when you cut me. My waist is right here. Don’t make a mistake.”","“Chak-“","Sister White Dragon’s body was also cut into two halves.","Song Shuhang said, “I’m surprised that this magical treasure worked on Sister White Dragon.”","Sister White Dragon’s state was similar to the virtuous lamia, and she had a body made of pure energy. It was thus quite surprising that her body could be cut in half in such a way.","Following that, under Senior White’s machinations, the half-bodies of Sixteen and Sister White Dragon were exchanged.","On one side was a combination of Sixteen’s upper body and Sister White Dragon’s lower body.","On the other side was a combination of Sister White Dragon’s upper body and Sixteen’s lower body. The body with Sixteen’s upper body waved to Song Shuhang and co. and left with Daoist Turntable and the several other beast cultivators.","As for the body with Sister White Dragon’s upper body, she stood beside Song Shuhang and patted his shoulder with her hand before saying softly, “Shuhang, do I look like the ‘Dragon King of the Four Seas’ from that movie now, the kind with a dragon head and a human body?”","Song Shuhang shook his head. “In that movie, only the head of the Dragon King of the Four Seas was a dragon head. But as for you, Sister White Dragon, your whole upper body is that of a dragon. By the way, can’t you assume a human appearance?”","“I can’t at the moment. But as Sixteen’s cultivation realm improves in the future, I’ll be able to transform like Fairy @#%x,” Sister White Dragon replied. “However, I would still prefer to remain as a dragon.”","Song Shuhang glanced at himself, at Senior White, and at Sixteen + Sister White Dragon’s fusion.","He felt that the three of them were really a great combination.","Eventually, Fairy Blue Phoenix brought Song Shuhang and Senior White to the holy mountain.","Both Senior Turtle and Lady Onion had been sent into the Inner World by Song Shuhang.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, Fellow Daoist Sage White, are you ready?” Fairy Blue Phoenix asked. “The trial ground is about to","open.”","While she was speaking, a golden moon appeared in the sky, right above the holy mountain.","Rays of golden moonlight shone down, and roads were formed by runes that had emerged out of thin air.","“All those who have a slot for the trial can embark on these golden roads and move onward.” Fairy Blue Phoenix blushed slightly as she continued, “I wish Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song success.”"]},{"number":2035,"title":"Chapter 2035 - Hugging Senior White’s thigh","paragraphs":["Chapter 2035 Hugging Senior White’s thigh","Song Shuhang cupped his fists and said, “Thanks for your kind words, Fairy Blue Phoenix.”","However, for some reason, her wishing him success felt like it was raising a red flag...","The roads of golden runes reached the ground one by one. At last, six runic roads appeared in front of Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Song Shuhang asked, “Senior White, which way do we go?”","There were several roads ahead. If it were another cultivator, they would probably worry themself to death when faced with so many choices.","Fortunately, Shuhang had Senior White by his side.","He could simply let Senior White choose and then follow him.","With Senior White’s luck, he had nothing to worry about.","“This one.” Senior White made his choice. Then, he stepped onto one of the runic roads, getting transported to Garre Holy Mountain as if he had taken an escalator.","Song Shuhang jumped onto the same road.","The combination of Sister White Dragon and Sixteen followed closely behind them; she had also successfully embarked on the trial roads.","“It seems that even after Sixteen was cut in half, she’s still considered as one person.” Song Shuhang turned his head to look at Sister White Dragon and nodded.","It was equivalent to them having gained an extra fighter for free.","The runic roads transported Senior White, Song Shuhang, and Sister White Dragon into the depths of Garre Holy Mountain.","Along the way, Song Shuhang saw that on the trial roads not too far away from theirs, the other practitioners would, from time to time, tremble, scream in pain, or fall to their knees and break down crying.","It seemed that as soon as they embarked on the runic roads, the trial had begun.","What was the best way to test out the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique)?","Of course, it was taking attacks!","A full-on attack on a practitioner’s body would effectively test their mastery of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique).","Therefore, the beast cultivators on the runic roads were suffering various attacks.","Lightning, fire, humongous pressure, floods, hammers, slashes, etc.","These attacks could not be seen by outsiders. Only those who were taking the trial and standing on the runic roads could see and experience these events.","“Fortunately, I brought Senior White with me,” said Song Shuhang with lingering fear.","So far, the runic road that he and Senior White had taken did not make them experience any disaster.","“Huh? I thought that you would be disappointed. After all, aren’t you Song ‘I Enjoy Pain, Pain Makes Me Stronger’ Shuhang?” The black Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said. Its state was very special, and just like the black-skinned Soft Feather, it could sneak into Song Shuhang’s shadow and join the trial.","Song Shuhang: “...”","I just have a strong tolerance for pain, but that does not mean that I enjoy pain. Don’t put me together with masochists!","The black Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said seriously, “Shuhang, you have three body-tempering techniques, so there’s no need to shy away from the challenge. I recommend that you jump onto the road next to us and enjoy the trial to its fullest and strengthen yourself.”","Song Shuhang reached out and used the (Saber-Nurturing Technique) on Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword ten times.","After the second instance of the (Saber-Nurturing Technique), Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword had already turned quiet.","Senior White turned around and said, “We’re here.”","The runic road had directly transported everyone to the bottom of the giant tree growing on Garre Holy Mountain.","Senior White stepped off of the runic road, and as soon as he took his feet off of the runic road...","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","Right by Song Shuhang’s ears, the sound of explosions echoed.","The sound of the explosions was mixed with the sound of thunder and the crackling fire.","At the same time, Shuhang felt as if a humongous weight had been placed on the top of his head.","As soon as the walking lucky charm, Senior White, left the runic road, the trials erupted in all their strength.","“Aaahh!” Song Shuhang screamed again and again.","If he were to face the trials one by one, he would not be afraid of them in the slightest. The pain caused by each one separately was no different from a drizzle to him.","However, when they all erupted at the same time, the sheer number caused a great change in intensity, and the pain they inflicted reached a terrifying level.","Song Shuhang could not help but let out his classic four-toned scream.","The attacks did not last long as Song Shuhang was already close to the end of the runic road by the time Senior White stepped off of it.","As he finished screaming, he reached the end.","Senior White turned around and used a healing technique on him while sharing his analysis. “It seems that the pain inflicted by the trial road is mental. There are no signs of injury on your body.”","“That was for the best. My mental pain tolerance is over ten times higher than my physical pain tolerance.” Song Shuhang then turned to look at Sister White Dragon.","Were Sister White Dragon and Sixteen going to be okay?","On the runic road, Sister White Dragon scratched her chin with her little claw and said, “Lightning damage? It’s so weak.”","She was a member of the dragon race, and her resistance to lightning damage was very strong","The weak lightning attacks used by the trial road were not even enough to scratch an itch for her.","“I’m afraid that the majority of the road’s energy was used up on Shuhang’s body,” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said. In preparation for the possibility of the Inner World getting blocked as they entered the trial area, she had transplanted a strand of her hair on top of Song Shuhang’s head.","“So that was the case. No wonder the attack felt so weak.” Sister White Dragon used a healing technique on Shuhang. “You’ve worked hard, little friend Shuhang.”","Song Shuhang took a breath and patted his chest.","In the meantime, the people on the other roads were also delivered to the bottom of the giant tree.","Almost all of the practitioners had passed the test of the runic roads.","After all, this was just an appetizer.","Those who had been deemed qualified to participate in the trial had considerable strength, so it was normal for them to be able to make their way through the runic roads as long as they tried hard enough.","Other than a few particularly unlucky guys, who fell into a coma due to unforeseen circumstances, the rest managed to make it through the runic roads.","After everyone arrived at the feet of the giant tree, rays of golden moonlight came down again.","When he was bathed in the golden moonlight, Song Shuhang felt his skin become thicker. It seemed all those who practiced the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) would benefit from the moonlight.","The moonlight bath lasted for about ten breaths of time.","After that, the giant tree opened.","Inside the giant tree, one by one, cabins came into view.","The size of the cabins varied. There were single-person models, two-person models, and some that looked like they were made for five or six people.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Pavilion Master Chu speculated, “It looks like we’re going to be sitting in these cabins.”","“As usual, Senior White, please choose a cabin,” said Song Shuhang. This time, he was going to hug Senior White’s thigh tightly. If Senior White left the cabin, he would immediately follow him!","At the same time, he turned to inspect the crowd. But as there were too many beast cultivators, he could not find Sixteen."]},{"number":2036,"title":"Chapter 2036 - Malice from the world","paragraphs":["Chapter 2036 Malice from the world","Song Shuhang asked, “Sister White Dragon, can you sense Sixteen’s position?”","“I’ll try.” Sister White Dragon closed her eyes and searched for a while. Then, she shook her head and said, “Garre Holy Mountain is worthy of its fame. I can only vaguely perceive the aura of my and Sixteen’s other half. When I try to pinpoint them, the specific coordinates seem as if they’re changing every moment.”","In Sister White Dragon’s field of vision, Garre Holy Mountain was composed of countless small spaces, and the position of these small spaces was ever-changing.","Because the frequency at which the spaces were moving was too fast, she would lose track of Sixteen right after locking onto her aura.","“It is indeed an interesting place,” Senior White praised.","Senior White’s interest was piqued.","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “Senior White, which cabin should we choose?”","A place that could attract Senior White’s interest was a place where crisis coexisted with opportunity. Song Shuhang had thus decided to hold onto Senior White’s thigh tightly. He would make sure that the distance between him and Senior White would not exceed one meter.","“Hm, let’s just go with that one.” Senior White stretched out his hand and casually pointed to a cabin.","“Then that one it is. Sister White Dragon, let’s....” All of a sudden, Song Shuhang found himself at a loss for words. This was because the cabin that Senior White had randomly pointed at was a small, single-person cabin.","And it was a smaller model among single-person cabins. It looked like only someone like Sixteen could fit inside it. Song Shuhang’s wooden body was huge, so he would not be able to squeeze into the cabin with Senior White.","If Senior White went into that cabin, what were he and Sister White Dragon supposed to do?","If they were to sit in separate cabins, then the distance between him and Senior White would definitely exceed one meter!","How could he hug Senior White’s thigh if that happened?","No, I have to try my hardest.","“Senior White, that cabin is too small. How about we switch to another one?” Song Shuhang suggested to Senior White.","In general, Senior White was a very reasonable person. If Song Shuhang’s suggestion made sense, Senior White would consider it.","But this time, Senior White seemed to have an especially soft spot for this cabin.","He shook his head slightly, his smooth black hair fluttering in the air.","“I like this cabin,” Senior White said seriously.”My intuition tells me that this single-person cabin is the most interesting among the lot. No other cabin is as interesting as this one.”","Song Shuhang tried persuading, “But that cabin is too small. At most, only one Sixteen can squeeze into it. Senior White, it will be difficult even for you to squeeze into it. The space inside is just too small, and it would definitely not be a good experience to sit inside it. We should choose a three-person cabin.”","Senior White looked thoughtfully at the small cabin.","Indeed, the space inside the cabin was a little too small. It would be really crowded if he sat inside it.","“Idiot, don’t use Sixteen as a unit of measurement.” Sister White Dragon hit Shuhang with her claw in dissatisfaction.","At this moment, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword had already recovered, and it could not wait to add, “Yes, Fellow Daoist White, it’s best if you choose a three-person cabin so that Shuhang can hug your thigh. Hahahaha.”","“Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, you are too straightforward,” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said. “Although your words are true, you should save some face for Shuhang.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword coughed lightly and corrected itself, “Fellow Daoist White, Shuhang is worried about your safety, so he hopes to be able to sit in the same cabin with you and make sure you’re safe.”","Song Shuhang’s heart felt even more stifled when he heard that.","Senior White nodded and said, “This cabin is indeed a little too small.”","When Song Shuhang heard his words, a smile appeared on his face.","I did it! I managed to convince Senior White through my reasonable words and by appealing to his emotions.","“I’ve decided.” Senior White nodded and said, “I’ll let you hug my thighs this time, Shuhang.”","“Then Senior White, which cabin do we choose?” Song Shuhang said cheerfully. Striking while the iron was hot, he hurriedly asked Senior White to choose a three-person cabin.","“No need to fret.” Senior White smiled slightly.","Afterward, he reached out and gestured at his waist. Suddenly, his waist and thighs separated.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","“Here you go... I’ll be leaving my thighs with you for safekeeping, Shuhang.” A smile bloomed on Senior White’s face. Then, his real body quickly went into the small cabin.","Now, the size of the cabin was just right, and it was also very comfortable to sit inside it.","Senior White nodded in satisfaction.","In this way, he could satisfy his wish of sitting in the small, single-person cabin, and also satisfy little friend Shuhang’s wish of hugging his thigh. It was a perfect solution.","Song Shuhang: (Jono).","Inside the single-person cabin, Senior White gave him a thumbs up. His two thighs then made their way to Song Shuhang’s side.","Song Shuhang, who was dumbfounded, suddenly felt deep malice coming from the world.","After some time, Song Shuhang and Sister White Dragon chose the three-person cabin right behind Senior White’s cabin. Next to Song Shuhang were the thighs of Senior White’s clone-it looked as if Senior White had just cast an invisibility technique on his upper body.","It was a rather literal interpretation of “hugging someone’s thigh”.","Song Shuhang asked, “Sister White Dragon, do you know how to perform divinations?”","“A little bit,” Sister White Dragon said happily. No matter what, she was once the Ancestral Golden Dragon of the Ancient Heavenly City, a top existence even among Immortals.","Song Shuhang pointed to himself and said, “Can you divine my future?”","Sister White Dragon quickly replied, “Don’t worry, you won’t die.”","Song Shuhang tilted his head and looked out of the cabin, feeling a strong stifling sensation.","“Focus. Don’t be distracted,” Sister White Dragon said. “Maintain contact with Fellow Daoist White at all times so that even if something happens, you can respond immediately.”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “That’s the only thing I can do.”","After some time, all the cultivators who got past the runic roads had boarded the cabins on the giant tree.","Golden moonlight shone down, and everyone felt their cabins start to vibrate.","Song Shuhang subconsciously reached out and grabbed at the side of his seat, but he discovered that there was nothing there. “There’s no seat belt!”","Without a seat belt, he had no sense of security","“Boom-“","Outside, a cannon blast sounded.","Along with the sound of the cannon blast, Senior White’s voice could be heard vaguely.","Song Shuhang looked up and saw that the single-person cabin that Senior White was sitting in had been launched into the air. Like a small flying boat, it flew toward the golden moon above.","The small cabin flew fast, almost as fast as Senior White’s disposable flying swords.","“That’s the cabin that Senior White said was the most exciting?” Song Shuhang swallowed.","“BOOOM-“","Immediately afterward, there was an even louder cannon blast.","Song Shuhang asked, “Has another cabin been launched?”","Sister White Dragon replied, “No... The entire giant tree has been launched.”","Song Shuhang: “???”","The giant tree that was rooted on Garre Holy Mountain had been shot into the sky, rushing toward the golden moon.","Pavilion Master Chu’s voice sounded, “So the trial area is actually the golden moon above","US...”","Song Shuhang suddenly remembered something. “Is Senior White’s hometown on the moon?”"]},{"number":2037,"title":"Chapter 2037 - If not for my little brothers holding me back, I would have gone up there and beat you up!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2037 If not for my little brothers holding me back, I would have gone up there and beat you up!","Fairy Creation’s small head came out for a peek, but due to the limited space, her head could only stick close to Song Shuhang’s ear as she sang loudly, “I’m looking up- at the moon-“","Song Shuhang was taken aback by Fairy Creation’s sudden appearance.","He reacted quickly and covered his other ear. From his experience, he knew that whether it was Fairy Creation or the virtuous lamia, whenever one came out, the other would follow soon.","But even after a while, the virtuous lamia did not come out.","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","For some reason, with the virtuous lamia not coming out, he felt uncomfortable.","Fairy, come out and sing!","After you sing, I’ll feel more at ease.","Don’t be shy! Sing whenever you want!","At this moment, Sister White Dragon softly said, “A new trial is coming.”","Then, her figure shrunk abruptly to the size of Sixteen, though still maintaining a dragon’s upper body. When he saw her like this, Song Shuhang recalled Yu Jiaojiao.","“What kind of trial is it?” Song Shuhang turned his head and asked.","At the same time, he saw two humongous creatures appear in front of the giant tree and the single-person cabin that Senior White was in—the two creatures were huge holy apes.","The one on the left had a body that was bulging with muscles, while the one on the right had a more balanced frame.","The two holy apes stood in the air side by side, their bodies overshadowing the sky and the moon.","As the two holy apes appeared, 66 holy apes materialized on the top of Song Shuhang’s head—the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) had activated on its own.","The 66 holy apes were wearing scholarly robes, and they were all holding scholarly scriptures in their hands. With the large Holy Ape from Senior White Two at the very center, the rest of the Holy Apes arranged themselves into six petal-like lines around it.","After the holy apes appeared, they did not begin chanting or reciting their scriptures. Instead, they calmly looked at the two humongous holy apes.","This was not the case only for Song Shuhang.","All of the beast cultivators participating in the trial had their (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) passively activated.","The entire world seemed to have become filled with apes of varying sizes. It was a spectacular sight.","as a","However, besides Song Shuhang’s holy apes, the other holy apes were all cluttered together in a mess. They were not arranged in any order whatsoever.","Song Shuhang looked at the two humongous holy apes.","It seemed that this trial requires the holy apes of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) to be acknowledged by these two huge holy apes... Will the trial after this one be related to dragons?","After all, it was the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique). Since the apes had already appeared, it would make sense for the dragons not to be too far away, right?","“Wo00000-” The humongous holy apes let out strange cries.","After everyone’s holy ape projections were summoned, golden light shot out from the eyes of the humongous holy ape on the left. The light scanned through everyone who was participating in the trial.","As Song Shuhang had guessed, Garre Holy Mountain’s trial mainly focused on the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique).","These humongous holy apes were here to inspect the participants. Those who failed to meet the conditions would be eliminated.","Everyone who was swept by the golden light was placed under enormous pressure, and many were almost crushed flat on the ground because of it.","The light swept through everyone one by one.","Soon, the golden light fell on the cabin where Song Shuhang was.","The light first swept through Sister White Dragon.","Wait, neither Sixteen nor Sister White Dragon have practiced the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), will they be able to pass this assessment? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","While his mind was occupied with this thought, the golden light swept over the combination of Sister White Dragon and Sixteen. The Dragon Power in Sister White Dragon’s body circulated slightly. Afterward, the golden light swept past her.","It seems that as long as one either has Holy Ape Projections or Dragon Power, they can pass this test.","Song Shuhang let out a breath of relief.","Then, his gaze shifted to Senior White, who was in the single-person cabin in the distance. Senior White does not practice the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), nor does he have dragon power or draconic energy, will he be able to successfully pass this test?","“Fwoosh-“","At this moment, the golden light fell on Song Shuhang’s body.","The golden light expanded, directly covering Song Shuhang’s 66 Holy Ape Projections.","It was time to get into the limelight.","The large holy ape that had been gifted to him by Senior White Two lightly patted the scholarly robes on its body. It seemed to have been waiting for this moment.","With everyone’s eyes focused on it, the large holy ape opened the scholarly scripture in its left hand. After that, it raised its right hand and made a “6” gesture.","It then opened its mouth, and began to chant the scripture with a majestic voice while regularly swaying its right hand.","After the large holy ape began chanting, all of the smaller holy apes followed suit.","They all opened their scriptures and waved their right hands while chanting in a variety of languages.","The muscular humongous holy ape froze.","This was the first time that it had seen such strange holy ape projections.","As a result, the golden light shooting out from the humongous holy ape’s eyes intensified; an even more powerful pressure descended on Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang said angrily, “F*ck you!”","Why do things always seem to go wrong when it’s my turn?","“Roar-” The large holy ape above Song Shuhang’s head roared. It violently threw the scholarly scripture in its hand to the side and ripped off its scholarly robe, revealing its perfectly-sculpted muscles.","Then, it slapped its chest fiercely in an attempt to provoke the humongous holy ape.","All of Song Shuhang’s smaller holy apes rushed toward it and hugged the hairy legs of the large holy ape.","The large holy ape kept slapping its chest while roaring non-stop. It was as if it was saying, “If not for my little brothers holding me back, I would have gone up there and beat you up!”","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","He had been slightly suspicious in the past, wondering if Senior White Two had given him a rather problematic holy ape from his army. But this large holy ape... Was simply amazing!","It actually dared to provoke that huge holy аре.","It did not cower in the slightest, decisively provoking the other party.","The attention of everyone who was participating in the trial was drawn toward Shuhang’s large holy ape.","Throughout the Beast Realm’s history, there never had been a trial taker who had dared to confront and provoke the two ape kings.","A beast cultivator suddenly said, “Wait a minute, why do those holy apes wearing scholarly clothes look so familiar?”","After all, these 66 holy apes were unique. All of their holy apes were naked, but these ones had scholarly clothing on them.","“Pr-Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!”","“De-Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar!”","“An-Ancient Sage Tyrannical Dragon!”","Unexpectedly, this terrifying existence was also participating in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial!","Everyone’s eyes were focused on Song Shuhang and his large holy ape, causing Senior White, who was in the VIP cabin, to be ignored.","At this time, the ape king with a balanced frame was “playing” with Senior White.","The ape king grabbed Senior White’s cabin, spun it several times in place, and then threw it out like a frisbee. After the cabin flew back, the ape king grabbed onto it with both hands and used a magical technique.","With a loud boom, the VIP cabin was then launched forward at a hundred times the speed of sound.","Senior White was having a great time, but the ape king was covered in sweat from exhaustion."]},{"number":2038,"title":"Chapter 2038 - A refreshing spring in the desert","paragraphs":["Chapter 2038 A refreshing spring in the desert","The ape king with a balanced frame was falling into despair.","Its job was to lift up the giant tree after the muscular ape king was done assessing the contestants and then launch it toward the moon at an extreme speed.","Afterward, it could enjoy the terrified screams of the trial takers together with the other king. These screams were enough to keep the two ape kings happy for several years.","This was also part of the trial, to allow the participants to experience what true speed was!","Those who practiced the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) must have nerves of steel. If they could not even bear this kind of speed and height, how could they hold their heads up high?","WO","neo","However, during this trial, someone had selected the secret VIP cabin.","Normally, the person who chose this cabin could be said to be the unluckiest one among all the participants, because this specific cabin would usually be handled by the ape king with a balanced frame.","In the past, while the muscular ape king was assessing the participants, the thinner ape king would use all the means at its disposal to toss around the VIP cabin.","However, it could not threaten the life of the person on board, and could only make them faint.","At the beginning, the thinner ape king was very happy as it finally got another chance to throw around the VIP cabin after so long.","As soon as the cabin came into view, it began using its different moves.","It swung the VIP cabin around like a supersonic windmill—[Supersonic Windmill).","Or shook it violently-[Hellish Shakedown).","Or launched it at the fastest speed it could, and then pulled it back at an even faster speed —[Deadly Round Trip Experience).","It tried to force the passenger to scream out in fear in the shortest time possible.","But after using nearly thirty different techniques, it found that the practitioner inside the cabin was lively and excited rather than afraid.","It was at this point that the thinner ape king began questioning its life choices.","It wondered if its strength had ended up regressing as it hadn’t gone all-out for several thousand years.","In the end, it began using magical techniques.","Super Railgun Cabin Launcher, Four-Fold Acceleration Formation, Holy Ape Gale Technique. It tried its best to launch the cabin to the very limits its abilities allowed. At the same time, it also arranges various obstacles on the route of the cabin to enhance the stimulation the person inside would experience.","However, the person in the cabin only became happier!","The thinner ape king was absolutely bewildered. It looked through the cover of the cabin to check on the person inside-it wanted to see who exactly was inside.","“Sage White!” After a single glance, it knew the identity of the person inside the cabin.","Even without the Sage Seal’s effect, it was impossible for anyone who had seen Sage White to forget him because of his outstanding looks.","After learning of Senior White’s identity, the thinner ape king worked even harder.","Its brain went into overdrive as it tried to think of all the methods it could use to defeat Sage White.","Within a short period of time, the thinner ape king’s brain power and physical strength were consumed greatly; it had become covered in sweat.","Just when the thinner ape king was about to reach its limit and collapse from exhaustion, the muscular ape king completed its assessment of the trial takers.","Since the muscular ape king had two eyes, it could use both to test the participants.","It assessed Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s holy apes with one of its eyes, while it used its other one to shine light on the other participants and check them out.","However, this undoubtedly increased the strain on its eyes.","After it finished assessing the participants, the muscular ape king had dry eyes and felt like crying","“ROAR!” Above Song Shuhang’s head, the large holy ape projection began to dance rhythmically, not showing any weakness.","At this moment, a smile formed on the muscular ape king’s mouth.","Keep being arrogant, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. After all, you can only be arrogant for so long. In a while, you will get a taste of what it feels to fly at the fastest speed possible!","It had decided to cooperate with the thinner ape king to increase the flight speed by 3 times, or even more.","It turned its head to call its companion, but in the next moment, it was left stunned.","Its good friend, the thinner ape king, was sweating profusely. The hair on its body was soaked wet, just as if it had just run through heavy rain. Other than that, it was gasping for air due to exhaustion.","The muscular ape king was bewildered.","After hearing the call of the muscular ape king, a relieved expression surfaced on the thinner ape king’s face.","It grabbed Sage White’s cabin, cast a magical technique, and sent it blasting toward the moon.","It was finally over.","The two ape kings looked at each other, their eyes moist.","What the hell was wrong with the trial takers this year?","Both ape kings had a horrible experience while managing the test.","The two apes high-fived before taking a deep breath and mustering their strength.","They swung their palms and hit the giant tree at the same time, using up all their magical and physical energy.","Scream!","Blame the fact that Sage White and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song are participating in this trial with you. Don’t blame us!","“Boom_”","The giant tree darted forward.","It broke the speed of sound instantly, and its speed continued to increase in the following seconds. It seemed as if the tree was never going to stop accelerating.","All the auxiliary formations on the tree were activated, and the difficulty of the trial was increased to the maximum level.","In addition, many obstacles such as meteorites, iron chunks, giant bones, ancient demons, and so on appeared on the path of the giant tree. All of these obstacles enhanced the visual impact.","“Scream!” The two ape kings grinned evilly. Although this speed might not necessarily scare Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, it was undoubtedly a hellish experience for the other trial takers.","They were going to punish the other participants for the suffering they had to withstand due to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and Sage White.","“Aahhh! Too fast! I’m going to die~ I’m going to die~ Stop!”","Unexpectedly, the first one to scream was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","The muscular ape king was stunned.","It scratched its ears, thinking that it had heard wrong.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who was so arrogant before, gave in so quickly?","However, there was no mistaking, and it was really Profound Sage Tyrannical Song screaming","The two ape kings could vaguely see Profound Sage Tyrannical Song tightly clutching the door of his cabin and screaming.","The screams of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song were like a refreshing spring in the desert, nourishing the wounded hearts of the two ape kings.","The duo nodded and high-fived. Then, they disappeared.","In the cabins on the giant tree, all the screaming participants discovered that their holy ape projections had begun to strengthen.","Their (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), which had been acknowledged by the muscular ape king, was getting stronger.","Among them, Song Shuhang’s 66 holy apes were the ones who got strengthened the most.","Every holy ape above his head gained a metallic sheen to its body. It looked as if all of them were performing the (Steel Hands Technique)","It was the evolution of the basic holy apethe steel holy ape!","This showed that the two ape kings held Song Shuhang’s (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) in high regard.","As the managers of this trial, they were very rigorous and fair in their assessment.","“Boom-“","The giant tree crashed on the moon, landing in an overbearing manner. After the crash, half of the giant tree was inserted into the ground.","No wonder there were so many holes on the moon of the Beast Realm. Were all of them caused by the giant tree?"]},{"number":2039,"title":"Chapter 2039 - 39 Illusory reality, an all-purpose ability?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2039 Illusory reality, an all-purpose ability?","After the powerful impact, a large number of the beast cultivators in the cabins could not resist and ended up falling unconscious.","Their companions hurriedly acted and began using various means to wake them up.","There were some who fed their friends medicinal liquid, some who used healing techniques, and some who called out to their companions affectionately. However, Song Shuhang saw the most used and straightforward method was violently slapping them in the face.","After all, the beast cultivators who could reach the golden moon all had excellent physiques and had passed the assessment of the two ape kings.","So with that in mind, their companions simply slapped them mercilessly.","Loud slaps echoed throughout the area. Due to the rhythm, it felt as if they were at the concert of a popular singer, and the audience was applauding enthusiastically. “Where’s Senior White?” asked Song Shuhang, his legs weak. On this occasion, his wooden body had cooperated with his head, starting to quiver.","Sister White Dragon’s small claw pointed in a certain direction and replied, “He’s over there, waving at us.”","Song Shuhang looked in the direction Sister White Dragon had pointed.","The VIP cabin was open, and Senior White’s upper body was by the cabin window, waving at Song Shuhang-it was apparent that Senior White was in a great mood.","“Let’s go meet up with Senior White.” Song Shuhang propped himself up slowly.","The giant tree’s cabin then opened.","Sister White Dragon stretched out her claws, lifted Song Shuhang and the other half of Sage White’s body, and flew out of the cabin.","Afterward, Sage White’s lower half ran in the direction of the VIP cabin on its own.","The other half of Senior White flew out of the cabin and seamlessly reunited with his missing part.","“So this is the trial area of Garre Holy Mountain...” said Senior White. He then crouched down, stretched out his hand, and poked lightly at the ground.","The ground was soft, and some areas were outright sandy.","Song Shuhang imitated Senior White and also poked at the ground. When his finger touched the ground, it left behind a small hole. Moreover, the hole kept getting deeper and deeper.","After the 66 holy apes were transformed into steel holy apes, Song Shuhang’s body was greatly strengthened.","For this reason, he had trouble controlling his strength.","Song Shuhang said, “The (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) was strengthened more than I thought after the trial of the ape kings.”","He shook his hand, poked at the ground again, and began to adjust his strength.","This was not the first time he had experienced a sudden increase in the strength of his physical body. In other words, he was kind of used to it.","At this moment, the transplanted strand of Pavilion Master Chu’s hair said, “Do you also get a familiar feeling from this place?”","Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “I don’t know why, but as soon as we reached the golden moon, I felt as if I had returned home, the place where I belong.”","Pavilion Master Chu replied, “No, what I meant is that this place is very similar to my Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion.”","we.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword exclaimed, “The Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion is Fellow Daoist Chu’s home. Song Shuhang felt like this place was his home. Also, back when we were approaching Garre Holy Mountain, Sage White said that the place gave him a sense of familiarity and made him recall his hometown. Perhaps, this golden moon can remind people of the warm feeling of home!”","Sister White Dragon said, “No... Everything here is very similar to an illusory reality. I think that is what Fellow Daoist Chu was trying to hint at.”","It was not just a patch of land, but the entire golden moon that was like an illusory reality.","This was not just some city, but an entire planet!","It was already a miracle that Pavilion Master Chu had been able to maintain the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion. And to do that, she ended up having to spend most of her time in a state of sleep.","And this golden moon was far larger than the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion.","Moreover, it had not only lasted for a day or two. The existence of the Beast Realm’s Garre Holy Mountain and the holy mountain’s trial could be traced back all the way to the ancient era.","An era before the emergence of the Scholarly Sage and the Ancient Heavenly City.","Song Shuhang suddenly remembered something and asked, “Sister White Dragon, I remember that the structure of the Ancient Heavenly City is also related to an illusory reality, right?”","Sister White Dragon nodded. “Yes, the structure of the Ancient Heavenly City is indeed related to an illusory reality. It could be said to be an enhanced version of Fellow Daoist Chu’s Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion. It was precisely because of its special structure that the members of the Heavenly City could integrate their own path into the city.”","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and said, “Why do I feel like a Venerable’s illusory reality ability is especially heaven-defying?”","“Indeed.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “In my memory, Scarlet Heaven also expressed several times how wondrous an illusory reality was.”","Senior White’s eyes lit up. “If this golden moon really is an evolution of an illusory reality, then it should have a core. Let’s find it!”","Song Shuhang asked, “How are we supposed to find it?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested, “How about we dig a hole? If it’s a core, then perhaps it’s at the core of this moon.”","Song Shuhang said, “But it could also be somewhere on the golden moon. I think it’s better to have Senior White use the branch method to locate it.”","“Well, then let’s go with that.” Senior White nodded. He reached out and broke a branch off of Song Shuhang’s body and threw it into the sky.","“Boom-“","Suddenly, a beam of light came and destroyed the branch.","Song Shuhang’s eyes widened.","Who is it? How dare you break my little branch?!","Even if that little branch that had been broken off of his body, it was still a part of his body!","This beam of light that had come out of nowhere was the prelude to the trial.","In the sky, hideous monsters emerged from the shadows.","They had innate skills that worked like spatial abilities. They could create a shadow in the void and travel freely in that shadow.","Senior White pinched his chin and wondered, “Is this also part of the trial?”","In the distance, a three-eyed monster let out a strange laugh. It was the one that had destroyed Song Shuhang’s little branch.","As it laughed and laughed, it started coughing violently, as if it had choked on its own saliva.","The three-eyed monster slammed its fist into its chest, but the more it hammered, the harder it choked.","After choking for a while, it foamed at the mouth and fell to the ground, its body convulsing repeatedly.","Song Shuhang: “...” Sister White Dragon: “...” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","It was the first time they had seen an enemy who laughed so hard that they ended up choking and falling to the ground.","At the same time, those beast cultivators who climbed out of the cabins of the giant tree were already familiar with engaging in close-quarters combat with these monsters. Was this part of the trial as well?","“I see,” said Song Shuhang. The 66 steel holy apes above his head roared as he stepped forward and punched the monster that was choking and foaming at the mouth.","“Wait, that punch didn’t feel right.” Song Shuhang quickly jumped back. He felt as if he had hit a balloon.","Is it a fake monster?","While he was in thought, the three-eyed monster suddenly disintegrated.","Then, a broken rune landed on Song Shuhang’s fist.","From the rune, there were a lot of memories related to the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) that poured out..."]},{"number":2040,"title":"Chapter 2040 - Buddy, all my teeth are broken","paragraphs":["Chapter 2040 Buddy, all my teeth are broken","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword asked curiously, “What are these runes?” Song Shuhang replied, “Experience points. Experience points in the truest sense.”","Memories and experiences related to the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) were extremely important for those who practiced the technique.","But for Song Shuhang, these were not of much use now. After all, he had been possessed by the Sage’s obsession and the Indestructible Lord’s will not too long ago. Through them, his understanding of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) had risen to an extremely high level.","Therefore, these cultivation experiences were of very little use to him.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Then, are you going to grind for these experience points?”","“There’s no need. It would simply be a waste of time.” Song Shuhang shook his head. “Let’s head to the next challenge.”","Senior White asked, “But how do we do that?”","This was indeed a big problem. Neither he, Senior White, nor Sister White Dragon knew where the next challenge of the trial would take place.","“For now, we can just continue trying to look for the core of this golden moon.” Song Shuhang broke a branch off of his body and handed it to Senior White.","Sister White Dragon said, “At our four o’clock, a trial taker was knocked down by a monster.”","Song Shuhang turned his head to look and saw a lone beast cultivator being overwhelmed by several ferocious monsters. The monsters opened their mouths and bit down at the beast cultivator ravenously. It was like they had been starved for several hundred years and finally found some food.","With a thought from Song Shuhang, his serrated blade wheel flew out and slashed two monsters.","However, there were just too many of them around the beast cultivator. The rest of the monsters had already bitten into the skin of the beast cultivator.","In the next moment, the beast cultivator’s body began losing moisture at a speed visible to the naked eye.","After two breaths of time, the beast cultivator’s body had become as shriveled up as a dry mummy.","After draining the moisture from the beast cultivator, the monsters became more agile and rushed toward other targets in the surroundings.","“Why does this scene look so familiar to me?” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said curiously.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair swayed slightly. “It’s similar, in a way, to those beast cultivators who were infected with the evil energy of the Netherworld and sent to Song Shuhang by Fairy Blue Phoenix. Remember how those beast cultivators were drained by the roots of Song Shuhang’s lotus projection? They were also all shriveled up after getting drained by the roots.”","“...” Song Shuhang. What does that have to do with me?","“Their lives are not in danger. It’s just that they’ve become extremely weak after having been drained of their strength. They should recover in a few months,” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword said. “Tsk, even the state they’re left in is the same as when they’re drained by Song Shuhang’s tentacles. I suspect these monsters were in the same family as Song Shuhang 800 years ago.”","Song Shuhang retorted, “800 years ago, my ancestors weren’t even born yet.” Anyway, after the monsters drained the energy of these beast cultivators, the giant tree would extend some branches over and drag the weak cultivators back to it before throwing them into a cabin.","In this regard, it was apparent that even if one failed the trial, there was no threat to their life. At most, they would be sent back empty-handed. Then, after resting for a few months, they would return to peak condition again.","The black-skinned Soft Feather came out and said, “The beast cultivators who were drained look quite pitiful.”","Song Shuhang said, “It’s still better than losing their life.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather added, “Also, have you noticed? These monsters are somewhat like inner demons.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword added, “Indeed, these monsters are very similar to inner demons.”","“Now that you say that, I do see some similarities.” Song Shuhang had been in contact with the black-skinned Soft Feather and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword for some time now, so he was no stranger to inner demons.","“Is it a combination of the illusory reality and inner demons?” Sister White Dragon said, thoughtful.","This was especially similar to what the Heavenly Emperor had done.","The Ancient Heavenly City was based on an illusory reality. Then, in a later period, the Heavenly Emperor began studying inner demons in secret. Moreover, her research on inner demons obviously yielded some results, and this could be seen from Soft Feather’s inner demon clone technique.","Was this a coincidence?","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “How about we capture one and study it?”.","Senior White shook his head. He was not interested in these monsters.","“I want to grab one and give it a try.” After Song Shuhang said that, he tried opening his Inner World.","But sure enough, inside this trial space, the Inner World was blocked. It was a similar situation to when he was in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Although he could sense the Inner World and felt that he could open it, it would take a long time to do so. It would probably take about ten days to half a month before it could open.","It was like having a horrible Internet connection.","Sister White Dragon said, “Then, let’s grab","one.”","She raised her little claw, and a dog-like monster was pulled over and sent toward Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang stretched out both of his hands and got into a boxing stance, ready to strike the dog-like monster. “I have to control my strength and can’t just blow it apart. I need to make sure that it only falls unconscious.”","However, just as the dog-like monster entered Song Shuhang’s attack range, its head suddenly disappeared.","At the same time, a shadow appeared above Song Shuhang’s head.","The monster’s head emerged from the shadow and bit down at Song Shuhang’s head fiercely.","It was the special innate skill of these monsters.","Pavilion Master Chu shouted, “Shuhang, watch out!”","At the same time, her strand of hair quickly moved from the top of his head all the way to his back.","This strand of hair was purely used for “observing” the outside world. Fighting was not its main function.","Song Shuhang did not expect that Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair had the ability to move.","At this time, the monster was about to bite down on his head.","Song Shuhang said softly, “Heh, my head is not a weak spot.” “Crack-“","When the dog-like monster bit down on Song Shuhang’s head, its teeth shattered.","A dumbfounded expression surfaced on the monster’s face. In the entirety of its dog life, it had bitten down on countless heads, but there was no doubt that this head was the hardest one it had ever encountered.","It was so hard that it literally broke its teeth.","Buddy, how did you train your head to make it so hard?","My teeth are broken! They’re all broken!","This made it so that monsters who attacked by biting would be put out of work!","Song Shuhang reached out and grabbed the monster biting his head, pulling it off of his head.","Sister White Dragon stretched out her small claws and cast several seals on the dog-like monster.","“And that’s that.” Song Shuhang tried to store the dog-like monster inside his magical bracelet, but it did not work.","As such, he could only choose to drag it around for now.","“Senior White, where should we go next?” Song Shuhang looked at Senior White.","“Leave it to me.” With that, Senior White gently tossed the little branch that Song Shuhang had given him.","While Senior White was doing his thing, Song Shuhang looked around, ensuring no monster would suddenly destroy the branch he had given Senior White."]},{"number":2041,"title":"Chapter 2041 - The dragon’s assessment","paragraphs":["Chapter 2041 The dragon’s assessment","This time, the branch thrown by Senior White smoothly landed on the ground and pointed toward their five o’clock.","Song Shuhang said, “Nice. Nobody messed with us this time.”","Although he said that, he was slightly disappointed. If the branch were blown up again, he would have proposed to Senior White to throw his real body instead to determine where to go, thinking that the effect might be better.","However, that did not happen, and the branch method worked, which was quite a disappointment.","Wait... I shouldn’t even have considered that as an option! Song Shuhang immediately dispelled the thought, sending the bold thought into the deepest depths of his mind, sealing it up with layers upon layers of seals so that it would never see the light of day again.","Staying alive was the most important thing! “Alright, let’s head in that direction.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair ran back to the top of Song Shuhang’s head, swaying with the wind.","Senior White picked up the branch and headed towards their five o’clock together with Song Shuhang and Sister White Dragon.","Song Shuhang dragged the toothless dog-like monster along with them.","The monster was still struggling, but it could not resist Song Shuhang with its strength. And after being sealed, its struggle was even more pointless.","Its claws left four deep marks on the ground while it was forcibly dragged away.","The monsters in the surroundings looked at Song Shuhang, Senior White, and Sister White Dragon, silently turning their heads and targeting other cultivators.","All of them were aware that these three were not to be messed with.","The combined strength of Sage White, White Dragon, and Tyrannical Song probably made up 90% of the total strength of the participants of the trial this time.","To be more precise, it was Sage White and White Dragon, both of whom had the word “White” in their names, that belonged to the ranks of those who must not be provoked. As for Tyrannical Song, he just happened to be together with the other two.","And so, Song Shuhang and his group got to leave behind the monster horde and move around without any obstructions.","Along the way, Song Shuhang tried to look for Sixteen and Daoist Turntable, but even after searching for so long, he could not find Sixteen.","As before, Sister White Dragon could lock onto Sixteen’s aura, but the trial ground was interfering with her senses, making it impossible for her to find her exact position.","Because of that, Song Shuhang had to temporarily give up on the idea. He could only hope to run into Sixteen in the next part of the trial.","After advancing about 10,000 meters, Senior White once again picked off a branch and threw it into the air.","The branch spun in the air before plunging straight into the ground.","Sister White Dragon asked curiously, “What does that mean?”","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said, “Is it pointing down or up?”","“The branch’s youngest end should be the tip, so it’s pointing toward the sky, I guess,” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said","After a moment of thought, Senior White pulled out the branch and threw it in the air again.","The result was the same as before. The branch plunged into the ground, its tip pointing toward the sky.","Senior White looked up at the sky, but there was nothing there.","Sister White Dragon said, “Could it be that because the monster horde has not been dealt with, the passage that should be in the sky has not opened yet?”","Senior White smiled slightly and said, “Regardless, we can just head up there.”","He then stepped up into the air and flew upward.","Sister White Dragon followed right after him.","Song Shuhang tied down the dog-like monster before following them.","But after taking three steps into the air, Song Shuhang felt as if there was a large invisible hand pressing down on his head, trying to force him down.","With every step he took, the pressure grew stronger.","The black lotus beneath his feet cracked under the great force weighing down on his body.","The 66 steel holy apes were summoned again. They hovered above Song Shuhang’s head and raised their heads, looking upward.","Is this road to the sky also part of the trial?","But Senior White and Sister White Dragon don’t seem to be feeling the slightest bit of pressure as they fly upward...","Is this trial only for those who have practiced the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique)? Song Shuhang gritted his teeth and continued to move upward.","About a hundred steps ahead of him, Sister White Dragon and Senior White stopped.","The two turned their heads and looked at Song Shuhang","After Song Shuhang reached the 50th step, the pressure weighing down on him was much stronger than before. It was so strong that his head was almost sunk into his wooden body.","He could only make use of both of his arms and feet to push through. He even used the (Hair Growing Technique) to grow long hair and form some extra hands that could help support his head.","With great difficulty, he managed to reach Senior White and Sister White Dragon. “Have we arrived?”","“Yup.” Senior White reached out and pulled Song Shuhang up.","Sister White Dragon stretched out her small claw and swiped it in front of her.","Afterward, a “divine dragon” appeared out of nowhere in front of them.","The divine dragon seemed to be slumbering. Its body was coiled on itself, and there were faint traces of saliva at the corner of its mouth.","“Sure enough, after the ape kings, it’s the dragon’s turn to conduct an assessment.” Song Shuhang adjusted his breathing.","Now, how was this dragon going to assess him?","After some thought, Song Shuhang sent forward two of his hair-palms and pressed them on the dragon. The left hand used the (Secret Appraisal Technique) to check on the identity of the dragon, while the right hand used the (Saber-Nurturing Technique) to measure its limits.","Senior White: “...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","As Song Shuhang’s hair-palms touched the dragon, its eyes opened wide.","The divine dragon opened its mouth and said, “Huh? You got here so soon? Is the level of the trial takers that high this time around?”","The divine dragon spoke in the language of dragons.","Fortunately, Sister White Dragon was with them and could help with the translation. Therefore, they had no need to worry about not understanding each other.","At this time, the two magical techniques that Song Shuhang had used took effect.","The (Secret Appraisal Technique) activated, and his left hair-hand shone brightly.","A faint, painful sensation emerged in Song Shuhang’s mind-the appraisal had failed.","It had been quite a long time since he last failed in using the secret appraisal technique.","Moreover, the price of the failure was very low. He did not even suffer a wound from using the technique.","This was the first time that Song Shuhang encountered such a situation.","Generally speaking, if the appraisal failed, it was due to him having no way to appraise the other party because of how powerful they were. If not that, it was because the price of the appraisal exceeded the limit that Song Shuhang could bear, resulting in the forced interruption of the technique.","We","In these two cases, even if the appraisal failed, the price that he would pay for using the technique was very high.","But this time, the cost was nil.","In the meantime, the (Saber-Nurturing Technique) also caused Song Shuhang’s right hand to shine brightly.","The huge divine dragon raised its head and let out a majestic roar.","Right after waking up, it had received a refreshing and rejuvenating massage. The divine dragon lowered its head and looked at Song Shuhang. Its eyes, which had been rather drowsy earlier, were now wide awake and filled with appreciation.","The divine dragon said, “Young trial taker, you aren’t bad.”","Sister White Dragon translated its words.","It seems that the divine dragon was very fond of the (Saber-Nurturing Technique).","Since you like it, it makes things a lot easier.","Song Shuhang’s long hair spread out and turned into twenty hands, which then went toward the divine dragon.","At the same time, the hands of his wooden body also pressed on the body of the divine dragon.","(Saber-Nurturing Technique) 22!","The divine dragon raised its head high up, and its body shone so brightly that it reminded one of a small sun.","After a while, the light subsided.","The divine dragon lowered its head to Song Shuhang and said, “Very good! Young trial taker, I’m very fond of you.”"]},{"number":2042,"title":"Chapter 2042 - Song “Part-Time Worker” Shuhang","paragraphs":["Chapter 2042 Song “Part-Time Worker” Shuhang","The divine dragon lowered its head and looked at Song Shuhang. “Are you interested in staying here and working for me? I can assure you that you’ll be satisfied with the wage.” Sister White Dragon continued to translate the divine dragon’s words for Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Did it take a liking to me? Is that why it wants me to stay here?","Pavilion Master Chu chuckled and said, “Has this dragon become addicted to the (Saber-Nurturing Technique)? I’m afraid that it’s going to end up as a waste dragon.”","Sister White Dragon thought for a moment, then translated Pavilion Master Chu’s sentence word for word.","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","She almost forgot that the White Dragon was her rival in love. Although they usually worked together because of Song Shuhang and Sixteen, when it came to a chance to pull the rug from under her feet, the Ancestral Golden Dragon of the Ancient Heavenly City would show no remorse!","The divine dragon coughed lightly. “Fairy Hair, you’ve misunderstood me. It’s just that I feel that this young... Eh? Tyrannical Song... Scholar... Dragon? Why do you have three Sage Names?”","Across the entire universe, everyone only has a single name to their person, so why does this little friend have three names?","Sister White Dragon entered into automatic translation mode and acted as a translation machine between Song Shuhang’s group and the divine dragon.","“Fairy Hair?” Pavilion Master Chu’s heart felt stifled.","Song Shuhang’s hair fluttered as he replied, “I ended up getting three names by sheer coincidence. It’s fine for Senior Dragon to simply call me Tyrannical Song.”","The story about how he got the three Sage Names was simply too long. It would take him more than half a day if he wanted to explain everything to the dragon.","“I see. I’ll call you Tyrannical Song then, although I like the name Tyrannical Dragon better,” the divine dragon replied. “Regardless, I feel that little friend Tyrannical Song’s magical technique is really interesting, and it can be used in the trial. That is why I want him to work for me. I’ve exhausted most of my ideas over the years, and I don’t know what method to use to test the trial takers anymore. Yet, when I experienced this magical technique of little friend Tyrannical Song, I felt greatly inspired.”","“So, by work, you’re referring to me staying here and experimenting on the trial takers with the (Saber-Nurturing Technique)?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement. Now that he got a better idea of what the dragon was talking about, he felt excited.","“That’s right. And I’ll make sure that you’ll get paid well.” The divine dragon’s eyes were full of joy.","Song Shuhang pointed to himself and said, “But I am also a trial taker.”","The divine dragon said, “Isn’t this dragon fairy maiden with you? Since you brought her here, you’ve met the hidden condition and passed the test. I acknowledge you, and you’ll now receive my blessing. Your (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) will be strengthened.”","In this particular case, the assessment was just a formality.","On this golden moon, the will of the divine dragon was absolute.","The 66 holy apes above Song Shuhang’s head were strengthened again.","There were now golden lines that looked like tattoos on their steel-cast bodies.","These golden lines eventually formed the lifelike picture of a dragon, majestic and beautiful.","After the golden dragons took shape, Song Shuhang got the feeling that the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) had attained its complete form.","In the past, he could only exert the power of the holy apes. But now, when he fully activated this magical technique, he could erupt with both the power of holy apes and dragons!","The golden light slowly dissipated.","The large holy ape put away its golden scholarly scripture. It then lifted its scholarly robe and looked at the golden dragon on its body.","After a few breaths of time, the large holy ape covered its face with its hands and cried bitterly.","The little holy apes also stretched out their hands and lifted up their scholarly robes.","Their reaction was the same as that of the large holy ape. They covered their faces with their hands and cried bitterly.","It was as if they had been defiled. Their cries were filled with sorrow.","Song Shuhang was baffled.","What’s going on?","He felt that he was finding it more and more difficult to understand the thoughts of the things attached to his body.","After some thought, Senior White said, “Who knows, perhaps your scholarly apes feel that tattoos are not appropriate for scholars? It might be why they burst into tears after they saw the tattoos on their bodies.”","After all, there was a saying in the scholarly faction that one’s body was received from one’s parents and none had the right to alter it.","“Is that really a tattoo?” Song Shuhang wondered. “These golden lines are more similar to paint. At most, it could be considered some kind of body paint or a sticker tattoo. What’s there to cry about?”","Hearing that, the large holy ape suddenly stopped crying.","It re-fastened its scholarly robe, re-opened its scholarly scripture, and continued chanting.","The group of little holy apes followed in the footsteps of their boss.","The divine dragon looked at Song Shuhang’s holy ape projections in disbelief.","It was an ancient creature, and it had seen many things throughout its long life.","However, it was the first time it had seen something like little friend Tyrannical Song’s holy ape projections. These holy ape projections were both strange and interesting.","I really want this little guy to stay and work for me.","That magical technique called (Saber-Nurturing Technique) feels too good.","The divine dragon said, “Little Fellow Daoist, I’ll give you another reminder. This is a reminder that only those who brought a ‘dragon’ into the trial can get from me.”","While it said that, it turned to look at Sister White Dragon and said, “Little friend Tyrannical Song, as long as you unite with Fairy White Dragon, your (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) will improve and enter the final stage. The dragon pattern on the body of your holy apes will materialize and stop being a simple picture. With that, the technique would have the power of both apes and dragons when used. This is the true and complete form of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique). After your technique reaches this level, when you enter the deepest part of the trial ground, your chances of comprehending the General Principles Chapter will be 20% higher!”","Sister White Dragon translated mechanically, but as soon as she finished translating the divine dragon’s words, she found herself at a loss for words.","What the hell do you mean by “union”?!","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair shook slightly, and said in a gentle voice, “Union? Shuhang, this is about whether or not you can comprehend the General Principles Chapter of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique). You must be careful on the path of cultivation, and there is no room for mistakes. You and Fellow Daoist White Dragon should unite. ... If you end up finding another girlfriend in the future, I can help you come clean- Ah- Let go of me! Get your claws off of me!”","Sister White Dragon grabbed the strand of hair, and Pavilion Master Chu protested loudly in response.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky and sighed. “The relationship between you two is really good.”","His eyes filtered the scene on their own. From his filtered perspective, it looked as if Sister White Dragon was gently stroking Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair.","Without the filter, the reputation of the two fairy maidens would be left in shambles.","At this time, the divine dragon added, “By union, I meant combining yours and Fairy White Dragon’s powers. I can help you with the process.”","Sister White Dragon stopped and hurried to translate the sentence.","“Also, Fellow Daoist, do you know of the Nascent Soul of the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm?” When the divine dragon said this, it found a problem.","How did Tyrannical Song have three Sage Names despite only being at the Sixth Stage Realm?","“Mm-hm, I know. In the realm of the Venerable, the Lotus turns into a Nascent Soul.” Song Shuhang replied. The divine dragon paused. It ignored its previous discovery and continued, “Wrong. A Nascent Soul that is not born from a pregnancy is unacceptable!”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Why does this line sound so familiar?"]},{"number":2043,"title":"Chapter 2043 - Trial Officer Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2043 Trial Officer Song","What the f*ck, isn’t that what the Scholarly Sage said in my nightmare yesterday?","“Sister White Dragon, hit me!” Song Shuhang turned his head and said to Sister White Dragon. He suspected that he had","unknowingly fallen into some kind of illusion and was currently inside a nightmare.","Sister White Dragon asked, “Why? Have you finally lost your mind?”","!!","Song Shuhang said, “I suspect that I’m having a nightmare right now. Hit me, but don’t hit me too hard...”","“I’m afraid I won’t be able to control my strength.” Sister White Dragon waved her small claws as she replied to Song Shuhang. At the same time, she did not forget her job as a translator.","“Let me do it,” said Senior White. He then pointed his finger toward Song Shuhang’s forehead, flicking his head lightly. “Boom~”","With a booming sound, Song Shuhang’s head left his body, hurtling toward the divine dragon.","“Shiet!” The divine dragon anxiously caught Song Shuhang’s head. Sage White is actually so powerful? After agreeing to do it lightly, with just a single flick of his fingers, he uprooted Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s head!","“Ugh, that hurt.” Song Shuhang’s hair","fluttered as he spoke. He condensed one hand with a portion of his hair and used it to rub his forehead.","The physical pain he felt told Song Shuhang that he was not having nightmares. He was now certain that he was awake and that he was in the real world. Song Shuhang, who had experienced all kinds of pain, could easily distinguish between the pain of the body and the pain of the soul or the mental pain that was felt in dreams.","Sister White Dragon very professionally translated Song Shuhang’s screams to the divine dragon.","The divine dragon looked at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s head, which was between its claws, and was at a loss for words.","At this time, Song Shuhang’s twenty hair-arms extended to his left and right. Then, they acted like two wings and flapped, allowing him to fly back to his wooden body and plant himself back onto the wooden body’s neck.","This disturbing sight caused the divine","dragon to feel pain in its liver.","“Senior Dragon, do you know the Scholarly","Sage?” Song Shuhang asked.","Since this was not a nightmare, he suspected","that there was a connection between the divine dragon and the Scholarly Sage.","The divine dragon replied, “Who doesn’t know of the Scholarly Sage of the ancient era? There was an Immortal from our Beast Realm back then who had gone to the main world to challenge the Scholarly Sage. In the end, she came back in tears.”","As it spoke, it ended up reminiscing, and its tone was filled with nostalgia. When it came to creatures that had lived for tens of thousands of years, once they were caught in their memories, they became like this.","It was the vicissitudes of the times.","Song Shuhang looked at Sister White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu on the top of his head, the virtuous lamia, and Fairy Creation. These people were also existences that had been alive since the ancient era up until now, but","they did not give off such a vibe at all. When Pavilion Master Chu was in the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, she was a little similar. Although she was lazy, she would still give off the vibe of a decadent beauty. There was a sense of history about her person. However, ever since the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion was inherited by Pavilion Master Chu Two, she let go of her burdens, and it was now difficult to see that side of her.","Song Shuhang added, “Senior dragon, did you know the Scholarly Sage personally?”","The divine dragon shook his head and replied,","“My existence is rather special. I have always lived on the trial grounds of this holy mountain. The Scholarly Sage has never been here, and so we have never met each other.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Then, what’s with you mentioning that the Nascent Soul should be born from pregnancy?”","The divine dragon lowered its head and said profoundly, “I see that Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song is currently at the Sixth","Stage Realm, and you’ve already condensed life wheel. You’ll now have to face the","your bottleneck of the Ten Heavenly Layers. Given","your situation, within a hundred years, you","should definitely be able to condense a","Nascent Soul and reach the Seventh Stage Realm.”","Sister White Dragon stopped for a moment.","Eventually, she still chose to translate the","divine dragon’s original words to Song Shuhang.","“Uh... Mm-hm, yup.” Song Shuhang nodded","and agreed. Within a hundred years, he should indeed have condensed a Nascent Soul","and reached the Seventh Stage Realm. He was, at least, confident about this.","After all, Senior White Two had helped him by giving him nine dragon patterns. If he could not reach the Seventh Stage Realm even with such help bestowed upon him, then it would be extremely embarrassing for both him and Senior White Two.","The divine dragon continued, “After the Ten Heavenly Layers is the Lotus Formation, and finally from the Lotus you go to the Nascent Soul. This is the path taken by normal cultivators. Among these three, the Lotus Formation is merely a step of accumulation,","making it not hard but rather time-consuming. Little friend Tyrannical","Song should understand this, right?”","Song Shuhang nodded.","The Lotus Formation step was where cultivators would prepare and accumulate energy so that they could ultimately condense","a Nascent Soul. This step was very","time-consuming.","There were Sixth Stage True Monarchs who","spent a thousand years on this step alone. There were even some who did not have much","left to live that ended up getting stuck in this step, accumulating for a Nascent Soul until they died.","The divine dragon saying that Song Shuhang would be able to condense a Nascent Soul","within a hundred years was akin to saying that he was a genius among geniuses. It believed that with Song Shuhang’s solid foundation, he had a good chance of","condensing a Nascent Soul after accumulating","energy during the Lotus Formation for only a hundred years. “Under normal circumstances, even someone","as talented as Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song would need a lot of time to accumulate energy during this small realm. However, as you have the option of working together with a true dragon, coupled with the fact that you have the complete version of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), giving birth to a Nascent Soul will be better for you.” The divine dragon","wore a light smile on its face as it continued, “If you use this method, I estimate that you","can reduce the initial amount by fifty years if you cultivate diligently, giving birth to a Nascent Soul much earlier!”","A Nascent Soul within fifty years? Song","Shuhang scratched his head and thought that this should be an attractive plan. “What do you need us to do, Fellow Daoist Dragon?” Senior White asked directly. He found his interest piqued when he heard that","the divine dragon had a way to reduce the accumulation period in the Lotus Formation Realm through this method of giving birth to a Nascent Soul.","“Good question.” The divine dragon smiled","slightly. “Since Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song does not intend to work for a long time, what do you think of a part-time job? After you complete your task, as a reward, I will tell you and Fairy White Dragon about this method. I can also guide you if you need help.”","“Part-time job?” The corners of Song Shuhang’s mouth twitched. Senior White asked, “What will he do as a","part-time worker, train those who are participating in the trial?” “Yup. That’s exactly what he’s going to do.”","The divine dragon laughed. “So, are you up for it?” Song Shuhang looked at Senior White. Senior White nodded. “I feel that being a trial","officer should be pretty fun, and if you meet Sixteen, you can give her some help and make things easier for her.”","Senior White is simply too witty. However, is it really okay to talk about this matter in such an upright manner? Song Shuhang raised his head and said to the","divine dragon, “Sure, I’ll take the position.” Today, he was going to be a trial officer."]},{"number":2044,"title":"Chapter 2044 - Experiencing all kinds of things is what made Song Shuhang strong","paragraphs":["Chapter 2044 Experiencing all kinds of things is what made Song Shuhang strong","“Are you sure you want to take this job?” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair swayed in the wind as she said, “You do know that temporary workers receive the most blame, right?”","Song Shuhang replied boldly, “That’s not a problem. I’ll take the position.”","First, Senior White suggested taking this job. Second, he could give Sixteen some leeway in the trial, so why not just take the job?","With Senior White around, even if something did happen, he would definitely not have to shoulder the blame. Instead, the blame would probably fall onto the world itself, so Song Shuhang felt at ease.","!!","“Then, the deal is sealed.” The divine dragon rubbed its claws and temporarily transferred some of its authority to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was given the authority of a trial officer.","Everyone who passed Song Shuhang’s trial could go to the divine dragon to receive the dragon’s blessing and have their (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) improved and a dragon tattoo added to their holy apes.","As for the content of the trial, the divine dragon gave Song Shuhang the freedom to decide it. It did not plan on interfering with Song Shuhang’s trial method. The only requirement it had was that the difficulty of the trial had to meet a certain standard.","In addition, the divine dragon gave Sage White and Fairy White Dragon some authority as well, because it saw that the duo was also very interested in the matter.","It lured one worker and got two more for free. It was a great deal.","Moreover, this was a deal where it made a huge profit-it was the kind of deal where it bought a potato and got two gold bars as","extra.","The divine dragon floated nearby happily, entering into observer mode.","It was different from the ape kings. Their trials were changed every year but in name only. The main purpose remained the same, which was to send the trial takers to the golden moon.","On the other hand, the divine dragon had to change the content of its trial every year. Because of that, over the years, it had lost its","imagination. And now, it could no longer come up with new ways to test the trial takers.","It hoped that little friend Tyrannical Song could give it a surprise, helping it come up","with new ideas.","Song Shuhang, Senior White, and Sister White Dragon descended to the ground.","Song Shuhang asked, “Senior White, what do you think should be the content of our trial?”","“How about you just use the Expert’s Appraisal?” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword","suggested the most realistic plan. In this way, they could identify the peerless experts within the group with a single glance.","“If possible, I would rather not use that here,” Song Shuhang retorted.","He had already given too much “love” to the universe. He felt that he needed to take it slow and improve his image. This was to make sure that when he ascended to the Eighth Stage Realm for real and he held his Divinity Show, he would be received in a more positive","manner.","“Yes, let’s keep the Impregnating gaze as a","last resort,” Senior White agreed. He said this because none of the trial takers was immune to the Impregnating Gaze, so no one was going to pass the test.","However, the Impregnating Gaze could make it into the trial even if it was not used directly. After all, it could be used as a way to","test the mental strength of the trial takers.","Senior White asked, “Soft Feather, Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, as inner demons, you should be able to create a bunch of phantoms of Shuhang, right? They don’t need to have any attack power. It’s fine as long as they can replicate his appearance.” Scarlet Heaven Sword replied, “That’s a very simple matter. After all, Shuhang’s body is right here. It’s as simple as copy and paste.”","“Very good.” Senior White nodded. “In a while, place some of Shuhang’s phantoms in various places in the trial area. After the trial","takers enter the area, make it look like the phantoms are casting the Impregnating Gaze on them. This method can be used to test","their will.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Good idea. Soft Feather, let’s do it.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather stepped out from Song Shuhang’s shadow and reminded gently, “My name is Butterfly Song White","Creation Yellow Trigram Lychee Six Dou Phoenix.”","“Nobody is going to remember that name.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword could not","help but retort.","The black-skinned Soft Feather looked","aggrieved. Regardless, she and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword began making phantoms with Song Shuhang’s appearance in mind. Then, according to Senior White’s instructions, spread them all over the trial","area.","Song Shuhang took out a small notebook and","began to take notes. When he returned to the Black Dragon World, he would set up a new inheritance area for Scarlet Pupil.","He could just copy Senior White’s plans for","the current trial and have Scarlet Pupil go through the same tests.","“By the way, have you experienced anything particularly thrilling?” Senior White asked while pinching his chin. If anybody had any","such experiences, he could make them part of the trial. “There are quite a few.” Song Shuhang quickly ran through his memories ever since","he entered the world of cultivation and blurted out, “One example is when I just picked up Senior White after you came out of seclusion. Back then, the large hole that Senior White created after falling to the","ground made my entire body go weak.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair above Song Shuhang’s head shook lightly, silently moving down to his back from the top of his head.","“Mm-hm, we can work with that.” Senior","White nodded. “After the trial takers come here and pass the test of will, Shuhang can go","over and fall onto the ground in front of them.”","Song Shuhang looked confused. Why am I the one who has to do that?","“Because you’re the trial officer,” said Senior","White calmly. At this moment, he also had a small notebook in his hand and was writing something down.","“Wait, Senior White. I’m afraid I won’t be","able to blow up that big of a hole when I fall.”","Song Shuhang tried changing Senior White’s mind. Senior White smiled at Song Shuhang and said, “Don’t worry, I will use a magical technique when you fall to make sure you recreate the effect.”","Song Shuhang: Did I just screw myself over?","“Also, I propose that we have Shuhang release","his illusory reality.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested after arranging Song Shuhang’s phantoms.","“But my Pseudo Illusory Reality does not have any lethality. At most, it can do some heavenly-tribulation-type damage,” said Song Shuhang. Additionally, the ending in his illusory reality was usually a scene of him","burning on a demonic god pillar, screaming as he died. It was very embarrassing for him.","“That’s not the illusory reality I’m talking about. I’m referring to the ‘death experience’","that you showed back when we were in the Black Dragon World.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword was indeed an inner demon, and it had many deranged ideas. What it was referring to was what Scarlet","Pupil saw back then, when the young boy had experienced Song Shuhang’s various deaths. This included when Song Shuhang was beaten to death over and over again in the scholarly faction’s world of the golden lotus by the fat ball. Back then, copious amounts of blood were left all over the place.","Then, there was the agonizing experience","from when Song Shuhang died by forging his own body into a life-bound magical treasure. After that was when he closed up and inexplicably exploded and died. Besides those, there was also that time in the","Black Dragon World when, in order to avoid the Heavenly Punishment, Song Shuhang asked Senior White’s clone to behead him and","cut him into small pieces. Also, there was the Heavenly Tribulation","Realm incident, when he chose to accept Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s request and was pulled into the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm. Sage Monarch Melon Eater had only protected Li Yinzhu and left Song Shuhang to fend for himself, resulting in him being blasted apart.","And many more. These painful experiences were what made Song Shuhang who he was today! “Not bad.” Senior White recorded everything in his notebook. “If we add some of my own","ideas, we’ve almost got enough. Let’s work together and try to prepare the area before the next wave of practitioners arrive!”"]},{"number":2045,"title":"Chapter 2045 - Even being able to close their eyes had become a luxury","paragraphs":["Chapter 2045 Even being able to close their eyes had become a luxury","During the first phase of the golden moon trial, after much effort, the participants managed to deal with the numerous inner-demon-like monsters.","The beast cultivators also suffered some losses. Some of their unfortunate members had been sucked dry by the monsters, to the point where they had become skin and bones. These guys would have to rest for three to five months to return to their previous state.","The giant tree continued to systematically grab these people and send them into its cabins.","After all the monsters were slain, the giant tree uprooted its body from the golden moon’s surface. Then, along with a loud rumbling sound, it set off to return to Garre Holy Mountain, bringing back those that had failed the trial with it.","!!","After witnessing the scene, the remaining trial takers sighed in relief.","*****","A tall, sheep-horned female beast cultivator said, “It’s time to head to the next challenge.”","Most of the beast cultivators regarded this upcoming trial with great importance.","Although the General Principles Chapter of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) was hidden in the trial grounds, not everyone was aiming for it.","The goal of the majority of the Fifth and Sixth Stage beast cultivators was the upcoming trial, where they would be assessed and acknowledged by the divine dragon. If they passed the test, then their (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique) would become complete, and their holy apes would gain a dragon pattern.","In the future, after they ascended to the Seventh, Eighth, or Ninth Stage, they would have another opportunity to participate in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial. It was not too late to acquire the final chapter of their cultivation technique at that time.","A one-horned beast cultivator said, “By the way, I saw Senior Tyrannical Song and Sage White move on to the next stage earlier. I wonder if they have already passed the assessment of the divine dragon.”","The members of the Beast Realm both loved","and feared Tyrannical Song.","There was no need to mention why they feared him. As for why they loved him, it was because he had given medicines and tips to the Beast Realm that helped them treat those who got infected with the evil energy of the Netherworld. In addition, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, himself, was an expert in treating those who were inflicted with the evil energy of the Netherworld and had personally cured many patients.","Nearly every person participating in the trial","had at least one of their friends or relatives treated by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song either directly or indirectly. As such, most of them had received his help in one way or","another.","The tall, sheep-horned female beast cultivator said, “Overall, I hope that Senior","Tyrannical Song can pass the test of the divine dragon. It would be even better if he","has already gone to the next challenge.”","Because of the grace bestowed upon the Beast Realm by Senior Tyrannical Song, nobody wanted him to fail.","But at the same time, they hoped they would not encounter him during the trial.","For this reason, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song having passed the assessment or having","already entered the next area—or the one after that—was what the beast cultivators","thought to be the best case.","“With Senior Tyrannical Song’s strength, he has definitely left us behind.” A snake-scaled beast cultivator laughed and said, “Maybe he’s already several challenges ahead. To be honest, we probably don’t have to worry about him at all.”","The one-horned beast cultivator smiled and","said, “That’s right. We, as Sixth and Seventh Stage cultivators, should not worry about Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who is at the Eighth Stage.”","In the crowd, Sixteen smiled but did not say anything. She continued listening to the beast cultivators around her praising Song","Shuhang.","Having experienced the sudden attack of the","monsters during the first phase of the golden moon trial, when they headed to the second area, most of the trial takers chose to move in groups, watching out for each other. Soon after, the first batch of trial takers","arrived at the area of the second test.","“We’re here!” said the snake-scaled beast cultivator.","A black-furred beast cultivator said, “Be","careful. There’s a shadow beast ahead!”","At the border of the area where the second part of the trial was to be held, there was a dog-like shadow beast tied to a thin branch. The dog-like shadow beast raised its eyes and","weakly glanced at the trial takers. Then, it closed its eyes, lay on the ground, and pretended to be a dead dog.","A beast cultivator frowned, “Why is there a shadow beast in the second part of the trial?”","These shadow beasts could shuttle back and","forth between the shadows. Their means of attack were strange and difficult to defend against. These beast cultivators had managed to make their way here after killing a whole","group of monsters, so they were not that keen on having to fight again so soon. The snake-scaled beast cultivator said, “I’ll go kill that shadow beast.”","At this time, the sheep-horned female beast cultivator hurriedly said, “Wait, don’t be impulsive. I remember that Senior Tyrannical Song grabbed a dog-like shadow beast when he left the area of the first test. It’s very likely","that this shadow beast is part of Senior Tyrannical Song’s loot.” “Yeah, I also remember Senior Tyrannical Song dragging away a dog-like shadow beast","earlier.”","“But why did Senior Tyrannical Song leave","this beast tied here? Could it be that he has not passed the second trial yet?”","“I don’t see Senior Tyrannical Song or the","others that were with him anywhere nearby. Could he... have failed?”","“With the strength that Senior Tyrannical","Song possesses, there is no way he fails this kind of test. Perhaps Senior Tyrannical Song just tied the shadow beast here and went to the next area...”","“Regardless of what happened, let’s just ignore this shadow beast.”","And","so, this group of beast cultivators that had nine members bypassed the dog-like shadow beast and entered the second test’s","area.","As soon as they stepped into the area of the","second test, they felt as if the entire world had started spinning. Immediately afterward, the nine people were sent to nine different locations.","[Spatial energy?]","The nine beast cultivators were startled, and","they all immediately assumed defensive stances.","At this moment, the sound of a microphone","being tuned rang in their ears. “Welcome to the second test of the golden","moon trial, where you will be taking on the hardest challenge of your lives. Those who pass this test will be acknowledged by the divine dragon and receive its blessing. Those who fail will fall into a hell full of despair and","be unable to reincarnate for eternity.” A","gentle female voice sounded in everyone’s","ears.","As the language of the Beast Realm was used,","there were no problems with regard to communication.","The nine beast cultivators gulped anxiously.","“Are you ready? I’ll give you ten seconds to prepare. Widen your eyes, prepare your defenses, and welcome the harshest test!” The nine beast cultivators all focused. They fully activated their (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique), and various defensive measures emerged around them in quick succession.","Their eyes stared straight ahead with rapt attention.","Then, a familiar figure that the beast cultivators respected, loved, and feared","appeared in their field of view.","After this figure appeared, a pair of deep eyes shone ominously.","“What is love?”","“What is filial piety?”","“Do you know the greatness of maternal","love?” Then, a terrifying light appeared in the pair of","eyes.","Due to the nine beast cultivators focusing as much as they could, their eyes wide and staring straight ahead, they did not have the","slightest chance of escaping the sudden flash of light.","At this moment, even closing their eyes had become a luxury!","They were left with no way out. “Ty... Tyrannical... Song...” The nine beast cultivators screamed in","unison, their minds collapsing. They had thought of thousands of possible","outcomes and many kinds of cruel tests.","However, they did not expect that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would ambush them all","of a sudden.","He was also a trial taker, so why did Senior Tyrannical Song suddenly become part of the","test?"]},{"number":2046,"title":"Chapter 2046 - Director White, there’s something wrong with the script!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2046 Director White, there’s something wrong with the script!","Were we not on the same side until a moment ago? When did you become a trial officer?!","The beast cultivators had readied themselves, but they were still taken by surprise.","They knew that this trial would be especially harsh, but they did not expect that the test would be administered by Senior Tyrannical Song himself.","Whenever Tyrannical Song’s eyes lit up, the world dimmed.","!!","Even though the Impregnating Gaze did not really take effect, the beast cultivators began feeling some discomfort in their stomachs.","“The problem here is that I already understand maternal love very well.” The snake-scaled beast cultivator burst into tears. “Additionally, my race is oviparous, so giving birth is not this painful for us. Senior Tyrannical Song’s Impregnating Gaze is really unfair to those who are oviparous like me.”","“Heavens, this fellow does have a point.” Song Shuhang found himself speechless.","Although it was just a phantom of Song Shuhang that was in front of the","snake-scaled beast cultivator, Song Shuhang,","Senior White, Sister White Dragon, and the divine dragon were all monitoring the reactions of the cultivators.","After all, they needed to observe the trial takers before assessing them and giving them a score, which would determine if they passed or not.","In addition, in order to allow everyone to understand the language of the beast","cultivators, the monitoring screen that Shuhang and the others were looking at had subtitles.","The Impregnating Gaze really does seem to be quite unfair to those who lay eggs. Next time I see the Sage in my nightmare... Song Shuhang was in the middle of his thoughts when he shook his head with a wry smile.","Sister White Dragon said, “Anyway, let’s rate these nine trial takers.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair asked,","“Which one are you going to rate first?”","“Let’s start with the snake-scaled beast","cultivator. Out of 10 points, I can give them 6 points for their response,” said Song","Shuhang. As the snake-scaled beast cultivator had pointed out a shortcoming of the","Impregnating Gaze, he felt the need to reward","them with an additional point.","“I’ll give them a 4, no more than that.” Sister","White Dragon was unexpectedly stern.","Senior White pinched his chin and said,","“There’s no need to be so strict. I feel that they’re quite amusing. I’ll give them 6 points.”","The divine dragon took out a pen and recorded, “After averaging your ratings, the snake-scaled beast cultivator gets 5.3 points out of 10.”","Song Shuhang said, “Let’s rate the","sheep-horned beast cultivator next. When she","faced the Impregnating Gaze, other than some panic at the beginning, she was relatively calm throughout the entire process. I give her 8 points. Her reaction reminded me of that evil demon from the Netherworld that","had given birth to many children.”","Sister White Dragon nodded and said, “Women do have an advantage when faced with the Impregnating Gaze. After they have experienced it once, their resistance toward the second time should improve significantly. I’ll also give her 8 points.”","After experiencing it once, the second time","usually went smoother. As long as somebody had given birth enough times, they would probably develop a resistance toward the Impregnating Gaze.","Senior White said, “I’ll also give her 8","points.”","The divine dragon continued to record the","scores. “Alright, then the sheep-horned beast cultivator gets 8 points out of 10.”","Song Shuhang, Senior White, and Sister White","Dragon quickly rated the nine trial takers, and the divine dragon calculated their average score and recorded it down.","The four worked together with great coordination.","The nine beast cultivators screamed for a long","time, but nothing happened.","They looked down at their flat bellies, and","then looked at the Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in front of them, wry smiles on their","faces.","“It was just an illusion.”","“From the looks of it, this phantom of Senior Tyrannical Song was part of the trial.”","“Was this to test our reaction?”","“Maybe it was to test out mental strength or","perhaps our willpower...’","“If this was part of the trial, I wonder how much we scored.”","Although the nine trial takers had been","separated, they had a way to communicate despite the long distance.","“We should watch out. There might be more phantoms of Senior Tyrannical Song.” “Moreover, we should not panic like we did","this time.”","“If we encounter Senior Tyrannical Song","again, we should first try to determine if the other party is real or not.”","While the nine trial takers were conversing with one another, they felt another turbulent wave, and the world seemed to start spinning","again.","A spatial ability had been used once again.","They were brought together. “Congratulations, you have passed the first test. Next, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song will present you with a reward.” The gentle woman’s voice sounded again. [Don’t let yourselves be deceived by her words.]","[If it wasn’t for her reminder last time that","had us widen our eyes and concentrate, we would not have been so frightened by Senior Tyrannical Song’s sudden appearance.]","[Mentally prepare yourselves. Don’t panic regardless of whether Senior Tyrannical Song’s phantom or real body appears before","us.]","The nine trial takers continued to communicate with each other. While they were communicating in secret, a","figure appeared in the air ahead of them—it was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. Song Shuhang smiled slightly as he looked at","the nine trial takers.","When they saw him, the nine trial takers","lowered their eyes in unison as a sign of respect.","Song Shuhang said, “First of all, let me congratulate you for passing the first test.” While speaking, he slowly moved forward.","According to the script, after taking ten steps, he would plunge to the ground, right in front","of the nine testers, and create a huge pit. Song Shuhang thought to himself, I’m sorry,","fellow daoists of the Beast Realm, but I’m just acting according to Director White’s script. Don’t blame me for this!","One step, two steps, three steps...","Suddenly, his foot slipped, and he plunged to","the ground. Song Shuhang looked confused. Director White, there’s something wrong","here! Didn’t the script say that I would only fall after taking ten steps? I’m not ready yet! Song Shuhang fell to the ground with a heavy crash.","His body was one made of wood, and if he did not hit the ground properly after the fall, he","would not be able to create the giant hole they were looking for.","“Boom~” At this moment, the ground shook.","Song Shuhang and the nine trial takers were all swallowed by the explosion. Immediately afterwards, there was a series of","screams.","Song Shuhang screamed the loudest while trying to play his part. This kind of explosion could not hurt him or","make him feel pain. However, he felt that","screaming miserably would help with their","plan.","At this moment, the second batch of trial takers had arrived in the area. This second batch included the team that","Sixteen and Daoist Turntable were a part of. Everyone could hear the incessant screams coming from the area ahead of them, and they","had also heard a loud explosion a few seconds","ago.","The people who were part of the second batch gulped involuntarily.","They all wondered what had happened to","evoke so much fear among the batch of trial takers ahead of them.","The screams of one man in particular made","them feel very anxious. The man’s cries made their hearts wrench. They all wondered as to just what kind of pain the owner of the cries","had to endure to scream out so miserably. Sixteen: “.” Isn’t that Shuhang’s voice?"]},{"number":2047,"title":"Chapter 2047 - I can’t help but smile","paragraphs":["Chapter 2047 I can’t help but smile","If that’s really Shuhang’s voice, does that mean that he’s in the middle of his test? Also, what exactly was Song Shuhang made to go through that he would scream so miserably?","Sixteen rubbed her brows. Her intuition told her that there was something wrong with this","scream.","The female beast cultivator in their team asked weakly, “Brother Turntable, do we really want to proceed?”","!!","“Let’s wait for now.” Daoist Turntable stretched out his hand and motioned for the team to sit down and rest to recharge their energies. Then, he reminded his team, “We should try to understand the situation first. According to my experience, the second trial on the golden moon is related to the divine dragon. This second test is always different. Let’s wait until the other trial takers are done, then we observe and try to get a gist of the situation.”","This was a very rational approach, and many of the other trial takers had the same idea as Daoist Turntable.","Unfortunately for them, this was within Director White’s expectations.","Twenty seconds after Daoist Turntable’s group sat down, a gentle female voice echoed in their ears from the trial area. “Welcome to the second area of the golden moon trial, where you will be taking on the harshest test of your lives. Those who pass this test will be acknowledged by the divine dragon and receive its blessing. Those who fail will fall into a hell of despair and be unable to","reincarnate for eternity!”","Daoist Turntable was taken aback.","Have we already entered the second area?","In the next moment, Daoist Turntable’s group felt as if the world had started spinning.","It was spatial energy. They had been moved to the trial area.","With this move, the trial takers were denied the chance to gather intelligence.","“Well done.” The divine dragon grabbed a small notebook with its claws and noted down","this tactic.","“Huh? That’s Sixteen. She’s here alongside Daoist Turntable’s team,” said Sister White Dragon. She had sensed Sixteen’s presence among the second batch of trial takers.","“Sixteen is here?” Song Shuhang, who was still screaming in the huge pit, stopped and jumped out. He seemed to be full of energy, just as if nothing had happened.","Then, he activated his authority as a trial","officer and gathered the members of Sixteen’s","team who were about to be split up.","As for the other trial takers of the second","batch, they were still split up.","It was only Sixteen’s team that was gathered","in the same location.","The divine dragon scratched its chin with its claw. It acquiesced to Song Shuhang’s actions and, at the same time, a smile emerged on its face.","Daoist Turntable shook his head, recovering from the dizziness brought about by the teleportation.","“What is this place?” asked a young beast cultivator who was a disciple of Daoist","Turntable.","Daoist Turntable replied, “This is the second area of the golden moon trial. As long as you can pass this test, you’ll receive the blessing of the divine dragon like I have. When you receive the blessing, a dragon pattern will be added to the bodies of your holy apes. Be careful, this second test is not to be taken","lightly.”","Daoist Turntable was a Seventh Stage Venerable right now, and he had participated in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial back when he was a True Monarch, receiving the blessing of the divine dragon. Now that he had reached the Venerable Realm, he joined the trial again in hopes of comprehending the General Principles Chapter of the (Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique).","While he was speaking, the gentle woman’s voice sounded again.","The content of the message was the same,","and it was to remind all the cultivators to open their eyes wide and focus on what was ahead of them.","Why does this voice sound like Pavilion Master Chu’s voice? Sixteen silently thought to herself.","While she was in thought, Song Shuhang’s","voice sounded in the ears of everyone on Sixteen’s team. “Here’s a tip. Prepare yourselves as you’re going to be facing the Impregnating Gaze in a short while. Don’t worry as it’s just an illusion. Be brave.”","Daoist Turntable looked around suspiciously.","“I seem to have heard Senior Tyrannical Song’s voice just now.”","In the meantime, while the other trial takers","were focused on staring ahead, Song Shuhang’s phantoms made their appearance.","Then, his deep eyes conveyed the greatness of maternal love to all the trial takers.","“Ty-Tyrannical Song!” the trial takers all exclaimed in unison.","As for Sixteen’s team, due to Song Shuhang’s","reminder, although they were a little surprised, they did not panic. “Why did Senior Tyrannical Song appear here?” asked the young beast cultivator.","“This is just a phantom... But as a trial taker","himself, why did Senior Tyrannical Song become part of the trial?” Daoist Turntable","frowned.","“Even if it was just a phantom...” The female","beast cultivator in their team grabbed a medicine bottle with trembling hands, took out two pills, and swallowed them. She","suffered from the Tyrannical Song Speech Sequelae, so even though she knew that it was","an illusion, she could not help but have an adverse reaction to Shuhang’s sudden appearance.","The young beast cultivator asked, “Was it","Senior Tyrannical Song who warned us just now?”","Everyone in their team turned to look at","Sixteen.","After all, Sixteen was the only one who knew Senior Tyrannical Song. Was the trial officer helping them cheat?","“Wonderful! I’m getting more and more","ideas.” The divine dragon quickly recorded","what had happened in its notebook, writing down everything Song Shuhang did. As long as a warning was issued, the trial","takers would feel relieved, to the point that","they dared to look at Tyrannical Song’s phantom directly. But what if Tyrannical Song’s phantom was replaced with another","test? What would happen if the trial takers were made to face an especially terrifying test when their guard was lowered?","Hiring little friend Tyrannical Song as a","part-time worker seemed to be working wonders!","Sister White Dragon said, “The second test","should be coming up next. How is Shuhang going to help them there?”","During the first test, he could secretly warn them of what was going to happen. However, during the second test, they would not have","any time to avoid the explosion even if they were warned in advance.","“Let’s wait and see,” said the divine dragon with a smile.","The free fall test was underway once more.","The second batch of trial takers was teleported over to the location of the second test. Meanwhile, the first batch was sent to","face the third test, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s nightmare.","Sixteen’s team reunited with the other trial takers of the second batch.","What’s the content of this test? Will Profound","Sage Tyrannical Song give us a hint again? Daoist Turntable thought to himself. While he was in thought, Song Shuhang’s real body appeared in front of everyone. Song Shuhang looked at Sixteen and smiled.","This time, he did not transmit his voice or give them any hints.","He began taking steps. One step, two steps, three steps... four steps...","It seemed like Director White had changed the","script again.","Previously, the explosion took place after three steps. Song Shuhang took a deep breath and took another step, then another.","After the sixth step, he felt his foot slide.","This is it!","Song Shuhang stretched out his arms and","grabbed his head, throwing it toward Sixteen. “Boom~”","The wooden body plunged to the ground, and","the power of the explosion swallowed the trial takers.","At that same time, Song Shuhang’s long hair","grabbed Sixteen and used his authority as a trial officer to bypass the flight restrictions placed in the area, dragging her into the sky.","From the sidelines, the divine dragon smiled again."]},{"number":2048,"title":"Chapter 2048 - Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is nowhere to be seen","paragraphs":["The divine dragon said while taking notes, “Maybe I should give little friend Tyrannical Song a reminder.”","Senior White thought for a while, then replied, “It’s okay. He’s having a good time.”","“You’re right. Then, I’ll just continue smiling,” said the divine dragon. Afterward, it continued to wear a bright smile on its face.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Are these two on the same wavelength? There’s actually someone who can be on the same wavelength as Fellow Daoist White?","!!","At this time, on the monitoring screen.","As she was timely brought away by Song Shuhang’s head, Sixteen managed to avoid the explosion.","As for the rest of her team, Song Shuhang was unable to help them.","After all, he only had one head, so he could not bring too many people with him. Even if his hair could turn into 20 arms, during a critical moment, he could only save Sixteen.","Besides, Daoist Turntable’s team was not as important to him as Sixteen, which was both a fact and a big factor.","From the beginning, he only planned on saving Sixteen anyway, so the others were doomed from the start.","Even if time were to rewind hundreds of times, he would not have changed his decision, and the ending would still be the same.","So, the rest of Daoist Turntable’s team and the second batch of trial takers could only face the explosion and get buried in the resulting huge pit.","They also wanted to rise in the sky like Song Shuhang, but the restrictions in the area forced them to keep their feet on the ground and endure the explosion.","Without the authority of a trial officer, it was impossible for them to rise up into the sky.","“Aahhh!” All kinds of screams echoed in the trial area.","In the end, the screams turned into a mournful ensemble.","In the sky, Sixteen steadied herself. She then stretched out her hands and embraced Song Shuhang’s head.","“It’s over.” Song Shuhang let out a breath of relief.","Below them was a hellish scene, one that the participants could not skip even if they wanted to.","After all, everything that was happening was part of the trial, and they would not get a good score by skipping it.","The more terrifying the test was, the more they had to apply themselves.","That was why it was a hell from which they could not escape.","Sixteen asked curiously, “Shuhang, how did you become part of the trial?”","Song Shuhang replied, “By applying for the position of temp trial officer. In short, I’m just doing my job.”","Sixteen: “...”","She knew she was somewhat different from other people, yet Song Shuhang was a freak even when compared to someone like her.","No matter how normal things looked, whenever Song Shuhang joined the fray, everything would become unpredictable.","Song Shuhang said, “After the explosion is the final test of this area. The last test will begin when all the trial takers have gathered as it requires Senior White’s help, and he does not want to waste too much time.”","Sixteen smiled and said, “That’s in character for Senior White.”","The explosions lasted for quite some time before subsiding. The more people entered the area, the greater the strength of the explosions.","Once the explosions subsided, the trial takers slowly climbed out of the huge pits.","Song Shuhang looked down and said, “It seems that no one has failed during this second test.”","Sixteen blinked and asked, “Were you hoping for people to fail during this test?”","“It’s contradictory, isn’t it?” said Song Shuhang as he looked up at the sky. Part of him hoped that the participants would fail and stop here.","At the same time, he was also looking forward to seeing how this group of trial takers would fare when faced with the third and final test in this area.","Because the third test was way more terrifying than the second test.","It was a test where the trial takers would have to experience death again and again, and that was something only a few could endure.","?????","Time slowly passed by.","After the third and fourth batches of trial takers arrived and passed the first two tests, the third and final test could finally begin.","Eventually, all the trial takers were moved in front of a gate.","The gentle woman’s voice echoed again. “Congratulations for passing the first two tests. You will be now facing the final test of the second trial on the golden moon.”","All the trial takers cheered up.","It was time to take on the final test, and as long as they passed it, they would be able to obtain the blessing of the divine dragon, and most of the trial-takers were here for that reason.","“Trial takers, please place your hands on the gate. The gate will send you to different tests which will be determined by the choice you make.” The gentle and lazy female voice was heard again.","Sixteen said, “The test is starting. Let’s go.”","“No, we don’t have to go down.” Song Shuhang willed it, and the wooden body lying at the bottom of a pit climbed out. Then, it jumped into the air and reunited with Song Shuhang’s head.","The test of the third and fourth batches of trial takers was carried out by his wooden body alone. Song Shuhang’s head had been in the air the entire time, observing the scene below.","Song Shuhang said, “Follow me. I will get you through the final test when the time comes.”","Sixteen giggled. “Okay.”","That gentle female voice echoed again, “The test will now begin.”","The trial takers gulped and gingerly placed their hands on the gate. Everyone had already fallen victim to the tricks of this gentle-sounding woman, so they all acted with caution toward anything she said.","Some people went as far as covering their hands with magical techniques or putting on magical treasures before pressing their palms on the gate.","When their palms touched the door, Sage White’s voice resounded in their minds.","Sage White’s voice was impossible for anyone who had heard his speech to forget.","[In an empty space with no shelter or cover, your enemy is 800 meters away from you, and they have already cast a wind spell. The spell takes the form of a sharp half-arc. Under the premise that there is no outside interference, what do you do in order to accurately avoid the attack or counter it?]","The trial takers were all dumbfounded.","This final test was very different from what they imagined.","However, there were many answers to this question.","According to the different cultivation techniques and magical techniques they practiced or their realm, there were many possible answers to this question.","Whether it was defending, dodging, or counterattacking, a thousand people might have a thousand different answers.","As the trial takers answered the question in their minds, their figures disappeared from before the gate.","Afterward, they found themselves in separate worlds.","No matter which trial taker it was, and regardless of which world they were sent to, they immediately started observing their surroundings.","Then, they simultaneously let out breaths of relief.","This time, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was nowhere to be seen!","Truth be told, they all held some fear toward him."]},{"number":2049,"title":"Chapter 2049 - On this day, we’re all Tyrannica","paragraphs":["The beast cultivators respected and loved Senior Tyrannical Song, but at least for the duration of this trial, they did not want to see him again.","Now, in this last test of the second moon trial, everyone felt relieved when they discovered that Senior Tyrannical Song was nowhere to be seen.","“As long as Senior Tyrannical Song is not here, we can pass this last test!” This thought and belief emerged in the minds of 90% of the trial takers.","Anyway, the participants were placed inside different “worlds.”","Someone landed beside a blonde fairy maiden with a blurry face who was busy hammering a magical treasure on a forging table.","Someone sat quietly in the middle of a group of seniors discussing the Great Way. Similarly, the faces of this group of seniors were all blurred, and it was impossible to make out their real appearance.","Someone stood opposite a giant whale. The giant whale looked up at the sky and seemed to be waiting for something.","Someone found himself fighting a sci-fi-looking metal man.","There were a few who were relatively luckier and happened to end up with Sage White. They chatted with Sage White as they traveled through a city, and they felt as if they were going to melt at the sight of Sage White’s smile.","Finally, a group of people appeared beside a bunch of disciples of the scholarly faction. The disciples seemed to be very busy. Similarly, they also had blurred faces.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Behind the scenes, Senior White and Sister White Dragon had already prepared everything.","What the trial takers were experiencing now was an illusory reality created by Senior White. These worlds were based on Song Shuhang’s memories, with a touch of Senior White’s artistic sense attached to them.","As long as there was a script, there was nothing that Director White could not do inside his Illusory Reality World.","After ascending to the Eighth Stage, Director White’s Illusory Reality World had become very special. Everything inside the illusory could be changed according to his will.","This was something that Song Shuhang had personally experienced not too long ago.","Meanwhile, Sister White Dragon was responsible for replicating the “pain” that was experienced by Song Shuhang in his memories and transferring it to Director White’s Illusory Reality World.","Song Shuhang simply stayed in the trial area, cooperating with Sister White Dragon to pass on the “pain.”","Senior White said, “Let’s begin.”","Sister White Dragon said, “I’m ready.”","The divine dragon quietly gulped.","Song Shuhang received the signal from Sister White Dragon.","“Let the world feel pain!” Song Shuhang said in a low voice while holding Sixteen.","Sixteen blinked at him with uncertainty in her eyes.","Song Shuhang replied earnestly, “This is also part of my job.”","As he said that, the worlds where the trial takers had been transported to came to life.","The plot of each illusory world began to unfold.","The blonde fairy maiden who was holding a big and small hammer said, “Are you ready? Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, the next step is the final step required to complete the forging of the magical treasure. Are you ready to pay the price?”","Among the group of seniors who were discussing the Great Way, someone looked at the trial taker and said calmly, “Tyrannical Song, what do you think?”","The giant whale said, “Come, this is the last heavenly tribulation! Endure it, Tyrannical Song. Whether you live or die all depends on this moment!”","The sci-fi-looking metal man said fiercely, “Tyrannical Song, this time, your demise is set in stone!”","Sage White’s eyes lowered slightly, and he said softly, “Forgive me, Tyrannical Song.”","The scholarly faction disciples suddenly turned to look at the trial taker and said, “Senior Tyrannical Song, you’re here.”","Wait, what?","Tyrannical Song?","Are they referring to us?","The trial takers in each world were stunned, frozen in their original positions.","They thought that there would no longer be any appearances of “Senior Tyrannical Song” in this final test. It was also because of that thought that they had greater confidence in passing this test.","However, none of them expected such a plot twist.","They would not get to “see” Tyrannical Song in this final test because they... had become Senior Tyrannical Song!","This plot twist hit was so unexpected that the trial takers were all caught off-guard.","An ominous premonition flooded everyone’s heart.","We’ve become Senior Tyrannical Song...? What do we do now? What can we do?","Some people tried to struggle, but they could not control the development of the plot.","At this time, they were like performers acting according to a preset script.","With a loud clang, the blonde fairy maiden slammed down her big hammer onto the magical treasure. At the same time, the “Tyrannical Songs” who were in this scenario found themselves jumping onto the scorching-hot forging table.","The flames on the forging table were terrifying. They were not just some ordinary flames but the inextinguishable flames of a phoenix!","What’s Senior Tyrannical Song doing?","Is he using his body to forge a treasure?","Is he crazy? Senior Tyrannical Song is crazy!","Does he actually believe in the nonsense of using one’s body to forge a magical treasure?!","This kind of forging technique had long since been rejected by the world of cultivation because of how cruel it was and how low the probability of improving the quality of the magical treasure was.","Anyone who used this refining technique was an idiot!","The “Tyrannical Songs” that jumped onto the forging table were instantly melted down by the phoenix flames.","“Aahhh!” Screams of agony echoed through the sky, piercing through the clouds high above.","The pain that resulted from using one’s body to forge a treasure was absolutely horrifying.","Even if they were to use all the words and expressions they knew that were related to “pain,” it was far from enough to describe the terrifying pain they were experiencing at this moment.","Just when they thought that they were experiencing the worst pain that could be felt, the blonde fairy maiden’s big hammer smashed down on them.","The ruthless hammer taught them that pain was like the universe, boundless. When they thought they had reached the limit, they learned and experienced a new realm of pain with just one additional strike of the hammer.","They could not do anything but scream.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","In the discussion group, the batch of Tyrannical Songs who were in a daze felt their bodies heat up.","Immediately afterward, a tearing pain came from within their bodies.","“Boom~”","Their bodies exploded all of a sudden, turning into a bloody mist.","The pain of this explosion stemmed from the very core of their body.","Although it was just a brief moment of pain, it was devastating.","“Aahhh~” They all let out miserable screams.","Although the trial takers’ bodies had blown into a bloody mist, the pain still reverberated in their minds. Pain crashed into their minds like a tsunami. Wave after wave after wave slammed into them.","This was the art of pain.","In fact, Song Shuhang had no memory of what it was like when he had died from exploding into a bloody mist. Back then, he had been in a deep slumber, so he did not actually remember what it felt like. However, he had felt similar levels of pain before.","There had been several times when the pain from forcibly using the secret appraisal technique left him feeling as if he was on the verge of having his body torn to pieces. Moreover, the price that he had to pay for using the secret appraisal technique was ten times more terrifying than normal pain!","If he were to casually go through his memories, he would be able to easily extract an experience where he felt pain of this level.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","In the world with the giant whale.","The giant whale said softly, “Experience it for yourself. This Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation will be a very valuable experience for you.”","The eyes of all the Tyrannical Songs widened when they heard that.","What?","Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation?","“Boom~”","A bolt of tribulation lightning that could shake a person all the way to their core descended.","This lightning bolt carried with it a terrifying might and laws that could destroy worlds.","The Tyrannical Songs, who were on average at the Sixth Stage, were immediately forced to their knees when faced with tribulation lightning of this level."]},{"number":2050,"title":"Chapter 2050 - Senior White is happy","paragraphs":["It was really too difficult for a Sixth Stage cultivator to face a Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation.","The fact that they had not directly fallen unconscious when faced with its might showed that they had very strong wills. After all, those who could make it to the second trial of the golden moon were elite members of the Beast Realm.","In any case, 99.999% of the cultivators would tremble with fear before the heavenly tribulation, and the “Tyrannical Songs” in the world with the giant whale were no exception.","The difficulty of this test turned out to be way beyond their expectations.","“Boom~”","The trial takers could not resist in the slightest before the heavenly tribulation. They instinctively wanted to defend themselves, but their hearts were filled with despair at this moment.","The gap in strength was simply too big, and even comparing it to the distance between heaven and earth would not do it justice.","Not everyone was a little bug that was too hard to kill. Most people were only soft little bugs that would be pinched to death without problems.","The heavenly tribulation descended, and the batch of Tyrannical Songs died very quickly.","They were all blasted apart and reduced to ashes.","Similarly to the people in the other worlds, even if they had been turned to ash, they were still conscious. The pain of being blasted apart by the heavenly tribulation crashed into their minds.","Their desperate and fearful screams merged together, giving rise to a chorus of screams.","However, there was a slight difference from before. Among the people in this batch, there were three “Tyrannical Songs” whose screams had a hint of excitement in them.","After all, as the giant whale had said, this was an extremely valuable experience. These people got to experience the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation ahead of time and without repercussions.","Even if they had been reduced to ashes and were experiencing excruciating pain that made them scream at the top of their lungs, this was indeed a precious experience!","They were in pain, but they were also happy.","These three “Tyrannical Songs” in the giant whale world got to taste the beauty of pain for the first time in their lives.","These three had the aptitude to evolve into unkillable little bugs in the future.","One of them was the tiger cultivator, Daoist Turntable, from Sixteen’s team.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Compared to the misery mixed with excitement that the people in the giant whale’s world felt, the ones in the liquid metal man’s world were baffled.","These “Tyrannical Songs” experienced the battle with the liquid metal man firsthand.","They could feel that this was an epic battle!","It was a battle between existences at the very pinnacle of the universe.","Theoretically speaking, as long as they could understand even the slightest bit about this battle, they would gain countless benefits.","However, the level of the fight was simply too high.","Skipping a step was worthy of a genius, but if you were to skip too many, you would probably not understand anything.","Although the appearance of the liquid metal man was blurred to the point of it almost having become a human-shaped mosaic, it did not detract from its horror.","The terrifying aura that came from the liquid metal man seemed to be a combination of all the evils in the universe.","When looking at the other party, all the Tyrannical Songs felt great fear, and their thoughts slowed down.","In this state, it was even harder for them to comprehend anything.","It was this event that led to Song Shuhang’s current predicament. At that time, the Heavenly Punishment Twin Dragons collided and crushed Song Shuhang’s body, which was why Song Shuhang came to the Beast Realm seeking the General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","Halfway through the scenario, Senior White muttered softly, “Huh?”","He then hurried to pause the scene.","Sister White Dragon asked, “What’s wrong?”","After a moment of thought, Senior White said, “Hmm, let’s switch to a different scenario.”","The divine dragon asked curiously, “What’s wrong with this one?”","“I discovered something interesting. This scenario drew a response from a particular type of energy in the Beast Realm. Let’s save this scenario for later,” Senior White said with a big smile on his face.","This smile was a genuine one, different from the smile that he usually wore when trying to hide his charm.","It was the right choice to go to Garre Holy Mountain with little friend Shuhang. We encountered something interesting again.","Senior White was happy.","When Senior White smiled like this, his charm was fully at play.","Sister White Dragon and the divine dragon, who could both see him from close-up, were stunned senseless.","“I’m changing the scenario.” Senior White began to act.","In the next moment, the Tyrannical Songs who were fighting against the liquid metal man felt the world change.","All of a sudden, they were transferred to a dark world, and in front of them was the gentle-looking Sage White.","Sage White was holding a sharp sword in his hand as he spoke. “Forgive me, Tyrannical Song.”","The Tyrannical Songs who were originally in the liquid metal man scenario had all been moved here.","Above their heads, there was a group of dark clouds similar to tribulation clouds. The difference was that these dark clouds were a million times more terrifying than tribulation clouds!","While the heavenly tribulation was extremely powerful, it still left those who challenged it a chance to survive.","However, the dark clouds above their heads and the lightning that brewed inside them gave them a feeling of absolute despair. It felt as if it would not stop until the target was dead!","This was not the heavenly tribulation, but the Heavenly Punishment!","The Heavenly Punishment existed to completely obliterate its target. It mainly targeted Netherworld Rulers who forced their way into the main world or other special beings.","The lightning of the Heavenly Punishment continued brewing in the dark clouds.","Right after, boundless and terrifying pressure emerged from the clouds and assaulted the Tyrannical Songs.","A single thought reverberated in their minds,? I’m going to die! I’m going to die! I’m going to die!","Under the punishment lightning, their deaths were certain. They had no way of avoiding the lightning, and their bodies were sure to be obliterated.","The hearts of the Tyrannical Songs were filled with despair.","Most of these Tyrannical Songs turned their heads and looked at Sage White.","When faced with the Heavenly Punishment, only Sage White could bring them a hint of warmth.","Spending their last few moments with Sage White was their sole consolation.","Just as the Tyrannical Songs thought this, the sword in Sage White’s hand flashed.","The sword light turned into a net, slicing the Tyrannical Songs into neat little squares.","All of the Tyrannical Songs looked bewildered and could not believe what just happened.","Sage White had actually attacked them and sliced their body apart! What kind of horrible play was this?","In order to enhance the shock factor, Senior White added a few touches here and there.","He also added a slow-motion effect when the sharp net wrapped around the Tyrannical Songs’ bodies.","Every single one of the Tyrannical Songs felt the intricacies in the sharp sword light as it cut into their bodies, slicing them into numerous pieces.","It was a very painful experience.","Being personally killed by Sage White placed them in greater despair than being blasted to death by the Heavenly Punishment.","And so, the chorus of screams echoed again.","Behind the scenes, Senior White pinched his chin.","Sure enough, not everyone is like little friend Shuhang. Not everyone can taste pain and endure it...","With that, the Sage White scenario concluded.","Senior White’s attention moved to the final group of trial takers who were a part of the golden lotus scenario.","This scenario was the most tragic one out of all of them.","Senior White said softly, “Let’s conduct another experiment.”","The liquid metal man scenario had evoked a reaction from the Beast Realm’s energies.","So what about this golden lotus scenario?","According to Song Shuhang’s memory, the main villain of this plot was also Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball."]},{"number":2051,"title":"Chapter 2051 - Who killed Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?","paragraphs":["2","The divine dragon asked curiously, “Is there something wrong with this plot?”","At the same time, it wondered to itself, Why did Sage White look so happy when he was talking about this plot?","Senior White said calmly, “Overall, this is a rather miserable scenario.”","The divine dragon was even more confused. Then why are you so happy, Sage White?","It had previously felt that its train of thought matched Sage White’s fairly well. But in the blink of an eye, Sage White’s mind had jumped to a completely different world.","!!","At this moment, the scene on the monitor changed.","The screen focused on the last batch of trial takers, who had been sent to the golden lotus scenario. This batch was the smallest one among all of the batches, and their luck sure was something.","The Tyrannical Songs walked dazedly in the world of the golden lotus while the disciples beside them greeted them one after the other.","Senior White said, “Let’s begin.”","Sister White Dragon nodded and began casting spells.","The plot in the scholarly faction’s world of the golden lotus accelerated.","The Tyrannical Songs were invited by the scholarly faction’s leaders to stand by their side.","Everyone from the scholarly faction seemed to be waiting for something to happen.","The Tyrannical Songs were very curious about what the members of the scholarly faction were waiting for.","However, because Sage White was the one who wrote the script, he had cut out a lot of things. Therefore, the Tyrannical Songs did not know where they were or what they were there to do.","Suddenly, the scholarly disciples panicked.","Space shattered, and a steel finger entered everyone’s field of vision.","“Aahhh!” One of the leaders suddenly screamed. It was as if what the steel finger had shattered was not the space around them but his body.","In the air above, the steel finger shook gently.","“[Angry laugh] Who left a mark on this world? Who took away my treasure?” A robotic voice reached their ears.","Right after that, a terrifying pressure descended on everyone.","When they heard this voice, the Tyrannical Songs in the trial felt pain in their souls, and their bodies felt as if they were being torn apart.","I t wasn’t me. I didn’t do it! the Tyrannical Songs shouted in their minds.","It wasn’t me. I didn’t do anything. Don’t mind me, please!","At this moment, the leader of the scholarly faction that was screaming suddenly stretched out his hands and gently pushed the “Tyrannical Songs.”","All the Tyrannical Songs panicked.","What was that for? Are you pushing us out and making us the scapegoat here?","The scholarly faction leader said, “Sorry, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. You should not have been involved in this issue. I’ll send you away.”","The robotic voice said angrily, “[Angry laugh] Do you want to leave? No one can leave! You all have to die!”","The steel finger violently poked at them.","Filth, extreme evil, and terrifying energy exuded from the steel finger. This energy was the evil energy of the Netherworld, and not just any kind. It was the most powerful evil energy found in the Netherworld.","Under the machinations of the steel finger, the evil energy turned into a storm and crushed everyone, including the trial takers who were in the scenario as Tyrannical Song.","They could not resist the power of the storm of evil energy at all.","The power of this storm was unfathomable, having the ability to even destroy worlds.","When the Tyrannical Songs faced this storm, they felt small and insignificant.","They did not even qualify as little bugs before this storm.","Copious amounts of blood flooded the place.","The blood of the trial takers and the blood of the scholarly disciples dyed the black storm a dark red, getting sprinkled all over the world they were in.","However, that was not the end of it. When their corpses fell to the ground, they were invaded by the evil energy of the Netherworld, which forced unimaginable torment on their souls.","They all experienced immense pain across their bodies, souls, and minds.","The extreme pain was beyond the limit of what the Tyrannical Songs could bear.","[Who is the owner of this metallic finger?]","[Who killed Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?]","[Was all of this experienced by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?]","[Did Profound Sage Tyrannical Song really suffer such pain? Was he tormented by the evil energy of the Netherworld to this point?]","[No wonder Senior Tyrannical Song could create a method for treating the evil energy of the Netherworld. His understanding of the evil energy comes from the depths of his soul.]","Every single thought that emerged in the minds of the Tyrannical Songs was turned into a comment that appeared across the monitoring screen behind the scenes.","It could be observed from these thoughts that their aptitude was the best one among all of the trial takers. They were not merely screaming and suffering as their minds could still afford to have some intelligible thoughts.","[I’m going to die, I’m really going to die!]","[Is there no one here to help me?!]","[My consciousness is beginning to fade...]","[This is the end...]","The Tyrannical Songs were finally put out of their misery.","[Is this how Senior Tyrannical Song died once? Due to that storm of evil energy?]","[It seems like Senior Tyrannical Song embarked on the road of revenge. So, this was the reason Senior Tyrannical Song later became an expert in the treatment of the evil energy of the Netherworld...]","Behind the scenes, Sister White Dragon stretched out her claw and pinched her chin. “I feel that Shuhang’s popularity in Beast Realm will rise again after this trial.”","It appeared that overthinking matters could, sometimes, lead to a positive outcome.","Some unreasonable things could end up looking a lot more reasonable after some overthinking.","Even Sister White Dragon, who was watching the comments from behind the scenes, felt like she was getting brainwashed by the comments. It turns out that little friend Song Shuhang became an expert in treating the evil energy of the Netherworld because of how deeply he hated it!","[It’s finally over. Is this what death feels like? How brutal...] This batch of Tyrannical Songs shared similar sentiments in their minds.","Over? No, not yet!","That leader of the scholarly faction who was screaming earlier stood up with great difficulty. He was covered in blood, and his eyes were filled with sadness.","He stretched out his hand and seemed to be casting a magical technique or trying to use some kind of authority.","Then, time seemed to start flowing backward.","All of the broken bodies, crushed flesh, and blood returned to their original state.","The Tyrannical Songs were resurrected, and so were the disciples of the scholarly faction.","The Tyrannical Songs who were part of the trial were dumbfounded.","The robotic voice said, “[Sneer] Resurrecting won’t save you.”","The finger moved again.","The storm of death appeared once again.","[F*ck, it still isn’t over?] The minds of all the Tyrannical Songs collapsed at once.","They had experienced a cruel and brutal death once, and they did not want to experience it again.","Behind the scenes, Senior White nodded and asked, “What’s scarier than a tragic death?”","The divine dragon answered, “Two tragic deaths.”","Senior White continued, “What’s more terrifying than two tragic deaths?”","The divine dragon replied, somewhat uncertain, “Another tragic death?”","“No, an infinite loop of tragic deaths.” Sister White Dragon gently pushed up one of her claws along the bridge of her nose. In the future, she planned to order a pair of glasses, ones that a dragon could use.","The divine dragon gulped and asked, “Then... Are they going to be dying forever?”","Senior White looked at the Beast Realm, which was below the golden moon.","When they would stop depended on the evil energy of the Netherworld spread across the Beast Realm."]},{"number":2052,"title":"Chapter 2052 - Where is this holy knight from? How is he so good at healing?","paragraphs":["The owner of the steel finger that had repeatedly crushed Song Shuhang in the world of the golden lotus was the fat ball.","The liquid metal man’s scenario had evoked a reaction from the fake treasures used to spread the evil energy of the Netherworld in the Beast Realm, so could this other scenario do the same?","This time, Senior White was ready, and he was looking forward to what would happen next.","It seemed like the Netherworld Fat ball was scheming something. At the very least, it did not seem like it had spread so many fake treasures across the Beast Realm just to increase the population of evil demons.","With so many fake treasures scattered across the Beast Realm, it seemed like the prelude to some sort of ritual or ceremony.","!!","And when the liquid metal man’s scenario had evoked a reaction from the evil energy of the Netherworld inside the fake treasures, perhaps it had satisfied a certain part of the ritual.","Hmm... I wonder what will happen next!","Senior White’s gaze was locked onto the monitoring screen.","?????","In the world of the golden lotus scenario.","All the Tyrannical Songs were resurrected, bewildered looks on their faces. They did not expect the place they were in to have such a function.","However, the problem was that the steel finger was still there and the big shot had not left.","As the big shot had said, resurrection could not save them.","The storm of evil energy started brewing anew.","And with that, the wind of death blew once more.","The flesh of the Tyrannical Songs in the world of the golden lotus scenario was torn to pieces. Everything was swept up by the storm, and their bones were invaded by the evil energy of the Netherworld.","The same course of action, the same feeling, and the same agonizing pain.","All of the Tyrannical Songs “died” again, despair filling their hearts.","They did not even have the strength to scream this time. They could only make powerless grunts of pain.","[Is it finally over this time?]","[Means of resurrection are very precious for cultivators, especially if they are instantaneous like the one used just now. Even if we can be resurrected again, there should be some cooldown, right?]","[Let me sleep for a while. I just want to rest...]","Similar thoughts appeared in the minds of the “Tyrannical Songs.”","However, just as they were relieved and ready to go to a corner to lick their wounds, that leader of the scholarly faction stood up again. His head was lowered, and his whole body exuded a sorrowful aura.","The souls of the various Tyrannical Songs trembled.","Can we call you brother?","It’s fine even if you even want us to call you daddy, but can you just stay down?","If you keep standing while we’re lying down, we’ll be under a lot of pressure.","The sorrowful leader of the scholarly faction stretched out his hand and waved it. Afterward, an ability that was either from a magical technique or from his authority was activated.","The various Tyrannical Songs, who had just gotten ready to rest, were resurrected again.","And when that happened, all of them felt like crying.","They tried running away at their fastest speed to escape from the wretched world they were in.","However, how could they possibly outrun the magical technique of a Netherworld Ruler?","The brutal storm of evil energy came again, bringing death with it.","With that, the Tyrannical Songs got to experience despair again.","They died in the same way, feeling the same agonizing pain.","There was a saying that the more you experienced something, the more you got used to it.","This was already the third time, yet they still could not adapt to this kind of pain that was beyond the limit of what their minds, bodies, and souls could bear.","[This is already the third time! Please let there be no more of this. It should be over by now, right?]","[Are these the personal experiences of Senior Tyrannical Song? If so, how many times did Senior Tyrannical Song die?]","Just as the Tyrannical Songs were screaming and thinking to themselves, the leader of the scholarly faction stood up again.","The souls of all the Tyrannical Songs trembled again.","Where is this holy knight from? How is so good at healing? He can still resurrect us?!","Other resurrection techniques would feel ashamed if they knew how useless they are compared to this man.","Can’t you at least wait for the big steel finger to leave before resurrecting everyone?","Unfortunately, there was no option to opt out.","Despite their wishes, they were resurrected.","Perhaps due to having died too many times, a few of the Tyrannical Songs began having hallucinations.","They saw a huge projection of the Beast Realm’s War God floating in the air, smiling compassionately at all beings.","This War God was a very ancient Immortal native of the Beast Realm. He had created a lot of cultivation techniques suitable for beast cultivators, and he unified the Beast Realm back in his days.","Therefore, he was considered by the Beast Realm to be the common ancestor of beast cultivators.","The projection of the War God faced them and said with a gentle voice, “Do you desire power?”","This voice was ethereal, close yet far, male yet female, immature yet aged, and it sounded very strange. The voice carried a fatal temptation, which greatly affected people when they heard it.","[No, I desire death. Just let me stay dead for a long while, the kind where I’m not resurrected right after dying.]","[I desire warmth.]","[I desire love.]","[I desire world peace.]","All the Tyrannical Songs had long since been broken by the repeated cycle of death and resurrection. Other than the concept of “death,” their minds were filled with nothing else.","At this time, they longed for different kinds of things, and some even longed for death. However, one thing was for certain and that was that none of them longed for power.","Besides, the Beast Realm’s troubles with the evil energy of the Netherworld were well-known.","The beast cultivators who entered Garre Holy Mountain’s trial knew how people got infected by the evil energy.","Because of that, the trial takers were extra careful when it came to similar questions.","Even when in a state of unconsciousness, they instinctively avoided replying to this kind of question directly.","?????","The replies of the Tyrannical Songs also appeared on the monitoring screen.","Senior White smiled and said, “Here it is!”","Looking at their replies, there was no doubt that the trial takers had been affected by the Beast Realm’s fake treasures.","However, the golden moon above Garre Holy Mountain was a special space, and even Song Shuhang’s Inner World had been temporarily blocked while he was there.","Therefore, the evil energy of the Netherworld could not reach the golden moon. The only thing it could do was try to influence the minds of the trial takers from afar.","“It’s time to end the test,” said Senior White. After all, his objective could be considered complete.","Sister White Dragon’s claw tapped in the air and replied, “Got it.”","The divine dragon let out a breath of relief.","It felt that if the trial takers kept dying like this, they would have gone mad.","With Sister White Dragon’s help, the world of the golden lotus scenario finally entered its final stage.","The infinite loop was broken.","As the world of the golden lotus scenario was coming to an end, Senior White took out a disposable flying sword.","It was a flying sword made from a branch of Song Shuhang’s wooden body.","“Disposable flying sword, follow the traces and find the source!” Senior White made some hand seals, and the flying sword swiftly charged through the air."]},{"number":2053,"title":"Chapter 2053 - Negative distance","paragraphs":["How big can the distance between people be?","If one were to look at it from the point of view of ordinary people, then the world was huge and human beings were really small. A human would have a hard time trying to find another human even if it was not too far from them.","As for Sage White, it was just a matter of mood.","As long as he was in a good mood, even reaching the furthest end of the earth was not a problem for him.","As long as he wished for it, he could send one person to another person no matter how far they were, making the distance between them zero or even negative.","!!","“Go!” Senior White made a few hand seals, and the brand-new disposable flying sword embarked on its journey.","It rushed into the void by breaking the spatial confinement of Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds.","It rushed toward the source of the evil energy of the Netherworld by following that wisp of spiritual influence that Senior White had sensed earlier.","Just like that, it was gone.","The divine dragon said in shock, “Holy shiet.”","Space was locked in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds, and even if it were to use its authority as a trial officer, the divine dragon could use spatial abilities only within a small range.","Yet, Sage White simply ignored the restrictions and used his spatial abilities with relative ease.","Just who is this White?","He’s really... too cool.","Sister White Dragon tilted her head and said calmly, “Mind your language.”","The divine dragon opened its mouth but did not know what to say.","Embarrassed, it decided to stretch its body.","Now, it was time for it to give its blessing to the beast cultivators who had passed this test.","?????","On the trial grounds, the worlds created through the illusory reality were gone.","Along with that, the trial takers who were caught in an infinite loop returned to the real world.","They weakly fell to the ground and no longer moved.","“Let me lie down here for a while. Please, no one wake me up.”","“Same here. I don’t even have the strength to speak.”","“What did you guys experience? I was made to experience a scene where Senior Tyrannical Song self-destructed during a discussion. I will never forget that horrifying pain.”","“I experienced Sage White killing Senior Tyrannical Song. However, I am still deeply fond of Sage White.”","“As for me, I experienced Senior Tyrannical Song’s death from being forged into a magical treasure by a blond fairy maiden. It was shocking to see him use his body to forge the magical treasure. It was a very miserable experience.”","“Your experience is pure bliss compared to mine. What I experienced was an endless cycle of death and resurrection. That kind of despair... I don’t even know if it’s possible to describe it with mere words.”","The trial takers began exchanging their experiences.","It was similar to how students would meet up after an exam to share their experiences. These trial takers talked about their tests and what they had learned from them.","“The pain that Senior Tyrannical Song has experienced is far above our understanding.”","“How many times has he experienced death and despair over the course of his long life?”","“Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is the first Sage in a thousand years, and my master speculated that he should not have lived over a thousand years. In less than a thousand years, he has actually experienced so many hardships. Sure enough, the path of every Sage is filled with blood and enemies.”","The opinion that the beast cultivators had of Tyrannical Song rose again.","In the air, Song Shuhang was holding Sixteen in his arms.","As a trial officer, he could conceal his presence and make it so that he would not be noticed by the trial takers.","Song Shuhang said with a sigh, “, I wonder what they’ll think if I let them know that I experienced all that stuff in half a year...”","Sixteen stretched out her hand and gently caressed Shuhang’s face.","The distance between them seemed to have shortened, and so had the distance between their hearts.","At this time, a cute flower suddenly bloomed on Song Shuhang’s head.","“Pfft~” Sixteen could not help but burst into laughter.","At the same time, dark clouds appeared in the bright sky, lightning flashing within them.","Then, the huge figure of the divine dragon appeared among the clouds.","Its appearance represented the end of this portion of the trial.","The divine dragon said, “Thank you for your hard work, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. Please go over there and get some rest.”","But as Sister White Dragon did not come out to translate its words, Song Shuhang just stood there dumbfounded.","The divine dragon looked up at the sky and let out a deep sigh, choosing to ignore Song Shuhang and Sixteen for the time being.","It then lowered its head to face the group of trial takers.","The divine dragon said solemnly, “I congratulate you, brave warriors of the Beast Realm. Every one of you has passed this test, which was quite different from the usual ones. Nevertheless, know that I saw all the hard work you put in to make it through.”","Its voice was full of majesty.","Song Shuhang noticed that when the divine dragon spoke, the language of the dragons and the language of the Beast Realm sounded in their ears at the same time.","This should be a special ability of the divine dragon, right?","The trial takers raised their heads and looked at the divine dragon in surprise.","“I recognize your efforts, and as a reward for your struggles, I bestow upon you my blessing.” The huge body of the divine dragon shuttled back and forth among the clouds.","As its majestic voice echoed, the blessing ceremony began.","The bodies of the beast cultivators who had passed the trial started to heat up.","Their respective holy ape projections appeared above their heads, quietly accepting the blessings of the divine dragon. The power belonging to the “dragon” began to circulate in the bodies of the holy apes.","For those who were receiving the blessing for the first time, a dragon pattern emerged on their holy ape projections, just like it had happened with Song Shuhang.","As for those who were receiving the blessing for the second time, the dragon pattern on their holy apes became larger. In addition, it felt like the pattern had changed from a 2D style to a 3D style. It was as if the picture of the dragon was going to come alive and jump out of the holy apes’ bodies.","With that, the dragon’s acknowledgment ceremony concluded.","After resting for a short while, the trial takers got up and headed deeper into the trial grounds as instructed by the divine dragon.","Next, they were headed into the Purgatory Tunnel of the General Principles Inheritance Land.","Once the trial takers began leaving the area, the divine dragon pointed its claw at Song Shuhang and Sixteen, motioning for them to follow.","It was going to take Song Shuhang to Fairy White Dragon and then give them a reward.","?????","Meanwhile, Sage White’s disposable flying sword broke through layers upon layers of space, moving forward bravely.","After one last spatial jump, it appeared in an open area.","When it traversed space, it used the Space-Time Traversal ability of the giant turtles of disaster, which was an especially strange and wondrous spatial ability that not even the Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball could detect.","The disposable flying sword eventually arrived at the ruins of an abandoned palace.","These ruins were filled with pitch-black crows.","The dense murder of crows covered the entire ruins, and this scene alone could make one’s scalp tingle.","These crows, which should have been rather noisy, did not make a single sound while inside the ruins.","“Whoosh~” After the disposable flying sword finished shuttling through space, it struck a hard object.","The distance between itself and this hard object had become negative."]},{"number":2054,"title":"Chapter 2054 - Information waiting to be deleted 1","paragraphs":["Chapter 2054: Information waiting to be deleted 1","“Plup~”","A beautiful flower bloomed in the air.","This was a flower that only bloomed from creatures with blood in their body, and it was known as a “blood flower.”","In the eyes of some people with particularly twisted characters, this was the most beautiful flower in the world.","At this moment, the blood flower was blooming on a large monument made of black stone.","“Aaahhhh!” A scream came from the monument.","The disposable flying sword that Senior White had launched was stuck in the back of the monument, and blood was constantly pouring out from the crack. It was as if a Coca-Cola bottle had been stabbed with a knife after being shaken violently.","The stone monument spoke again. “Ahhh! Where did this sword come from? Who shot it here? Why didn’t I notice it?”","As long as someone in this world locks onto me and has the intention of attacking me, I should sense it right away.","After all, this stone monument had been made with this function in mind.","Wait a minute... Right, this is not the Netherworld Realm.","“This damn world.” The voice coming from the stone monument said while sounding like it was gnashing its teeth.","Then, the stone monument released a strange wave of energy.","After sensing the fluctuation, the crows around and inside the ruins flew over. They grabbed the flying sword with their claws and flapped their wings vigorously, trying to pull it out of the stone monument.","However, the flying sword was inserted very firmly inside the stone monument. It was impossible for these crows to pull the sword out in a short period of time with the strength they had.","“Ouch, that hurts!” The stone monument screamed again and again.","After a long while, the crows finally managed to pull out the flying sword inserted into the stone monument.","Strangely enough, when the flying sword was pulled out, blood immediately stopped flowing out of the stone monument.","The crows grabbed the wooden flying sword and placed it in front of the stone monument.","A pair of spheres formed before the monument, which seemed to act as its eyes.","The stone monument said, “Why does this thing look so familiar?”","The more it looked at the wooden sword, the more it felt that it was familiar. Yet, it could not find any detailed data on the sword in its database even after searching for a good while.","“Caw~ Caw~” The crows were circling above the stone monument.","Still, what would happen if these crows that were circling above the monument were to suddenly want to defecate? Would they be killed by the stone monument should that happen?","Anyway, the two “eyeballs” of the stone monument started moving, and after a while, something that looked like a nose emerged underneath the two eyes.","A retractable nose!","Unexpectedly, the stone monument had such an advanced feature.","Everyone had to keep up with the times in this era. To achieve true perfection, creativity was indispensable.","A crow flew down, grabbed the flying sword, and brought it to the nose of the stone monument.","The stone monument sniffed the flying sword. “Overall, the smell of this sword feels unfamiliar. I can’t tell what wood it’s made of, but there is a faint but very familiar smell coming from it... I’ll extract the smell and begin analyzing it through a cross-reference method.”","The stone monument went through its vast database, comparing the scent coming from the sword with the information stored in its database.","A string of garbled runes flashed across the stone monument.","After five or six minutes, the stone monument finally found the corresponding information.","It took so long to find the data because this string of information had been moved to the “recycle bin”.","If it were half a month later, this information would have been deleted.","“This scent is... Tyrannical Song’s.” The stone monument had confirmed whose scent it was.","The stone monument fell silent for a moment.","“Caw~ Caw~ Caw~” The crows that were circling above the stone monument cawed loudly.","The stone monument mused, “According to the information in the database, Tyrannical Song was annihilated under the Heavenly Punishment. There should be nothing wrong with this information, and Tyrannical Song should be really dead.”","Any creature that died under the Heavenly Punishment would be obliterated and erased from existence. No matter what means of resurrection they had prepared, there was no way for them to revive after dying under the Heavenly Punishment.","Even if Tyrannical Song had countless means of resurrection, after being reduced to ashes under the Heavenly Punishment, he would stay dead. This was why all the information it had on Tyrannical Song had been moved to the recycle bin, because that information no longer had any value and was just taking up space.","So, what was going on with this wooden flying sword stained with Tyrannical Song’s smell?","After some thought, the stone monument felt that the truth might be pretty simple.","“Perhaps this sword is a magical treasure that Tyrannical Song forged when he was alive, and it has been obtained by someone else now,” the stone monument concluded.","After much deliberation, it could only think of this possibility.","Tyrannical Song must have forged some magical treasures before dying. After his death, his items and equipment would surely be inherited or acquired by other cultivators.","The stone monument continued, “What a troublesome guy. Even after his death, he’s still causing trouble.”","Then, a small grid was ejected from the back of the stone monument, where the flying sword had pierced it before. Inside the grid was a round bead.","Beads were great tools for storing information.","The stone monument stored all the information on the wooden flying sword and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s scent in the bead.","A crow landed and swallowed the bead into its belly.","Then, it spread its wings and flew into the air, where there was a temporary passage that led to the Netherworld Realm. The crow took the bead and drilled into the passage to enter the Netherworld Realm.","The stone monument said, “Send this flying sword back to my main body as well. Perhaps it can figure out more things about it.”","Two more crows came down, grabbed the flying sword, and flew toward the passage.","The disposable flying sword vibrated slightly, and before it was brought into the passage, it sent a secret message to Senior White.","After the bead and the flying sword disappeared, the stone monument began considering another matter.","Who was the person that launched this flying sword all the way to its location?","It did not have a clue.","The flying sword had appeared out of nowhere and inserted itself into its body.","There was a chance that the person who shot the flying sword may be acquainted with the deceased Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. In addition, the style of the wooden sword was very familiar, which was another clue.","Just as the stone monument was deliberating, a crow returned from the Netherworld Realm.","The crow brought back two pieces of information.","[White.]","[Change locations.]","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","On the golden moon.","Senior White took out his notebook and wrote down some coordinates on it.","These coordinates were exactly where the stone monument was located.","“That stone monument looks very advanced.” Senior White twirled the pen with his fingers. He wanted to dismantle the stone monument and see its internal structure.","At this time, the divine dragon brought Song Shuhang and Sixteen back to the surveillance area.","“Shuhang, congratulations,” Senior White said. “According to the records, you are dead.”","Song Shuhang was baffled."]},{"number":2055,"title":"Chapter 2055 - Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique","paragraphs":["Chapter 2055: Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique","Song Shuhang once believed that death was the fairest of all and made no distinction between human beings. No matter what kind of person someone was, no matter how much power or wealth they had, and no matter whether they were handsome or ugly, they would die eventually.","Even if someone’s death was for a noble cause, the end result would not be any different.","No one could escape this fate.","Dying, getting buried, and getting forgotten. At some point, even the corpse, the only proof that someone had existed, would be gone.","Just as you did not bring anything with you when you came to life, you would not bring anything with you as you left for death.","It was a sad but poetic truth.","It was not until the day Song Shuhang experienced death himself that he realized that death was not as fair as he initially thought.","Right now, when it came to death, the sorrow and fear he felt were pitifully small.","Song Shuhang touched his face.","He could feel warmth. He was alive.","At the very least, his head seemed to be perfectly fine.","“Senior White, when did I die again?” Song Shuhang asked with a confused expression on his face.","“Oh, in that fat... Hrm, according to the records of that fat ruler, you are dead.” As Senior White spoke, his hands drew a large circle in the air.","As the evil energy of the Netherworld might have infiltrated Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds, Senior White did not mention the nickname of the Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball, lest the other party sense it.","Song Shuhang quickly understood what he meant.","Senior White continued, “Also, it seems that the information the fat ruler has on you is going to be deleted from its recycle bin soon.”","Song Shuhang slammed his left fist in the palm of his right hand and said happily, “That’s wonderful news!”","This was indeed wonderful news.","The Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball was among the top three existences he least wanted to encounter, and it was not third or second.","Whenever Song Shuhang encountered it, nothing good would come out of the encounter.","Many of the deaths he had experienced had to do with the fat ball.","In the scholarly faction’s world of the golden lotus, he was crushed to death countless times by the fat ball. If it was not for his incredible will, his mind and spirit would have long been crushed.","The reason he was killed by Senior White’s clone back in the Black Dragon World was a drop of the fat ball’s liquid clone, which drew the Heavenly Punishment. To avoid dying under the Heavenly Punishment, Senior White’s clone acted first and killed him before the lightning could descend.","And most recently, the Heavenly Punishment that brought about the two dragons that sandwiched him to death also originated from the fat ball.","If it was not for Senior White Two and Senior White covering for him, he would have died a long time ago.","In short, every time he encountered the fat ball, he would face misfortune.","He was really afraid of the fat ball.","Now, hearing that he was dead in the records of the fat ball, Song Shuhang’s mood soared sky-high. He felt as if he had won the jackpot in the lottery.","Song Shuhang clenched his fists and said, “That means I have to keep a low profile for the time being.”","He would keep a low profile for some time, live his life, and let the fat ball forget about him.","If all the information the fat ball had on him was deleted permanently, it would be the best-case scenario for him.","If that were to happen, the fat ball would not come to trouble him again.","“Mm-hm, indeed, you should keep a low profile for some time.” Senior White patted Song Shuhang lightly. Then, he picked two strange fruits from Shuhang’s wooden body, wiped them, and ate them.","Song Shuhang said, “At the very least, I should keep a low profile until I show my divinity again.”","The divine dragon was slightly taken aback and asked, “When are you supposed to hold another Divinity Show? I can see that you already have three Sage Names. Doesn’t that mean that you’ve already shown your divinity three times?”","The divine dragon was coiled into a ball and huddled next to Fairy White Dragon while listening to her translation.","Just now, it was paying attention to the beast cultivators who had advanced to the next trial, especially to the team with Daoist Turntable.","In fact, Daoist Turntable’s team and Sixteen could have directly received the blessing without going through the test.","As Sixteen had the blood of a true dragon, she could be regarded as a “dragon,” which would allow her team to pass the test just like Tyrannical Song did because he brought Fairy White Dragon with him.","But when it saw that Tyrannical Song was having so much fun, it did not have the heart to remind him of this detail. As such, he let him use his authority as a trial officer to keep having fun.","If not, as the main trial officer, how could it just sit by and watch little friend Tyrannical Song cheat?","Song Shuhang replied without any hesitation, “Hahaha! Is there even a need to ask? Naturally, it’s when I reach the Eighth Stage.”","Before the Eighth Stage, he would definitely keep a low profile.","The divine dragon could not help but ask, “Then, where did your first three Sage Names come from?”","Song Shuhang explained, “I obtained one after transcending a group heavenly tribulation in the main world and another one after accidentally getting dragged into the Demonic Tribulation Realm in the Netherworld Realm.”","The divine dragon nodded slightly. These two were easy to explain.","One was the Sage Seal of the main world, and the other was the corresponding Demon Seal of the Netherworld Realm.","Song Shuhang said, “As for the third one, which is the Ancient Seal, I condensed it in a strange minor world. That world is very special. It is a world of its own, and it does not belong to the main world or the Netherworld Realm.”","“Is that a thing?” The divine dragon was stunned.","No wonder little friend Tyrannical Song was the only one to condense three Sage Seals. The methods he used to obtain them were definitely out of the ordinary.","However, when Song Shuhang defined the small world, the divine dragon had a feeling of déjà vu.","It felt as if it had heard of a similar place a long time ago.","However, the divine dragon was a rather special being and thus different from ordinary creatures. Some of its ancient memories could no longer be recalled clearly.","The divine dragon shook its head gently and then said with a cough, “Now then, little friend Tyrannical Song, I will teach you about the dragon union to further strengthen the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and give birth to a Nascent Soul!”","The tests arranged by Tyrannical Song, Sage White, and Fairy White Dragon were much more effective than it had initially thought they would be. At some point during the trial, it even felt distressed for the trial takers.","Anyway, it was now time to give Song Shuhang the agreed-upon reward.","“What do I need to do?” Song Shuhang sat up.","Sister White Dragon asked, “Does this technique have a name?”","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, don’t worry. Just follow my instructions.” The divine dragon answered Song Shuhang’s question first and then answered Fairy White Dragon’s question. “This wondrous technique is a minor chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? called ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique?.”","“I seem to have heard of this cultivation technique before,” said Senior White suddenly. “I vaguely remember that there was a saber heart technique...”","“As expected of Fellow Daoist White, you’re very knowledgeable.” The divine dragon laughed and said, “The ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? is actually adapted from a saber scripture called the ?Dragon Tiger Convergence Saber Heart Technique?. In addition, the creator of that saber heart technique is also the creator of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.”","A saber technique?","Song Shuhang scratched his head. If it was a cultivation technique that was based on a saber technique, then it might suit him.","The divine dragon said, “Then first, I need a dragon pearl.”","As soon as it finished speaking, Sister White Dragon and Sixteen summoned their dragon pearls."]},{"number":2056,"title":"Chapter 2056 - Like Grandpa Calabash","paragraphs":["Chapter 2056: Like Grandpa Calabash","When the divine dragon saw this scene, its tail stiffened.","It found itself in a dilemma.","Cultivating the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? required a single dragon pearl. Although it kept on saying that a Nascent Soul that was not born through pregnancy was not good enough, a Nascent Soul was not the same as a child. At the very least, there was no such thing as twin Nascent Souls.","A person could only have a single Nascent Soul.","So, what would happen if there were two dragon pearls? Well, you could only choose one of the two.","But which one would it choose if it were in little friend Tyrannical Song’s shoes?","It seemed that no matter which dragon pearl was chosen, it would seem rude.","The divine dragon felt a little guilty, about 0.1 mg of it.","It was much more interested in seeing what would happen next.","Song Shuhang asked curiously, “How come Sixteen also has a dragon pearl?”","Although her true dragon bloodline had been awakened, Sixteen’s body structure was still that of a human.","“It’s because of what happened last-last time,” Sixteen said. “When I woke up one morning, my throat felt a little itchy, then I coughed out a dragon pearl.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","The last-last time? So after she fought her clone?","“I thought I was sick, but my instinct later told me that it was just my dragon pearl,” explained Sixteen.","Sister White Dragon came closer and leaned over Sixteen. She then smiled and said, “Sixteen’s transformation into a dragon is speeding up. This is good news.”","The faster Sixteen’s transformation was, the higher the completion level of her “trial”.","Song Shuhang gently stretched out his hand and caught the two dragon pearls. Afterward, he asked, “One day, will Sixteen completely transform into a dragon?”","“How can it be so easy? Do you think that true dragons are like cabbages and anyone can just transform into one so easily?” Sister White Dragon said gently. “However, as her transformation becomes increasingly complete, Sixteen will become more and more attractive. ”","Sixteen subconsciously glanced at her chest.","Sister White Dragon’s little claw patted her head. That was not what she was referring to when she was talking about being attractive.","Song Shuhang looked at the dragon pearls in his hands and said curiously, “Sister White Dragon, are these dragon pearls worth a lot?”","Sister White Dragon replied softly, “I’m going to kill you.”","Song Shuhang said, “No, no, that’s not what I meant. I was not planning on selling Sixteen’s dragon pearl or yours. It’s just that if dragon pearls are really valuable, then is there a chance for me to transform into a dragon and maybe sell mine?”","When Senior White heard the word “money,” he raised his head and said, “Do you want money? I can lend you some.”","Song Shuhang said, “Senior White, please don’t make things worse for me. I seriously want to repay my debt.”","Senior White reached out and quickly wrote in his notebook. “You better find a way to repay the interest first.”","“You don’t have the bloodline of a dragon, so stop dreaming,” Sister White Dragon replied.","Song Shuhang raised his head. “Heavens~”","Senior White deftly spun the pen in his hand and said, “Anyway, you have two dragon pearls now. Which one are you going to use?”","Without even thinking about it, Song Shuhang said, “Of course, I’m going to use both.”","The divine dragon said, “Unfortunately, you can only use one dragon pearl.”","Sister White Dragon translated the divine dragon’s words.","“Why?” Song Shuhang wondered. “Isn’t it better the more dragon pearls there are?”","“A single person can only produce a single Nascent Soul. Don’t eat more than you can chew.” The divine dragon’s front claws made a waving motion.","Song Shuhang said thoughtfully, “Senior Dragon, are you saying that since a cultivator can only have a single Nascent Soul, then they can only use a single dragon pearl?”","“Exactly. It’s just like how a child cannot be born of two women. A child can only have one mother,” explained the divine dragon.","Song Shuhang retorted, “What about surrogate mothers? Theoretically speaking, the fertilized egg can be provided by the biological mother but brought into the world by a surrogate mother. Should that happen, then the child would be born of two women.”","He understood what the divine dragon meant, but as he suddenly thought of surrogate mothers, he could not help but argue against it.","Sister White Dragon translated out of habit. When she finished translating, she realized that Shuhang was looking for a beating.","Lightning crackled on the horns on the divine dragon’s head.","It seemed like it was about to lose its temper.","Sister White Dragon stretched out her claws and gave Shuhang a hard smack on the head. “Stop being naughty.”","The divine dragon said, “Then, I’ll change my wording. A child cannot be born to two women at the same time. A woman can’t give birth to a child’s upper body while another gives birth to that same child’s lower body. In the same way, a Nascent Soul can’t be born from two dragon pearls.”","After listening to the explanation, Song Shuhang laughed and said, “Actually, this puts me at ease. I will use both dragon pearls. In fact, if there are even more dragon pearls, I won’t refuse them!”","The divine dragon: “???”","Are you even listening to what I’m saying?!","Believe it or not, I’ll take your head off and play with it as if it were a ball!","In the next moment, Song Shuhang’s head fell off. He had been laughing with such delight that he moved it too much.","His head had been blown off by Senior White earlier, and he also took it off again when he saved Sixteen, so it was not properly glued to his neck at this moment. Later, Sister White Dragon also smacked him on the head.","Seeing this scene, the divine dragon felt refreshed.","Sixteen skillfully picked up Song Shuhang’s head, stood on the tip of her toes, and put it back on his neck.","“Senior Dragon, you don’t have to worry,” said Song Shuhang as he patted his chest. “Ouch, that hurt a bit.”","When he patted his chest, he ended up patting his nipple-eyes by mistake.","The divine dragon thought to himself, I was not worried about you at all. Actually, I was quite happy watching the scene.","However, it still had to maintain its dignified appearance, so it said nothing.","“Actually, let alone two dragon pearls, I could use five more!” added Song Shuhang.","Air shot out of the divine dragon’s nostrils. “You mean, you want to absorb seven dragon pearls?”","“Yes,” Song Shuhang nodded and said, “I am a man who wants to give birth to at least seven Nascent Souls like Grandpa Calabash1!”","Senior White nodded and said, “If we count your original dantian, perhaps you can even have eight Nascent Souls.”","What? Even Sage White is agreeing with little friend Tyrannical Song? After keeping silent for a moment, the divine dragon stared at Song Shuhang and said, “Is there something special about little friend Tyrannical Song’s body?”","Sage White is very reliable.","If he thinks that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song can give birth to more than one Nascent Soul, does this mean that Tyrannical Song has a special constitution?","The eyes of the divine dragon stared at Song Shuhang, trying to peer into his secrets.","Its eyes pierced through Shuhang’s wooden body, but they could not see through the Sage’s blood.","Song Shuhang’s secrets were now contained in the Sage’s blood, and the divine dragon could only vaguely see a cluster of colorful rays of light.","Since the divine dragon could not see through Shuhang, it withdrew its gaze.","However, it was not satisfied, and it was now even more curious.","“Little friend Tyrannical Song,” the divine dragon coughed and said solemnly, “if you can prove that what you said is true, then you can also use my dragon pearl.”"]},{"number":2057,"title":"Chapter 2057 - Honest people are easy to take advantage of","paragraphs":["Chapter 2057: Honest people are easy to take advantage of","The divine dragon took this decision after carefully pondering the matter.","Things like dragon pearls were generally not lent out as they were very private objects.","However, if Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song could prove that he could birth seven Nascent Souls, then he would be receiving its dragon pearl, which was definitely a great honor for Tyrannical Song!","After all, this was the first time the divine dragon was lending its dragon pearl to another person to use.","If it was not for Sage White, even if there were a hundred Tyrannical Songs begging for its dragon pearl, there was no way it would give it away!","But contrary to expectations, Song Shuhang did not reveal an expression of joy after listening to Sister White Dragon’s translation.","He said solemnly, “Actually, there’s no need for that. Sixteen and Sister White Dragon are both close to me, so it’s okay for me to combine their powers with mine to give birth to a Nascent Soul. However, using Senior Dragon’s dragon pearl feels awkward. After all, we’ll have to unite our powers to give birth to a Nascent Soul!”","Lightning flashed on the horns of the divine dragon again, and beautiful sparks flew in all directions.","It really wanted to open Tyrannical Song’s head to see how his brain was wired since he always managed to make it angry.","Sister White Dragon let out a long sigh after she finished translating Song Shuhang’s words.","She then stretched out her claw and smacked Song Shuhang’s newly-attached head.","She reminded Shuhang in a gentle voice, “Don’t mess around and just show your seven Golden Cores. You better start taking this seriously or I’ll blow your head off.”","Sixteen trotted over and picked up Song Shuhang’s head.","“Sister White Dragon, you’ve already blown my head off.” Song Shuhang sighed. “Actions should come after the threat, not before it. Seriously...”","Sixteen giggled and put Song Shuhang’s head back on his neck.","The divine dragon was happy again. Whenever Little Friend Tyrannical Song’s head was separated from his neck, it felt reinvigorated.","Senior White tapped his chin with the end of his pen, showing a thoughtful expression.","In his eyes, Song Shuhang, the divine dragon, Sister White Dragon, and Sixteen formed an infinite loop.","Song Shuhang was to provoke, the divine dragon was to get annoyed, Sister White Dragon was to administer punishment, Sixteen was to put Shuhang’s head back on his neck, and the divine dragon would then feel happy once again.","As a result, the divine dragon was in an endless cycle of getting annoyed and pleased.","Unknowingly, its impression of everyone had risen sharply.","Senior White mused to himself, “Perhaps this is Fellow Daoist Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s role in the Nine Provinces Number One Group...”","Right, didn’t Thrice Reckless come to the Beast Realm as well?","I wonder what he’s doing right now.","Sister White Dragon’s gentle voice sounded again. “This is the last warning. Stop messing around, or I’ll smack you again!”","“Ugh...” Song Shuhang scratched his head.","Okay, I’ll stop messing around.","And so, he raised his head and looked at the divine dragon. The divine dragon looked back at him.","Song Shuhang said, “Senior, I will prove myself as you wish.”","Hmm, although I’m not too familiar with Senior Divine Dragon now, our friendship can be improved slowly. After this matter is over, I’ll add it to my friend list. But first, let’s borrow the power of its dragon pearl.","Plus, it’s actually easy for me to prove myself. I just need to show my seven Golden Cores.","Song Shuhang thought for a moment. Then, a serrated blade wheel appeared beside his body.","“A Sixth Stage True Monarch’s life wheel?” mused the divine dragon. It could see that Song Shuhang’s life wheel was composed of eight serrated blades.","However, this did not prove that Song Shuhang had eight Golden Cores.","“Yes, this is a life wheel,” Song Shuhang replied. “One Golden Core corresponds to one life wheel.”","While he was speaking, seven more life wheels emerged from Song Shuhang’s body.","There was a “sword wheel” composed of broadswords, a “page wheel” composed of metal pages, a “ball wheel” composed of spiraling swords, a “gear wheel” composed of sharp interlocked gears, a “circular wheel” composed of eight balls of thread, and the “octagonal wheel” which had a distinct style where every corner of the wheel seems to be linked to karma.","The divine dragon was left dumbfounded when it saw all the life wheels.","The seven life wheels with different attributes constantly spun around Song Shuhang.","As long as Song Shuhang’s willed it, the seven life wheels could launch a flurry of attacks at nearby enemies.","“How did your dantian end up holding seven Golden Cores?” The divine dragon felt that its knowledge of the world was lacking and that much of what it knew was nothing but a lie. “Are you not afraid of exploding and dying?”","“I’m not afraid. After all, it’s not like I haven’t exploded and died before.” Song Shuhang casually waved his hand, as if this matter was of no importance at all.","The divine dragon: “...”","Song Shuhang continued, “Also, my Golden Cores aren’t all stored in my original dantian. My seven small Golden Cores are located in my seven small dantians.”","“Then, what’s inside your original dantian?” The divine dragon did not miss this important detail.","Song Shuhang replied, “Hmm? There’s a fat whale Golden Core inside it that can barely swim. It’s quite special, and it hasn’t condensed a life wheel yet.”","The divine dragon frowned. It was extremely puzzled, and it could not help but ask, “How did you do it?”","It asked this question despite knowing that it should not.","After all, matters like this one were usually kept secret as they may be related to a cultivator’s trump cards.","Asking about such things was just as rude as asking an ordinary person what underwear they were wearing.","However, it was just too curious.","Curiosity could kill not only cats but dragons as well.","Song Shuhang replied sincerely, “If I said that they appeared on their own while I was cultivating, would you believe me?”","“Like hell I’d believe it!” The divine dragon opened its mouth and spat a dragon pearl at Song Shuhang.","A dragon pearl with an illusory beauty struck Song Shuhang’s face, sending his head flying.","Song Shuhang: “...”","This is life.","When I’m messing around, I lose my head.","When I’m not messing around, I lose my head.","When I’m being honest, I lose my head.","No matter what I do, I still lose my head!","Honest people are easy to take advantage of!","But this time, Song Shuhang’s head did not land on the ground.","Sixteen had been ready, and when the dragon pearl struck his face, she moved behind Song Shuhang.","Then, she stood on the tip of her toes, jumped up gently, and pushed Song Shuhang’s head back with both hands as if she were pushing a volleyball.","Little Sixteen was getting better and better at this.","“Beautiful.” Sister White Dragon praised Sixteen.","“Full score.” Senior White nodded in agreement.","The divine dragon felt a new type of joy.","Although Tyrannical Song’s head did not fall to the ground, it was still very happy to see his head being thrown around like a ball.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand to straighten his head. “Sometimes, no one believes the truth.”","“I can confirm that he’s telling the truth.” Senior White testified for Song Shuhang. “The seven Golden Cores really did appear when Shuhang was dying repeatedly.”","The divine dragon asked, “Do you mean cultivating?”","“I got an idea.” Senior White went beside Song Shuhang and motioned for him to open his hand.","Song Shuhang stretched out his right hand, puzzled.","In the next moment, Senior White opened his mouth and spat out a dragon pearl.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","Senior White can also spit out dragon pearls?"]},{"number":2058,"title":"Chapter 2058 - Very persistent","paragraphs":["Chapter 2058: Very persistent","This was the fourth dragon pearl that he had seen today.","Song Shuhang looked at the dragon pearl in his palm and blurted out, “Senior White, there’s really nothing you can’t do!”","It felt like there was nothing Senior White could not do aside from birthing a child.","But even in that case, Shuhang suspected that if Senior White really wished for it, the rules of the universe would change, making it so that males could give birth to children.","!!","Anyway, if Senior White could spit out a dragon pearl...","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up. “Senior White, do you have a secret technique that allows a human to transform into a dragon?”","“What?” Senior White looked at Song Shuhang in confusion.","“Is that a mirage dragon’s dragon pearl?” asked Sister White Dragon while looking at the dragon pearl in Song Shuhang’s palm.","Senior White nodded and said, “Yes, it’s a mirage dragon’s dragon pearl.”","“This isn’t Senior White’s dragon pearl?” Song Shuhang could not help but feel a little dejected. He really wanted to learn a secret technique that could allow him to transform into a dragon so as to condense his own pearls.","“I’m not a dragon, so how am I supposed to produce a dragon pearl?” Senior White smiled and said, “However, if I have the time, maybe I can study the structure of true dragons and how they produce dragon pearls. Afterward, I might be able to condense a pearl of my own.”","Song Shuhang mused, “A white pearl in this case?”","Senior White glanced at Shuhang and said, “Your naming talent absolutely sucks.”","Sixteen turned her head and chuckled.","Song Shuhang said bitterly, “There’s nothing that I can do about that. Very few of the cultivation techniques I practice have normal names. After getting used to such names, my talent for naming has also dropped to the same level.”","The basic fist technique, the steel hand technique, the blade dragging technique, and the pay-to-win strike... The name of each of these techniques was very straightforward.","“Don’t make excuses about your bad naming sense. Just be honest.” Senior White was particularly straightforward today. “Also, you’re the one who gave me this mirage dragon pearl.”","Song Shuhang scoured through his memories and remembered. “Is it from the mirage dragon we met at the Immortal Feast?”","During Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s Immortal Feast, a group of mirage dragons mixed with the dishes.","Back then, the leader of the mirage dragons took control of Song Shuhang’s dreams and created a world related to “Little White”, which ended up drawing the attention of Senior White Two.","As a result, the mirage dragon was captured by Senior White Two and became his pet. Before Senior White Two took the mirage dragon away, he squeezed out its dragon pearl and gave it to Song Shuhang.","Afterward, Song Shuhang gave this dragon pearl to Senior White so that he could use it to research the illusory technique of mirage dragons, and Senior White gave him in return a colorful whale monster core that had a mirage dragon’s ability.","Since Song Shuhang had barely gotten to hold this mirage dragon pearl before it left his hands and entered Senior White’s, he had almost forgotten about it.","Song Shuhang now had two dragon pearls in his palms and another two floating beside him.","He raised his head and looked at the divine dragon. “Senior Divine Dragon, we only have the mirage dragon leader’s dragon pearl here. The main body is elsewhere. Is that a problem?”","The divine dragon thought for a moment, and then said, “It should be fine as long as you can guide the energy inside the mirage dragon pearl.”","“There’s no problem then,” Senior White said. “I can utilize the energy inside the dragon pearl at will, so I can help Shuhang when the time comes.”","“Great, now I have four dragon pearls.” Song Shuhang chuckled.","After thinking for a moment, Sixteen looked at Fairy White Dragon and asked, “Sister White Dragon, can you give him three more dragon pearls?”","Sixteen was prepared to help Song Shuhang get the seven dragon pearls he needed in one go.","Sister White Dragon shook her head and said, “If it was the me from back then, it would have been a trivial matter to cough out a few dragon pearls. But in my current state, I am unable to do that.”","“That’s a pity,” Sixteen said. “If only the seniors of our group were here... After all, people like Senior Tyrant Flood Dragon should also have some dragon pearls.”","Senior White suggested, “Why don’t you tear that insurance ticket and summon Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant and then buy three dragon pearls from him?”","In Senior White’s eyes, the insurance tickets were just a method to summon the Almighty Merchant.","Song Shuhang said, “I’ll try contacting the other seniors first.”","Sixteen and Senior White’s words reminded him that he could just borrow some dragon pearls from his seniors.","And so, Song Shuhang’s consciousness sank into the Sage’s blood and entered the sixth and seventh Golden Core’s Spirit Lakes.","He activated the QR code Golden Core Composition and the Network Golden Core Composition.","Those big shots who added him as a friend through the QR code could all use numerous functions of his Golden Core Composition, such as communicating with him by leaving a postscript when sending strength remotely.","But as Song Shuhang’s strength was lacking, he had yet to learn how to send messages after transmitting his energy to other people.","However, due to his strong desire to survive, the QR code Golden Core Composition had once taken the initiative to send a request for help to all the big shots who added him as a friend.","So, as long as he willed it with enough force, he should be able to send a help signal to his “friends” through the QR code Golden Core Composition.","“Seniors, especially those related to dragons, please lend me your dragon pearls for a while.” Song Shuhang kept repeating this thought in his mind.","Because it was the first time he had taken the initiative to do this, he tried to keep the content of the message simple.","As for the repayment, he planned to just discuss it after they contacted him.","Please work, QR code contact function!","Song Shuhang tensed up as he repeated the message in his head. His face turned red from how hard he was trying.","After a while, the QR code Golden Core Composition reacted, and it began flashing.","According to Song Shuhang’s will, it began to send a message to Song Shuhang’s friends for help.","Some of the selected friends received the message.","[Beep~ Tyrannical Song requests your remote assistance. Specific Request: Requires a dragon pearl. Do you choose to help him? Y/N.]","[Beep~ Demon Emperor Hezhi has rejected your request for remote assistance. PS: “...”]","[Beep~ The Indestructible Lord has rejected your request for remote assistance.]","The two blacklisted big shots received Song Shuhang’s request for help, and they cruelly rejected him as they got the message.","The reason these two received the message was that they were of very high rank and were among the strongest people aside from the Wielder of the Will. When Song Shuhang sent out his request, he could not avoid sending them a message as well.","[Beep~ Your Buddy, the Heavenly Emperor, has remotely sent you 1 point of strength. PS: “Yo, Senior Song, here’s 1 point of help for you today.”]","[Beep~ Your Ally, Dragon Network Will Fat Ball, has agreed to your request for help and has begun to provide you with remote assistance.]","Song Shuhang said happily, “It worked!”","It had actually worked.","The will of the Dragon Network represented the Black Dragon World, and she had accepted his request for help.","She isn’t going to get the dragon pearl from the Black Dragon itself, is she? Or does she have her own dragon pearl?","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has transferred your request to Striped Dragon Two, but the transfer failed...]","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","It’s Fairy Cheng Lin, who’s supposed to be so dead that she can’t die again.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has transferred your request to Striped Dragon Two again but the transfer failed...] ×10","It seemed like Fairy Cheng Lin was very bored today.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang’s mind became filled with messages.","Unceasing beeping sounds rang in his mind.","In a single breath of time, Fairy Cheng Lin had tried to transfer Song Shuhang’s request nearly 300 times.","It seemed like she really wanted to make her presence known today."]},{"number":2059,"title":"Chapter 2059 Cute New Nickname","paragraphs":["2059 Cute New Nickname","Perhaps only Fairy Cheng Lin had the gall to harass Striped Dragon Two in this manner.","If anyone else dared to spam him with messages, they would have long since been pinched to death. That was, of course, unless they could become like Song Shuhang, a little bug that was hard to pinch and could handle repeated rounds of powerful pinching.","From this interaction, it could be observed how patient Striped Dragon Two was. No matter how many times Fairy Cheng Lin redirected the message, it continued to refuse it without hesitation.","And so, Fairy Cheng Lin and Striped Dragon Two started using Song Shuhang’s mind as a battlefield to carry out their war of endurance. They wanted to see who would last longer.","Whether it was Fairy Cheng Lin or Striped Dragon Two, their patience could probably be calculated in units of 10,000 years. If no compromise was reached between the two, then this battle would probably last at least 10,000 years!","Yet, after just twelve breaths of time, somebody had already fallen.","The War of Ten Thousand Years had just started, but there was already a casualty, resulting in the war getting postponed.","Of course, the one who had fallen was none other than Song Shuhang.","In a mere twelve breaths of time, Fairy Cheng Lin initiated nearly 10,000 transfers to Striped Dragon Two, and Striped Dragon Two rejected each and every single one of them.","At this moment, Song Shuhang’s mind was filled with beeping sounds.","The sound was so loud that he could not stop it even if he were to cover his ears.","After listening to the beeping sound so many times, Song Shuhang felt like throwing up every time he heard it. He was not even pregnant, but the symptoms were awfully similar.","Song Shuhang said weakly, “Bleurgh~ Fairy Cheng Lin, please have mercy.”","Unfortunately, his cries could not reach Fairy Cheng Lin as she could not hear messages that were not sent through the QR code Golden Core Composition.","After all, they were separated by countless mountains and rivers, perhaps even worlds.","Fairy Cheng Lin stepped up her efforts and increased by several times the speed at which she was redirecting the message to Striped Dragon Two.","Song Shuhang felt like he was losing his mind; his brain could no longer do anything. He could only try his best to hold on as the battle between Fairy Cheng Lin and Striped Dragon Two raged in his head.","His brain was overloaded with messages.","Finally, Striped Dragon Two reacted out of annoyance.","[Beep~ Striped Dragon Two changed its account name to Little Stripey. Beep~ Little Stripey blacklisted you by blacklisting itself.]","Song Shuhang was baffled.","Did Striped Dragon Two just change its nickname to something as cute as Little Stripey?","Also, why the hell was I blacklisted?","What in the world is going on?!","It was Fairy Cheng Lin who was relentlessly sending messages to Senior Striped Dragon Two, so why was I the one who got blacklisted?","It was as if there was Papa Bear, Daughter Bear, and a passerby all sitting on a bench.","Then, Daughter Bear starts annoying Papa Bear, who in return gives the nearby passerby a punch filled with fatherly love.","What did the passerby do wrong?","Even if you love your daughter, you can’t treat me like this!","But soon, Song Shuhang understood why Striped Dragon Two did what it did.","?????","After Striped Dragon Two changed its name and entered the blacklist, Fairy Cheng Lin failed to reach him.","And this time, the reason for the failure was different from before.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has transferred your request to Striped Dragon Two, but the transfer failed... No such username found.]","At this point, Fairy Cheng Lin stopped trying to transfer the request to Striped Dragon Two.","No such username found?","There were only two possible scenarios.","One was that Striped Dragon Two had left the group, but the chances of this happening were very low, and it did not really match Striped Dragon’s personality.","The second possible scenario was that Striped Dragon Two had changed its name.","So, Fairy Cheng Lin tried doing something else.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin used the “remote access” function.]","What’s this?","Song Shuhang did not even know that his QR code Golden Core Composition had all these wondrous functions.","His realm was not high enough, and despite having the highest authority, he could not access some of the functions of the QR code Golden Core Composition. It was as if his version of the QR code Golden Core Composition was outdated.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has requested authorization to temporarily use the search function. Do you give her permission to do so? Y/N.]","Song Shuhang could sense that Fairy Cheng Lin was making this request through his ghost spirit.","This ghost spirit...","Song Shuhang frowned.","He recalled that he obtained his first ghost spirit when he was with Soft Feather, and that ghost spirit was forcibly borrowed by the lustrous scholar some time later. The contract between the first spirit ghost and Shuhang still existed, but it was in a strange, damaged state.","As for his second ghost spirit, he only recalled that it was a very special existence. Given the haze surrounding this ghost spirit, he suspected that his second ghost spirit might have entered a place similar to the Wielder’s small black room.","Then, there was his third ghost spirit.","He did not have many memories of this ghost spirit. One day, he woke up and discovered that his second ghost spirit had been replaced by his third ghost spirit.","From the looks of it, there was a deep connection between this third ghost spirit and Fairy Cheng Lin.","[Yes!] Song Shuhang granted Fairy Cheng Lin temporary access to the search function.","Stirring up trouble was one of his favorite hobbies.","When he gave his consent just now, he had already forgotten that he was throwing up until a moment ago.","It was a symptom of the late stage Thrice Reckless Disease, one’s short-time memory did not exceed five seconds while seeking death.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: “Little Shuhang, well done! Just wait and see how I get you some dragon pearls! Hmph! Does it think that it can avoid me just by changing its name? Too naive!”]","Then, Song Shuhang sensed through the ghost spirit that Fairy Cheng Lin had started to use her newly-acquired authority to search through his friend list.","She searched everything from top to bottom.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: “What happened to Striped Dragon Two?”]","Song Shuhang said to the ghost spirit, “It’s in the blacklist. It changed its name to Little Stripey.”","Shuhang betrayed Striped Dragon Two without hesitation.","In the next moment, Fairy Cheng Lin tried to search through the blacklist, but she failed to do so.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has forwarded a request to remove “Little Stripey” from the blacklist and move it into the “Ally” list. Do you agree? Y/N.]","Song Shuhang chose [Yes] without hesitation.","?????","Inside Striped Dragon Two’s hideout.","[Beep~ Profound Sage Tyrannical Song wants to remove you from the “Blacklist” and move you to the “Ally” list. Do you agree? Y/N.]","“No.” Striped Dragon Two yawned.","Returning to the ally list was a no-no. Instead, being on the blacklist felt like returning home. The other two guys on the blacklist were also well-respected existences in the universe, so staying here would not make it lose face. It liked this place very much.","?????","[Beep~ Little Stripey has refused to be removed from the blacklist.]","“Just as I expected.” Song Shuhang sighed.","He was beginning to suspect that this blacklist was not a blacklist at all, but rather a VIP Group."]},{"number":2060,"title":"Chapter 2060 Ahhh! This dragon pearl is poisonous!","paragraphs":["2060 Ahhh! This dragon pearl is poisonous!","Whenever he moved an enemy big shot to his blacklist, the QR code Golden Core Composition would kindly remind them that Shuhang had put them there.","If he wanted to remove them from the blacklist, he would need their consent first.","Then, every time he sent a request for help, the people on the blacklist would also be notified.","And today, when Fairy Cheng Lin used the search function to look through Song Shuhang’s friend list, she was barred from checking the blacklist.","It worked for his friends but not for his enemies!","What’s with this blacklist?","It’s just a privileged VIP Group for big shots!","No wonder the Indestructible Lord refused to leave the blacklist after being put there. It seemed like every other list was nowhere as comfortable.","After trying everything in her power, the “already dead” Cheng Lin still failed to reach Little Stripey.","At this point, Fairy Cheng Lin seemed to give up.","[Beep~ Little Stripey has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: “Hehe, your uncle will always be your uncle.”]","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky. He felt so tired that he wanted to retire.","While he was in thought, another prompt sounded in his mind.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has moved to the blacklist. Synchronization in progress. Fairy Cheng Lin is now a part of the blacklist.]","“Heavens!” The thing that Song Shuhang feared most happened.","After getting to experience the beauty of the blacklist, all the big shots might decide to move there and refuse to leave.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin, who is on the blacklist, has transferred your request to Little Stripey, who is also on the blacklist. The transfer process has begun... The transfer failed. Little Stripey refused the transfer.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","People on the normal friend list could not contact those who were on the blacklist, but those on the blacklist could contact others who were on the blacklist.","Your auntie is still your auntie... No, this is not good. This word really is not suitable to describe someone as beautiful as Fairy Cheng Lin.","Song Shuhang’s desire to live was acting strangely as of late, weak at times and very strong at other times. He was just like the protagonist of a shonen manga; whenever he was in a weakened state, he couldn’t even defeat cannon fodder, but when he was at his highest level, he could even hold his own against boss-level characters.","Little Stripey refused the transfer with no hesitation, but this only reverted everything back to how it had been before they moved to the blacklist.","Fairy Cheng Lin kept transferring requests to Little Stripey, and the speed at which she did so got faster and faster.","As a result, beeping sounds rang in Song Shuhang’s mind endlessly.","Shuhang massaged his temples, but he did not fall as he did previously.","After all, his endurance and adaptability were truly among the best in the universe.","As long as he has experienced something once, he would quickly develop a certain resistance to it.","This also applied to the beeping sound that was constantly echoing in his mind. As long as he got used to it, it was just another kind of pain tolerance training for Song Shuhang.","Acclimate to the pain, endure the pain, and enjoy the pain. This was how the life of a good man should be.","He should learn to have fun amid suffering. No matter how horrific the pain was, he should welcome it with a smile, bury it deep inside him, and smile at his family.","[Beep~ Little Stripey has requested to be removed from the blacklist.]","It seems that Senior Striped Dragon Two can’t bear it anymore and wants to leave the blacklist.","“Hahaha, Little Stripey, you have your bad days too.” Song Shuhang laughed and chose [No].","At this time, he finally understood how invigorated the Indestructible Lord must have felt when it refused to leave the blacklist back then. ‘You blacklisted me against my will, so do you really think I’ll leave now because you need me to?’","“Don’t treat love as a commodity; true love cannot be bought with money!” Song Shuhang was so excited that his wooden body began trembling.","Going against a big shot was truly exciting, so exciting that it was almost addictive.","No matter whether this big shot was an ally or not, he wanted to go against them.","As for the consequences, especially the consequences of provoking an ally big shot, he simply ignored them as his desire to survive was in a weakened state.","Sixteen patted Shuhang lightly, but he did not respond.","Sister White Dragon said, “This child is too far gone.”","The divine dragon added, “When he revealed that demented expression just now, I thought that he had gone crazy.”","Senior White was holding a glass of juice in his hand. He took a sip through the straw and said, “There are two powerful consciousnesses using Shuhang’s mind as a battlefield. They are engaging in an intense battle.”","[Beep~ Little Stripey has agreed to Fairy Cheng Lin’s transfer request.]","In the end, in this war between father and daughter, it was Striped Dragon Two who compromised first. Luckily, it did not turn into a war that could last for tens of thousands of years.","[Beep~ Little Stripey has summoned the remote texting interface.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","He was sure of one thing now; the greater one’s strength, the higher the number of functions they had unlocked when accessing the QR code Golden Core Composition.","Even Fairy Cheng Lin could only communicate with Song Shuhang by sending 1 point of energy and leaving a postscript, but Striped Dragon Two could directly send him text messages.","In the next moment, a lotus flower materialized before Song Shuhang’s eyes, and above this lotus flower was something akin to a blackboard.","Little Stripey: [Today is the first time in nearly ten thousand years that Cheng Lin has acted like a spoiled child when talking to me.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","You’re referring to her constant harassment as acting like a spoiled child?","Little Stripey: [I’m very happy today.]","Little Stripey: [So you’re definitely dead, Tyrannical Song.]","This last message appeared for just a moment before it was deleted by Striped Dragon Two.","But everyone present was a cultivator, and their eyesight was exceptional.","Senior White asked, “Who did you offend this time?”","The divine dragon said, “Who is this? Why do I feel especially uncomfortable when I see their name?” When it saw the other party’s name, it felt a certain kind of hierarchical suppression.","“Little Stripey” was such a cute name, but the divine dragon felt rather uncomfortable when it read it.","Sister White Dragon said, “I feel that this Little Stripey is a powerful and terrifying existence. When it comes to existences of this level, a random word of theirs may mobilize the power of the universe and form a curse. Shuhang, you should be careful.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","I did nothing. I just pressed the [No] button.","Little Stripey: [I can’t lend you any of my dragon pearls unless you’re ready to die.]","When Song Shuhang saw this message, he suddenly thought of a scene. In the scene, he took a dragon pearl from Striped Dragon Two and then collapsed to the ground while screaming, “Ahhh! this dragon pearl is poisonous!”","It was just a random thought, but a string of words appeared on the blackboard.","Tyrannical Song: [Ahhh! This dragon pearl is poisonous!]","Little Stripey: [...]","Little Stripey: [Would you believe me if I were to say that guys like you don’t last more than three episodes during a series?]","Tyrannical Song: [Actually, I believe you. In the past six months, on average, I’ve probably died about once every three episodes.]","Little Stripey: [...]","Little Stripey: [Alright, let’s get back to the main topic. I can’t give you my dragon pearls. However, I do have... My son’s dragon pearl. I can lend that to you.]"]},{"number":2061,"title":"Chapter 2061 An angry dragon","paragraphs":["2061 An angry dragon","Striped Dragon has a son?","Song Shuhang always thought that Striped Dragon was single, so he never expected it to have a son.","Little Stripey: [I’ve had enough of talking nonsense with you. Get ready, I’m going to teleport the dragon pearl to your location.]","After it sent this message, the lotus and the blackboard disappeared.","Then, a fist-sized spatial gate forcibly opened right beside Song Shuhang.","When the divine dragon saw this scene, its whiskers trembled slightly. Today, it had seen people forcibly break through the spatial lock of Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds twice.","Sage White, as well as this mysterious Little Stripey, could ignore the spatial lock of the holy mountain and use their spatial abilities.","It seemed like it was about time for the spatial confinement of the holy mountain to be upgraded.","After the fist-sized spatial gate opened, a dragon pearl with black and white patterns fell into Song Shuhang’s hands. As expected of the dragon pearl of Striped Dragon’s son, even its dragon pearl was striped. Their genetics were truly powerful.","Song Shuhang now found himself quite curious about who the son of Striped Dragon might be.","However, Striped Dragon did not give Song Shuhang a chance to ask, so he could only suppress his curiosity and leave the question for later.","I’ll just ask about it at a later time.","“Now, I have five dragon pearls.” In Song Shuhang’s left hand were the dragon pearls of Sixteen and Sister White Dragon, and in his right hand were the dragon pearls of Senior White, the divine dragon, and Striped Dragon’s son.","At this moment, the divine dragon’s heart was in turmoil. This guy isn’t really going to collect seven dragon pearls, is he?","[Beep~ The Dragon Network Assistant is now ready. Tyrannical Song, please get ready to receive the dragon pearl.]","After the beeping sound, another small spatial gate appeared beside Song Shuhang.","“This is already the third time today.” The divine dragon sighed and looked toward the sky. It felt that the locked space of their Garre Holy Mountain had become the playground of these strangers, who could enter on a whim with their powerful spatial abilities.","I can’t let this go on. As soon as I’m done with this stuff, I need to upgrade the spatial defense system. We must make it so that the next batch of trial takers is awed by our majestic spatial lock.","After the spatial gate opened, Lady Kunna’s petite hand stretched out of it. In her palm was a jet-black dragon pearl.","“Is that the Black Dragon’s dragon pearl?” Song Shuhang gulped when he saw the black dragon pearl.","Lady Kunna placed the black dragon pearl in Song Shuhang’s palm, and then she waved her hand as if to say goodbye.","Actually, the Black Dragon is huge. If it were to spit out a dragon pearl, that pearl has to be the size of a small or medium-sized country...","“Thank you,” said Song Shuhang. He knew that he had to take note of this favor.","Lady Kunna made an “OK” gesture as her hand retreated back into the spatial gate, disappearing from their sight.","Su Clan’s Sixteen said, “Six.”","One more and Song Shuhang would have the seven dragon pearls he needed.","Sister White Dragon asked, “How are you going to get the last dragon pearl?”","Song Shuhang thought for a while and asked, “Senior White, do you have any dragon pearls left?”","First thing, he should ask the almighty Senior White.","Senior White replied, “I might, I might not. I can’t remember. However, even if I do have a dragon pearl stored somewhere, its grade should not be that high. Otherwise, I would have a deeper impression of it.”","The six dragon pearls in Song Shuhang’s hands were all uncommon. Rather than using an ordinary dragon pearl to make up the numbers, it would be much better for him to wait and get a better dragon pearl.","“In that case...” A bold idea formed in Song Shuhang’s mind. If he took out some of Senior Skylark’s body parts, could he summon the father of that female giant turtle of disaster?","He remembered that Papa Turtle had a dragon’s head and a turtle’s body. Since he had a dragon’s head, then he might also have a dragon pearl.","But after giving it some thought, he decided against it.","This was because if Papa Turtle were to appear, the thing that was most likely to happen was that he would be rewarded with a Roaring Dragon Cannon rather than a dragon pearl.","In addition, there was no certainty that Papa Turtle even had a dragon pearl.","As such, Song Shuhang went back to racking his brains in search of a solution.","“Right, is it possible for me to use something else rather than a dragon pearl?” Song Shuhang asked casually.","The divine dragon asked in return, “For example?”","“For example, the Scholarly Sage’s eye,” replied Song Shuhang.","The divine dragon: “...”","If eyeballs were useful here, then I could lend you mine, you idiot! How dare you take a true dragon’s dragon pearl so lightly?!","Song Shuhang said regretfully, “Seems like that isn’t an option.”","Afterward, he glanced at Sixteen.","“Heh, I nearly forgot about her!” Song Shuhang laughed.","Right after that, he activated his newly-learned ?Flame Substitution Technique?.","The adult Sixteen condensed from the flames of the magical technique.","This time, the adult Sixteen did not immediately commit suicide. Instead, she decided to bide her time and see if there was a chance for her to get out of this Flame Substitute and invade the body of some other creature.","Although the odds might be small, as long as one was still alive, there was hope.","Song Shuhang asked, “Adult Sixteen, do you have a dragon pearl?”","The adult Sixteen raised her head and glanced at Shuhang contemptuously.","“If you have a dragon pearl and you lend it to me,” Song Shuhang smiled slightly and said, “I might look for a way to separate you from the Flame Substitute.”","After all, the ?Flame Substitution Technique? was an important life-saving skill, and he also wanted to have the magical technique working normally.","Hearing this, the adult Sixteen’s eyes lit up.","But after a while, she lowered her head in disappointment.","Unfortunately, she did not have a dragon pearl.","Sixteen took out an insurance ticket and said, “Then, I’ll tear this insurance ticket and summon Senior Almighty Merchant.”","The Almighty Merchant had all kinds of goods, and he should have some dragon pearls in stock.","“Let me give you a reminder,” said the divine dragon all of a sudden. “The ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? requires you to use the energy inside a dragon pearl... Moreover, the owner of that dragon pearl must be alive.”","The six dragon pearls in Song Shuhang’s hands were filled with vitality, and there was no doubt that their owners were in good condition.","However, when it came to dragon pearls that were traded, it was pretty common for them to belong to deceased dragons. That kind of dragon pearl could not be used to practice the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique?.","After all, this method of birthing a Nascent Soul required vitality. If it were the dragon pearl of a dead dragon, how could it possibly give birth to anything?","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said, “Maybe the Almighty Merchant has the dragon pearl of a living true dragon in his hands. After all, he is the Almighty Merchant.”","If they really could not get the dragon pearl of a living dragon, then they could just ask the Almighty Merchant if he could borrow a dragon pearl from a true dragon for him.","“Then, I’ll summon him.” Sixteen stretched out her hand and tore the insurance ticket.","In the next moment, spatial fluctuations appeared in the air.","The divine dragon was mad when it sensed the spatial fluctuations.","This defense system is too garbage!","This is the fourth person to completely ignore the locked space of Garre Holy Mountain in just half a day!","After the spatial fluctuations created ripples in the air...","A large hand stretched out nowhere, grabbed the adult Sixteen, and disappeared.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “...”","To be fair, this was the purpose of the insurance ticket; it was supposed to be used to save Sixteen at a critical moment.","There was completely nothing wrong with what just happened.","Of course, other than the fact that the Almighty Merchant had saved the wrong person."]},{"number":2062,"title":"Chapter 2062 My lord, I’ve got interesting news","paragraphs":["2062 My lord, I’ve got interesting news","Translator: GodBrandy","Sixteen gazed at the large hand as it disappeared and said, “Should I tear another ticket?”","She felt that in addition to that small problem with her constitution, there was also the problem of easily being mistaken for someone else. An example of this was when Demon Monarch Anzhi wanted to kidnap her but ended up taking Shuhang away instead.","And from what she could recall, similar scenarios had taken place several times back when she was a child.","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “Don’t tear another one; that would be a waste. After he realizes that he saved the wrong person, the Almighty Merchant should contact us on his own.”","These insurance tickets were life-saving trump cards, and they should not be wasted.","Additionally, he trusted the Almighty Merchant to keep his word as his reputation preceded him.","Even a customer he hated could buy goods from him as long as they were willing to pay a higher price, and the goods were guaranteed to be genuine!","And if there was a problem with the transaction, the Almighty Merchant would do his best to make things right.","When making purchases from the Almighty Merchant, one could set one’s heart at ease.","Song Shuhang knew the Almighty Merchant very well, and he really wanted to be friends with this big shot.","Song Shuhang snapped his fingers and canceled his Flame Substitution Technique so that the Almighty Merchant would be able to realize that he had grabbed the wrong person.","?????","A few minutes earlier, in the world of the black lotus.","The Almighty Merchant was in the middle of making a deal with Senior White’s Pet No. 1, Little Sun You’re Busy T233.","Song Shuhang was right about one thing.","Even if the Almighty Merchant hated someone, as long as the other party was willing to overpay for the product, he would show them a very professional smile and proceed with the transaction.","The Almighty Merchant’s smile was surely the cheapest one to buy among all the Immortals in the universe.","The Almighty Merchant was somewhat anxious while carrying out the transaction, and he was ready to run for his life.","He had previously been captured by Senior White Two, and he knew how dangerous the world of the black lotus was. If possible, it was better to stay away from this place.","Furthermore, the rulers of the Netherworld never had a great reputation. As they were the evilest and most deceitful beings in the universe, nobody expected them to have a conscience. If a ruler of the Netherworld refused to pay, then the Almighty Merchant would have no choice but to suffer a loss.","However, under the temptation of making a huge profit, he still chose to bravely come over.","There was a chance that he might suffer a loss, but if the transaction was completed, then he would have gained big time. Completing this deal would be equivalent to being handsomely rewarded for all the effort he put in over the past hundred years!","Even taking into account the risk of the ruler of the Netherworld reneging on his promise, the temptation of making a huge profit was irresistible!","Luckily, the transaction proceeded smoothly.","The goods that Little Sun You’re Busy T233 wanted could only be provided by the Almighty Merchant.","In addition, it was the Netherworld Ruler’s side that had suggested paying 10,000 times the normal value of the goods. Otherwise, the Almighty Merchant would have never come over.","Just when they were about to close the deal, the Almighty Merchant sensed the signal from an insurance ticket.","Moreover, the source of the signal was very close to him as he and Su Clan’s Sixteen were only separated by the Inner World.","As such, the Almighty Merchant casually stretched out his hand and grabbed Su Clan’s Sixteen, bringing her over.","With that, the purpose of the insurance ticket had been met.","[Eh? Isn’t this Su Clan’s Sixteen, the girl who’s always with No Tyrannical Song?] Little Sun looked at Sixteen curiously and said, [Is there something wrong with her? She doesn’t seem the same as before...]","The adult Sixteen raised her head and looked at the huge, dazzling sun.","“Did she grow up?” The Almighty Merchant was similarly confused.","While they were discussing, they heard a popping sound, similar to that of a balloon popping.","Then, the grown-up version of Su Clan’s Sixteen exploded and disappeared.","[It turns out that it was just a Flame Substitute.] Little Sun explained with a smile, [It should be from that fire-type life-saving magical technique called Flame Substitution Technique.]","The Almighty Merchant’s heart froze, and he could not help but grab onto the sheet covering his body tightly. At this moment, he felt as if all the world’s malice was directed at him.","Little Sun smiled and said, [Su Clan’s Sixteen has been staying with No Tyrannical Song recently. I wonder which big shot No Tyrannical Song provoked this time...]"]},{"number":2063,"title":"Chapter 2063 IOU","paragraphs":["2063 IOU","Little Sun sent a message, [No Tyrannical Song was finally blacklisted by Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant. The show we have been waiting for for months is finally unfolding before our eyes.]","Several joyful peals of laughter came from the depths of the world of the black lotus.","Little Sun T233 continued, [The next report is serious.]","That little fairy maiden from the Su Clan required a dragon pearl, specifically the dragon pearl of a living true dragon.","Seeing that Tyrannical Song had three dragon pearls in each of his palms, Little Sun speculated that the little fairy maiden from the Su Clan was looking for a dragon pearl on No Tyrannical Song’s behalf.","No Tyrannical Song required a living dragon’s dragon pearl, and Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant would be the one to supply it.","The ruler of the Netherworld could use this piece of news in several ways. After all, the ruler of the Netherworld could easily do things that other people had a hard time doing.","Little Sun reported everything in detail to its master, Netherworld Ruler White.","?????","Meanwhile, the Almighty Merchant asked, “So, you just want to borrow the dragon pearl of a true dragon?”","How do I say this...","This price is much lower than what I imagined.","By relying on his reputation, it was almost of no cost for him to find a true dragon friend and borrow their dragon pearl and pay them back later.","Sixteen replied, “Yes, just loaning would be fine.”","“But it has to be a true dragon’s dragon pearl,” added Sister White Dragon. Everything they did would be pointless if they were to lower their standards for this dragon pearl.","The Almighty Merchant smiled and said, “Give me some time then. I’m going to finish an on-going transaction and will be back immediately.”","Before leaving, he waved vigorously at Song Shuhang.","Goodbye, No Tyrannical Song~ After this meeting, we’ll never see each other again!","Song Shuhang looked at the enthusiastic Almighty Merchant and had no choice but to smile back.","?????","Back to the world of the black lotus.","With a professional smile, the Almighty Merchant said to Little Sun You’re Busy T233, “Sorry for making you wait, Fellow Daoist.”","Little Sun T233 smiled gently and said, “It’s fine. I’m not in that much of a hurry.”","The Almighty Merchant said both expectantly and nervously, “Then, let’s finish the transaction.”","Making 10,000 times the profit was very tempting to him.","But considering that the other party was the ruler of the Netherworld, it would be normal for there to be some haggling involved. Therefore, the Almighty Merchant was prepared not to get the agreed sum.","However, it did not mean that he would still proceed with the transaction if the profit dropped too much. If it only dropped from 10,000 times to 7,000 times, he could accept it for example. In the end, Netherworld Ruler White was rather honest, and when he said that he would return his sheet, the Almighty Merchant really did get it back.","It was precisely because Netherworld Ruler White was more honest than the other creatures in the Netherworld that the Almighty Merchant bit the bullet this time and went to the world of the black lotus to carry out this transaction.","If not for that, he would have never accepted to meet the other party there considering their background.","“As for the payment... We’ll give you half the amount for now. We will forward the remaining half after confirming that there are no problems with the goods. This is how they carry out all transactions in the main world nowadays, and we must also keep up with the times. Moreover, we also need to determine whether or not there is any problem with Fellow Daoist’s goods, right?” Little Sun said. “Rest assured, my master is the ruler of the Netherworld, and it is impossible for him to default on the bill. As long as there is no problem with the goods, we will send you the remaining half of the payment within half a month at most.”","Little Sun’s words made too much sense to be refuted.","The Almighty Merchant: “...”","Doesn’t your conscience hurt even a little bit when you said that line?","Is a Netherworld Ruler who never defaults on his debts still a Netherworld Ruler?","Anyway, half of the original amount is still fine.","The Almighty Merchant was mentally prepared to receive only half the payment.","However, half of the agreed price was still 5,000 times the profit, which was a tremendous amount.","Although it was a little less than what he originally expected, it was still within an acceptable range for the Almighty Merchant.","Little Sun T233 continued, “Then, as for the first half of the payment...”","When it got to this point, Little Sun paused for a moment.","“Is there any problem with the first half of the payment?” The Almighty Merchant’s heart tensed up, and he got ready to flip the table.","Even if the other party was the ruler of the Netherworld, when it came to getting his money, he would not budge an inch.","“No, there isn’t any problem with the payment. It’s just that I received a message from my master just now,” Little Sun said gently. “We will give you the first half of the payment right away, and we’ll pay you in spirit stones.”","The rulers of the Netherworld collected spirit stones as well, but the amount was relatively small as they were useless to them.","Of course, the amount was small only when compared to their other treasures. In the eyes of ordinary cultivators, it was still massive.","The Almighty Merchant heaved a sigh of relief.","Little Sun T233 shone a bit brighter. Some investments were required in the early stages, and this first half of the payment was a kind of investment, which Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant seemed to like.","After a few more transactions like this, they could let the Almighty Merchant go.","“Also, my master is an honest ruler of the Netherworld, so you don’t have to worry about the remaining half of the payment. We will give you a very valuable IOU, which you can use to claim the rest of the agreed amount in half a month at most,” Little Sun T233 added. “You can only use this IOU once, so don’t waste it.”","The Almighty Merchant was stunned for a moment. Netherworld Ruler White was truly a man of noble character among the Rulers of the Netherworld!","In the next moment, Little Sun T233 took out a small box and handed it to the Almighty Merchant. He also brought out a small mountain of spirit stones to complete the first part of the payment.","The Almighty Merchant opened the box and saw a shiny pearl inside the box.","This is... A dragon pearl?","This dragon pearl is full of vitality. It’s the dragon pearl of a living true dragon.","Little Sun T233 smiled and said, “This dragon pearl is of extraordinary significance to my master. Fellow daoist, make sure to cherish it.”","The corners of the Almighty Merchant’s mouth twitched.","He knew how he was supposed to use this dragon pearl.","He was aware of the relationship between Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and Netherworld Ruler White, and that little fairy maiden from the Su Clan just so happened to ask for a true dragon’s dragon pearl...","He had no doubt in his mind that this dragon pearl was prepared by Netherworld Ruler White for Tyrannical Song.","To make use of him and give this dragon pearl to Tyrannical Song, Netherworld Ruler White had delayed the remaining half of the payment.","The Almighty Merchant blamed everything on Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Sure enough, it’s never a good thing when I meet Tyrannical Song!","“Fellow Daoist T233, don’t worry. I will handle this matter,” the Almighty Merchant said. For the remaining half of the payment, he would perform his duties flawlessly.","After saying that, the Almighty Merchant took away the spirit stones and the dragon pearl, reappearing at Song Shuhang’s coordinates."]},{"number":2064,"title":"Chapter 2064 Schrödinger’s dragon pearl","paragraphs":["2064 Schr?dinger’s dragon pearl","As half of the Almighty Merchant’s body emerged from the portal, he said, “Little girl of the Su Clan, what you wanted was—”","Song Shuhang quickly interjected, “The dragon pearl of a true dragon. We don’t want a golden dragon’s pearl or a silver dragon’s pearl.”","The Almighty Merchant glanced at Song Shuhang and turned his head around, ignoring him. Out of sight, out of mind... And if he could not have Tyrannical Song out of sight, he could use a censoring technique that would remove Tyrannical Song from his field of vision.","Sixteen coughed lightly and said, “Senior, I just need to borrow a true dragon’s dragon pearl.”","The Almighty Merchant nodded solemnly and handed a small box to Sixteen. “This dragon pearl is very precious. Remember, you can only use it once. If you use it more than once and ruin it, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song will have to bear full responsibility for it. Its value is equivalent to a small mountain of Ninth Stage spirit stones, and it’s worth two times the flat imperial hat that Tyrannical Song bought from me previously. Therefore, you best handle it with care.”","“Wha... Heavens! It’s worth two times the flat imperial hat?” Song Shuhang gulped.","The flat imperial hat had cost him an entire spatial magical treasure’s worth of spirit stones, and that was already a debt that he had been unable to pay after all this time.","In the past, he believed that as his strength increased, the speed at which he earned spirit stones would also get faster, and he would then be able to repay his debt.","The higher one climbed, the more one earned. There was nothing wrong with it in principle.","However, reality just so happens to, more often than not, smack one right in the face with the truth, ruining one’s fantasies.","It was true that he was earning more and more as his level increased. After all, he could now fight higher-level monsters and exchange them for higher-level spirit stones, as well as go to more dangerous ruins and obtain higher-level loot.","But the problem was that while he was indeed earning more and more, he was similarly spending more and more. Most of the time, the money he earned would not even reach him before being spent or used elsewhere.","A debt worth a single flat imperial hat was already too difficult for him to pay back.","If he were to owe a debt of another two flat imperial hats, perhaps he would have to take Sixteen, Senior White, and Sister White Dragon with him and change his identity.","No, no, Senior White is also a creditor of mine.","What a mess! How can I bring a creditor with me when I run away?","This is not child’s play, and it’s not like I’m going on vacation!","However, if he did not take Senior White with him, Song Shuhang was afraid that he would end up dying somewhere along the way.","At this moment, his mind was filled with all kinds of thoughts.","?????","Sixteen took the small box.","The Almighty Merchant said solemnly, “Alright, the transaction is complete.”","Transactions should be carried out with seriousness.","By doing so, one would be able to make one’s customers feel that they were spending their money’s worth.","“Senior, please wait.” Song Shuhang asked cautiously, “Senior Almighty Merchant, before I take this dragon pearl, I would like to ask if there is any problem with it. It’s not broken, is it?”","As this dragon pearl was worth two flat imperial hats, he could not help but be extra careful.","When the Almighty Merchant heard his question, his body trembled violently and his expression changed drastically.","When the Almighty Merchant’s expression changed, so did Song Shuhang’s.","The Almighty Merchant’s expression changed when I asked him that question. Could he be trying to trick me just now?","Is there something wrong with this dragon pearl?","Is the Almighty Merchant trying to trick me into paying him two flat imperial hats’ worth of money?","Song Shuhang said via secret sound transmission, “Be careful, Sixteen. Don’t open the box!”","The Almighty Merchant felt rather regretful at the moment.","I was careless. I can’t believe I made such a mistake while doing business with the ruler of the Netherworld.","When he received the dragon pearl from Little Sun You’re Busy T233, he did not inspect it carefully.","He merely glanced at it and confirmed that it was the dragon pearl of a living true dragon. He did not take the dragon pearl out of the box and check if it was intact and undamaged.","If there was a problem with this dragon pearl, wouldn’t the remaining half of his payment be lost forever?","I must have been influenced by the ruler of the Netherworld back in the world of the black lotus. Otherwise, how could I have made such a rookie mistake? the Almighty Merchant thought to himself.","The ruler of the Netherworld is one of the most, if not the most, terrifying existences in the universe.","When I head to the world of the black lotus in the future, I must place a few more magical techniques on my person to make sure that I can resist the influence of the Netherworld Ruler.","“To be honest with you, when I received this dragon pearl, I did not inspect it carefully,” the Almighty Merchant said solemnly. “This is the second blunder I’ve made this year.”","The first blunder was getting to know Tyrannical Song.","The Almighty Merchant said seriously, “As such, I’m not sure if the dragon pearl in this box is good or not. It might be good, but it might also be bad. According to a theory proposed by a famous physicist, the dragon pearl in the box could be either good or bad, and it’s thus in a state of both at this moment. Its life and death are in a superimposed state. Only when you open the box can you know whether this dragon pearl is alive or dead.”","Sister White Dragon laughed and said, “Schr?dinger’s dragon pearl?”","“I don’t care about that,” Song Shuhang said. “I just want to know, if this dragon pearl is damaged, who is to blame?”","The Almighty Merchant raised his head and looked up at the sky.","He felt that he had been tricked.","He then looked at Senior White and asked, “Sage White, what do you think?”","“Open it.” Senior White nodded and said, “I’m looking forward to seeing Song Shuhang pregnant with septuplets.”","The Almighty Merchant laughed heartily. He felt more at ease now, and he said boldly, “Open it. If it’s damaged, it’s my fault.”","Sixteen’s slender fingers opened the small box.","The moment the box was opened, a seal was broken.","The dragon pearl in the box shone with a gentle and beautiful light.","“This dragon pearl...” The divine dragon and Sister White Dragon muttered at the same time.","The two big shots had sensed something special about the dragon pearl.","The level of the dragon pearl was extremely high.","Moreover, it was also of a very special kind.","Sister White Dragon said, “This feeling... A demodragon?”","“A demodragon? That sounds familiar... Ah, the demodragon medicine!” Song Shuhang suddenly remembered the demodragon medicine, which could significantly enhance a cultivator’s physique. It was a medicine that would allow the user to spin a cocoon after drinking it.","Sixteen asked in puzzlement, “Is the demodragon also a true dragon?”","Isn’t a demodragon a type of cosmic demon?","With the continuous improvement of the technology that cultivators had at their disposal, cosmic demons that appeared in the main world were no longer seen as disasters but rather as walking treasures.","“I’m not certain about the specifics of this matter either.” Sister White Dragon touched the dragon pearl lightly.","There was nothing wrong with the aura coming from the dragon pearl, and concealed within it was also the madness typical of cosmic demons.","However, what was surprising was that demodragons also had dragon pearls."]},{"number":2065,"title":"Chapter 2065 There’s no time, so get to the delivery room","paragraphs":["2065 There’s no time, so get to the delivery room","Just as the divine dragon had said earlier, a true dragon’s dragon pearl was very precious and hard to find.","After all, not all pearl-like objects were dragon pearls, and it was not something that could be spat out by any scaly creature.","However, the demodragon in question, which was classified as a cosmic demon, had condensed a genuine dragon pearl!","This left the divine dragon and Sister White Dragon, two big shots from the dragon race, quite baffled.","It was like seeing a dog spit out a giant diamond; it went against all common sense.","Senior White said, “Well, cosmic demons are very strange creatures.”","In fact, practitioners all over the universe felt the same way.","Every time a cosmic demon made its appearance, it would start destroying everything in its sight. This was why whenever a cosmic demon was sighted, practitioners had to deal with them as soon as possible, lest they wreak havoc and destroy vast swathes of the main world.","As practitioners all over the world killed more and more cosmic demons, they discovered that there were all kinds of treasures in their bodies.","There were spiritual stones, magical treasures, and even precious medicinal herbs and natural medicinal materials.","Over time, practitioners came up with many theories.","Some believed that the treasures were the spoils that cosmic demons instinctively took from other practitioners after killing them.","Some believed that cosmic demons once had a civilization of their own and that they may have gone through a prosperous era before they became irrational creatures that only wished to bring destruction.","Senior White continued to speculate, “Perhaps the demodragon was a true dragon before it became a cosmic demon, or maybe some other type of dragon.”","The divine dragon fell silent, not knowing how to answer. It was like asking a human being to admit that a mandrill was of the same race as them.","Sister White Dragon looked at the Almighty Merchant.","The dragon pearl came from the Almighty Merchant, and the demodragon to which the dragon pearl belonged was still alive, so he had to know something.","The Almighty Merchant said, “Don’t look at me. I’m just a middleman in this transaction, and this dragon pearl isn’t even mine. After you use it, I have to return it to its owner.”","Song Shuhang turned his hair into a small hand and took the demodragon’s dragon pearl from Sixteen. “Senior Divine Dragon, will this dragon pearl do the job?”","The divine dragon said, “In theory, it should.”","As long as it was a true dragon’s dragon pearl, it should work just fine.","“In that case, please watch over me,” said Song Shuhang as he used his secret appraisal technique.","A small wound appeared on Song Shuhang’s cheek. The price of the appraisal was surprisingly low.","At the same time, the results of the appraisal emerged in his mind.","[A treasure from a certain Netherworld Ruler: Demodragon’s Dragon Pearl.]","The information was short and concise. No wonder the price of the appraisal was so low.","Song Shuhang tried urging the secret appraisal technique to obtain more information, but it was to no avail.","It was as if the information was being blocked on purpose.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and held the dragon pearl, raising it before his eyes to observe it carefully.","There were two rulers of the Netherworld, so from whom was this dragon pearl?","It should be from Senior White Two. Shuhang quickly reached this conclusion.","If the demodragon dragon pearl was from the fat ball, it would have poisoned him the moment he touched it and killed him.","Therefore, the dragon pearl must have come from Senior White Two.","Song Shuhang sniffed the dragon pearl, but he did not manage to smell anything from it. He could not sense Senior White Two’s aura either.","Senior White asked suddenly, “Do you want to eat it?”","Senior White’s voice seemed to be imbued with temptation.","Or perhaps it was more apt to say that his voice seemed to somehow stimulate the demodragon’s dragon pearl.","When Senior White said that sentence, Song Shuhang started to feel that the demodragon dragon pearl was incredibly tasty.","It looks so delicious. I want to eat it.","In Song Shuhang’s eyes, the demodragon dragon pearl had turned into a delicacy that could not be resisted at all.","As he stared at the dragon pearl, he began salivating. He felt really hungry.","And so, Song Shuhang put the dragon pearl in his mouth and swallowed it in one go.","“Shiet!” the Almighty Merchant called out in alarm.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is really like a sinkhole.","He actually swallowed such a big dragon pearl.","This is so tiring. I don’t want to see Profound Sage Tyrannical Song ever again. If I need to deal with him in the future, I’ll just send my disciple while I stay behind the scenes.","In this way, if they were to somehow fall victim to Tyrannical Song’s vicious manipulation and owe a huge debt, he could sell his adorable disciple to pay off the debt.","The divine dragon and Sixteen were left utterly speechless.","“Is it delicious?” Sister White Dragon smiled slightly.","Song Shuhang nodded instinctively. “It’s delicious. I can still feel the taste in my mouth.”","I want to eat another one.","After eating it, he finally determined that the dragon pearl was from Senior White Two. Although it was extremely faint, Senior White Two’s aura was present deep inside the dragon pearl.","Sister White Dragon reminded him, “Don’t forget that this dragon pearl is worth two of your flat imperial hats.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Little friend Tyrannical Song, you’re the one who swallowed the dragon pearl. If it gets damaged, you’ll have to pay for the loss,” said the Almighty Merchant immediately. After all, he did not want to bear responsibility for Shuhang’s actions.","Song Shuhang returned to his senses and patted his chest forcefully, trying to force the dragon pearl out of his mouth.","Senior White said, “Don’t bother.”","He then took a step forward and lifted Song Shuhang’s head from his neck.","The dragon pearl was stuck under his neck, shining brightly.","Song Shuhang’s head and wooden body were merely glued together, and his mouth and stomach were actually not connected. As such, the things he swallowed would not go into his wooden body.","Therefore, no matter how hard he patted his chest, he would not be able to spit out the dragon pearl as it never reached his stomach.","Senior White said, “Sixteen, come and extract the dragon pearl.”","Song Shuhang exclaimed, “Wait, Senior White. Isn’t it weird to take it out from under my neck?”","In the meantime, many silk threads extended out from the demodragon dragon pearl. With Song Shuhang’s neck as the center, the threads spread in all directions.","Silk threads also emerged from Song Shuhang’s mouth.","Am I about to spin another cocoon?","Song Shuhang was an expert in this field.","Although he was not taught how to spin a cocoon in school, he had managed to learn through experience.","“Huh?” Seeing the scene, the divine dragon was stunned.","When it returned to its senses, it said, “Place the other six dragon pearls around him. The energy inside the demodragon’s dragon pearl has already been activated. Fellow Daoist White, little girl from the Su Clan, Fairy White Dragon, work together to activate the other dragon pearls.","“Little friend Shuhang, carefully listen to what I’m about to say. I will explain how the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? works.”","There’s no time, so enter the delivery room and get ready to give birth to your Nascent Souls!"]},{"number":2066,"title":"Chapter 2066 I_don’t_care,_go_off_on_your_own.jpg","paragraphs":["2066 I_don’t_care,_go_off_on_your_own.jpg","Senior Divine Dragon, there’s something wrong.","Didn’t you say that you would explain the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? in detail and then guide me step by step when I’m birthing the Nascent Soul?","What’s with this fast-paced, C-section kind of guidance you’re giving me right now?!","I’m Song Shuhang, and I’m panicking right now.","I don’t know what will happen to me next. However, my intuition tells me that Senior Divine Dragon’s original plan has completely fallen through.","The plan failed to keep up with the changes, which is truly anxiety-inducing.","Unfortunately for Song Shuhang, he had no way of speaking right now. Silk threads spewed out from his mouth unceasingly as the demodragon’s dragon pearl he swallowed earlier had been completely activated.","At the same time, under the guidance of the divine dragon, Senior White, Sister White Dragon, and Sixteen activated their dragon pearls. Afterward, the dragon pearls that belonged to the divine dragon, Little Stripey, and Fairy Kunna were also activated.","The six dragon pearls formed a spinning ring of light above Song Shuhang’s head, which worked together with the demodragon’s dragon pearl that he had swallowed.","With a deep and solemn voice, Senior Divine Dragon began to explain the steps of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique?.","Concurrently, Sister White Dragon assumed the role of a translator.","Song Shuhang said using group voice transmission: [Wait, Senior Divine Dragon. Is it fine for me to spin a cocoon while I learn the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique??]","“Spin a cocoon, eh?” The divine dragon looked at the silk threads that were constantly spewing out of Song Shuhang’s mouth, and then said, “Okay, go ahead and give it a try. Still, make sure to pay attention to my words and not to get distracted.”","Song Shuhang replied, [No problem.]","Then, he started moving his head around skillfully.","Senior White stretched out his hand, and the soil on the ground rose up, forming three walls around Song Shuhang which would help him with the cocoon.","Senior White had also spun a cocoon in the past, so he knew what Song Shuhang needed.","Seeing that Song Shuhang seemed so familiar with the process, Senior Divine Dragon asked, “Could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is a monster caterpillar?”","Looking at Tyrannical Song’s actions, it was obvious that this was not his first time spinning a cocoon.","If one isn’t a monster insect, who would be so bored as to learn how to spin a cocoon?","I thought that Tyrannical Song was from the human race. Could I have been wrong?","“Pfft~” Sister White Dragon could not help but laugh when she heard the divine dragon’s words. She did not translate, and instead replied to the divine dragon in the dragon language, “Yes, Shuhang is also a little bug that’s very difficult to crush to death. This has been acknowledged by several big shots in the universe, a few of which are old seniors who are even stronger than me.”","Sixteen was speechless.","Ever since she awakened her true dragon bloodline, she had inherited some knowledge from it. In that knowledge, there were bits and pieces about the dragon language, so she could somewhat understand what they were talking about.","Sixteen said softly, “Sister White Dragon, you’re misleading Senior Divine Dragon. What if this spreads around?”","“This is a good thing, actually,” Sister White Dragon replied. “It is very beneficial to hide your information so that others have a harder time finding your weaknesses. Just think about it this way. If, in the future, someone targets Shuhang and wants to harm him, this piece of information may lead them to use a method that was created to deal with monster insects. Won’t it be amusing to see how their efforts become pointless?”","Why are you assuming Shuhang is going to get targeted?!","Sixteen wanted to refute Sister White Dragon’s words, but after recalling what Song Shuhang had been through over the past few months, she found herself at a loss as to how to refute her.","Little Sixteen ended up feeling really complicated emotions.","?????","The divine dragon briefly explained the content of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? to Song Shuhang and then had him remember it firmly in his mind.","The explanation was simple and explained how pregnancy and childbirth worked, as well as how mothers had to prepare when giving birth.","When the divine dragon finished introducing the cultivation technique, Song Shuhang’s cocoon had already taken shape.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song lives up to his name of ‘monster caterpillar that’s difficult to crush’. The speed at which he spun that cocoon is simply extraordinary.","Afterward, the divine dragon began explaining the key parts of the technique.","The divine dragon instructed, “Tyrannical Song, recite the first volume of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? in your mind, then guide the draconic energy inside the dragon pearl to your Spirit Lake and make them come in contact.”","Song Shuhang thought for a while and said, “Senior, I have seven small dantians and seven dragon pearls. How do I match them?”","“How am I supposed to know? I’ve never helped deliver septuplets!” The divine dragon shook its head and added, “How about you just let fate decide?”","Senior White nodded in agreement. “If you don’t have a plan, it’s a good idea to just close your eyes and let fate decide.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","A plan like that was only suitable for Senior White. After all, he was someone who could choose the best course of action with his eyes closed. If others followed his example, they were very likely to end up dead.","“How about you let the draconic energy inside the dragon pearls decide on its own?” Sister White Dragon suggested. “Although the draconic energies in the pearls don’t have a consciousness, they aren’t too far off. Perhaps they can find the most suitable small dantian to merge with.”","“I’ll try that.” Song Shuhang sighed.","Under normal circumstances, he would have sat down with a few seniors and studied the attributes of the dragon pearls and the attributes of his small dantians.","He would find the best combinations and then let the draconic energy of the various dragon pearls go to the small dantian Spirit Lake that they matched.","Unfortunately, he did not have much time to prepare this time around.","Song Shuhang’s consciousness sank into his original dantian—the Scholarly Sage’s blood was truly a marvelous thing, and it had saved the most important things in Song Shuhang’s body before disaster hit it.","The energy inside the seven dragon pearls, under the will of their owners, merged with Song Shuhang’s head, and then all entered his original dantian through the Sage’s blood.","Projections of the seven dragon pearls appeared above the fat whale golden core inside Song Shuhang’s original dantian.","“Alright then, all of you can go off on your own,” Song Shuhang said to the projections. “There are seven small dantians before you, you can choose whichever you want to enter.”","I_don’t_care,_go_off_on_your_own.jpg","After some time, the projections of the seven dragon pearls did not show any reaction.","Sadly, it seemed like the plan of letting them search for a suitable small dantian on their own was not going to work.","There was no other choice, and he could only rely on his luck now.","Song Shuhang found the energy projection of Sixteen’s dragon pearl first.","Compared with the other dragon pearls, Sixteen’s had the least energy and was thus the easiest to control.","Song Shuhang carefully wrapped the energy projection with his psychic energy, preparing to move it to his first small dantian.","The projection of Sixteen’s dragon pearl moved little by little, eventually leaving the fat whale golden core.","“Hm?” In the outside world, Sixteen blinked.","The divine dragon said, “Don’t worry. When the dragon pearl’s energy is being transferred and merged with a Spirit Lake, the true dragon that corresponds to the dragon pearl will have the illusion that they are soaring through the clouds. This is a normal phenomenon.”","“Soaring through the clouds?” Sixteen’s expression changed subtly, because she felt as if she was being held by a warm pair of hands and getting shaken violently.","Inside the original dantian.","When Song Shuhang finally moved out Sixteen’s energy projection, the fat whale golden core, which had been lazing around like a pig, suddenly opened its eyes.","Like a child that had their favorite toy taken away from them, it began throwing a tantrum.","Take my splash attack!"]},{"number":2067,"title":"Chapter 2067 The next step is very important","paragraphs":["2067 The next step is very important","As always, it looked very graceful as it performed its splash attack, its fat body moving at incredible speed despite its girth.","Song Shuhang was left confused as he watched Sixteen’s energy projection get swallowed by the fat whale.","It happened so quickly that he did not have the time to stop it.","This stupid whale is seriously beyond saving.","Is its memory so bad?","Not everything can be eaten. Why can’t it understand this simple truth?","In the outside world, a strange expression appeared on Sixteen’s face.","“Now, I feel as if my dragon pearl was swallowed by something.” Sixteen tried to describe what she was feeling.","“Swallowed? That doesn’t sound right.” The divine dragon became curious.","It had never heard of anyone who practiced the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? making a true dragon feel as if their dragon pearl was swallowed.","It wanted to see what exactly was going on in Song Shuhang’s original dantian, but due to the Scholarly Sage’s blood blocking its senses, it could not see anything.","What was even worse was that Song Shuhang was spinning his cocoon faster and faster. As his body was wrapped in silk threads, it was difficult to even see his appearance.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Inside the cocoon.","Even though Sixteen’s energy projection had been swallowed by the fat whale, Song Shuhang still remained calm.","After experiencing everything he did, this little bit of turbulence could no longer affect his state of mind.","In addition, he knew that as long as he summoned the virtuous lamia, this stupid whale would be forced to spit out everything it had swallowed.","Besides that, the splashing and trashing of the fat whale golden core reminded him of when he was in the Fifth Stage Realm.","Song Shuhang recalled that when his small golden cores first merged with his original dantian, they were swallowed by the fat whale in the exact same way.","Then, after being squeezed out, the small golden cores automatically found a small dantian to settle in.","If I let this stupid whale swallow all the energy projections and make the virtuous lamia squeeze them out later, will the projections take the initiative to find a spirit lake suitable for them?","Hmm, this is a lot better than relying on luck.","I can give it a try!","And so, Song Shuhang began to use small bits of psychic energy to move the other six dragon pearls to the top of the fat whale golden core’s head.","Sure enough, that silly whale was beyond saving.","Every time Song Shuhang moved a projection, the whale would jump up hastily and swallow it.","In the outside world, the complexions of Sister White Dragon and the divine dragon changed in quick succession.","The two big shots of the dragon race also felt as if their respective dragon pearls’ projections had been swallowed.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","After all the seven dragon pearls were swallowed, Song Shuhang laughed and summoned the virtuous lamia.","He thought that the virtuous lamia’s whale-squeezing skill would become useless after the Fifth Stage; little did he expect that it would come in handy even during the Sixth Stage Realm.","The virtuous lamia emerged from Song Shuhang’s back.","She stretched herself and appeared right outside the giant cocoon.","The divine dragon looked at the virtuous lamia in surprise. “What’s this? Light of virtue?”","Although it was said that light of virtue could manifest into all kinds of forms in its later stages, the divine dragon had never seen a lifelike manifestation like the one that belonged to Tyrannical Song.","After waking up from its slumber, the divine dragon did not have any time to watch the Profound Sage Speech delivered by a certain Profound Sage surnamed Song, so it had a hard time comprehending the existence of the virtuous lamia.","Right after appearing, the virtuous lamia looked around and took in her surroundings.","She saw the divine dragon, Sister White Dragon, Sixteen, and Senior White all watching her, so she felt a little shy.","Her tail coiled up, and she clutched her chest as she slowly fell down. “Aahhh!”","Did she die?","The divine dragon was stunned.","Song Shuhang’s voice sounded from the cocoon, “Fairy, stop messing around. I’m in labor. Help me.”","When she heard Shuhang’s words, the virtuous lamia calmly got up from the ground.","She floated up to the cocoon and pierced it with her hands, going for Song Shuhang’s original dantian.","The Scholarly Sage’s blood did not stop her hands.","Soon, she skillfully caught the fat whale.","Although the fat whale was much stronger than before, the virtuous lamia had similarly gotten stronger.","The fat whale managed to dodge her hands twice but ended up getting caught by the virtuous lamia in the end.","Then, along with the silent cries of the fat whale, the energy projections of the dragon pearls were squeezed out one by one.","Surprisingly, what was squeezed out was not just an energy projection but an actual dragon pearl!","It had to be noted that the fat whale swallowed the energy projections of the seven dragon pearls, but what was squeezed out were actual dragon pearls.","“I’ve struck it rich!” This was the first thought that came to Song Shuhang’s mind.","If the fat whale golden core could produce a dragon pearl after swallowing the energy projection of one, wouldn’t he be able to make a fortune by selling dragon pearls?","Had he found a way to make a huge fortune in a short period of time?","Did I gain the golden touch like Midas?","No, it’s probably more apt to call it the dragon pearl touch.","Seven is truly a lucky number.","There are seven days in a week, the Big Dipper has seven stars, and I have seven dragon pearls.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The divine dragon asked curiously, “What is that light of virtue doing?”","“It should be...” Sixteen stopped mid-sentence.","This was because she realized that if she continued talking, what she said next might end up creating a huge misunderstanding.","“It worked!” Song Shuhang’s voice sounded from the cocoon, perfectly interrupting Sixteen’s awkward pause.","At this moment, there were a total of seven small dragon pearls dancing around the fat whale golden core.","Song Shuhang sensed that an intimate bond had formed between him and the seven small dragon pearls now that they had been processed by the fat whale golden core.","He tried issuing the same order he did previously to the seven small dragon pearls. “Go, little ones. Find a small dantian that suits you!”","This time, the little dragon pearls listened to him.","The first one to move was the small dragon pearl that corresponded to Sixteen. This small dragon pearl was born from the fusion between Sixteen’s dragon pearl energy and his fat whale golden core’s energy.","It was the first one to move and it moved upstream from the original dantian, arriving at the spirit lake formed by his first small golden core.","This was the most normal small golden core that Song Shuhang had in his body. It was an ordinary small golden core with nine dragon patterns.","After Sixteen’s small dragon pearl, the mirage dragon pearl that came from Senior White was the next one to move. It entered his second spirit lake, which had been formed by the colorful monster core. Song Shuhang speculated that this was because both were related to the power of mirage dragons.","The small dragon pearl that corresponded to Sister White Dragon entered his third small dantian, where the spirit lake was formed by the virtuous diamond ball. Perhaps due to Sister White Dragon’s current state being similar to a body of virtue, her dragon pearl and the virtuous diamond ball found themselves drawn to one another.","Unsurprisingly, the demodragon’s dragon pearl that was given to him by Senior White Two entered the fourth small dantian, where the spirit lake was formed by the royal blood demon core. Since both were related to cosmic demons, this was expected.","The dragon pearl that belonged to Striped Dragon’s son entered the fifth small dantian, where the spirit lake was formed by the mechanical core reactor.","As for the dragon pearl of the divine dragon, it entered the sixth small dantian, where the spirit lake was formed by the ancient witch blood.","Finally, Fairy Kunna’s dragon pearl entered the seventh small dantian, where the spirit lake was formed by the ancient nether dragon soul which Song Shuhang condensed in the Black Dragon World.","Besides the dragon pearls of Striped Dragon’s son and the divine dragon, the other dragon pearls chose spirit lakes that seemed to match them fairly well.","With that, all seven dragon pearls had found their place.","Song Shuhang asked, “What’s next, Senior Divine Dragon?”","The divine dragon said, “The next step is very important. You need to use the energy of your spirit lakes to nurture the projections of the dragon pearls, just as if they were a magical treasure. In this way, they can evolve into ‘pseudo-dragon pearls’ that are infinitely close to the actual thing. This is a very time-consuming process, so you’ll have to close up for a long period of time.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","He looked at the small dragon pearls, which had entered their respective spirit lakes inside his small dantians and were already infinitely close to real dragon pearls.","If I were to tell it the truth, would I be killed by Senior Divine Dragon?"]},{"number":2068,"title":"Chapter 2068 I close my eyes, I open my eyes, and I am a brand new Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["2068 I close my eyes, I open my eyes, and I am a brand new Tyrannical Song","Song Shuhang was also helpless, and there was nothing that he could do about things not following the natural order.","After all, other practitioners did not have a stupid whale in their bodies, and they needed to use their spirit lake to nurture the dragon pearl’s energy projection to make it evolve into a pseudo-dragon-pearl. According to Senior Divine Dragon, this process should be quite lengthy and generally required one to close up.","And when cultivators closed up, they would usually do so for at least a month.","However, the dragon pearls in his small dantians were already close to the real thing, so he theoretically did not need to go through this step.","So, should I skip this step?","Or should I pretend to nurture my dragon pearls so as to look like I’m following Senior Divine Dragon’s instructions?","But even in that case, how long should I pretend to close up?","I can’t possibly keep acting for half a month. That would be too much of a waste of time.","Also, I don’t have the acting skills of the virtuous lamia, so I won’t be able to keep up the act for that long, either.","Screw it, I’ll just try my best.","What the Almighty Merchant said earlier was correct. Being solemn and ceremonial was very important. A solemn attitude could give people a sense of security.","Thinking of this, Song Shuhang’s consciousness dove into his small dantians and began studying the small dragon pearls inside his body.","He wanted to take a closer look at what was so special about these small dragon pearls and if there was any possibility of re-nurturing them.","The first one he looked at was the small dragon pearl that corresponded to Sixteen.","This small dragon pearl was born from Sixteen’s energy projection after the latter was altered by the fat whale golden core.","In terms of structure, it should be pretty close to the pseudo-dragon-pearl mentioned by Senior Divine Dragon.","“It feels no different from a real dragon pearl. The only difference is in their size.” Song Shuhang carefully wrapped the small dragon pearl with his mental energy.","The small dragon pearl grew very excited when it sensed his presence. When Song Shuhang’s mental energy came into contact with it, their energies merged without any hindrance.","Through his mental energy, he felt as if the small dragon pearl had transformed into a miniature Sixteen","Song Shuhang’s mental energy took the form of a hand and grabbed the miniature Sixteen’s hand. The mental energy, draconic energy, and the energy inside the small dantian seemed to have formed a cycle.","A self-sustaining system was created, and it seemed to be a part of an even larger cycle that included the original dantian and the other six small dantians.","At the same time, Song Shuhang’s seven Life Wheels came over of their own accord, gathering inside the first small dantian.","The seven Life Wheels began spinning, seemingly gearing up for a big battle.","Currently, Song Shuhang was trying to breach the Seventh Heavenly Layer among the Ten Heavenly Layers.","The Eighth, Ninth, and Tenth Heavenly Layers that came after the first seven were reserved, respectively, for ordinary, advanced, and super VIP True Monarchs.","It was only with at least seven dragon patterns on one’s Golden Core that one would have the opportunity to breach these three layers.","An ordinary VIP True Monarch who had breached eight heavenly layers had the strength to escape from Seventh Stage Venerables who had ascended while having breached only six heavenly layers.","An advanced VIP True Monarch with nine heavenly layers breached would, when cultivating, face a level of difficulty equal to an ordinary, non-VIP True Monarch who had ascended to the Venerable Realm. Their combat power was also not much weaker, and they only lacked the signature moves of Seventh Stage Venerables. Moreover, only those with eight dragon patterns on their Golden Core could reach this level.","As for those who had breached ten heavenly layers, they were usually people with nine-dragon-patterned Golden Cores.","Sixth Stage True Monarchs who could disregard the difference in realm and slay a Venerable were all “Favored Children of Heaven” who had breached ten heavenly layers.","More than 99% of the Immortals in the universe were in this category when they were younger. Among the big shots that Song Shuhang knew, only the now-blacklisted Demon Emperor Hezhi had a lower number of dragon patterns when he was younger.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Inside the first small dantian, the seven Life Wheels were spinning frantically, waiting for Song Shuhang’s order.","After pondering for a while, Song Shuhang gave them the order to attack.","It was better to not waste time and strive to breach ten heavenly layers.","“Boom!” The seven Life Wheels frantically bombarded the barrier in the first small dantian.","With 7 against 1, it was seven times easier for Song Shuhang to break the barriers in his dantians compared to other people. Although he had seven more dantians, he should still be faster on average.","Additionally, Song Shuhang was supported by his light of virtue, his ghost spirit, his two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, and his three Sage Seals.","Coupled with the enhancement of his ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and the help of the draconic energy of Sixteen’s dragon pearl, the seven Life Wheels were unprecedentedly powerful.","The barrier to the Seventh Heavenly Layer had no chance of resisting the onslaught of the seven Life Wheels.","It was as fragile as a piece of paper and was shredded to pieces.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was a man who was ruthless toward his enemies and even more ruthless toward himself. The way by which he dealt with the barrier in his own body was absolutely cruel and heartless.","The barrier to the Eighth Heavenly Layer did not last long, either, and was swiftly shredded by his seven Life Wheels.","When ordinary cultivators were attacking these barriers, they had to grind them down slowly. Moreover, it was a dignified 1v1 between their Life Wheel and the barriers of the Ten Heavenly Layers.","It was completely different from Song Shuhang, who used group attack tactics. Aside from being a 7 versus 1, there were various auxiliary helpers buffing the troops on his side.","If the barriers of the Ten Heavenly Layer were sentient, they definitely would have lodged a complaint to the Wielder of the Will for Tyrannical Song’s ruthlessness and cruelty.","Old Eighth was killed, and Old Ninth and Old Tenth soon followed in the footsteps of their younger brother.","While they might not have been born on the same day, month, and year, they, at least, died on the same day.","The way they died was also the same. The barriers of the Eighth, Ninth, and Tenth Heavenly layers were all violently shredded to pieces.","When the Tenth Heavenly Layer was breached, Song Shuhang felt a brand-new feeling.","His entire being seemed to have risen to a new level.","However, this was not the end.","Song Shuhang’s mental energy reluctantly let go of the hand of the miniature Sixteen. Then, he rushed to the second small dantian.","This was where Senior White’s mirage dragon pearl was located.","“I shall push all seven small dantians to the Tenth Heavenly Layer today!” Song Shuhang was filled with fighting spirit.","This was the same as playing a game and wanting to end it in a single session.","It was very enjoyable.","Anyway, since the dragon pearl in the first small dantian had transformed into a miniature version of Sixteen, what would the mirage dragon pearl in the second small dantian transform into?","After Song Shuhang’s mental energy entered the second dantian, he used it to wrap the second small dragon pearl.","Just like the first dragon pearl, the mirage dragon pearl also welcomed Song Shuhang’s mental energy.","In Song Shuhang’s eyes, the mirage dragon pearl began transforming.","In the next moment, it turned into a gentle and beautiful woman from the Jiangnan area.","Song Shuhang: “...”"]},{"number":2069,"title":"Chapter 2069 Senior, I’m done closing up","paragraphs":["2069 Senior, I’m done closing up","To be honest, Song Shuhang would not have been that surprised if the mirage dragon pearl assumed the appearance of the mirage dragon leader or Little Senior White.","However, looking at the beautiful woman in front of him, Song Shuhang was puzzled.","He began to wonder if he had a crush on the owner of the bookstore. Otherwise, why would she appear in his small dantian?","Yet, Song Shuhang was certain that he had never thought of her that way.","“Why did the mirage dragon leader’s dragon pearl take on the appearance of the bookstore’s owner?” Song Shuhang asked himself. “Hey, let’s negotiate. Can you change your appearance?”","How could he comfortably merge with the dragon pearl in this kind of situation?","It felt like he was taking advantage of the proprietress by going through with this.","At least change to a look that I won’t feel pressured by when I merge with it!","As if sensing Song Shuhang’s thoughts, the mirage dragon pearl began to change.","In the next moment, the proprietress in front of him disappeared.","Her figure began to dissipate, eventually turning into a dragon claw.","It was the claw of the mirage dragon leader.","As this dragon pearl was from a mirage dragon, it could innately assume numerous forms. Shuhang was rather curious as to what laws or principles it followed when changing forms.","Anyway, Shuhang let out a breath of relief after the dragon pearl transformed into a claw.","He reached out and grabbed it, giving it a solemn handshake filled with a ceremonial feel.","Yet, for some reason, he felt that there was something wrong with this dragon claw.","In the next moment, the ultra-buffed seven Life Wheels rushed into the second small dantian.","“Go.” Song Shuhang gave them a simple order.","The seven Life Wheels were filled with vigor as they bravely rushed forward.","The barriers of the Seventh, Eighth, Ninth, and Tenth Heavenly Layer were broken one after the other.","Compared to the first dantian, the time the wheels took to clear the barriers in the second dantian was a whole two breaths shorter.","Practice makes perfect. The ancients did not deceive me!","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“Let’s move on to the next stop!” After giving the mirage dragon leader’s claw a handshake, Shuhang rushed forward without looking back.","Tonight was destined to be a night of bloodshed!","At the third stop was Sister White Dragon’s dragon pearl.","This stop was relatively normal, and there was nothing strange about it. Sister White Dragon’s dragon pearl had taken the form of a Little White Dragon, and Song Shuhang only had to shake her hand solemnly and be done with it.","At the same time that they shook hands, the seven Life Wheels arrived, and rivers of blood flowed in the third small dantian. The barriers of the heavenly layers were shredded one after the other, and their torn corpses were left on the ground.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“Go!” Song Shuhang waved his hand and headed straight to the fourth stop.","At this stop was the dragon pearl that Senior White Two gave him.","This dragon pearl belonged to a demodragon, so it should take on the form of one.","Yet, when Song Shuhang’s mental energy wrapped around the demodragon’s dragon pearl, it was a cocoon that appeared before his eyes.","The demodragon that he had been expecting did not appear.","Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback.","His mental energy took the shape of a hand and touched the cocoon.","The fluctuations from the cocoon seemed to belong to Senior White Two.","“Wasn’t this dragon pearl from a demodragon? If not, then where did this dragon pearl come from? Or could it be that the image was affected by my will?” Song Shuhang found himself at a loss.","However, the time at his disposal was limited.","The seven Life Wheel began their slaughter once again.","Song Shuhang only needed to issue a command, and the seven Life Wheels instantly enter a frenzied state, forcing their way through the barriers with increasing efficiency.","Song Shuhang’s palm left the cocoon, and a bold guess appeared in his mind. Is this dragon pearl Senior White Two’s dragon pearl?","When I see Senior White Two again, should I consider seeking some guidance on this matter?","“Forget it. I shouldn’t be thinking about that right now. Let’s go to the next stop.” Song Shuhang pushed the thought to the back of his mind and headed straight to the fifth stop.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The dragon pearl at the fifth stop was the dragon pearl of Striped Dragon Two’s son.","I wonder what Striped Dragon Two’s son looks like. Is he also a big shot? What’s his actual identity?","Song Shuhang approached this dragon pearl curiously.","In the next moment, several figures appeared in the world seen through his mental energy.","There was an illusory figure wielding the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, an illusory figure holding a lotus and smiling, and a figure dancing with a fan.","The three figures gathered together and combined to form Fairy Cheng Lin.","“It’s not a male dragon but Fairy Cheng Lin instead?” Song Shuhang felt that Fairy Cheng Lin was in no way a male dragon.","Whether it was the person wielding the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, holding a lotus flower, or dancing with a fan, none of them really matched Fairy Cheng Lin.","It felt more like Striped Dragon Two was concealing the truth, and it was making use of Fairy Cheng Lin’s appearance to do so.","It doesn’t matter.","If I am to know, there will come a time when I will know.","Moreover, I’ll feel less pressure while dealing with Fairy Cheng Lin.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gave “Fairy Cheng Lin” a high five.","After all, he was quite familiar with the “already-dead” Fairy Cheng Lin.","After the two high-fived, the fusion was complete.","The seven Life Wheels came over again, turning Song Shuhang’s fifth dantian into a battlefield.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","At the sixth and seventh stops, where the dragon pearls of the divine dragon and Fairy Kunna were located, everything proceeded smoothly.","Song Shuhang shook hands with the claw of the divine dragon and high-fived Fairy Kunna to complete the ceremony.","After the seven Life Wheels unleashed a final onslaught, the Tenth Heavenly Layer of the seventh and final small dantian was shattered.","The seven Life Wheels began resonating with one another, and the sound of ocean waves spread from Song Shuhang’s cocoon.","Illusory golden lotuses and dragons appeared around the cocoon, which was then dyed a golden color.","The divine dragon wore a calm expression, but it was actually dumbstruck.","What’s going on?","I’ve never heard of such a huge commotion taking place during the process of nurturing a dragon pearl. There’s even the sound of ocean waves and a natural visual phenomenon.","What in the world is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song doing?","Sixteen said, “Shuhang’s aura is getting stronger.”","Sister White Dragon scratched her chin as she said, “This is the sensation caused by the Tenth Heavenly Layers getting breached, isn’t it?”","Moreover, it did not happen once but a whole seven times.","Did Shuhang breach the Tenth Heavenly Layer in each of his seven small dantians?","Senior White reached out to touch one of the golden lotuses, but when he did so, the golden lotus disappeared.","Unfortunately, it seems that I can’t eat them. Senior White thought to himself, feeling rather regretful.","“Fwoo~”","The cocoon burst open, and a large number of green branches that belonged to Song Shuhang’s wooden body extended out of it, quickly spreading in all directions.","Having been affected by Shuhang’s rise in strength, the wooden body flourished once again.","The branches germinated, with green leaves, red flowers, and fresh fruits appearing on them.","“Senior, I’m done closing up.” Song Shuhang spoke with no change in expression whatsoever. “What do I do next?”"]},{"number":2070,"title":"Chapter 2070 Sitting down and humbly asking for advice","paragraphs":["2070 Sitting down and humbly asking for advice","What, you’re done closing up?","Tyrannical Song, could you have misunderstood what the word “closing up” means?","Come here. Allow me, the Guardian Dragon of Garre Holy Mountain, to teach you how to properly close up!","The divine dragon’s heart was in turmoil, to the point that it was ready to launch a breath attack to calm itself.","Shuhang’s branches continued to extend, all the way until they reached Sage White, Fairy White Dragon, Sixteen, and the divine dragon.","There were fruits of different sizes on the branches. The small ones were the size of plums, the regular ones were as big as a fist, and the large ones were as big as a casserole dish.","Sage White and Sixteen stretched out their hands, picked brightly colored fruits from the branches, wiped them, and then ate them.","The virtuous lamia, who was behind Song Shuhang, also picked one. She grew in size and ate one fruit with every bite.","Isn’t she a materialization of light of virtue? Why can she still eat? The divine dragon felt its horizons getting wider and wider.","This was the first time that it had seen a light of virtue do such a thing.","While it was lost in its thoughts, a faint fragrance entered its nostrils. The divine dragon’s claws involuntarily moved forward, plucking off a fruit from a branch and placing it into its mouth.","Mmh, delicious~","The taste of this fruit is special. Although the spiritual energy contained inside it is very low, it’s really tasty.","And depending on the size of the fruit, the taste is also different.","The smallest ones are especially good. When you put them inside your mouth, it feels like they’re popping.","The divine dragon ended up eating a few more fruits.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Sage White was holding a bag filled with plum-sized fruits in his hand.","“Ptui~ Ptui~ Ptui~” He then spat out a bunch of pips into a small pit nearby, using the Ground Leveling Spell to cover it up.","Sixteen took out her sword and began to skillfully cut down Shuhang’s branches so that they would not hinder his movements.","The virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and the black-skinned Soft Feather were responsible for processing the branches and turning them into long strips that Senior White could use for his disposable flying swords in the future.","A few branches that were especially lush were left behind as Song Shuhang planned to transplant them inside his Inner World and see if they could grow further.","At the same time, Sister White Dragon threw several fruits at the Almighty Merchant, who was hovering in the air.","The Almighty Merchant grabbed a fruit and gnawed it fiercely, just as if he were gnawing at Tyrannical Song’s body!","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Sixteen’s movements were very smooth as this was not the first time that she has had to do this for Song Shuhang’s wooden body.","When she reached Song Shuhang’s waist, Sixteen saw that there was a unique fruit that was yet to ripen.","It seems that Song Shuhang does not intend to have this fruit ripen in advance and wants to nurture it little by little until it becomes something like a natural treasure...","Sixteen glanced at it and ignored it, deciding to let it grow.","Song Shuhang coughed lightly and asked, “Senior, is it delicious?”","The divine dragon’s claws stiffened slightly. “Yup, very delicious.”","Song Shuhang said calmly, “Then, can we move on to the next stage?”","The divine dragon’s claws stiffened again. “Sure.”","Feeding someone caused their heart to soften.","After enjoying the fruits from Tyrannical Song’s body, the divine dragon found itself more accepting of Tyrannical Song.","It had initially said that it would teach him how to close up, but it was no longer interested in doing so.","It was fine with simply proceeding to the next step.","“The next step is the last step of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique?.” The divine dragon wiped its mouth, and then continued, “Under normal circumstances, after a cultivator enters the Sixth Stage Realm, every small realm needs a lot of time to be handled properly. The Spirit Lake Conversion, the Laketop Life Wheel, the Ten Heavenly Layers, and the Lotus Formation, each of these generally takes a lot of time. It is especially so for the phase between the Ten Heavenly Layers and the Lotus Formation.”","“Mm-hm, it is indeed rather bothersome.” Song Shuhang sighed.","Sister White Dragon rolled her eyes. Bothersome your ass! You broke through the Seventh, Eighth, Ninth, and Tenth Heavenly Layer of each of your seven small dantians in just a few minutes!","After thinking for a while, Fairy Creation sang, “Oh~ You annoying little monster spirit~”","The virtuous lamia blinked and sang along, “You annoying soy milk maker~ Oh~”","The black-skinned Soft Feather carried Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword on her back and a bundle of Shuhang’s branches in her arms. This time, she did not interject as she felt that she could not keep up with her sisters.","There was a monster spirit and a soy milk maker. What else could she sing about?","However, her two seniors were very strict, and they turned their heads to stare at the black-skinned Soft Feather, expecting her to also join the performance.","The black-skinned Soft Feather felt very stressed.","Eventually, she sang, “Heyo~ You annoying... steamroller?”","Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia looked at Soft Feather sympathetically, turning their heads quietly.","The black-skinned Soft Feather: “...”","The sympathetic eyes of the two seniors dealt huge damage to the heart of the inner demon.","Sister White Dragon was bored, so she entered translator mode again and translated everything.","The divine dragon’s whiskers twitched.","“I see that you’ve already dealt with the Ten Heavenly Layers Realm. What you need to do now is to go for the Nascent Soul, the most troublesome soy milk maker... Ack! The most troublesome small realm.” The divine dragon accidentally had a slip of the tongue.","Sister White Dragon happily translated the divine dragon’s words verbatim.","It really made her happy to do this kind of work.","The Lotus Formation Realm was the most time-consuming small realm. There were some Sixth Stage True Monarchs with insufficient talent who would devote themselves to the grind for thousands of years and eventually die in this small realm.","In the history of the world of cultivation, there were numerous True Monarchs who stayed in this small realm for hundreds upon hundreds of years.","After the divine dragon finally returned to its senses, it continued solemnly, “Now, you only need to complete the last step of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique?. By doing this, you can shorten the time you need to spend in the Lotus Formation from at least a hundred years to fifty... or maybe even less!”","“Senior, please advise me.” Song Shuhang sat down obediently and humbly asked for advice.","“The last step is a bit peculiar.” The divine dragon paused for a while and said, “Do you understand what ‘love’ is?”","The reason the divine dragon asked this question was that human cultivators had some ancient sects that practice cultivation techniques that rendered the practitioner emotionless.","“Of course I know.” Song Shuhang nodded and said, “I am a normal man, after all.”","Fairy Creation’s eyes lit up. “What is filial piety?”","The virtuous lamia asked, “What is love?”","Song Shuhang did not even look back. His long hair turned into two palms, grabbed the two fairies, and hung them on the branches of his wooden body.","The black-skinned Soft Feather gestured with her hands and quickly retreated.","“It’s great if you understand what love is.” The divine dragon nodded and said, “During the last step, you need to use the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? to transmit your love to the pseudo-dragon-pearls in your body.”"]},{"number":2071,"title":"Chapter 2071 There are still six stronger bosses after this one","paragraphs":["2071 There are still six stronger bosses after this one","Song Shuhang asked probingly, “Love as in maternal love?”","Due to this being about getting pregnant and giving birth to a Nascent Soul, he immediately thought of maternal love.","It’s all the Scholarly Sage’s fault!","Besides the recent encounters with things related to the Scholarly Sage, the words of the two fairies caused him to think of maternal love.","In addition, would it not be much more convenient for him if it was about conveying “maternal love” to the pseudo-dragon-pearls inside his body?","He would just need to use the Scholarly Sage’s gaze.","“Why would a man like you know anything about maternal love?” the divine dragon said contemptuously.","Song Shuhang scratched his head and gave an awkward but polite smile.","Besides Senior White, who was spitting pips into another hole in the ground, Fairy Creation, the virtuous lamia, the black-skinned Soft Feather, Sixteen, and even the Almighty Merchant, all looked at Senior Divine Dragon after hearing Sister White Dragon’s translation.","Did I say something wrong? The divine dragon was confused.","“Other than conveying ‘love’ to the dragon pearls and following the steps of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique?, what else do I need to do?” Song Shuhang asked, giving Senior Divine Dragon a way out.","“After that, you can just let things take their course.” The divine dragon explained, “As I mentioned before, the creator of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? adapted it from another of his techniques, the ?Dragon Tiger Convergence Saber Heart Technique?, which combines the power of a dragon and a tiger. As long as you continue to convey love to the dragon pearls, and the level of your ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? is high enough, the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? will active on its own, merging the power of holy apes and dragons, conceiving a Nascent Soul Fetus.”","This process would greatly reduce the time needed for the Lotus Formation Realm.","After the Nascent Soul Fetus was formed, it was only necessary to take good care of it and avoid miscarriage. When the Nascent Soul was born, the step of “Lotus to Nascent Soul” that usually came after the Lotus Formation Realm could be omitted.","As long as the Nascent Soul Fetus was formed and raised properly, the gates that led to Seventh Stage Venerable Realm would swing wide open for the cultivator. This was, of course, on the premise that the Nascent Soul Fetus could be successfully conceived.","Sister White Dragon asked after translating, “Shuhang, are you confident?”","Although Song Shuhang’s understanding of maternal love was excellent, it could not be denied that he was still a rookie when it came to romantic love.","“I should be fine,” Song Shuhang said.","Sister White Dragon nodded and said, “Don’t put too much pressure on yourself. Experiment with Little Sixteen’s dragon pearl first as it’s more suited to your current level.”","Shuhang decided that he would try his best and see how things would go.","Senior White suddenly asked, “Apart from romantic love, can platonic or familial love also be used?”","The divine dragon nodded and said, “What is important is that it’s love. As for what kind of love it is, it doesn’t really matter.”","With these words, Song Shuhang felt a lot more at ease.","He clenched his fists and said, “I’m starting!”","Six dragon pearls were spinning above his head while the demodragon’s dragon pearl in his throat kept releasing dragon power, working in tandem with him.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “I wish Senior Song success and hope that you can give birth to seven children in one go.”","This was a sincere blessing from an inner demon.","“It’s not your fault that you’re pregnant~ It’s just that you haven’t figured out how to be a mother~” Fairy Creation, who was hanging on a branch of his, said tremblingly. The position she was in was not suitable for difficult tasks, so it was quite uncomfortable for her to sing in that position.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and patted his head. His consciousness entered the blood net formed by the Scholarly Sage’s blood, sneaking into his original dantian and moving forward.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","After returning to the first small dantian, Song Shuhang used his mental energy to scan his surroundings.","In the small dantian, the pseudo-dragon-pearl that corresponded to Sixteen was floating in the Spirit Lake.","The serrated-blades wheel had returned to its original place, and it was also floating inside the Spirit Lake while getting nourished from it.","At this time, the pseudo-dragon-pearl that corresponded to Sixteen had stuffed itself right in the center of the serrated-blades wheel.","This particular wheel was formed from eight large connected serrated hilts, and the hole in the middle was just big enough for the dragon pearl to fit in.","It had become one with the entire Spirit Lake.","“I cannot use the Impregnating Gaze,” Song Shuhang muttered to himself. This was not the time to play around as he could not afford to make mistakes.","After all, this was a very serious matter related to whether or not he could give birth to a Nascent Soul!","Therefore, this time, he would follow the standard procedure and do his best to follow Senior Divine Dragon’s instructions.","Song Shuhang began to silently recite the chant of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? to activate the secret technique. At the same time, he approached the pseudo-dragon-pearl that corresponded to Sixteen.","The next step was to convey his love to the dragon pearl.","The question was, how should he convey his love? After all, love was not some physical object that could just be given to others.","His only choice was to convey it verbally while using his mental energy.","Song Shuhang’s mental energy approached the dragon pearl as he prepared his speech.","In his mind, many plans to express his love formed.","However, when the time came to implement these plans, he found that it wasn’t so simple to achieve his objective.","His mental energy stopped right beside the dragon pearl, becoming motionless.","After a long while, Song Shuhang took a deep breath.","Focus... There are another six dragon pearls after this one!","I shouldn’t overthink things during times like these. I need to bring out the same courage I have when confronting big shots.","As he thought of this, his mental energy came into contact with the dragon pearl.","Dragon Pearl No. 1, this is my love. Accept it!","“Ding~”","A chime-like sound rang out in Song Shuhang’s consciousness.","When his mental energy came into contact with the pseudo-dragon-pearl, the scene in front of him changed.","This has already happened in the past, so Song Shuhang was very calm. Next, the pseudo-dragon-pearl should take on Sixteen’s appearance in his spiritual world.","Just as he expected, the dragon pearl’s activation led to a manifestation of his spiritual world.","He found himself inside an ordinary classroom with old desks and chairs.","Song Shuhang was sitting by the window, the hot sun shining on his face.","The wind blew through the window, bringing a hint of coolness amidst this scorching-hot summer day.","Song Shuhang turned his head, and in the seat across the aisle he saw Sixteen.","Her small face was resting in her arms as she looked at Song Shuhang sideways.","The wind blew, and her jet-black hair fluttered.","Her beautiful eyes were looking at Song Shuhang without blinking.","“You’ve finally looked my way,” Sixteen said softly.","“Haha, yeah.” Song Shuhang nodded.","Sixteen turned around, most of her face covered by her arm. “Is there anything you want to give me?”","Song Shuhang nodded again and said firmly, “It’s love. I want to convey my love to you.”","“Convey it to me? To Sixteen?” Sixteen’s eyes flashed with a craft light.","Song Shuhang was confused.","In the next moment, all the students in the classroom turned around and looked at him.","Everyone had become Sixteen."]},{"number":2072,"title":"Chapter 2072 Biased Shuhang","paragraphs":["2072 Biased Shuhang","So... So pretty!","When an entire classroom filled with Sixteens looked at him with bright smiles, Song Shuhang felt as if the sunlight shining upon him was getting brighter and brighter.","As a result, his body temperature rose slightly.","“Shuhang,” the Sixteen that was sitting at the table right next to him smiled and said, “to which Sixteen do you want to convey your love?”","!!","Song Shuhang looked at the Sixteens in the room, speechless.","Does this mean that I can only choose one Sixteen from this classroom full of Sixteens?","I’ve fallen into a trap!","Sure enough, conveying love is not as easy a task as I thought. If you want to successfully condense a Nascent Soul Fetus, it is impossible to do so by relying on your words alone.","And I’ll have to face a similar test six more times!","If I don’t come up with something, I might fail the next six tests.","I’ve gone through so much trouble to get here... Am I really going to fall short during the final stretch?","Is this to force me to use my trump card?","Speaking of trump cards...","He came up with a bold idea.","The six upcoming tests were no joke, and if he used such a primitive method to convey his love, he might end up failing.","Thus, he had to change his plans.","Shuhang suddenly thought of infusing his love into the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? and conveying it that way.","This was like cutting the Gordian knot, and since the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? was ultimately a saber technique, it should be enough to do the job.","?????","“Have you made your decision, Shuhang?” The Sixteen from before continued to put pressure on him.","The Sixteen sitting in the front row turned around. She propped up her chin with both of her hands and looked at Song Shuhang without blinking. “Which Sixteen are you going to choose?”","This Sixteen is so cute.","Song Shuhang felt someone poking him in the back.","When he turned his head, he saw another Sixteen who was poking him with her fingers. When she saw him turn his head, this Sixteen hurriedly looked the other way, quietly sneaking glances at him from the corner of her eye.","This one is also very cute.","“Every one of us is the real Sixteen.” Even on the podium was a Sixteen, this one wearing glasses. Sixteen briefly worked as an art teacher at Jiangnan University, and this Sixteen was dressed exactly the same as her back then.","This one’s very good as well.","“Actually, this isn’t that bad,” Song Shuhang replied in a mysterious manner. In fact, he did not really know what he meant by what he said, but this kind of vague answer was in line with his current mood.","“Huh?” The Sixteen that was putting pressure on him narrowed her eyes.","Song Shuhang replied, “A classroom full of Sixteens is pretty good.”","Since all of them were Sixteen, it meant that he did not really have to choose.","“I thought that you would be frightened,” she replied.","“It looks like you’re ready,” Teacher Sixteen looked at Song Shuhang and said. “Then, do you have the ability to convey your love to all of us?”","Teacher Sixteen emphasized the word “all”.","Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback. “Are you saying that there are more Sixteens than the ones in this classroom?”","The Sixteen that was putting pressure on him said, “How about you take a guess?”","It can’t be that the entire school is filled with Sixteens, right?","Is the difficulty of my task going to rise even further?","The Sixteen in the front row leaned toward him and said, “Since you’ve already made your decision, shall we head to the next part? After all, love can’t be conveyed by words alone.”","After saying that, she held her cheeks with both hands and raised her head slightly. She then closed her eyes, her long eyelashes fluttering slightly because of her bashfulness.","“Love requires action,” the Sixteen that was putting pressure on him said with a half smile.","Song Shuhang looked at the Sixteen in the front row, gazing at her long eyelashes, nose, and slightly upturned lips.","She was asking for a kiss, something they had yet to do in the real world.","“You can practice in this illusory world first,” said the Sixteen that was putting pressure on him.","“Moreover, there are so many Sixteens here for you to practice with.”","“There are even more Sixteens outside if you feel that the ones here aren’t enough.”","“Have you decided yet?”","The Sixteen in the front row blushed slightly, but she continued to keep her eyes closed and did not move away.","Song Shuhang leaned forward slightly, stretching out his hand and gently cupping her cheek.","Her skin felt so delicate that he was afraid to hurt her. As he brought his hand to her face, he could feel the warmth of her breath spewing onto his wrist.","When he was holding her face, he could sense her nervousness.","Everything was so real that he began doubting whether this was really an illusory spiritual world.","“I choose to cut the Gordian knot with a slash of the saber.” Song Shuhang’s face showed the bright smile of a single man.","His left and right hands lightly stroked the face of the cute Sixteen in the front seat.","The ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? x2, which was filled with all the love in his heart, fell on this nervous-looking Sixteen.","From the looks of it, love could maximize the effect of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","“Ehhhh?!” The nervous-looking Sixteen opened her eyes, her long eyelashes trembling.","And then, she lay weakly on Song Shuhang’s table, burying her face in her arms and letting out a soft whimper.","“Sometimes, the first time is especially important.” Song Shuhang retracted his palms, satisfied. “Therefore, I want to experience my first time in the real world.”","“You are really biased. The Sixteen in the real world is too shy. She can’t compare to us.” The Sixteen putting pressure on him buried half of her face back in her arms and only revealed her eyes, which held a hint of dissatisfaction.","“I’m not being biased.” Song Shuhang used the hair-growing technique together with Cheng Lin’s Self-Healing Technique to grow his hair to a length of five meters, which was then divided into 20 small hands.","Every small hand shone with the brilliance of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","“Biased,” said again Sixteen.","The ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? fell on all the Sixteens in the classroom.","Every instance of the technique contained Song Shuhang’s love.","When he stopped to think about it, Shuhang realized that the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? was tailor-made for the last portion of the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique?.","One helped to convey one’s love, and the other was in need of love.","It was simply a match made in heaven.","In the blink of an eye, all the Sixteens in the classroom, except the Sixteen putting pressure on him, were affected by Song Shuhang.","The Sixteen putting pressure on him stared at him with her eyes wide open. “You’re still saying that you aren’t biased?”","“Yep, of course I’m not biased,” Song Shuhang said cheerfully. “You’re all Sixteen, so there is no difference. No matter who I am biased towards, I am biased toward Su Clan’s Sixteen. There is nothing wrong with this logic.”","“Shuhang, you really have thick skin.” The Sixteen putting pressure on him burst out laughing.","“That’s a given. The ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, ?Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha?, and ?Variant Steel Hands Technique? have thickened my skin quite a bit.” Song Shuhang reached out and stroked the head of the pouty Sixteen.","The light of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? shone again."]},{"number":2073,"title":"Chapter 2073 Simple and crude, no more wasting time!","paragraphs":["2073 Simple and crude, no more wasting time!","With that, it’s over, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He had used the Saber-Nurturing Technique on all the Sixteens in the classroom, making sure that each instance of the technique was filled with enough love.","He also confirmed that there was no other space outside the classroom, and thus no more Sixteens.","“It’s done.” Song Shuhang said softly.","“So, the next step is to get a Nascent Soul Fetus, right?” said the Sixteen who was seated right next to him.","Song Shuhang caressed her head lightly and said, “Yes, as long as one gives the dragon pearl enough love and the conditions are met, the Nascent Soul Fetus will naturally take shape in the next step.”","Touching Sixteen’s head felt really good. In fact, Song Shuhang had always wanted to pet her head in the real world, but as he was afraid of hurting Sixteen’s self-esteem, he never did it.","“If you want a Nascent Soul Fetus, then I have something I want to give you.” The Sixteen in the seat next to him stretched out her hand and presented something to Song Shuhang.","Afterward, she buried her head in her other arm, refusing to look up.","There was a small strawberry in her palm.","What is this?","It has the appearance of a small strawberry and even smells like one, but it doesn’t look like a fruit and seems like a candy instead...","“A gift for you,” Sixteen said. “It’s delicious, strawberry flavored.”","Song Shuhang took the strawberry candy, which also carried the slight scent of Sixteen’s palm. “Thank you.”","He threw the candy into his mouth and savored it.","Song Shuhang said, “Hmm? It smells like a strawberry but tastes like an apple.”","It is quite delicious, though.","“It’s a contraceptive pill,” said Sixteen as she retracted her small hand.","Song Shuhang was stunned. “Huh?”","“It’s a birth control pill,” repeated Sixteen.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Why are you feeding a man a birth control pill?","Is it because I’m pregnant with a Nascent Soul Fetus? But isn’t that different from actual pregnancy?","Song Shuhang felt very confused.","“Are you afraid?” Sixteen turned her head around and grinned.","Song Shuhang: “...”","She waved her hand and said, “I’m just joking with you. Don’t worry.”","In the meantime, the entire classroom began to dissipate.","Sixteen said, “See you next time, Shuhang.”","All the other Sixteens began to dissipate as well.","However, there was no sadness in their parting as they were going to see each other again soon.","Although he was a little unsettled, this was overall a good thing for Song Shuhang. This meant that the love he had instilled in Sixteen’s pseudo-dragon-pearl was enough.","Next, he just had to operate the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique?, and he would be able to naturally produce a Nascent Soul Fetus.","Next, it’s time to witness a miracle!","I wonder how something like a Nascent Soul Fetus is born...","Song Shuhang was rather curious.","Due to all the different things he had seen on the Internet, Song Shuhang had always associated the golden core with kidney stones and the nascent soul with pregnancy despite them being very cool things.","It was only after he officially started cultivating and understood how the Sixth Stage worked that Song Shuhang’s mental image of the Nascent Soul changed.","Yet, he was going to give birth to a Nascent Soul through pregnancy today. He felt that his mental image of the Nascent Soul was going to collapse yet again.","“Forget it. If it collapses, then so be it.”","He was Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, and Tyrannical Dragon, and his mind could not be bothered by such a trivial matter.","It was fine as long as the Nascent Soul was born, even if he had to go through an experience similar to pregnancy. After all, it wasn’t like he hadn’t experienced it before.","Advancing was much more important than these mental images.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Inside the first small dantian, Sixteen’s pseudo-dragon-pearl stayed at the center of the serrated-blades wheel.","Song Shuhang began to operate the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and the ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? as instructed by the divine dragon.","A new Holy Ape emerged from Song Shuhang’s body, and Sixteen’s dragon pearl began to cooperate with him.","Thirty-three magical treasures appeared beside the serrated-blades wheel.","These were not actual magical treasures, but merely the projections of his life-bound magical treasure.","The pieces of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure moved next to the serrated-blades wheel and Sixteen’s pseudo-dragon-pearl, starting to fuse with them.","About ten breaths of time later, the Impregnable Holy City appeared in front of Song Shuhang, firmly protecting the serrated-blades wheel and the pseudo-dragon-pearl. As always, Song Shuhang’s figure was placed outside the gate of the Impregnable Holy City...","Suddenly, a powerful suction force came from inside the Holy City.","The water in the Spirit Lake was gathered and sucked into the Impregnable Holy City.","In the blink of an eye, the Spirit Lake was emptied.","It had to be noted that this was a Spirit Lake with its Tenth Heavenly Layer breached. In other words, for a brief period of time, it could unleash a power comparable to that of a Seventh Stage Venerable. Despite that, it was drained in just a few breaths.","If an ordinary cultivator were to have all the energy in their body drained, they would only be able to recover by taking medicinal pills, meditating, or practicing.","However, Song Shuhang had the support of his original dantian, other small dantians, and ghost spirit.","The energy from his original dantian and the other six dantians was mobilized. In the blink of an eye, the depleted Spirit Lake of the first dantian was restored to its original state.","One more time, a powerful suction force came from the Impregnable Holy City, absorbing all the water in the Spirit Lake.","This repeated seven times in total.","“Am I fated with the number seven?”","After the seventh time, Sixteen’s pseudo-dragon-pearl no longer absorbed the energy of the Spirit Lake. The Impregnable Holy City projection tightly wrapped around it like a cocoon.","The Spirit Lake’s Lake Soul—also known as the Golden Core Composition [The Forever Impregnable Holy City] and its inverse, [After the Collapse of the Holy City, the All-Destroying Giant]—followed the energy of the Spirit Lake and fused with the pseudo-dragon-pearl.","Song Shuhang’s mental energy peered into the projection of the Holy City.","The seven sets of spirit lake water wrapped around the pseudo-dragon-pearl while the energy of the Lake Soul fused with it.","This scene reminds me a bit of pregnancy.","Anyway, it seems that this process is going to take quite a while...","Song Shuhang felt that waiting for the process to finish was a waste of time. “Before this Nascent Soul Fetus takes shape, I should start on the remaining six dragon pearls.”","He could not afford to waste so much time on the other six dragon pearls, so he would deal with them in one go.","Song Shuhang’s consciousness entered the second dantian.","The pseudo-dragon-pearl born from Senior White’s mirage dragon pearl was in the center of the life wheel composed of broadswords.","“I’m here. Accept my love.”","This time, Song Shuhang did not use his mental energy to wrap the mirage dragon’s dragon pearl. Instead, he simply and crudely used the love-filled ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? on the dragon pearl."]},{"number":2074,"title":"Chapter 2074 Demon Emperor Hezhi’s scheme","paragraphs":["2074 Demon Emperor Hezhi’s scheme","Let’s cut through the Gordian knot with a saber!","Moreover, by using the technique on the main body of the pseudo-dragon-pearl, he could skip the spiritual world segment, and so he would not have to go through a plot like the classroom full of Sixteens.","It was simple and crude, but very effective.","Song Shuhang’s love was gathered and poured into the mirage dragon’s pearl through the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","!!","After the pseudo-dragon-pearl got a taste of the technique, its body shone slightly.","It seemed to work!","However, it was nowhere near enough.","Sure enough, it’s going to take more than a single usage of the technique, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Shuhang put his left and right hands together, alternating them in casting the technique.","In the second dantian’s Spirit lake, love-filled rays of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? flashed nonstop.","After using the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? nearly thirty times, the mirage dragon’s pseudo-dragon-pearl was finally activated.","At the same time, thirty-three magical treasures appeared. This time, it was a projection of the second set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure. Similar to what had taken place in the previous dantian, it began to gather beside the pseudo-dragon-pearl and eventually turned into the Holy Sword of the End.","The sword acted like a shell.","The Lake Soul, [The World-Ending Holy Sword], floated up and branded itself onto the pseudo-dragon-pearl, causing the pearl to evolve.","Now, the final step, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","A powerful suction force came from the Holy Sword of the End, sucking up all the spirit lake water below.","At this time, the water in the second Spirit Lake was around one-tenth of its normal value.","When the first Spirit Lake was condensing a Nascent Soul Fetus earlier, it sucked water from the other Spirit Lakes a total of seven times, draining all of their energy.","Now, even if the energy in the other Spirit Lakes and the Original Spirit Lake were to be combined, the second dantian would, at most, only be able to suck their water once.","However, Song Shuhang decided not to proceed. The energy in the other Spirit Lakes was needed to maintain the normal operations of his body, as well as to speed up the recovery of his spiritual energy.","Moreover, he had another reserve of energy that was equivalent to a Spirit Lake.","As he willed it, pure spiritual energy poured out from the ghost spirit hidden deep inside his body into his second Spirit Lake.","Ghost spirits were like huge cheats for cultivators. They automatically purified the spiritual energy inside a cultivator’s body, increased the rate of recovery, and the spiritual energy that they stored could be used during critical times.","As the spiritual energy of the ghost spirit came pouring in, the water in the second dantian’s Spirit Lake swiftly filled up.","At this time, even the ghost spirit only had 10% of its spiritual energy left.","Song Shuhang said, “Almost there.”","“Fwoo~”","The water in the overflowing second Spirit Lake was all drawn into the Holy Sword of the End, nourishing the pseudo-dragon-pearl and creating a second Nascent Soul Fetus.","At the same time that this happened, a feeling of emptiness resurfaced in Song Shuhang’s body.","Ever since he had gotten his seven small dantians, this was the first time that he had been drained of energy so thoroughly, to the point that even his ghost spirit’s energy was depleted.","Next, I’ll need to enter a state of meditation to recover my spiritual energy, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Under normal circumstances, for something like recovering spiritual energy, it was fine if he just slept and relied on his ghost spirit to do all the work.","However, he had used too much energy today, so he decided to join his ghost spirit in recovering spiritual energy.","?????","And so, Song Shuhang sat cross-legged and started meditating. After adjusting his state, he began circulating the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?.","The virtuous lamia took out some pills for spiritual energy recovery from Song Shuhang’s magical bracelet. Fairy Creation opened Song Shuhang’s mouth, and the virtuous lamia threw the pills into his mouth.","Most of these medicinal pills were of the Fifth Stage and some of the Sixth Stage, and they were part of Song Shuhang’s loot.","For Song Shuhang, the amount of spiritual energy that these medicinal pills could restore was already quite small, but it was still better than nothing.","In the meantime, the black-skinned Soft Feather pulled out several spirit stones from the corners of Song Shuhang’s magical bracelet.","Back when the scholarly faction had given Song Shuhang spirit stones, most of them were transferred to the Inner World, waiting to be used to pay off his debts. Only a few were stuffed into his magic bracelet due to their poor quality.","The black-skinned Soft Feather rummaged through the spirit stones. Afterward, she grabbed them and pressed them against Song Shuhang’s face.","Normally, she would have placed these spirit stones in Song Shuhang’s hands so that he could practice while extracting their energy in order to speed up the recovery of his own spiritual energy. But as Song Shuhang only had his head left, the black-skinned Soft Feather could only stick the spirit stones to his face, hoping that Song Shuhang could absorb their energy while practicing.","The divine dragon said, “It seems that his energy has been depleted. How many dragon pearls has he handled already?”","“Just one.” Sixteen and Sister White Dragon had already switched their half-bodies. Sixteen replied with her face buried in her knees.","Sister White Dragon petted her head lightly.","The divine dragon said, “If he has to meditate every time he deals with a dragon pearl, then he’s going to be taking quite a while to be done with everything.”","Senior White thought for a while and took out a bottle of Seventh Stage medicinal pills, throwing it at the virtuous lamia. Song Shuhang had already reached the Tenth Heavenly Layer, also known as the Super VIP Sixth Stage Realm, so it was much better for him to use the same medicinal pills that Seventh Stage Venerables used.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Shuhang’s spiritual energy is recovering relatively fast.”","With the help of his ghost spirit, Sage Seals, light of virtue, Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, and seven small dantians, the speed at which he recovered spiritual energy was actually extraordinary.","Sister White Dragon said, “However, his storage capacity is also much larger than that of normal cultivators of the same realm.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Are there ways to quickly restore Senior Song’s spiritual energy?”","Senior White said, “There will be negative consequences, so it’s better to not use them.”","?????","Back in the main world, in the Infernal Realm.","In a certain corner of this world of demonic cultivators, a new calamitous forbidden area appeared not too long ago.","All the creatures that stepped into this forbidden area were turned into dry corpses, and their body and soul were completely obliterated.","This kind of thing was normal in the Infernal Realm.","The living environment here has been extremely bad ever since ancient times. Every part of this small world was an active volcano that could erupt and become a forbidden area at any moment.","Deep inside this new forbidden area, demonic god pillars made of stone had emerged one after the other, appearing to be arranged in the pattern of a large formation.","There was a tall figure covered in blood inside the formation who slowly opened his eyes.","This was a being who used to rule over demons and was recorded in some ancient books of the demonic cultivation forces—Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Beside this tall figure, there was a clone, who said calmly, “The energy accumulated in this body has already reached the peak of the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm. It’s almost there.”","Ancient Sage Tyrannical Dragon, it’s time for you to pay the price.","There was a hideous look on the face of the clone.","[Beep~ Do you want to transfer all your energy to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song? Y/N.]","[Yes! This is my will, and I transfer it all to him.]","Explode and die, Tyrannical Song!"]},{"number":2075,"title":"Chapter 2075 From drained to overflowing","paragraphs":["2075 From drained to overflowing","Making Profound Sage Tyrannical Song overflow with energy until he exploded was the only option that Demon Emperor Hezhi could resort to at the moment as it was unknown how long it would take for his main body to recover.","When Profound Sage Tyrannical Song attacked him with that karmic magical treasure, the blow he suffered was devastating. He was going to need several hundred years to return to his previous state.","However, Demon Emperor Hezhi didn’t want to wait so long for his revenge.","As the Great Emperor of the Demon Sect, he had always been particular about taking revenge whenever he was wronged.","!!","The desire for revenge was burning in his heart, tormenting him day and night.","Every day, he pondered how he could take revenge on Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","That was until he discovered the “blacklist”, a function that allowed him to communicate with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","He began to study this blacklist, and he discovered that, through this ability, he could transmit energy to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","There would be a certain amount of consumption along the way, and the longer the distance, the greater the consumption.","However, Demon Emperor Hezhi had already worked out a plan to minimize the consumption during the transmission. While transmitting energy, he would hide one of his demonic god pillars near Profound Sage Tyrannical Song by manipulating space. The demonic god pillar would then act as a clone and help transfer the energy, allowing him to reduce the consumption by 20 or 30%.","With this method, the peak Tribulation Transcender-level energy that he transferred over would not be cut down by too much. Even if 20-30% of it was lost, the overall amount was massive.","As for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, he had investigated him carefully. He was the first Sage in a thousand years, someone who had become a Profound Sage this year.","Hezhi was the Demon Emperor, and even if he was hiding inside a forbidden area, he had numerous means to acquire the information he wanted.","If a newly-ascended Profound Sage were to receive the energy of someone at the peak of the Tribulation Transcender Realm, their fate would be sealed.","Turn into a magnificent display of bloody fireworks, Tyrannical Song!","Die! Die! Die!","?????","Back at Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds, in the Golden Moon World.","Song Shuhang maintained a state of deep meditation, still working hard to recover his spiritual energy.","The black-skinned Soft Feather was pressing spirit stones against his face while Fairy Creation continued to keep Song Shuhang’s mouth open. As for the virtuous lamia, she floated up and threw a Seventh Stage medicinal pill into his mouth.","“Speaking of which, do medicinal pills have any effect on Shuhang right now?” Sister White Dragon asked.","When he swallowed the dragon pearl, it got stuck in his neck, right?","“Who knows...” mused the divine dragon.","Then, it suddenly raised its head and looked toward the sky.","In the sky above the Golden Moon World, a demonic god pillar broke through the spatial lock and forced its way into this world.","God damn it, it’s still not over? The divine dragon bit its claws hatefully.","Do you guys really see our Garre Holy Mountain’s locked space as your personal backyard, coming and going as you please?","Song Shuhang, who was circulating the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? to refine his spiritual energy, shook violently.","[Beep~ “Blacklisted” Demon Emperor Hezhi wants to transfer 9999999+ points of spiritual energy to you. Due to the amount of spiritual energy being too large, you are given the choice to accept or deny the transfer. Do you accept the transfer? Y/N.]","A prompt appeared in Song Shuhang’s mind.","In the past, whether it was the Heavenly Emperor, Fairy Cheng Lin, or any of the other big shots, when they sent energy to Song Shuhang, it was only in small quantities. Besides that, the only other times he received energy remotely from a big shot was when he took the initiative to ask for help.","Because of that, this particular option that gave him the choice to accept or decline the transfer had never appeared.","In addition, the amount of energy that Demon Emperor Hezhi wanted to send over was huge, enough to make Song Shuhang explode instantly. It was another reason this option was activated.","It appeared that, at times, the QR code Golden Core Composition favored its owner.","When Song Shuhang received this message, he was bewildered.","What, Demon Emperor Hezhi wants to transmit me some energy?","And he’s sending such a large quantity of energy that the amount can’t even be displayed properly...","Does the Demon Emperor know that I’m lacking energy? Is that why he’s sending me some? This thought flashed in Song Shuhang’s mind.","But soon, he shook his head.","I have to be more self-aware.","Having self-awareness was a very important quality.","Shuhang was not Senior White, and he did not possess his charm. Moreover, Demon Emperor Hezhi wanted him dead, so how could he send him energy with the intention of helping him during this critical moment?","There must be another reason behind his actions.","Then... Should I reject it?","Song Shuhang murmured, “It’s probably better for me to reject the offer. It feels unsafe to accept something from him.”","He was at a critical stage in his cultivation, and he could not afford any accidents.","Leveling up was very serious business!","[Beep~ “Blacklisted” Fairy Cheng Lin has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Don’t reject the transfer. Try to see if you can receive the spiritual energy in batches. If you can’t, it’s also fine to just take it all in one go. You can send the energy that you aren’t able to absorb to your ghost spirit. I’ll deal with it for you!]","Fairy Cheng Lin had been constantly paying attention to Song Shuhang today.","With the powerful Jade Lake Empress having his back, Song Shuhang felt much more confident.","Then, I’ll accept it.","He used his consciousness to send instructions to the QR code Golden Core. He wanted to see if he could divide the vast amount of energy into 42 batches and absorb them separately as Fairy Cheng Lin had suggested.","Perhaps it was because Song Shuhang had now become a Super VIP Sixth Stage cultivator equivalent to a Venerable Realm-level character, which caused his authority to rise, but the QR code Golden Core accepted his instructions.","[Beep~ Attempting to divide the 9999999+ points of spiritual energy being transferred by Demon Emperor Hezhi into batches.]","[Beep~ Attempt failed.]","It seems like there’s nothing else I can do.","Song Shuhang sighed. “Fairy Cheng Lin, I’ll leave the rest to you!”","Then, he chose “Yes.”","[Beep~ You permitted the transfer of 9999999+ points of spiritual energy from Demon Emperor Hezhi. The transfer will now begin.]","In the next moment, a huge amount of energy passed through the demonic god pillar in the air and descended on Song Shuhang’s body.","All of those who were currently in the trial area looked up at the sky.","They all felt a sensation similar to when the heavenly tribulation descended, which made their bodies tremble.","The Almighty Merchant, who was in midair, frowned. He readied himself to protect Song Shuhang’s head if anything were to happen. After all, the dragon pearl that was worth half of his payment was still inside his body.","Below, the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation also frowned. The two fairies stopped playing around and became serious.","The virtuous lamia entered her guardian mode and enveloped Song Shuhang’s body, joining her palms as if she was praying.","Fairy Creation returned to Song Shuhang’s head, strengthening him from within.","They formed two filters to keep in check Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang’s consciousness quickly entered his second dantian’s Spirit Lake.","As the energy transmission began, the dantian, which was nearly drained, was instantly refilled.","The original dantian and the fat whale golden core worked with all their might to convert the energy being transmitted to Song Shuhang into spiritual energy. After doing that, they transferred the spiritual energy to his seven small dantians.","In the blink of an eye, the Spirit Lakes of the seven small dantians were filled to the brim and even began to overflow with water.","The excess energy was quickly transferred to Shuhang’s ghost spirit, and a portion went to the wooden body as well.","Going from exhausted to full of energy made Song Shuhang feel refreshed.","Once his body was full of spiritual energy, the second dantian’s Spirit Lake began to operate again, and the water-sucking process started anew.","The water in the second dantian was swiftly drained, and then quickly refilled as Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy kept pouring in.","Soon, the second small dantian was drained and refilled a total of seven times, until a Nascent Soul Fetus was born.","Song Shuhang did not have time to care for the Nascent Soul Fetus.","He hastily moved on to the third dantian as Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy was still pouring in.","By taking advantage of this opportunity, he wanted to be done with the remaining five pseudo-dragon-pearls."]},{"number":2076,"title":"Chapter 2076 Cultivation","paragraphs":["2076 Cultivation","Hurry up, hurry up!","Song Shuhang pushed himself to the limit.","This was because he could sense a familiar feeling, the feeling of death.","Song Shuhang felt that if he did not hurry, his head would explode.","Although Fairy Cheng Lin had given him her guarantee, he could feel the shadow of death coming closer and closer. It was as if there was a howling beast chasing after him, wanting to devour him.","As such, Shuhang gave his all.","Faster, faster!","As long as I run fast enough, even death can’t catch me!","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","In the outside world.","“Ptui~ Ptui~ Ptui~” Senior White said, “The second one has also been dealt with.”","He could sense that the mirage dragon’s dragon pearl had completed its mission. It had suspended the transmission of dragon power, and its corresponding pseudo-dragon-pearl had formed a Nascent Soul Fetus.","Sixteen’s interest was piqued. Her little face, which was buried in her knees, turned slightly, revealing one of her eyes. She looked at Senior White cautiously and expectantly.","However, she saw that Senior White’s face was calm and showed no signs of being affected.","Sixteen could not help but have some doubts in her heart.","Senior White is really different...","“Ground Leveling Spell.” Senior White had finished eating the plum-sized fruits. He stretched out his hand and made a hand seal, using the Ground Leveling Spell to flatten the hole in which he had spat the piths of the fruits.","Then, he looked at the demonic god pillar in the air and frowned slightly.","Spiritual energy was transmitted from the demonic god pillar nonstop, pouring into Shuhang’s body and providing him energy for his advancement.","It was also with the support of this spiritual energy that Song Shuhang could continue to advance.","However, this energy did not belong to Song Shuhang in the end.","Although it was repeatedly filtered until it could be considered “pure energy”, there would inevitably be some side effects.","Sister White Dragon’s gentle voice sounded. “Fellow Daoist White, are you worried as well?”","Senior White nodded.","The divine dragon said with a solemn expression, “He’s using so much external energy to advance. I’m afraid that the side effects won’t be small.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather was taken aback. “Side effects?”","Sixteen was also worried.","Senior White nodded again. “Under normal circumstances, after external energy is transferred over, as long as you refine it little by little and circulate it in your system a few times, you can make it yours. However, with the current situation being too urgent and everything moving too quickly, Shuhang does not have the time to refine this external energy. He’s merely filtering it before using it.”","Sixteen asked with a hushed voice, “Senior White... Is there any solution?”","Senior White said, “I’m not sure. I’ll have to see what happens to Song Shuhang in a while before considering how to help him.”","“Actually, there’s no need to worry too much,” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword said. “If the aftereffects are really that bad, just let him die. Death cures everything.”","As expected of an inner demon, it could only come up with vicious solutions.","The black-skinned Soft Feather looked at the black Scarlet Heaven Sword and said, “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, you’re too cruel.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, its heart stifled, “As a fellow inner demon, why are you so disappointing?”","Senior White pinched his chin and said calmly, “Indeed, if the price to treat him gets too high for it to be acceptable, we can consider letting him die once.”","The divine dragon, who was listening to the calm exchange, could not help but break out in a cold sweat.","“Eh?” At this moment, Senior White’s body shook, just as if he had been hit by something.","Sixteen immediately stared at Senior White, secretly observing his state.","Senior White stretched out his hand and swiped in the air. “I seem to have gained more abilities, or should I say authority?”","He was referring to Song Shuhang’s QR code Golden Core Composition.","After Song Shuhang condensed the second Nascent Soul Fetus, the friend function improved, gaining some new abilities.","As Senior White had been the one to provide the second dragon pearl, he had obtained some special authority.","For example, he now had a QR code of his own. He could add friends and pull people into the QR code friend list.","He could add people in Song Shuhang’s stead, and it felt as if he had gotten the authority of an administrator.","In addition, Senior White discovered that he could see a list in which were all of Song Shuhang’s QR code friends.","Interesting.","Senior White had discovered something new and found it to be both interesting and fun.","I wonder if there is an option that allows me to choose the name. After all, this is a friend group, so it should have a name, Senior White thought to himself.","When this thought flashed through his mind, a prompt box appeared in front of him.","[Beep~ Do you want to choose a name for Tyrannical Song’s QR Code Golden Core Friend Group? Y/N.]","“Yes,” Senior White said.","Then, a blank frame appeared in front of him.","After thinking about it for a short while, Senior White thought of stealing the name “Nine Provinces Number One Group.”","However, he soon shook his head.","This group isn’t a group created by Yellow Mountain, so it’s better if I choose a new name.","Actually, it’s better if little friend Shuhang chooses the name, mused Senior White.","After thinking for some time, Senior White entered a few more names in the box that Shuhang could use as reference.","Nine Provinces Number One Group, Meditation Group, Fellow Daoists Exchange Group.","Senior White said, “It really isn’t as easy as I initially thought.”","Finally, he added the word “Cultivation.”","Hmm, this one isn’t bad.","Simple and concise.","As for the rest, I’ll talk to Shuhang about it after he finishes condensing his Nascent Soul Fetuses.","Senior White slightly stretched out his hand and saved these group names for now.","“The... The third one. It... It’s done. Shuhang, he’s pushing forward with ease.” At this moment, Sister White Dragon curled up into a ball, seemingly feeling very cold as she trembled.","Song Shuhang’s third pseudo-dragon-pearl corresponded to Sister White Dragon.","Sixteen sniffed. She glanced at Sister White Dragon and looked back at Senior White, who was in high spirits.","Sure enough, Senior White is just too special.","But...","It’s precisely because Senior White is so special that he can be so reliable, especially when it comes to big events.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Inside the world of the black lotus","The demonic hamster, the orangutan, the mirage dragon leader, and the monster tree with a beautiful human face—all four of Senior White Two’s pets—were gathered together at this moment.","“Are you still not done?” No Hamster looked at the mirage dragon leader.","Senior White Two’s pets were playing cards together when all of a sudden, the mirage dragon leader began trembling nonstop. At the same time, it let out screams that could make even a hamster blush.","Now, the mirage dragon was curled up into a ball. It was hiding its head inside the ball, refusing to come out.","No Hamster felt very tired."]},{"number":2077,"title":"Chapter 2077 Chat","paragraphs":["2077 Chat","At this time, inside Song Shuhang’s body, his consciousness was rushing toward the fourth small dantian.","As long as I run fast enough, death can only eat dust!","“The pseudo-dragon-pearl in the fourth small dantian belongs to Senior White Two.” Song Shuhang rubbed its hands together, preparing to use the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? with both.","Every time he used the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?, the “love” that Song Shuhang infused into it was different. After all, he loved Sixteen, Senior White, and Sister White Dragon in different ways.","“Senior White Two, accept my love!” Song Shuhang’s consciousness shouted as he rushed into the fourth dantian.","“Scram!” Senior White Two’s angry voice sounded.","Song Shuhang’s spiritual body was sent flying out of the fourth small dantian, a bewildered expression on its face.","He sat at the entrance of the fourth dantian, scratching his head in confusion.","The two instances of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? fell on his own body as he was tumbling.","Hmm, this feeling is nothing too exaggerated. It’s similar to someone massaging your sore shoulders. That’s all.","So, is the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? actually a massage?","Anyway, that’s not what’s important here.","“There’s something wrong with this script!” Song Shuhang murmured.","Nothing of the sort happened before, whether it was the mirage dragon’s dragon pearl or Sister White Dragon’s dragon pearl.","After waiting for a while, Song Shuhang’s spiritual body carefully returned to his fourth small dantian.","This time, he did not shout out loud but entered quietly.","Above the Spirit Lake of the fourth small dantian, there was a wheel composed of overlapping spiraling swords.","The demodragon’s pseudo-dragon-pearl that Senior White Two had sent him was inside the ball-like wheel, quietly suspended above the Spirit Lake.","After seeing Song Shuhang come in again, the demodragon’s pseudo-dragon-pearl moved slightly. Like an eye, it turned to “look” at Song Shuhang.","Senior Divine Dragon must have been lying when it said that dragon pearls could not be replaced by eyeballs. Isn’t this demodragon pearl just an eyeball? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Song Shuhang greeted, “Hi, Senior White.”","As expected of the ruler of the Netherworld, he was truly different from the others.","Song Shuhang was almost certain of something now. This pearl did not belong to a demodragon. Instead, it should be something created by Senior White Two.","However, Senior White Two obviously wanted to keep this matter a secret.","Perhaps for Senior White Two, spitting out a dragon pearl was something very embarrassing.","Therefore, Song Shuhang was wise enough not to mention this matter.","Sometimes, keeping things secret even after discovering the truth would allow for friendships and relationships to remain strong.","“Hm? Even when you’re in the form of a spiritual body, your face is still as expressive as ever.” Senior White Two’s voice sounded, a hint of tiredness in his tone.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Then, the “face” of Song Shuhang’s spiritual body became blurred, just as if a holy knight had covered it with holy light.","Senior White Two’s heart felt even more stifled.","Can’t you change to a shadow priest?","After sighing, Senior White Two stopped wasting time and went straight to the point. “I see that you aren’t in great condition. Is someone forcibly transferring energy to your body?”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “It’s Demon Emperor Hezhi.”","Senior White Two wondered, “Why is he giving you energy?”","Song Shuhang said, “Senior White T— Emh, I don’t know exactly why. However, it just so happened that I was in urgent need of energy, so I agreed to this transfer.”","Senior White Two said, “You’re going to explode. The amount of energy is close to the peak of the Tribulation Transcender Realm.”","Song Shuhang gave him a thumbs up and said, “Don’t worry, Senior White. Fairy Cheng Lin is covering for me. When I’m about to explode, I can pour this energy into my ghost spirit to channel it over to her.”","“Did you not stop to think that if the rate at which you transferred the energy is too slow, you might still explode?” Senior White Two chuckled.","This was the energy of a peak Tribulation Transcender, and it was comparable to the water in a huge river, while the energy channel between Song Shuhang and his ghost spirit could only be regarded as a small stream.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior White Two said, “Forget it. In case your rate of transfer is too slow, grab the demodragon pearl that I gave you and divert some energy into it.”","Song Shuhang felt reassured now. “Thank you, Senior White.”","Senior White Two urged, “Also, don’t forget my stone tablet. Remember to take it before you leave Garre Holy Mountain.”","Song Shuhang said, “I will complete this task without a mistake.”","Senior White Two said, “Very well. Then, continue with what you were doing.”","“Umh...” Song Shuhang scratched his head.","His mission was not over yet.","Song Shuhang braced himself and said, “Senior White, I still need to pour ‘love’ into this demodragon pearl.”","“Don’t even think about doing that,” Senior White Two said. “As the ruler of the Netherworld, the ‘love’ as you understand it is very disgusting to me. I have my own means to handle the child-making process. Just go on to the next stop. Don’t make a mess of things here.”","Could it be that “love” is the same as holy light for a ruler of the Netherworld, and they have a negative opinion of it?","However, that can’t be right.","If love is to be viewed in reverse, then what’s the relationship between me and Senior White Two, and between him and his pets?","Is it hate?","Could it be that Senior White Two hates me deeply?","However, since Senior White Two said he did not need to do anything here, Song Shuhang did not pester him further.","As he began leaving the fourth small dantian, the ball-like wheel that was wrapped around Senior White Two’s pseudo-dragon-pearl started to draw the water of the Spirit Lake.","The lake water was drained seven times, and the pseudo-dragon-pearl got ready to conceive a nascent soul.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin. “Senior White really can do anything.”","When he was in the main world, he had been thinking that apart from having children, there seemed to be nothing that Senior White could not do. Now, it seemed that Senior White Two could even give birth to a child on his own!","“Ahhh!” Just as he was thinking, an invisible hand grabbed his body. It crumbled him into a ball and sent him rolling toward the fifth dantian.","In the fifth small dantian was the dragon pearl of Striped Dragon Two’s son.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","As Song Shuhang rolled away, Senior White Two said, “I forgot to ask him for a joke in return.”","He helped Song Shuhang deal with this matter, so he owed him one.","Next time, he had to make Shuhang pay him back with a joke.","Senior White Two’s mental fluctuations began to calm down.","Ever since he became the ruler of the Netherworld, no one had been able to chat with him normally like Song Shuhang.","“A normal chat...” Senior White Two could not help but think of the scenes in the desert with the white horse.","As Senior White Two was lost in his thoughts, in the real world, yellow sand began to rise beside Song Shuhang.","The black-skinned Soft Feather exclaimed, “Yellow sand... This is an illusory reality. Oh no, Senior White is distracted again!”","“No, it’s not my doing,” Senior White retorted.","Sixteen said, “It’s Shuhang.”","Beside Song Shuhang, yellow sand fluttered into the sky, forming the prototype of an illusory reality.","Senior White said, “No, it’s not Shuhang.”","Afterward, he slowly moved forward.","He could feel a very familiar feeling coming from this illusory reality.","It was the feeling of home."]},{"number":2078,"title":"Chapter 2078 Group","paragraphs":["2078 Group","Senior White reached out and touched the yellow sand.","In the next moment, his figure disappeared. He had been pulled into the illusory reality.","The black-skinned Soft Feather exclaimed, worried, “Senior White!”","Since this yellow sand was not part of Senior White’s or Senior Song’s illusory reality, wasn’t it dangerous to venture into it?","“I’ll go take a look,” said the black Scarlet Heaven Sword after thinking for a short while. It was also very interested in this yellow sand that had suddenly appeared.","With that said, it turned into a sword light and rushed toward the yellow sand.","Just as it was about to enter the range of the yellow sand, a big, golden hand grabbed it.","“Aahhh, hot hot hot! Fairy @#%×, don’t mess around! You’re a light of virtue, and I’m an inner demon. Direct contact with each other will only hurt us! Let go!” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword shouted. Its body was smoking where the virtuous lamia had touched it.","The virtuous lamia did not speak and quietly placed a mark on the black Scarlet Heaven Sword’s body. It was a mark from the special cultivation technique ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? that Song Shuhang had collected in the Throne of Wealth Distribution which allowed a divine weapon to be retrieved over long distances.","After leaving the mark on its body, the virtuous lamia quickly retracted her palm. With this mark, she could determine the coordinates of the black Scarlet Heaven Sword in case it got lost.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword increased its speed and dove into the yellow sand, disappearing like the others.","“How about I go in and take a look as well?” the black-skinned Soft Feather said softly. She felt that Senior White and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword were very unreliable.","But as soon as she said that, the yellow sand began to disappear.","The yellow sand fell to the ground. Then, despite being sand, it melted like snow, merging into the ground and disappearing without a trace.","The illusory reality was gone.","“Huh?” The black-skinned Soft Feather’s eyes widened.","She was surprised because Senior White and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword had not reappeared.","Reasonably speaking, if an illusory reality was dissolved, the people inside should reappear in their original places","“What’s going on?” Sister White Dragon approached Song Shuhang.","I didn’t sense any spatial fluctuations, so where did Sage White and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword disappear?","Sixteen asked in puzzlement, “Does Garre Holy Mountain have a hidden area?”","Sister White Dragon translated her question to the divine dragon.","The divine dragon shook its head. It had stayed in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds for a long time, and it had never heard of any hidden area.","The beautiful eyes of the virtuous lamia narrowed slightly, and she revealed a smug smile. It was the right choice to place a mark on the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","With this tracking mark and enough energy, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword could be located regardless of which corner of the universe it was in.","However, she needed to protect Song Shuhang now, so she did not have the time to wander about.","She would wait until Song Shuhang was done with the Nascent Soul Fetuses. Then, she could help lock onto the position of the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","At this time, inside Song Shuhang’s fifth small dantian.","After his encounter with Senior White Two, Song Shuhang did not enter recklessly into the dantian, opting to keep a low profile.","This area corresponded to the pseudo-dragon-pearl of Striped Dragon Two’s son.","If Striped Dragon really did have a son, he had to be a big shot that could not be trifled with.","The life wheel in the fifth dantian was the one with interlocked gears. Its Lake Soul was the Star of Creation and Destruction, drawn in a four-frame comic style.","This dantian seemed to have come out of a science-fiction movie.","The core of the fifth dantian was the mechanical core reactor, which had sunk to the bottom of the Spirit Lake and stopped moving after Song Shuhang ascended to the Sixth Stage.","Yet, it had drilled out from the bottom of the lake and risen to the surface now. The gears of the life wheel were scattered in the lake, floating on both sides of the core reactor like wings.","The pseudo-dragon-pearl that corresponded to the son of Striped Dragon Two was embedded inside the reactor.","Song Shuhang felt as if the combination of the core reactor and the pseudo-dragon-pearl was going to evolve into a mecha.","“Senior Striped Dragon’s son, I don’t know if you’re paying attention to this place, but I’ll be intruding for a while!” Song Shuhang’s spiritual body cupped its fists as a sign of respect.","Fairy Cheng Lin, who was still watching him, felt uncomfortable, afraid that Shuhang was about to harass her through the pseudo-dragon-pearl.","Song Shuhang’s spiritual body moved forward, and the pseudo-dragon-pearl inside the core reactor did not show any signs of rejection.","He stretched out his hand and placed it on the pseudo-dragon-pearl through the core reactor. Then, the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? was used several times in a row.","Since he was unfamiliar with Striped Dragon Two’s son, he did not know what kind of love he should convey. After thinking about it, he infused his feelings for Fairy Cheng Lin and Striped Dragon Two into this ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","In the end, they’re all one big family. I hope it works.","The pseudo-dragon-pearl accepted Song Shuhang’s love-infused ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? without any problem.","Perhaps it had something to do with its mechanical nature, but it was very calm from start to finish.","The pseudo-dragon-pearl shone brightly, and the core reactor began to absorb the water of the Spirit Lake, going on to form a new Nascent Soul Fetus.","“It’s done.” Song Shuhang was overjoyed. The whole process went smoothly.","He backed away, ready to rush to the next stop.","[Beep~ “I really want to take a color photo” has added you as a friend. PS: None.]","Song Shuhang: “???”","What’s this?","Someone added me as a friend through the QR code?","Who is it?","Looking at the other party’s weird name, Song Shuhang thought for a while before having a sudden realization. He then looked back at the pseudo-dragon-pearl of Striped Dragon Two’s son.","He stretched out his hand and used the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? on it one more time.","[Beep~ “I really want to take a color photo” has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: None.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Senior, thank you for your help. See you later.” Song Shuhang cupped his fists at the pseudo-dragon-pearl before turning away and leaving.","While rushing to the next stop, Song Shuhang moved [I really want to take a color photo] to the “Ally” list, noting them down as [Striped Dragon Two Son].","“This ‘note function’ is quite convenient. Not bad,” said Song Shuhang with a nod. With the improvement of his strength, he began to have access to some of the nicest functions of the QR code Golden Core Composition.","He felt that the friend list was getting better and better, and that it was even shaping up to be like a “group.”","Should I give this friend list a name? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","When the nickname Striped Dragon Two Son was noted down...","[Beep~ Striped Dragon Two Son has moved you to the blacklist. Synchronization in progress. Striped Dragon Two Son is now part of your blacklist.]","“???” Song Shuhang looked confused.","[Striped Dragon Two Son, who is on the blacklist, has transferred your request to Little Stripey, who is also on the blacklist. The transfer process has begun... The transfer failed. Little Stripey refused the transfer.]","After a while...","[Beep~ Little Stripey has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: What is the meaning of this ‘Striped Dragon Two Son’? Are you saying that this dude is my father?]"]},{"number":2079,"title":"Chapter 2079 Narcissist","paragraphs":["2079 Narcissist","“???” Song Shuhang checked the name in the friend list again.","Striped Dragon Two Son.","It was not until he read it several times over that he finally noticed something was wrong.","The name “Striped Dragon Two Son” could mean different things.","One meaning could be [Senior Striped Dragon Two’s Son], which was what Song Shuhang meant.","Another meaning could be [Striped Dragon Two, Son], in which case Striped Dragon Two became the son of the said member.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Sometimes, languages could really be profound.","For good reasons, he did not want to infuriate Senior Striped Dragon Two—he did not have the guts nor the strength to do such a thing.","“Senior Striped Dragon, it’s a misunderstanding. Look at my sincere expression. I definitely did not mean it that way!” Song Shuhang tried to explain to Senior Striped Dragon Two.","At this time, his honest face could come in handy.","Through the face-reading skill that every big shot had, his sincere thoughts would definitely be transmitted to Senior Striped Dragon Two.","Song Shuhang worked hard to maintain a sincere smile, hoping that when Senior Striped Dragon Two read his facial expression, he would be able to see his inner thoughts.","[Beep~ Striped Dragon Two has remotely transferred you some energy. PS: A face covered in holy light... Hehe, are you trying to disgust me even further?]","You said you were going to show me a sincere expression, but what you showed me is a face covered in holy light!","I’m the third ruler of the Netherworld, and you’re making me look at a face shrouded in holy light?!","How devious.","Striped Dragon Two was going to remember this insult.","Then, it cut off the connection.","The smile on Song Shuhang’s face stiffened.","[Fairy Cheng Lin has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Stop wasting time. If you keep on delaying, you might really explode.]","Cheng Lin was in a good mood after seeing the scene she wanted to see, so she reminded Shuhang that there were still two dragon pearls that he had to take care of.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“The next stop is the pseudo-dragon-pearl that corresponds to Senior Divine Dragon.” Song Shuhang took a deep breath and psyched himself up.","The sixth dantian held the golden core with the QR code Composition and the octagonal life wheel. It was a very important small dantian.","The pseudo-dragon-pearl that corresponded to the divine dragon did not behave strangely, and it floated quietly above the octagonal life wheel.","Song Shuhang said softly, “Senior Divine Dragon, please excuse my intrusion.”","Then, his hands began to shine with a bright light.","Because he was not too familiar with Senior Divine Dragon, he tried his best to pour “friendship” into the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","I hope that this “friendly” love will be enough.","However, the pearl began to shine before he could even convey his friendship.","As time passed, the pearl flashed brighter and brighter, and the pace at which it was flashing increased as well.","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","After the pseudo-dragon-pearl flashed about ten times, it began to emit light constantly.","Afterward, without Song Shuhang even having to do anything at all, the pseudo-dragon-pearl entered the Nascent Soul Fetus formation stage and began to absorb the water in the Spirit Lake.","It sucked a Spirit Lake’s worth of water seven times.","It was as if someone had poured love into the divine dragon’s pseudo-dragon-pearl, but the problem was that Song Shuhang had not done anything.","What’s going on with Senior Divine Dragon’s pseudo-dragon-pearl?","Is it a narcissist that loves itself too much?","Song Shuhang looked at his shining hands and then at the dragon pearl.","“It doesn’t matter. What’s important here is the result. It works as long as the desired outcome is reached.” Song Shuhang comforted himself.","After saying that, he got up and hurried to the last dantian as he had no time to waste.","Anyway, why does it feel like someone replaced me in pouring love into the pseudo-dragon-pearl? Or am I just overthinking things?","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Inside the seventh dantian.","Song Shuhang’s hands were shining as he rushed toward the last small dantian. “After I pour love into this dragon pearl, it’ll be over!”","This was the pseudo-dragon-pearl that corresponded to Lady Kunna from the Black Dragon World, who could be regarded as a good friend at this point.","It should be easy for me to succeed here, right?","The Lake Soul of the seventh dantian was [The Connected World]—the network of the QR code Composition.","The golden core of this dantian was the Ancient Nether Dragon Soul, which was born from the magic system of the Black Dragon World.","Song Shuhang stepped into the seventh small dantian.","As soon as he entered the Spirit Lake, he saw the Ancient Nether Dragon Soul emerge from a node, holding Kunna’s pseudo-dragon-pearl in its palm.","The Ancient Nether Dragon Soul was modeled after Song Shuhang, except that it had dragon scales all over its body, a pair of dragon horns on its head, dragon wings on its back, and a huge whale tail.","After a cultivator ascended from the Fifth to the Sixth Stage, their Golden Core would melt and turn into a Spirit Lake. The corresponding Golden Core Composition would then transform into the Lake Soul of the Spirit Lake. However, as the Ancient Nether Dragon Soul was a foreign item of sorts, after Song Shuhang ascended to the Sixth Stage, it did not disappear. Instead, it became the central node of the entire network.","It was a golden core as well as Song Shuhang’s clone.","The Ancient Nether Dragon Soul did not have a consciousness of its own, but it could be influenced by Song Shuhang’s will and carry out some simple actions. For example, it seemed to be currently conveying Song Shuhang’s feelings to Fairy Kunna’s pseudo-dragon-pearl.","And as a result, the pseudo-dragon-pearl began to shine, responding to the “love” of the Ancient Nether Dragon Soul.","After a while, the process came to an end, and the drawing of the water began.","Song Shuhang was moved to tears.","The Ancient Nether Dragon Soul was like an exemplary employee.","Its execution was simply superb!","With the last dragon pearl entering the Nascent Soul Fetus formation stage, Song Shuhang’s realm had advanced one step further.","Next, even if Song Shuhang didn’t do anything and merely waited for the birth of the Nascent Souls, he could step into the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm.","According to Senior Divine Dragon’s guess, it only took about 50 years for the Nascent Soul Fetus to grow into a Nascent Soul.","This length of time was unbelievably short for a cultivator.","For most cultivators at Song Shuhang’s level, 50 years was just enough time for a short meditation session!","Alternatively, this time could be used to prepare for the tribulation.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Song Shuhang’s mental energy withdrew from the small dantian and entered his original dantian. At the same time, he kept paying attention to the changes happening to the Nascent Soul Fetuses in the seven small dantians.","He said softly, “Fifty years, huh?”","[Beep~ Do you want to give a name to the “QR code Friend Group”? Y/N.]","A familiar sound rang in his mind.","What?","He had indeed been considering giving a name to the friend list he had gotten through his QR code Composition.","I didn’t know that this function existed.","“Yes.” Song Shuhang chose.","[Beep~ Your close friend “White” had suggested some names: Nine Provinces Cultivation Chat Group, Meditation Group, Fellow Daoists Exchange Group, Cultivation. These are for reference only.]","“It seems Senior White suggested some names for the friend list...”","Nine Provinces Cultivation Chat Group? Meditation Group? Fellow Daoists Exchange Group?","These names all sound pretty good.","“However, wouldn’t a name like ‘Tyrannical Song Chat Group’ be more interesting?”","After a short while...","Song Shuhang reached out and tapped on the name “Cultivation.”","In the end, this was the one he chose.","This name was simple and concise."]},{"number":2080,"title":"Chapter 2080 Path to simplicity","paragraphs":["2080 Path to simplicity","Simplicity.","This was what Song Shuhang had in mind when he chose the name “Cultivation” for the QR code Friend List.","If he wanted to, he could come up with a bunch of poetic and complicated names. Yet, at times, no matter how gorgeous a name was, it could not match the beauty of simplicity.","The name “Cultivation” was simple but captured the essence of the matter.","He felt a deep connection to this name, as if it was related to his future.","It just feels right, Song Shuhang thought to himself as he made up his mind.","[Are you sure that you want to use “Cultivation” as the group name? Do you want to make an announcement? Y/N.] The prompt sounded again in his mind.","“Wait a minute.” Song Shuhang selected [No].","He was supposed to keep a low profile, so he shouldn’t go around making announcements.","In the future, when the time is right, I’ll announce the name of the “Cultivation” chat group.","But for now, I must keep a low profile and not make any waves!","After choosing the name Cultivation, Song Shuhang felt as if he had taken an important step—perhaps even a turning point for his future.","His mind and spirit became one as a result.","This feeling was very strange, and impossible to describe with mere words.","As he experienced this mysterious spiritual sublimation, Song Shuhang started to feel pain in his mind and nonexistent body.","“The process of spiritual sublimation is truly magical,” said Song Shuhang emotionally. However, this level of pain was too weak, and it could not even make him scream.","[Magical your ass. That means your body is about to explode. If you don’t take action, I can dance at your grave next year on this day.] Fairy Cheng Lin’s words were like an arrow that pierced his heart.","F*ck, I almost forgot that Demon Emperor Hezhi is still sending energy over to make me explode.","“Fairy Cheng Lin, help me!” Song Shuhang urged his main Golden Core to circulate the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?, rerouting Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy to his ghost spirit.","When the pseudo-dragon-pearls in his body turned into Nascent Soul Fetuses, each pearl consumed seven Spirit Lakes’ worth of energy, which was huge.","The total amount of energy consumed was, to the very minimum, equivalent to one unit of Eighth Stage energy. This was impressive as Song Shuhang was only ascending to the Seventh Stage, and the fat whale golden core in his original dantian had yet to make any moves. This was the doing of his small dantians alone.","Yet, compared to the energy Demon Emperor Hezhi was sending over, which was close to the peak of the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, this consumption was irrelevant.","The remaining energy was enough to make Song Shuhang die several times over!","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? worked like crazy while the Sage’s blood and his three top-tier body-tempering techniques protected his body. At least for a short period of time, Song Shuhang did not have to worry about his body being unable to bear the load and exploding.","The fat whale floated up and down in the huge Spirit Lake of his original dantian. Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy passed through it before being sent to the ghost spirit.","During this process, every time the fat whale rerouted a batch of Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy, it refined part of it, making it its own.","The seven small dantians had already entered the fetus formation phase. As such, they no longer needed to consume as much energy as they had a short while ago. They moved to assist the fat whale by refining the energy that flooded Shuhang’s body, sending it back.","During this process, the different powers, laws, and attributes of the seven small dantians were passed on to the fat whale.","The golden core, monster core, virtuous diamond ball, cosmic demon core, mechanical core reactor, ancient witch blood, and ancient nether dragon soul represented most of the races in the universe.","Humans, monsters, special life forms, cosmic demons, mechanical beings, ancient witches, and beasts were all present.","Song Shuhang’s body carried the traces of various systems, which included daoists, buddhists, scholars, witches, monsters, science, and magic.","The Golden Core Compositions on each of the small golden cores, when combined, became a huge “foundation.”","The thirty-three pieces of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure gathered in Song Shuhang’s original dantian, surrounding the whale core and resonating with it.","Ever since Song Shuhang had come in contact with cultivation, he had followed the path of a loose cultivator. As such, his cultivation techniques were especially varied. Whatever cultivation technique was suitable for him, he would learn it.","Today, everything he had learned over this period of time began to add together.","This was also an important step for Sixth Stage True Monarchs who wanted to step into the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“Splash~” The fat whale golden core suddenly jumped out of the Spirit Lake.","On its body, the Golden Core Composition “Star Road” began to shine.","On this long road stood the people who Song Shuhang had become familiar with.","The first figure on the star road was Soft Feather’s.","Behind her were Medicine Master, Riverly Purple Mist, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator, Great Master Profound Principle... Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman, Su Clan’s Seven... Doudou, True Monarch White Crane... Senior Brother Three Realms, Guoguo, Lady Onion... Yu Jiaojiao, True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon, Immortal Master Copper Trigram... Young Master Phoenix Slayer, Senior Yellow Mountain, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber... A handsome man that Shuhang could not remember.","Fairy Lychee, Dharma King Creation, True Monarch Ancient Lake Temple, Fairy Dongfang Six, Venerable Spirit Butterfly, and many more. All of these people were neatly lined up along the star road.","Further back were Pavilion Master Chu and a strange figure who was hiding in her shadow.","Senior Turtle, the Great Northern Emperor, Sage Monarch Melon Eater, and the big shots that Song Shuhang met after them were also present.","The order by which they appeared on the road was based on the order Song Shuhang came in contact with them.","All the people on the star road had one thing in common; they had joined Song Shuhang in the chat group named “Cultivation.”","Except for a few ones, all the figures that Song Shuhang had added as friends were on the Fat Whale Star Road.","Senior White, Senior White Two, Striped Dragon Two, Fairy Cheng Lin, the Scholarly Sage, Fairy @#%×, Fairy Creation, Sister White Dragon, the Heavenly Emperor, and Lady Kunna were missing.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was also nowhere to be seen.","This group of people was quite special. With Song Shuhang’s strength, it was still impossible to record them!","“Sixteen’s figure has still not appeared,” Song Shuhang looked at the whale core and said softly.","His eyes followed the star road. At the very end, there was another Soft Feather. Song Shuhang suspected that this Soft Feather who was pushing open the door at the end of the road was the Heavenly Emperor.","After the fat whale jumped out of the lake, it started swaying.","A few more figures appeared on the road","They were Song Shuhang’s new friends—the Indestructible Lord, Demon Emperor Hezhi, and Senior Almighty Merchant.","The sixth small dantian was the QR code for entering the group, the seventh small dantian was the network, and the fat whale golden core was the database, which recorded the information on the group members."]},{"number":2081,"title":"Chapter 2081 Shocking! Tyrannical Song is actually getting blown up! Clinging onto life! Ten seconds until the end!","paragraphs":["2081 Shocking! Tyrannical Song is actually getting blown up! Clinging onto life! Ten seconds until the end!","Song Shuhang looked at the Fat Whale Star Road with emotion.","If he could record down people like Senior White, it would be a great achievement!","The fat whale jumped out of the Spirit Lake, but because it was too fat, it crashed back into the lake right after.","However, it did not give up and used its tail to propel itself out of the water.","Then, it opened its mouth and took a deep breath, sucking in all the spiritual energy in the huge original Spirit Lake.","As long as I eat fast enough, I won’t have the time to get fat!","The highly-compressed spiritual energy was then ejected from the blowhole on the top of the fat whale’s head.","In the end, the spiritual energy turned into a ring of light.","It looked somewhat like an angel’s halo, but the fat whale’s halo was thorny, and there seemed to be eight holes in it.","“Is that a Life Wheel?” Song Shuhang recognized the true nature of the light wheel at a glance.","The fat whale golden core evolved into the light wheel fat whale?","This life wheel looked very powerful, although Song Shuhang had no idea what special ability it had.","Nevertheless, he was looking forward to finding out.","At the very least, it should be able to exert power equivalent to a peak Sixth Stage magical technique as it was the life wheel condensed by the fat whale golden core.","He, the first Sage in a thousand years who could only use techniques such as the Lightning Drawing Technique, would have to rely on these special life wheels to put up a facade.","After the evolution, the light wheel fat whale started floating over the Life Spirit Lake.","This light wheel seemed to have given the fat whale the ability to fly.","With the help of the light wheel, the fat whale golden core slowly fell back into the dry Life Spirit Lake.","The ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? continued operating, drawing Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy and filling the Spirit Lake.","Coupled with the continuous rerouting to the ghost spirit, the pressure that Song Shuhang was experiencing was reduced a little.","I only need to hold on for a while. If I really can’t handle it anymore, there’s still Senior White Two’s dragon pearl, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","As long as he was careful not to make any mistakes, he would not die this time!","“Low-key, low-key,” Song Shuhang repeated to himself.","His desire to survive was strong sometimes and weak other times. Right now, it was undoubtedly a time when his desire to survive was extremely strong.","He forced his desire to do something stupid into the depths of his heart, hammering a big nail into it to prevent it from breaking free.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","In a forbidden area in the Infernal Realm.","Demon Emperor Hezhi was finished on his side, which meant that all of his energy had been transferred to his clone, from where it would find its way to Tyrannical Song.","Through the blacklist, he could sense that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was receiving the enormous energy he had transferred remotely.","Since he was the source of the energy, he could also vaguely sense the state of Tyrannical Song’s body, which was on the verge of collapse.","Demon Emperor Hezhi’s clone said, “The first Sage in a thousand years is indeed quite capable to have been able to hold on for so long.”","While speaking, he scanned Song Shuhang’s state from a distance through the demonic god pillar.","When the results of the scan were passed back to the Infernal Realm, Demon Emperor Hezhi let out a hearty laugh.","“Hahaha! Tyrannical Song, you’re finally going to die!”","He could see from the report that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s body was already gone, and only his head was left!","Moreover, this head would not last long.","In one minute at most... Tyrannical Song’s head should blow up as well!","Demon Emperor Hezhi felt his mind clear up. It was as if all the unhappiness in his heart had been swept away, which improved his mood quite a bit.","He said softly, “In my life as a demonic cultivator, I have always been careful not to let revenge brew for too long. If one exacts revenge in a timely manner, their state of mind will improve as a result.”","At this moment, he really wanted to share the happiness he was feeling with other people.","He wanted everyone in the world to know that he, Demon Emperor Hezhi, was about to make Profound Sage Tyrannical Song explode. He wanted to share the picture of the bodiless Tyrannical Song with all the fellow daoists who hated Shuhang.","[Would you like to share your feelings with everyone? Do you want to post this picture to your stories?] A gentle reminder sounded in his ears.","“Yes! Eh, wait... Is this a function of Tyrannical Song’s blacklist?” Demon Emperor Hezhi was delighted.","He had not noticed before that this blacklist had so many different features.","After the reminder, he discovered that he could use Tyrannical Song’s own channel to publish the news that Tyrannical Song was about to explode.","This instantly doubled the pleasure.","It gave off a similar feeling to stabbing the enemy with their own knife while trampling them in their own base camp, pressing them onto the ground, dragging them across the ground, and humiliating them.","When Demon Emperor Hezhi chose to publish the news, he also chose a very eye-catching title.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","After about two breaths of time, all people who had been added to the “Cultivation” chat group by Song Shuhang received a new message.","A member of the blacklist, Demon Emperor Hezhi, has posted a new story.","A story?","Does Song Shuhang’s friend list also have this feature?","Is it a new feature?","This story could be viewed by all the people on Shuhang’s friend list.","Because it was a new function, all the fellow daoists were very interested in taking a look. As long as they were idle or had nothing better to do, they checked it out.","[Shocking! Tyrannical Song is actually getting blown up! Clinging onto life! Ten seconds until the end!] published by Demon Emperor Hezhi.","As expected of a peerless immortal chef who could create a whole menu based on the heavenly tribulation, Demon Emperor Hezhi had always been at the forefront of fashion.","Below the title was a short explanation.","Demon Emperor Hezhi described his plan of remotely transferring a huge amount of energy that was close to the peak of the Tribulation Transcender Realm over to Tyrannical Song.","Below was a short video of Tyrannical Song with only his head left, looking like he would explode at any time.","The sleeping Indestructible Lord was the first one to like Demon Emperor Hezhi’s story, doing so out of instinct.","Then, the now-blacklisted Little Stripey and Almighty Merchant similarly liked the story.","Fairy Cheng Lin tried to leave a comment and discovered that it actually worked.","“Fellow Daoist Hezhi, thank you for the Tribulation Transcender energy.” Fairy Cheng Lin left a message, and she also liked the story.","[Close Friend] Thrice Reckless Mad Saber left a message: “Wait, I’m a little confused. Didn’t Shuhang’s body explode long ago? When did his body explode again?”","[CPU Cheat] Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “Who is Demon Emperor Hezhi? Why does this name sound so familiar?”","[Driving Goddess] Fairy Dongfang Six: “I’m very excited to take a picture with Senior Hezhi! Is it a living senior Demon Emperor?”","[Mama Yellow Mountain] Venerable Yellow Mountain: “Shuhang, are you okay? Please reply back.”","But after a while.","[Beep~ Mama Yellow Mountain has moved you into their blacklist. Synchronization in progress... Mama Yellow Mountain has been moved to your blacklist.]","Song Shuhang finally experienced what it meant to be so tired that you wanted to retire."]},{"number":2082,"title":"Chapter 2082 Time is running out, robbing me of my youth","paragraphs":["2082 Time is running out, robbing me of my youth","Mama Yellow Mountain, I’m sorry.","Still, why can the seniors who are leaving comments see the nicknames I gave them?!","Aren’t they supposed to be private?!","Song Shuhang glanced at the long list of nicknames in his friend list, his heart feeling cold.","After getting through this calamity, he had to change all the nicknames of the seniors so as to avoid ending his friendship with them.","If all the seniors ended up on his blacklist, how were they supposed to chat?","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Demon Emperor Hezhi’s first story was quickly viewed by the members of the [Cultivation] group.","All those who were idle came and left a message, not only to take a look at this Demon Emperor who was recorded in the books of demonic sects, but also to see what their title or nickname was.","Demon Emperor Hezhi’s wish was fulfilled, and the joy he felt was at an all-time high. However, after looking at the replies on his story, he kept on getting the feeling that something was wrong.","[Steel Friend] Doudou: “Is Shuhang still alive? Let me tell you something then. Yellow Mountain is planning to borrow Senior White’s Secret Realm of Slowness. He said that with you advancing through realms so fast, you might have burnt out your brain, so you need to close up for a while and calm yourself. If you end up dying, contact me after you resurrect.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior White’s Secret Realm of Slowness was very scary. It was a place where those affected by the Thrice Reckless Disease would suffer extreme torment.","In the future, I’ll grow a tree’s worth of plum fruits to bribe Senior White and stop him from lending the secret realm to Mama Yellow Mountain, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","[Buddy] Heavenly Emperor: “Senior Song was blown up? When did that happen? In the next ten seconds, Senior Song’s head is going to blow up as well? Fellow Daoist Hezhi is amazing~”","The Heavenly Emperor liked Demon Emperor Hezhi’s story.","Doudou: “...”","The title of the Heavenly Emperor was really amazing. It gave him a feeling of intimacy.1","[Reliable Friend] Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “I’m sorry, but I was late. I was busy receiving a fellow daoist just now, so I was not able to reply immediately. By the way, are the titles of Doudou and the person above me reversed?”","As the always-online holy warrior of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was usually the first one to respond.","Unfortunately, he missed the opportunity today.","However, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was always attentive, and he discovered the problem with the Heavenly Emperor’s and Doudou’s titles at a glance.","[Buddy] Heavenly Emperor: “Senior Song, dadadada~”","[White-Skinned Soft Feather] Soft Feather: “Dadadada? What’s that supposed to mean? Anyway, when will you return my ghost spirit to me?”","[Ancestral Golden Dragon] Sister White Dragon: “Let me translate. It means, ‘Senior Song, you are dead’.”","Sister White Dragon was a professional translator, and there was no language in this world that she could not understand.","[Su Clan’s Sixteen] Sixteen: “Shuhang is busy refining the energy that is being sent his way, so it’s unlikely that he will see your messages.”","Song Shuhang, who was scrolling through the messages, blushed.","In fact, he was doing two things at once. While circulating the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? and pouring Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy into the ghost spirit, he was looking at the messages below the story.","Just now, he wanted to leave a comment to anger the Demon Emperor, but after seeing Sixteen’s message, he could only give up on the plan.","For the time being, he would have to pretend to be practicing seriously.","“Speaking of which, I should also move the Heavenly Emperor into the blacklist,” said Song Shuhang with a stifled heart.","However, he was surprised by his remarks.","After all, what was so heart-stifling about the Heavenly Emperor joining the blacklist?","The two of them belonged to different camps. Although they would sometimes cooperate, when they could trick the other party, neither side would be lenient.","Moreover, with the strength of the Heavenly Emperor, she was eligible to enter the Blacklist VIP list.","Demon Emperor Hezhi, the Indestructible Lord, Little Stripey (Striped Dragon Two), the Almighty Merchant, Fairy Cheng Lin, Striped Dragon Two’s son... and Mama Yellow Mountain.","The strength of the Heavenly Emperor was at about the same level as the other people in the list; they were all at the very peak of the universe.","[Beep~ Your Buddy Heavenly Emperor has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Hehe, Senior Song, here’s your daily point of energy. Oh, and there was another thing I wanted to ask you. Is my Southern Autumn Temple in your hands, Senior Song?]","The Southern Autumn Temple was the palace of the Great Southern Emperor.","Together with the Great Northern Emperor’s Palace of Winter, the Great Western Emperor’s Palace of Summer, and the Great Eastern Emperor’s Eastern Spring Pavilion, they were known as the palaces of the four Great Emperors of the Cardinal Directions.","The Southern Autumn Temple had been unearthed by Senior White and was temporarily stored in Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","When Song Shuhang saw this message, he broke out in a cold sweat.","He remembered Senior Turtle’s evaluation of the Great Southern Emperor.","The Great Southern Emperor was always smiling and looked kind, but deep down, he was very difficult to get along with. If you opposed him, you would probably not have a single moment of peace in the future.","This was the type of person that Song Shuhang was most afraid of.","When a big shot did not even care about their reputation and took time out of their busy schedule to bully a much weaker party all day long, what could the weaker party do?","Should I say no?","Anyway, the Southern Autumn Temple has already been properly taken in by the Inner World, so I don’t have to worry about it being discovered by the Heavenly Emperor.","As long as he kept his mouth shut and said that he had never even seen the Southern Autumn Temple, the Heavenly Emperor could not do anything to him.","While he was lost in his thoughts, the Heavenly Emperor sent him another bit of energy. [There’s no need to deny it, Senior Song. In fact, shortly after the Southern Autumn Temple was taken away by you, I sensed it. Since the Southern Autumn Temple is in your hands, then I will not be polite. Dadadada~]","Dadadada?","Right, it was translated by Sister White Dragon before. It means “you are dead.”","[Beep~ The Heavenly Emperor has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Senior Song, do you know that time is the most ruthless of all? Not only does it kill people, but it also robs them of their youth.]","“What?” Song Shuhang was confused. The topic had changed too fast. One second ago, he was being threatened. Then, one second later, they were speaking about literature.","While he was in thought, a spatial gate the size of a palm opened close to him.","Senior Divine Dragon next to him began to have a severe stomachache.","A slender finger stretched out from the spatial gate and pointed at Song Shuhang. “Time is running out, robbing me of my youth!”","This poetic name was in line with the style that cultivators had, which conformed to the theme of the group “Cultivation.”","Next, the finger retreated back into the spatial gate and disappeared.","“Sister White Dragon, was that the Heavenly Emperor?” Sixteen asked worriedly.","“Mm-hm, that was her. Don’t worry, she just came here to add a buff. She did not cast a harmful magical technique,” Sister White Dragon comforted her.","If it was a harmful magical technique, she would have blocked it."]},{"number":2083,"title":"Chapter 2083 Crazy World","paragraphs":["2083 Crazy World","Sixteen was still a little worried. “What buff did the Heavenly Emperor leave to Shuhang?”","“I can’t tell.” Sister White Dragon shook her head.","Although the Heavenly Emperor had given a very poetic name to her move, everyone knew that the names cultivators used were mostly random.","Shouting the name of a move aloud could increase one’s momentum and make the move look more impressive.","Alternatively, using a fake name could mislead naive enemies. There was always that chance that one could make a fool believe that the move was impressive just because of its name.","Unless it was someone who had just entered the world of cultivation, it was best not to believe a single word of what the enemy was saying.","Sister White Dragon said, “I’ll ask her what she did.”","After Song Shuhang’s QR code Composition allowed the publishing of stories, some things became much more convenient.","Sister White Dragon opened Demon Emperor Hezhi’s story again and left a message. “Heavenly Emperor, come out. What buff did you leave to Little Song?”","However, the Heavenly Emperor did not reply.","“Is it a death buff?” Doudou guessed.","“It seems that Shuhang is doomed this time,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said. Demon Emperor Hezhi and the Heavenly Emperor had teamed up to target Song Shuhang, giving him no chance of survival at all.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Song Shuhang no longer had the time to pay attention to the messages on Demon Emperor Hezhi’s story. He was really busy.","His spiritual body saw the phantom of a huge palace appear out of nowhere—it was the phantom of the Southern Autumn Temple.","This was the buff left by the Heavenly Emperor, and only Song Shuhang could experience its effects.","After the phantom of the Southern Autumn Temple weighed down on him, the real Southern Autumn Temple, which was stored in his Inner World, began to resonate with it. It was just like when the virtuous lamia used the Virtuous Palace Projection, which drew energy directly from the real Virtuous Palace in the Inner World.","The resonance caused the Time Box inside the temple to open. As a result, the power of time coursed through Shuhang’s body.","Then, the energy that was coming from Demon Emperor Hezhi was divided into two.","Most of the energy continued to pour into Song Shuhang, while a small portion was absorbed by the Southern Autumn Temple’s projection dropped off by the Heavenly Emperor.","Time was the most ruthless of all. It caused people to grow older and robbed them of their youth.","Today, Song Shuhang was going to personally experience the ruthless bullying of time.","He discovered that the flow of time around his body had become abnormal. Time had started to accelerate.","However, only his body was affected, while his consciousness seemed to be immune to acceleration.","This was very frightening, because if anything happened to his body, his consciousness would not be able to react in time. It was like a car that was speeding out of control.","“Sister Cheng Lin, help me!” Song Shuhang called out in his mind.","“Not even a please? Anyhow, I’m operating remotely now, and the lag is pretty big. You’ll have to grit your teeth and endure on your own over there.” This time, Fairy Cheng Lin spoke directly through Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit.","The lag was too big, so the communication method had to be changed.","“Right, Senior White Two’s dragon pearl!” With a thought, Song Shuhang began to direct a portion of the energy to Senior White Two’s dragon pearl.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The time in the outside world flowed slowly, but inside the phantom of the Southern Autumn Temple, the flow was completely different.","Song Shuhang could not estimate the extent to which his body had been accelerated, but the buff placed by the Heavenly Emperor seemed to have no upper limit. Time kept on accelerating and accelerating.","If things continued like this, the car that was his body was doomed to get into an accident.","Speaking of which, Senior White should really enjoy this sense of acceleration. If only this buff had been given to Senior White instead!","“Ahhh, the car is going to turn over!” Song Shuhang was very worried.","The speed at which his ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? was circulating was now off the charts.","If under normal conditions his ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? had a speed of 60 km/h, its current speed was over 600 km/h!","And it was still accelerating. Soon, things would be out of Song Shuhang’s control.","Not only that, even the energy that was pouring into Song Shuhang’s body was affected by the temporal power of the Southern Autumn Temple’s projection. The rate at which he was taking in energy had increased several times.","If things continued down on this path, his consciousness would definitely not be able to keep up.","At that time, he would truly explode and die.","“Since I can’t control it...” Song Shuhang gritted his teeth.","Then, I’ll just follow my instincts.","The fat whale could help him share some of the pressure his original dantian was feeling, but the remaining seven small dantians were in a state of pregnancy. They were powerless and unable to share the burden for Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang decided to let himself go.","He began to concentrate on strengthening himself. If he was going to crash, he would just have to make sure that he was strong enough to survive the crash.","Above his head, 88 holy ape projections emerged. Under the scholarly clothing of each holy ape, true dragon patterns flashed brightly.","The number of holy apes had increased from 66 to 88, and it was still going up.","After the 88 holy apes appeared, they opened their scholarly scriptures and began chanting.","But because of the change in the flow of time, the sound of their voices was accelerated into a burst of buzzing sounds. It was impossible to hear what they were saying.","Shuhang’s head assumed a pitch-black metallic color, and the three Sage Seals floated above it, blessing his body.","“Buzz~”","When Song Shuhang strengthened his head to the limit, his ears started ringing.","In the next moment, he felt his consciousness rise up.","He seemed to have jumped out of a river. He saw that the said river had many branches, but there was a large amount of fog in the distance, which made it impossible to see the branches clearly.","What’s going on?","Is this still due to the influence of the Heavenly Emperor’s skill?","If it’s related to the acceleration of time, could this be a prediction of the future?","Many thoughts appeared in Song Shuhang’s mind.","The number of branches that the river had was extremely high.","However, there were no signposts or anything of the sort.","“Snap~”","The time a fish could stay suspended in the air was very short. Song Shuhang was only able to remain in this state for a brief period before falling back into the river.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Song Shuhang’s consciousness returned to his physical body.","In the next moment, he was horrified to find that his body had undergone earth-shattering changes.","Inside the seven small dantians, every pseudo-dragon-pearl had grown.","Vaguely, one could see that the combined power of the spirit lake water, lake soul, and life wheel had formed a baby-like embryo.","But that was not the key point.","Song Shuhang discovered that each “baby” had a tail-like thing growing on its stomach.","This position, this shape...","A navel?","And is that an... umbilical cord?","It really is an umbilical cord!","Has the world gone crazy, or have I gone crazy?","“I haven’t been in the world of cultivation for that long, but don’t you lie to me. Is a Nascent Soul Fetus really supposed to have an umbilical cord?” Song Shuhang murmured."]},{"number":2084,"title":"Chapter 2084 Quietly growing up","paragraphs":["2084 Quietly growing up","Could it be that the tail has just grown in the wrong place, and somehow ended up growing where the navel is?","Song Shuhang carefully observed the seven little Nascent Souls Fetuses.","It turned out that he wasn’t wrong.","There really was an umbilical cord!","!!","These seven umbilical cords were connected to the Spirit Lakes, with the lakes having become their placenta.","However, these seven Nascent Soul Fetuses did not draw energy from the Spirit Lakes, but used them as a springboard to absorb Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy and transform it into nutrition for their growth.","In other words, the nutrients needed for the formation and growth of these seven Nascent Soul Fetuses all came from Demon Emperor Hezhi.","So, is Demon Emperor Hezhi the mother of these seven Nascent Soul Fetuses?","Ugh, I can’t make such a connection! Song Shuhang shook his head repeatedly.","Demon Emperor Hezhi merely acted as soil, providing the nutrients needed for the growth of seeds.","I feel a lot more comfortable thinking about it this way.","The energy needed for the growth of the seven Nascent Soul Fetuses was huge.","The fifty years that Senior Divine Dragon had mentioned were a good guess.","Under normal circumstances, even if Song Shuhang had all kinds of cultivation cheats, it would still take decades of hard work to nurture seven Nascent Soul Fetuses.","After all, this was the most time-consuming phase of the whole process.","What Senior Divine Dragon did not expect was that the Heavenly Emperor would suddenly appear and leave a time-related buff to Song Shuhang.","In addition, Demon Emperor Hezhi maliciously transferred over energy at the peak of the Tribulation Transcender Realm to make Song Shuhang explode.","The attacks of the two big shots worked very well together. With this combination of skills, even a real Eighth Stage Profound Sage would have had no hope of survival.","If it were not for Fairy Cheng Lin, the ghost spirit, and Senior White Two’s dragon pearl soaking up the majority of the energy, Shuhang would have inevitably died today.","Now, a delicate balance had been formed between the two sides, and this balance gave Song Shuhang some room to maneuver.","With this balance in place, his seven Nascent Soul Fetuses began to thrive.","Moreover, this kind of growth was ideal as the path of time was involved. It was completely different from something like hormone-induced growth, and it had no downsides.","As one of the most powerful among the various paths to immortality, the path of time was unpredictable and had infinite uses.","Once one grasped the path of time, they could enjoy things that ordinary people could never even dream of enjoying.","If this continues, will my Nascent Soul Fetuses grow into Nascent Souls? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","If they directly turn into Nascent Souls, will I have to transcend the tribulation?","Or do I have to wait for the fat whale in my original dantian to produce a Nascent Soul before transcending the Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation?","Whether or not I have to transcend the tribulation, I must keep a low profile.","A group tribulation, while refreshing at first, led to nothing but death.","Death itself was not terrifying. What was terrifying was that when one died, the people dear to them would also be involved.","Song Shuhang’s spiritual body touched its left breast. For some reason, whenever he thought of partaking in a group tribulation, he felt an indescribable feeling of sadness.","This feeling made him subconsciously resist the idea.","This time, I must not involve the people I value in the heavenly tribulation.","Men would always learn from their experiences and quietly grow up.","?????","In the outside world.","The divine dragon was trying to cross its arms, but because its arms were too short, they could barely interlock.","However, this did not affect its majestic aura.","It said in a deep, dignified voice, “It seems to be a time acceleration buff.”","“Mm-hm, and it should be a single-target time acceleration effect,” said Sixteen, her voice gentle and mature.","Sister White Dragon next to her said in a worried tone, “Will Shuhang be alright? His aura has changed too quickly.”","“You don’t have to worry. Since time is passing faster and faster, his strength is improving rapidly. He is now in a state of meditation, and during the time it takes for us to say a single word, several hours or even longer may have passed for his body. In addition, Fellow Daoist Hezhi’s energy is pouring into his body nonstop, so it is normal for his cultivation realm to soar,” Sixteen crossed her arms and replied.","“If this continues, will Shuhang ascend directly?” Sister White Dragon could not hide the worry in her tone.","The divine dragon: “...”","It felt like it had been slapped in the face very covertly.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said to Senior Divine Dragon, “Senior Divine Dragon, Senior Song’s Nascent Soul Fetus is beginning to mature.”","Senior Divine Dragon sighed. “Ah, yes, I can see that, Soft Feather.”","I need to save face. Fairy Soft Feather, please stop talking!","“It’s not ideal for him to ascend, though.” Sixteen calmly speculated, “First, Song Shuhang’s rapid progress this time is related to Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy. His foundation is shaky, and there would undoubtedly be some danger left if he were to ascend right now. Second, he only has his head left. For this reason, he should be stuck in the last section between the Sixth and Seventh Stages.”","Sister White Dragon let out a breath of relief. “That’s good. With that being the case, Shuhang will have some time to prepare, and he won’t have to rush to deal with the heavenly tribulation.”","“Instead of worrying about Shuhang, you should worry about yourself.” Sixteen crossed her arms again, and said to Sister White Dragon, “The ?Ape Dragon Miraculous Nascent Technique? that Song Shuhang learned is, at its core, an adaptation of the Dragon Tiger Convergence. You lent him your dragon pearl, so when you get it back, you will also receive some benefits. By then, you should not be too far from hitting your limit.”","Sister White Dragon asked, “Can I no longer suppress my realm?”","Sixteen said, “Don’t suppress it. It’s about time.”","?????","Song Shuhang had no idea how much time had passed.","He was obsessed with the beauty of cultivation and could not extricate himself from this state of meditation.","This time, his spiritual body did not run all over the place, and he wasn’t multitasking; he was really practicing. He nurtured the seven Nascent Soul Fetuses while redirecting large amounts of Demon Emperor Hezhi’s spiritual energy to his ghost spirit and Senior White Two’s dragon pearl.","Cultivation truly made people happy.","It was unknown how long it had been, but the energy coming from Demon Emperor Hezhi gradually reduced, and its strength also became weaker.","Coincidentally, the time buff from the Heavenly Emperor also began to weaken.","The seven little Nascent Soul Fetuses in Song Shuhang’s body seemed to have reached a critical stage. They were no longer growing, and they were now waiting for a chance to take the final step.","The body! Song Shuhang came to a realization.","Not having a body was limiting him. Only after forging a new body would these seven Nascent Soul Fetuses be able to fully develop.","It’s time to end this, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He then slowly opened his eyes."]},{"number":2085,"title":"Chapter 2085 Sixteen, can you flirt with me? Or should I flirt with you instead?","paragraphs":["2085 Sixteen, can you flirt with me? Or should I flirt with you instead?","Song Shuhang slowly opened his eyes.","At this moment, the branches of his wooden body were very dense as they had also been influenced by the path of time. The leaves were working hard to take in carbon dioxide and transform it into oxygen and spiritual energy.","One must have the mind to contribute to the world like a big tree.","Devote oneself to the duty wholeheartedly, learn how to endure hardships, absorb the nutrients in the soil, inhale carbon dioxide, bear sweet fruits, and release fragrant spiritual energy and oxygen.","To make the world a better place, he was even willing to have his branches cut off without complaint!","As Song Shuhang moved, the rustling sound of wind blowing through branches and leaves could be heard.","His head, buried in the branches, seemed to have returned to nature.","As his body swayed, the time-related technique that the Heavenly Emperor had cast on him just so happened to dissipate.","Although Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy was still pouring into his body, it could no longer threaten him. The intensity of the remaining energy could only be regarded as dessert after a meal, and Song Shuhang could easily consume this energy on his own as long as he continued to use the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","The vicious plot of Demon Emperor Hezhi had failed.","If it was not for him wanting to keep a low profile, Song Shuhang would have definitely left a message under Demon Emperor Hezhi’s story.","Low-profile, low-profile. I will record this matter in a small notebook, and when I ascend to the Eighth Stage and get to truly hold a divinity show, I will use it to rend Demon Emperor Hezhi’s heart! Song Shuhang thought to himself.","If he were to rend the other party’s heart by leaving a comment under their stories, only the people in his friend list would be able to see it. Additionally, as most of them were on his side, he wouldn’t feel much satisfaction.","As such, he decided to wait.","When everyone across the universe was watching his real divinity show, he could thank Demon Emperor Hezhi for sending him the peak Tribulation Transcender Realm energy that he received now. At that time, even if Demon Emperor Hezhi was made of steel, his heart would definitely feel as if it had been sliced into countless pieces!","Song Shuhang nodded slightly and said softly, “Sometimes, waiting will allow for the reaping of sweeter fruit.”","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“So tired.” The virtuous lamia’s voice sounded next to his ear.","As soon as Song Shuhang raised his head, he saw the virtuous lamia’s exhausted face. Her golden body was now dull and looked like it might collapse at any moment.","“Thank you for your hard work, Fairy.” Song Shuhang thanked the virtuous lamia.","During this incident, the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation worked nonstop to help him filter the energy transmitted by Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Without them, the balance that had formed in Song Shuhang’s body would not have appeared.","“Hmm.” This time, the lamia was really tired, and she did not even have the strength to make any playful remarks.","As for Fairy Creation, she did not even have the strength to respond and had gone to rest inside his body.","After responding, the virtuous lamia reached out and grabbed the Tyrant Cuttlefish’s Twin Blades, which were floating right beside Song Shuhang.","Then, with one blade in each of her hands, she stabbed her throat and heart.","The twin blades were very sharp, and they easily pierced the virtuous lamia’s body.","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","“Aahhh!” The virtuous lamia let out the iconic four-toned scream and fell to the ground.","This time, she was not playing dead.","Her body turned into light of virtue and disappeared.","But soon after, Song Shuhang’s light of virtue began to gather once again.","It was estimated that in ten minutes, a brand new and energetic virtuous lamia would reappear.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Is there anything that death cannot solve?","But when the virtuous lamia died, the atmosphere became very strange.","Song Shuhang said with a cough, “Fairy Waiting for a Promise was too tired, so she decided to reboot her system. She will be back in a while.”","The divine dragon was speechless.","“It looks like I made everyone worry,” said Song Shuhang, his eyes falling on the petite Sixteen.","Sixteen hugged him and revealed a gentle smile.","She had an especially nice smile today.","This evocative smile made Song Shuhang recall the scene that took place back when he poured “love” into the pseudo-dragon-pearl that corresponded to Sixteen.","He recalled the flirtatious Sixteen sitting next to him in the scene.","Yes, it’s the same feeling.","At this moment, Sixteen smiled just like the Sixteen that had been sitting next to him back then.","“Sixteen,” Song Shuhang said, “can you flirt with me?”","He wanted to see what the real Sixteen would look like when she was teasing someone.","He remembered that in the scenario produced by the pseudo-dragon-pearl, the Sixteen that had been sitting next to him said that the Sixteen in the real world was too shy and did not know how to flirt, but Song Shuhang disagreed.","Sixteen had even legdon’d1 him in the past, although he was seated when it happened.","Moreover, those who were shy also had their own means of flirting or teasing others.","The divine dragon was, again, speechless.","He glanced at Song Shuhang’s steel-covered face. As expected of a face made of steel, he could say such shameless words so frankly!","While you aren’t ashamed at all, that doesn’t mean that others can’t feel second-hand embarrassment, okay?","“Ahem!” Song Shuhang seemed to have realized that he said something inappropriate. He was asking a girl to flirt with him in broad daylight. It seemed that it was neither the right time nor place for such a thing!","“Uh, how about I flirt with you instead?” So Song Shuhang tried to make amends.","With his face covered in steel, he was not afraid of losing face.","Sister White Dragon’s small dragon claws moved to cover her eyes.","Sixteen quietly crossed her arms and looked at Song Shuhang.","“Sixteen, you have a really beautiful smile today.” Song Shuhang stood up and approached Sixteen. “Can you help trim my branches for me?”","Sixteen lowered her head and grabbed the dagger hanging at her waist.","As she lowered her head, Song Shuhang stretched out his arm and gently lifted her chin.","He recalled how the flirtatious Sixteen looked at him in the scenario produced by the pseudo-dragon-pearl. He used that same gaze to look at Sixteen now.","However, his branches were very lush, and they could easily obstruct the sight of the people looking at him.","Song Shuhang’s gaze was focused on Sixteen’s lips. He couldn’t help but compare the real Sixteen’s lips with the Sixteen who asked for a kiss in the illusion.","Sixteen coughed softly and said, “Stop, stop flirting with me. I’m White Dragon.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“To be honest, I really can’t bear to look at your provocative branches. I feel like I could burst out laughing at any time, but as laughing would hurt your self-esteem, I have to endure.” Sixteen gently patted Song Shuhang before pointing to White Dragon, who was beside her. “That’s Sixteen.”","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","White Dragon, still covering her eyes, explained, “We used the Silver Trigram masks that Senior White dug up a while back.”","One face, one life. One life, one experience.","Put on a mask, a different face, and experience another life.","The disguising technique of the metal trigram clan was truly an evil cheat code.","[Beep~ Do you want to move your Close Friend Immortal Master Copper Trigram to the blacklist? Y/N.]"]},{"number":2086,"title":"Chapter 2086 Dreams are meant for the night","paragraphs":["2086 Dreams are meant for the night","Translator: GodBrandy","Editor: Kurisu","Song Shuhang gritted his teeth, and then moved his hand toward the screen, tapping on the [No] button.","He, Song Shuhang, was not a person who would vent his anger on others.","It was Heavenly Silver Trigram who had made the masks, not Senior Copper Trigram. So, he could not move his Close Friend Copper Trigram to the blacklist for such a trivial reason.","The VIP— Emh, the blacklist was a list that was easy for others to enter but difficult to leave.","As such, he could not do something like move Senior Copper Trigram to the blacklist as he might not be able to move him out.","At most, if he were to meet Silver Trigram in the future, he could blacklist him.","Injustice had its reasons, and debt had its owner.","Blaming innocent people for no reason was just a sign of being a failure.","Therefore, Senior Copper Trigram should stay in the good friend list!","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Song Shuhang sighed deeply and looked at Sister White Dragon, who looked exactly like Sixteen.","Once again, it should be emphasized that the disguising technique of the metal trigram clan was truly an evil cheat code. In addition, they were just wearing a mask, so why did it also change their bodies?","It just does not make any sense!","“Sister White Dragon, it was not easy for me to muster up the courage to do what I did.” Song Shuhang sighed.","Luckily, the dense branches and leaves slightly helped with his embarrassment.","It was the first time in his life that he had flirted with another person in public, and all of this started because he blurted out some random nonsense in the beginning.","But after blurting out the line “Sixteen, can you flirt with me?”, he could only thicken up his face and go with the flow.","In order to reproduce this kind of scene again, the stars would have to align, and he had no idea when such an opportunity would present itself.","However, a man’s plans could never match the plans of heaven.","Little did he expect that Sixteen and Sister White Dragon had switched their appearance.","Sister White Dragon said softly, “How about I just keep quiet and you continue with whatever you were doing?”","Her gentle tone was like that of a person taking pity on a foolish child.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky. After a second, he forcibly changed the subject, “Sister White Dragon, why did you switch appearances with Sixteen?”","The change in topic was a bit abrupt, but it could at least take away the embarrassment.","“Senior Song, you can say that it’s because of me.” The black-skinned Soft Feather raised her hand timidly and said, “Just now, toward the end of your meditation, I was studying that mask of Silver Trigram that Senior White gave me earlier.”","Toward the end of Song Shuhang’s meditative state, things had already stabilized, so no one was worried about him anymore.","Finding herself bored and with nothing to do, the black-skinned Soft Feather remembered the mask that she was given earlier and wanted to see what uses it had.","Song Shuhang looked at her in puzzlement. “What does that have to do with Sixteen and Sister White Dragon switching appearances?”","How could a chef practicing cooking ultimately become a master of traditional painting?","When being stared at by Song Shuhang, the black-skinned Soft Feather lowered her head in embarrassment and said weakly, “It’s because I remembered that I’m an inner demon, and so I can transform into whatever I want even without this mask. Because of that, I felt that the mask was useless to me, so I let Sister White Dragon try it out instead.”","Sister White Dragon explained gently, “Since the human being I am most familiar with is Sixteen, I chose to use the disguise mask to change into her. The mask, plus my understanding of Sixteen, allowed me to imitate her appearance and replicate about 50% of her personality.”","If she had not been interrupted by Song Shuhang, given some time, she would have been able to replicate about 80% of Sixteen’s personality.","Song Shuhang then looked at Sixteen, who currently looked like White Dragon.","Still, why did Sixteen turn into Sister White Dragon?","As if seeing through Song Shuhang’s thoughts, Sixteen explained, “Sister White Dragon discovered that this mask is very powerful, and it doesn’t only have the ability to change one’s appearance. When she disguised herself as me, she felt that the process was the same as when she used the dragon race’s natural ability to transform into a human. So, she asked me to try to disguise myself as her to see if I would gain anything from it.”","Song Shuhang nodded and asked, “Did it have any effect?”","Sixteen replied, “Yes, it was quite effective.”","When she transformed into Sister White Dragon, she felt as if her body had become that of a dragon.","Every scale on her body, and even her dragon claws and dragon tail, felt exceedingly real.","It was as if she had really transformed into a dragon.","Sixteen was currently activating her true dragon bloodline, and her body was in the stage of transforming into a dragon.","After using Immortal Master Silver Trigram’s mask, her understanding of the process increased considerably. Moreover, the true dragon bloodline in her body seemed to have been stimulated and became very active.","Affected by this, the spiritual energy in Sixteen’s body started increasing.","In addition, Sister White Dragon released the seal suppressing Sixteen’s power, so her strength began to rise quickly.","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “That’s great then.”","He just felt a little bit regretful.","Sister White Dragon, who currently looked like Sixteen, could see through his thoughts at a glance, so she said through voice transmission, “If you’re feeling regretful, then go ahead and flirt with Sixteen again. With your steel face that even the heavenly tribulation can’t tear apart, what are you afraid of? Also, it’s not just you who feels that it’s a pity. If you look closely, you’ll be able to see that little Sixteen’s dragon scales are quivering slightly. That’s a sign that she’s also feeling some regret right now.”","Song Shuhang rolled his eyes.","Sixteen currently looks like you, Sister White Dragon. How can I make a move?","At this time, Senior Divine Dragon said, “This disguise is really commendable.”","It had cast a true sight magical technique of the dragon race, and its eyes were shining brightly","In addition, it had special authority as Garre Holy Mountain’s trial officer. In order to prevent anyone from sneaking into the trail grounds, its position gave it the power to see through things such as illusions and disguises.","But now, even with its authority and the magical technique guaranteeing it true sight, it could not see through the disguises of Sixteen and White Dragon.","It felt as if the two of them had really swapped bodies. Rather than a disguise, it looked more similar to a monster cultivator’s ability to transform into a human after the Fifth Stage.","After the Fifth Stage, whether it was their monster form or their human form, both were a part of their true bodies. For this reason, they could freely choose to appear in their monster or human form when they became a Profound Sage and had to deliver their Profound Sage Speech.","The divine dragon recounted what it saw and its guesses.","Sister White Dragon translated its words.","“After changing your appearance, it feels as if even your body has changed...” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and pondered.","If he really gained the ability to change his appearance like Fifth Stage monster cultivators... When he advanced to the Eighth Stage in the future, could he use this mask to change his appearance into one that was highly attractive?","The thought alone made him feel excited.","However, he quickly shook his head.","Dreams are meant for the night. How can a mask possibly deceive the heavenly tribulation?","“Fwoo~”","At this time, the energy that Demon Emperor Hezhi was sending over through his clone finally dried up.","In the next moment, six dragon pearls floated above Song Shuhang’s head.","They circled around him as if saying goodbye and went back to their owners.","The Almighty Merchant leaned over and asked, “Where’s the dragon pearl I lent you?”"]},{"number":2087,"title":"Chapter 2087 Prolonged illness can make a doctor out of a patient","paragraphs":["2087 Prolonged illness can make a doctor out of a patient","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “Senior Almighty Merchant, don’t worry. The dragon pearl isn’t running away.”","That dragon pearl is Senior White Two’s, so there’s really nothing to worry about.","Song Shuhang waved his hand, and the six dragon pearls floating beside him headed back to their respective homes, returning to Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, Senior Divine Dragon, Striped Dragon Two’s Son, Lady Kunna, and Senior White respectively.","Since Senior White had gone off to some secret realm, the mirage dragon pearl was temporarily kept by Song Shuhang.","!!","Striped Dragon Two’s Son’s and Lady Kunna’s dragon pearls, under the traction of their owners’ powers, broke through the locked space and disappeared.","Seeing this scene, Senior Divine Dragon’s claws trembled a little.","It was unknown where it had gotten a bottle of pills, but it popped the bottle open and threw two pills into its mouth.","As it swallowed the pills, its dragon pearl also returned, so it ended up swallowing its dragon pearl and the pills at the same time.","The divine dragon was left speechless.","The feeling this produced was similar to when one accidentally stuffed too much food into one’s mouth; it felt very uncomfortable.","Sister White Dragon, who currently looked like Sixteen, gracefully received her dragon pearl. She then used her left hand to cover her mouth and swallowed the dragon pearl back into her body.","Her actions were graceful and elegant.","Despite having Sixteen’s petite figure, every one of Sister White Dragon’s moves just gave off a mature vibe.","This discordant feeling carried an unexpected sense of beauty.","Song Shuhang tried looking from several angles, but he could not see how Sister White Dragon had swallowed the dragon pearl.","Did she swallow it, or did she keep it in her mouth?","He turned his head to look at Sixteen, but she had already returned her dragon pearl inside her body, so he didn’t get to see anything.","After recovering her dragon pearl, Sixteen’s aura increased even further, and lightning flashed on the dragon horns above her head.","Right now, she was on the verge of ascending to the Fifth Stage. The immortal bones that needed to be condensed in the Fourth Stage Realm had already been formed with the help of Sister White Dragon, and they were connected to her illusory core.","In fact, Sixteen had long ago reached the point where she was ready to transcend the tribulation, but Sister White Dragon had been suppressing her strength to allow her to have better odds with her dragon patterns.","Sister White Dragon had high expectations of Sixteen, and she was very strict in this regard.","The lowest limit was a golden core with eight dragon patterns, because if the golden core only had seven dragon patterns, then the chances a cultivator had of reaching the Immortal Realm were almost zero.","As for a golden core with eight dragon patterns, there were a few people who had managed to become Immortals with this kind of golden core.","One such example was Demon Emperor Hezhi.","“Is Sixteen about to transcend her heavenly tribulation?” asked Song Shuhang with a frown.","He could almost smell the scent of the heavenly tribulation from Sixteen’s body, something that would happen when the tribulation was about to descend.","In the past half a year, he and Uncle Heavenly Tribulation had met once or twice every month. If we also counted the times he watched other people transcend their heavenly tribulations, the number of times they met was even higher. Thus, Song Shuhang was very familiar with this subject.","Prolonged illness could make a doctor out of a patient.","Similarly, Song Shuhang had become half an expert in transcending the heavenly tribulation as he had been going through the process rather frequently.","The reason he could only be counted as “half an expert” was that his experience could not really be used as too close of a reference by other people. It was only stories about the effects and the might of the heavenly tribulation, as well as the new styles that Uncle Heavenly Tribulation would come up with every month, that could be passed down to his juniors.","Sister White Dragon nodded and said, “Mm-hm, she has endured enough. After so many deadly encounters and hardships, she has met the conditions to aim for nine dragon patterns. Even if she does not get nine dragon patterns, she’s guaranteed at least eight.”","“Is it not a bit too fast?” Song Shuhang asked with some concern.","Although it felt a bit weird when it was him asking this question, he was really worried about Sixteen.","It had been less than half a year since Sixteen had transcended her Fourth Stage heavenly tribulation, so the time she spent in the Fourth Stage was far from being comparable to that of a normal cultivator.","“Not at all,” Sister White Dragon said softly. “In the past, I took Sixteen to a secret place in the Dragon Realm. It was a time-related secret realm where she spent a long time. Because of that, Sixteen’s advancement is merely a matter of course, and there won’t be a backlash. You don’t have to worry.”","In other words, Sixteen had spent a long time practicing during the past six months.","Song Shuhang nodded. He felt at ease knowing this detail.","?????","“Ding~”","At this time, a finger tapped on Song Shuhang’s head, making a tinkling sound.","As Song Shuhang looked up, he saw Senior Almighty Merchant’s tired face.","“Where’s my dragon pearl?” asked Senior Almighty Merchant. He needed that pearl to get the second half of his payment!","“Don’t worry, Senior.” Song Shuhang opened his mouth and spat out Senior White Two’s dragon pearl.","After being spat out, the dragon pearl floated in the air.","The corners of Senior Almighty Merchant’s mouth twitched.","He stretched out his hand to cast a magical technique. The water vapor in the air condensed and wrapped around the dragon pearl, washing it from all directions without missing a single spot.","Song Shuhang said, “Senior, I did not think that you had mysophobia.”","Senior Almighty Merchant rolled his eyes. “If I were to spit out a pearl, would you grab it with your bare hands?”","“Hm, I guess you’re right.” Song Shuhang scratched his head. Previously, he had casually grabbed the dragon pearls that Sixteen and Sister White Dragon spat at him!","The Almighty Merchant held the dragon pearl and looked at it carefully.","When he was in the world of the black lotus, he had not gotten to check the item properly after Little Sun T233 gave it to him. Therefore, he took this chance to carefully inspect the goods.","He was afraid that there might be some flaws in the dragon pearl that would affect his final payment.","“Hmm, it looks okay.” The Almighty Merchant nodded in satisfaction.","He took out a box, carefully grabbed the dragon pearl with a silk handkerchief, and tried placing it inside the box.","Yet, when he tried to move it, the pearl did not budge.","The Almighty Merchant applied more force, but the dragon pearl stayed where it was. It was as if it had been fixed in that point in space, remaining completely motionless.","The Almighty Merchant stared at Song Shuhang.","“I didn’t do anything!” Song Shuhang gestured with his hands. In order to show his innocence, he even took three steps back.","But as he moved back, the dragon pearl followed him.","As far as Song Shuhang retreated, the dragon pearl retreated just as much. It always maintained an arm’s distance from him.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The Almighty Merchant: “...”","“Senior, would you believe me if I said that I really did not do anything to this dragon pearl?” Song Shuhang asked cautiously.","“Yeah, I believe you.” The Almighty Merchant nodded.","Song Shuhang let out a breath of relief.","The Almighty Merchant still understood him pretty well.","The Almighty Merchant continued calmly, “So, when can you return this dragon pearl to me?”","Song Shuhang: “...”","He reached out and grabbed the dragon pearl, placing it in the Almighty Merchant’s box.","This time, the dragon pearl did not resist.","The Almighty Merchant was still worried. After checking it again, he closed the box and stored it away.","“Farewell, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.” The Almighty Merchant waved his hand casually, tearing open the locked space.","“Senior, you said the same thing last time,” Song Shuhang reminded him.","The Almighty Merchant’s footsteps froze. After a while, he disappeared into the void without looking back."]},{"number":2088,"title":"Chapter 2088 The problem has returned to the starting point","paragraphs":["2088 The problem has returned to the starting point","Song Shuhang wanted the Almighty Merchant to stay for a while longer as his intuition told him that he would need his help soon. The main reason was the current state of his physical body.","After being affected by the Heavenly Emperor’s time technique and being flooded with Demon Emperor Hezhi’s peak Tribulation Transcender energy, Song Shuhang felt that there was something wrong with his body, although he could not pinpoint what the exact problem was.","As he had been flirting with Sixteen earlier, he was overcome with excitement, which made him forget his physical discomfort.","But once the awkward situation came to an end and the Almighty Merchant took his leave, he became more aware of his situation.","!!","The first problem was the illusory pain in his limbs.","His body below the neck had been disintegrated, yet he felt as if his missing parts were on fire and being flattened by a steamroller driven by Fairy Dongfang Six.","The pain felt so real that Song Shuhang even had the misconception that his body had grown back.","However, this level of pain was still nothing to him. He had experienced more pain than his peers had eaten rice. He could bear tenfold this kind of pain!","But amidst the sensation of searing flames and the sensation of being crushed by a steamroller, there would be short bursts of pain that came from his waist every twenty or so seconds, and this was the worst pain of them all.","It felt as if someone was kicking his waist violently, with his kidneys and dantians on the verge of exploding due to how powerful the kicks were. It was difficult to bear this severe pain, both mentally and physically.","Besides these sensations of pain, Song Shuhang felt as if his energy was flowing backward.","While using the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?, his energy would suddenly stop or straight-up start flowing backward.","This feeling gave him the urge to vomit blood.","But as he could not vomit blood in his current state, it only left him extremely uncomfortable.","“He’s experiencing cultivation deviation.” At this moment, the strand of hair on top of Song Shuhang’s head said aloud.","It was Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair.","At this time, her voice was very weak, as if it could get cut off at any moment.","When the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation built the great filter, this strand of Pavilion Master Chu’s hair had also contributed.","Due to them being in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds and the Inner World being partially blocked off, she could not rely on the energy of her main body. Because of that, after the energy in this strand of hair was exhausted, she had no way of recovering, which left her in a weakened state.","Sister White Dragon, who currently looked like Sixteen, said slowly, “These are the after-effects.”","She took a step forward and placed her hand on Song Shuhang’s body, using a mental magical technique to relieve Song Shuhang of some of the pain he was feeling at the moment.","Song Shuhang asked with a wry smile, “Is it because of the energy that Demon Emperor Hezhi gifted me?”","He was no longer as ignorant as he once was when it came to matters regarding cultivation.","When Pavilion Master Chu and Sister White Dragon said what they said, he immediately understood the reason behind what was happening to him.","When he condensed the Nascent Soul Fetuses, he used a lot of Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy. Due to time constraints, Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy was used directly, with barely any refinement.","While using this method, there would naturally be some troubles left behind.","The illusory pain and inconsistent flow of energy in his body were probably just the start of what he would have to face.","If these problems were not resolved with haste, his condition would only become worse.","Song Shuhang asked, “Seniors, do you know how I can solve this problem?”","“Actually, Senior White and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword discussed this matter when you were practicing earlier,” the black-skinned Soft Feather said. “At that time, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword came up with a possible solution. After dying once, you should be able to resolve all the issues.”","“Don’t talk about something as horrible as death!” Song Shuhang said, feeling tired.","The black-skinned Soft Feather smiled and said, “Mm-hm, I thought so too. That’s why I seriously protested Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s proposal.”","However, her smiling little face soon scrunched up. “As a result, I was severely reprimanded by Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword. It said in its adorable voice that I’m unworthy of being an inner demon.”","Song Shuhang gritted his teeth and said, “...When Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword comes back, I will show it what a real inner demon is. I’ll make sure it gets a little inner demon of its own!”","Sister White Dragon did not forget to translate everyone’s words.","When it heard the translation of what the others were saying, the corners of the divine dragon’s mouth twitched.","“Aside from dying, were there any other suggestions?” Song Shuhang asked expectantly.","At the same time, he felt as if someone had kicked his abdomen area again, and the pain was only getting worse.","The intensity had gone from violent kicks to someone jumping on his abdomen.","If this continued, the intensity would soon jump to someone dancing on his abdomen and then directly to graveyard dancing.","“Shuhang, you should tell us about your symptoms first. That way, the seniors will be able to better understand your current situation and come up with a suitable solution.” Sixteen, who currently looked like Sister White Dragon, flew over to Song Shuhang’s side and used her sharp claws to gently trim the overgrown branches on his body.","“Summing them up, I feel illusory pain in my limbs, and then my energy is flowing backward, and...” Song Shuhang began to briefly describe his state.","Sister White Dragon translated his words.","Senior Divine Dragon was still baffled as there were a lot of technical terms in Song Shuhang’s description.","For example, the feeling of being steamrolled by Fairy Dongfang Six and then the whole graveyard dancing thing.","It sounded like an incurable illness.","“Only those two?” Pavilion Master Chu asked weakly.","Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “For the time being, yes.”","Sister White Dragon said, “The illusory pain in your limbs should be a spiritual backlash.”","Pavilion Master Chu added, “The reverse-flowing of your energy is a physical backlash, but as it was suppressed by the blood of the Scholarly Sage, it should not be able to cause a big mess.”","The Scholarly Sage’s blood really was a wonderful item.","If it had not helped suppress the adverse reaction, Song Shuhang’s body would have probably been sent into utter chaos by the sudden reflux of energy.","“Overall, things are better than we expected,” Sister White Dragon said. “As for a solution, it would probably be fine to go into seclusion. You should close up and carefully refine all the energy that originally belonged to Demon Emperor Hezhi. You must convert it into energy that is truly your own. Once you do that, the flow of energy should return to its natural state.”","“As for the spiritual backlash, it can only be overcome through your will,” said Pavilion Master Chu.","“There is still another solution as well, and that is to make your body stronger. As long as the strength of your body increases, you can forcefully suppress and control the flow of energy,” the divine dragon said slowly. “So, the problem has gone full circle and returned to the starting point.”","The General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? seemed to be summoning Shuhang."]},{"number":2089,"title":"Chapter 2089 Oh no, this feels like a... heart attack!","paragraphs":["2089 Oh no, this feels like a... heart attack!","Song Shuhang nodded. “I see, the final chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?... That’s what I came here for, and now I need it more than ever.”","He then looked at Senior Divine Dragon. “Senior, how many tests are still left to complete the trial of Garre Holy Mountain?”","Since he was a temporary trial officer, he could probably get some inside information, right? He wanted to go all out and get through the final trial as quickly as possible!","Sister White Dragon translated his words with a deadpan expression on her face.","Senior Divine Dragon replied, “There are still several tests left, and they are not easy. About 60% of the trial takers who got my acknowledgement will be eliminated during those tests. However, those few tests are not very meaningful to you.”","Although it had not been in contact with Song Shuhang for that long, its worldview had been greatly impacted during this short period of time.","Shuhang had seven small dantians, each pregnant with a Nascent Soul Fetus, and he managed to endure peak Tribulation-Transcender-level energy invading his body. Other than that, his light of virtue was very pretty and had a consciousness of her own, and he had countless helpers.","When it was time to borrow dragon pearls, Tyrannical Song easily found a large number of powerful big shots that could ignore the locked space of Garre Holy Mountain and remotely deliver him dragon pearls.","With the level he was at, placing him in the same trial space as the others would be akin to bullying!","How much pressure would the other trial takers feel if he was with them?","As a trial officer of Garre Holy Mountain, it had to take into consideration the future of the cultivators of the Beast Realm. For this reason, the divine dragon felt that it was necessary for it to use its recommendation quota to send Tyrannical Song directly to the finish line, lest he rend the hearts of the other trial takers.","With Tyrannical Song’s heart-rending ability, there was virtually nobody in the universe who would not have their hearts turned into a sieve.","For each trial, the divine dragon had four quotas it could use to send the participants of the trial to the final point.","However, these quotas had been rotting in its claws all this time, and even the beast cultivators participating in the current trial did not know that the divine dragon had such quotas that it could use.","Senior Divine Dragon said slowly, “I’ll send you to the gate of the General Principles Inheritance Land. As for whether or not you can open that gate and enter the Inheritance Land, that depends on your fate.”","“An internal channel for employees?” After listening to Sister White Dragon’s translation, Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","Heh, this is the benefit of being a temporary worker!","The divine dragon rolled its eyes.","What are you even saying? I’m just using my recommendation quota.","However, it was too lazy to explain.","Because if it were to explain the recommendation quotas, it might also end up having to explain why it wanted to give Profound Sage Tyrannical Song one of the quotas. If its explanation was not good, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song might think that there was some sort of friendship between them, and he might try to get more benefits from the divine dragon. The divine dragon would then have to explain again to clear the misunderstanding. Was that not very troublesome? As such, it opted to keep its mouth shut.","The divine dragon nodded and said, “Yes, it’s something of the sort.”","Song Shuhang was overjoyed when he heard the explanation. “If it’s an internal channel for employees, can Sister White Dragon also use it? She worked with me and Senior White earlier, so she can also be considered a temporary employee, right?”","Sister White Dragon was now practically one with Sixteen, and if she were allowed through, Sixteen would naturally also be allowed through.","The divine dragon’s little claws froze.","Did he still end up trying to get more benefits from me?","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is worthy of being a self-proclaimed “bug that’s difficult to crush,” he’s truly difficult to deal with.","“Fine, I’ve got enough quotas anyway.” The divine dragon groaned tiredly. “They can also use the employee channel. I will send you all there in one go.”","Song Shuhang looked at Senior Divine Dragon gratefully. He felt that the seed of friendship was sprouting between him and Senior Divine Dragon.","Senior Divine Dragon’s personality made him a good friend candidate.","“Let’s get ready. We’re going to the final area.” Song Shuhang carefully put away the branches pruned by Sixteen. It was time for him to bid farewell to his wooden body and reconstruct his body of flesh!","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Senior Song, shouldn’t we wait for Senior White?”","Sixteen said, “Right, where did Senior White go?”","Song Shuhang shook his head, expressing that he had no idea.","“When Fellow Daoist White returns, I’ll send him directly to the final area,” said the divine dragon.","“Alright.” Song Shuhang cupped his fists at the Senior Divine Dragon. “Then, we’ll be troubling Senior Divine Dragon one last time.”","“It’s but the lifting of a claw.” The divine dragon stretched its body and a light wheel materialized.","The light wheel rotated, releasing colorful rays of light before finally turning into a spatial gate.","“By the way, Senior Divine Dragon...” Before leaving, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and summoned his QR code Golden Core Composition, which then floated in front of Senior Divine Dragon.","Now that a seed of friendship had been planted, this precious friendship should be watered in hopes of allowing it to grow.","“What’s this?” The divine dragon curiously scanned the QR code with its mental energy.","This was a common mistake that practitioners all over the universe made. Whenever they encountered something unfamiliar, they would either try injecting spiritual energy into it or use mental energy to scan it.","The divine dragon was no exception.","After its mental energy swept over the QR code, a notification popped up.","[Beep~ You have added “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song” as a friend.]","This text did not need to be translated because it had appeared in the divine dragon’s mind.","The divine dragon: “???”","What the...?","Since when did I become friends with Tyrannical Song?","[Beep~ You have been moved into Tyrannical Song’s new friend group, VIP Big Shot Group. Beep~ Tyrannical Song has given you the nickname “Seven Dragon Balls1.”]","The divine dragon grabbed its chest with its small claw.","The word “friend” gave it a familiar and unfamiliar feeling, and there was also the nickname Seven Dragon Pearls.","N-not good, my heart seems to be beating a little faster...","This feels like a... heart attack!","No, that isn’t it.","It isn’t a heart attack!","A heart attack wouldn’t be this intense.","This feeling... My heart is getting rent!","What it was afraid of the most ended up happening.","If they met again in the future, it would definitely press Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to the ground with its paws and not even give him a chance to speak. At that time, it would show him the terror of Seven Dragon Balls.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","In the meantime, the black-skinned Soft Feather and Sister White Dragon had returned to the bodies of their humans.","Song Shuhang and Sixteen stepped into the colorful channel, which turned out to be a deep well rather than a road.","The two fell all the way to the bottom.","Song Shuhang nervously held Sixteen’s little paw.","“Are you doing fine?” Sixteen asked with a smile. She knew that Song Shuhang had a fear of heights and speed.","Her dragon tail wrapped around Song Shuhang’s waist.","“I’m fine,” Song Shuhang said stubbornly. “Anyway, I just remembered that the puppy I tied outside the trial area has not been freed yet.”"]},{"number":2090,"title":"Chapter 2090 I finally have access to this feature!","paragraphs":["2090 I finally have access to this feature!","After being launched toward the golden moon from Garre Holy Mountain, Song Shuhang captured a dog-looking monster.","Since the monster’s body structure very much resembled that of an inner demon, Song Shuhang became curious about it. He caught the dog-looking monster to see if he could take it back home and raise it.","Song Shuhang had tied the dog-looking monster outside Senior Divine Dragon’s trial area, and the poor thing was probably still there.","Sixteen smiled and said, “Just remember to take it with you when you go back.”","!!","“I guess that’s what I’ll do.” Song Shuhang nodded. While chatting with Sixteen, he diverted some of his attention to deal with his symptoms.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair suddenly asked, “Have there been any changes with your symptoms?”","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “It’s still the same. My abdomen hurts a lot.”","“Mm-hm.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair responded while seemingly deep in thought.","Previously, she had been thinking about Song Shuhang’s symptoms, which resulted from Demon Emperor Hezhi transferring his energy to Song Shuhang. In hindsight, wasn’t what he was experiencing a bit like the morning sickness after pregnancy?","Song Shuhang said, “Senior Chu, why am I getting the feeling that your strand of hair is thinking of something malicious?”","“You’re just overthinking,” said Pavilion Master Chu emotionlessly. “Perhaps your symptoms are not as serious as we imagined.”","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","“From the onset of the sequelae until now, your symptoms have hardly worsened. I’ve thought of a possible reason for this,” Pavilion Master Chu continued. “It might be related to the Heavenly Emperor’s time technique.”","Under the effects of the time technique, Song Shuhang’s body and cultivation system contained in the Scholarly Sage’s blood experienced an accelerated passage of time, which was equivalent to long-term seclusion.","Perhaps this was the reason the symptoms that Song Shuhang was experiencing were so mild.","Song Shuhang asked, “Does that mean I should thank her?”","“Even if you’re grateful, don’t worry about it,” said Pavilion Master Chu. After all, she and the Heavenly Emperor were in opposing camps.","?????","The humanoid Sister White Dragon popped up and said, “We’re here.”","In the past, it would always seem as if a dragon was growing on Sixteen’s body. Now, it seemed as if a human was growing on Sixteen’s dragon body.","“Got it.” Song Shuhang stepped into the air.","Black lotus flowers emerged underneath his feet, supporting his figure.","Song Shuhang and Sixteen landed smoothly, and the colorful spatial passage above their heads disappeared.","The place where they landed was dark. It felt like being thrown into a small black room, which sounded particularly depressing.","This was how most trial grounds looked like.","However, when Song Shuhang and Sixteen touched the ground, the surroundings lit up as if the lights had been turned on.","“Is it an immortal boat?” Song Shuhang looked at his feet.","At this time, he and Sixteen were standing on an ancient-looking, gigantic immortal boat. In front of them was a large gate that led inside the immortal boat.","Is this the Inheritance Land of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique??","Song Shuhang could not help but feel surprised as he believed that the inheritance land would be located inside a huge cave or an independent secret realm.","“Go in,” Pavilion Master Chu said. She was also a little curious about what the Inheritance Land of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? looked like.","Song Shuhang reached out and pressed his hand against the gate, trying to push it open.","Layers of crimson warning runes appeared on the gate, forming a barrier that blocked Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang said, “It seems it won’t be easy to go in, huh?”","Beside him, Sixteen made a guess and said, “Could it have something to do with the ‘mark’ stamped onto our hands by Fairy Blue Phoenix?”","She was referring to the quota mark that allowed them to participate in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial.","Song Shuhang recalled and said, “Oh, I remember that mark. It was stamped on my face.”","And so, he moved his face closer to the gate of the immortal boat.","“Beep~”","A pleasant electronic sound that hinted that something had been unlocked echoed. At the same time, the red runes disappeared.","Song Shuhang gave Sixteen a thumbs up.","Then, he tilted his head slightly, assumed a good posture, and stretched out his hand to push the gate again. He was preparing to enter the immortal boat dashingly.","After the first push...","The large gate remained motionless.","After the second push...","The gate still did not give Profound Sage Tyrannical Song any face.","This feels rather familiar...","Isn’t this similar to when the Almighty Merchant was trying to move the dragon pearl a while ago?","Since when did retribution come so quickly?","But wait, I didn’t do anything to the dragon pearl, so why am I even receiving retribution?!","“Let me try.” Sixteen moved over and used her dragon claws to help Shuhang push the gate.","The two worked hard, but the gate to the immortal boat did not budge.","Song Shuhang looked at the gigantic immortal boat with a stifled heart. How shameless! Do you think I won’t dare to move you into the Inner World and take you away?!","“I remember Fellow Daoist Divine Dragon saying that if you are not fated, then you won’t be able to go through the gate to the inheritance land.” Sister White Dragon’s voice sounded in their ears.","Pavilion Master Chu also reminded, “Maybe you’re using the wrong approach, and you have to recite or chant something first.”","Song Shuhang said, “I’ll try asking Senior Divine Dragon.”","He opened the member list of the Cultivation chat group and found the newly added “Seven Dragon Balls”.","“Is there a messaging function somewhere?” Song Shuhang tried to issue a command in the group.","Demon Emperor Hezhi even managed to post a story, so something as basic as a messaging feature should not be missing.","?????","After a while, Song Shuhang gave up on the idea of finding how to send text messages and moved on to the next best thing.","“Can I remotely transfer 1 point of energy to Senior Divine Dragon?” Song Shuhang issued another command.","This time, the QR code Golden Core Composition immediately executed the order.","[Beep~ Remotely transferring energy to Seven Dragon Balls. Do you want to add a postscript? Y/N.]","“Hahaha, I finally have access to this feature as well!” Song Shuhang was elated.","[Beep~ Sent successfully.]","Song Shuhang was taken aback. Sent successfully?","What was sent successfully?","Wait!","What exactly was sent just now?! Undo, undo!!!","?????","Senior Divine Dragon was hovering in the air, listening to the broadcast of the various Profound Sage Speeches.","It had woken up not too long ago, and it began watching the Profound Sage Speeches starting from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s.","The speed at which Senior Divine Dragon watched the broadcast was very fast.","Big shots at its realm, even if they were in an abnormal state, were very different from ordinary cultivators. While watching the broadcast, it could do so at ten times the speed.","After all, it needed just a glance to determine if a Profound Sage Speech was interesting or not, and there were not many Profound Sage Speeches that could be useful to a powerhouse at its level.","Soon, Senior Divine Dragon finished watching the first seven Profound Sage Speeches."]},{"number":2091,"title":"Chapter 2091 Tyrannical Song, you’ve got no conscience","paragraphs":["2091 Tyrannical Song, you’ve got no conscience","“Interesting, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is actually the first Sage in a thousand years.” Senior Divine Dragon finished watching the first seven Profound Sage Speeches and clicked on the eighth one.","For the divine dragon, there were not many outstanding speeches among the seven it watched. After all, those who held Profound Sage Speeches were newly-ascended Profound Sages, so their realm and worldview limited the depth of their speech.","In fact, even those who were favored by the heavens might not be able to deliver an extraordinary Profound Sage Speech.","“However, Tyrannical Song’s speech wasn’t bad.” The divine dragon was certain that someone had given Tyrannical Song a manuscript for his speech.","!!","That lecture was about the widely circulated ?Daoist Canon?, but its content was of a very high level. The manuscript was, without a doubt, of the Immortal level. Unfortunately, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s eloquence and realm were not high enough, so he failed to explain things perfectly.","I hope I can get the opportunity to see the original manuscript one day.","The speech related to Buddhism delivered by the second Sage in a thousand years, Palace Master Seven lives Talisman, was also interesting.","As for the speech of the sixth Sage in a thousand years, Sage White, it was simply exemplary. Sage White was full of secrets, and even the divine dragon could not see through him. It could only give him a high score for his speech.","The rest had basically managed to reach the passing line. The one that surprised the divine dragon the most was probably the third Sage in a thousand years, who used the opportunity to make a confession. This had nearly caused the divine dragon’s old waist to get a cramp.","It found the thoughts of the younger generation to be truly incomprehensible.","?????","“Onto the eighth one. Besides Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who is a fake, how come there have been so many people who have ascended to the Profound Sage Realm recently?” Senior Divine Dragon mused.","In the past thousand years, there had not even been a single new Eighth Stage Profound Sage, yet this year alone, they were emerging in batches.","Sure enough, the world is about to welcome a huge change...","As the saying goes, heroes appear in troubled times, and in the same way, geniuses would come out one after the other when the world welcomes drastic changes.","The new age was before them.","While it was in thought, the divine dragon began watching the eighth speech.","“It’s Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar’s speech. This one seems to be Tyrannical Song too...” the divine dragon murmured.","But isn’t “Demon Sage” the Sage Name reserved for creatures of the Netherworld Realm?","Since when did the Netherworld Realm’s Divinity Show start being shown in the main world as well? Could it be that the main world and the Netherworld Realm have reached a consensus and entered a state of mutual exchange and cooperation?","Just what exactly happened to the outside world while I was asleep?","With complicated emotions, the divine dragon began to watch the Demon Sage Speech.","Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar’s speech was on inner demons.","The early portion was satisfactory; there weren’t any especially bright portions but no mistakes either.","Senior Divine Dragon began to look a little sleepy.","And so, it started playing the broadcast at ten times the speed.","Suddenly, it heard a beep. The divine dragon had received a message in its mind.","[Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Hahaha, I finally have access to this feature as well!]","Similar to the last time, the prompt that sounded directly in the divine dragon’s mind came with its own translation.","The divine dragon was stunned.","What is the meaning of this? Is this spam?","I just got added as a friend and then got this message out of nowhere. Is this a show of force?","In a while, it would study this function to see if it could block Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Every time it thought of Tyrannical Song, the divine dragon was reminded of its wounded heart.","Therefore, it did not respond to Song Shuhang’s harassing text message and shifted its attention back to the Demon Sage Speech.","Due to the increased speed, during the short time it was distracted, a large section of the speech had been skipped.","It seemed as if the speech had derailed, because Tyrannical Song was longer delivering a speech on inner demons but had changed to another subject.","“What is filial piety?”","“What is love?” The voice of Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar directly asked the spectators.","It was as if Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar’s temperament had changed. He looked more like a scholar now.","“Interesting, he actually changed scripts midway...” Senior Divine Dragon suddenly became interested.","In the next moment...","“Do you know the greatness of maternal love?” The voice of Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar penetrated into the viewers’ minds and captured their hearts.","“Look into my eyes!” Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar shouted.","At this moment, it was as if the Scholarly Sage had returned to life. Shuhang’s whole person was filled with supreme majesty.","The divine dragon could not help but shift its gaze to stare at Tyrannical Scholar’s eyes.","Then, it saw a strange light, and the mighty power within the light affected it through the broadcast of the Demon Sage Speech.","The divine dragon’s realm was very high, and even Sister White Dragon did not dare to underestimate it as it was very likely an Immortal.","However, its state of existence was special, and this was something that the divine dragon itself had mentioned to Song Shuhang.","And so, because of the restrictions and limitations brought about by its current state, it got hit by the strange light.","The Expert’s Appraisal Technique of the Sage’s eye traversed time and space and landed on the divine dragon’s body, giving it an unforgettable experience.","When the technique took effect, the divine dragon understood why the Immortal from the Beast Realm who challenged the Scholarly Sage in the ancient era had come back crying.","It also wanted to cry now.","At the same time, it remembered the message from Tyrannical Song that spoke of having gained access to a certain feature.","Is this the damned feature that Tyrannical Song was talking about?","[Beep~ Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Senior, I was just testing things earlier. Now I’ve got the gist of it, so everything is okay. Anyway, I’ve got a question to ask you, is there any chant needed to open the gate that leads to the General Principles Inheritance Land? Or is there some specific posture I need to assume when opening the gate?]","The divine dragon’s body trembled in anger.","?????","In front of the inheritance gate on the gigantic immortal boat.","“I’ve successfully sent the message to Senior Divine Dragon. I wonder if it can read what I wrote. Does the post-scriptum feature have a translation function?” Song Shuhang was still a little nervous.","“Beep~”","At this time, a familiar sound echoed in his mind.","Song Shuhang said, “Here it is. Senior Divine Dragon replied.”","[“Seven Dragon Balls” Divine Dragon has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Get lost! You’ve got no conscience!]","Song Shuhang was stunned.","What did I do?","When did I offend Senior Divine Dragon?","Why did it say that I’ve got no conscience?","Did someone pretend to be me and provoke Senior Divine Dragon?","Sixteen asked, “Did you get an answer?”","Song Shuhang shook his head.","Pavilion Master Chu suggested, “How about we break in?”","“Let’s not rush. Let me consult another senior.” With a thought, Song Shuhang brought up Senior White Two on his friend list.","[Close Friend] Senior White Two.","Before the “Close Friend” part, there seemed to be some other writing, but it had been crossed out, so it was difficult to read.","In the same way, Song Shuhang sent a postscript. [Senior White, are you free? I’m about to enter the inheritance land of Garre Holy Mountain, but I’m blocked by a gate. Do you have any idea how I can open this gate?]","Senior White Two replied quickly. [Try using the chant to retrieve my stone tablet.]","The chant to retrieve the stone tablet?","Is the stone tablet inside this immortal boat?","Song Shuhang followed Senior White Two’s instructions and performed the secret technique.","As soon as he cast the technique, he felt something being pulled away from under his feet.","In the next moment, a thunderous boom sounded.","The immortal boat related to the “General Principles Inheritance” had exploded.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”"]},{"number":2092,"title":"Chapter 2092 Dragon Ape’s eye VS Sage’s eye","paragraphs":["2092 Dragon Ape’s eye VS Sage’s eye","When the gigantic immortal boat exploded, the stone tablet that had been drawn over in response to Song Shuhang’s casting of the technique also lost connection with him.","Director, there’s something wrong with the script!","I just wanted to open the gate, and I did not think that the whole immortal boat would explode. I’m not a member of an explosives demolition team. I’m a pacifist! I’ve never thought of resorting to explosions to resolve problems!","Song Shuhang, who yearned for peace with all his heart, looked up at the sky.","He didn’t have a heart at the moment, but there were still waves of chills that struck his chest, causing him to feel very cold.","Song Shuhang’s face turned pale when he thought of the value of this immortal boat and the huge sum of money that he would have to pay for blowing it up.","He was not sure how much the boat was worth, but he was certain that it was an astronomical sum that he could not afford to pay.","This time, he was truly done for.","“Rumble~”","After the immortal boat was torn apart, the shock wave spread in all directions, flattening everything in its path.","However, the gate of the immortal boat was still tightly shut; it seemed to be indestructible. Not only it didn’t give Song Shuhang any face, it did not even give face to the explosion that destroyed the immortal boat.","It was as if it disrespected everyone!","The power of the explosion that went their way was completely negated, and the doors of the gate remained unaffected.","Song Shuhang and company, who were standing right in front of the gate, were unharmed.","The black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from Song Shuhang’s shadow and said softly, “Senior Song, the immortal boat that led to the Inheritance Land exploded.”","Song Shuhang felt the illusory pain he was experiencing worsen. His heart, which was not even there, was rent. “I know, Soft Feather.”","Sixteen’s dragon claw patted Shuhang lightly.","“It’s fine, Sixteen. You don’t have to worry about me.” Song Shuhang reached out and patted his cheeks.","Real men dared to look at bloody sights, and they also dared to look at explosions!","Moreover, Shuhang was someone who had gone against the fat ball numerous times, so his mental strength was way out of the ordinary.","He quickly forced himself to calm down.","After calming down, he began to think about how to deal with the problem before his eyes.","It was cowardly to run away, and even if he wanted to, he could not run away.","“Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, Senior Chu... Tell me, could the explosion just now have been an illusion?” Song Shuhang reached out and touched the two doors of the gate.","Under such a violent explosion, the gate remained motionless, which seemed very strange.","Sister White Dragon replied, “It was a real explosion.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair mused, “However, this gate is indeed quite weird.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather nodded and said, “From the experience my main body gained after peeking at Dad’s diary, this immortal boat might be an outer shell to deceive people’s eyes. The real Inheritance Land is probably hidden inside the secret realm behind the gate.”","The outer shell usually served as a trap.","If some trial taker who failed to get past the gate got the wicked idea to break through a window and enter the immortal boat that way, they would fall into the trap.","It was a trick that the older generations of many sects liked to use.","Although the method was old, it was very practical.","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up when he heard this. “In other words, the immortal boat I blew up might not be worth much...”","“Hehehe, even if you were to use your toes to think, you would be able to figure out that there’s no way that’s possible. The value of the immortal boat is definitely beyond your imagination. Let’s not even talk about its historical value, just the size of the immortal boat is enough to increase its price dramatically. The price of a gigantic immortal boat that is nearly a kilometer long would have to be calculated in Ninth Stage spirit stones at the very least.” Sister White Dragon quickly made some calculations for Song Shuhang.","The black-skinned Soft Feather commented, “Senior Song doesn’t have any toes now.”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Song Shuhang’s pale face became even paler, and even the ?Variant Steel Hands Technique? could not conceal how pale his face was at this moment.","“Just be ready to lose a lot of money,” added Pavilion Master Chu. At the same time, she kept paying attention to the now-defunct immortal boat.","The immortal boat had been blown up too thoroughly. There was nothing left of it, not a single trace could be found.","“What do we do now?” The black-skinned Soft Feather looked at Song Shuhang and asked.","Song Shuhang patted his cheeks and raised his head to look at the two doors of the gate in front of him.","For some reason, when the number of spirit stones that he would need to compensate for the damage exceeded his reserves, he no longer felt anything in his heart.","Anyway, the damage is done...","No matter what happens, I’ll have to compensate for the boat.","If he didn’t have the money, he had no choice but to borrow it.","Since he had no other choice, Song Shuhang calmed down.","He gritted his teeth and said, “Since the damage is done, it’s pointless to keep worrying about it.”","Shuhang began making hand seals and performing the technique again, once again attracting over the stone tablet that Senior White Two had left behind.","There was nothing to worry about as the immortal boat was already gone, only its very durable gate was left.","If the stone tablet could break open these two doors of the gate, at least he would have a chance to comprehend the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","That would allow him to cut some of his losses.","After finishing the set of hand seals, Song Shuhang sensed the existence of the stone tablet again.","The stone tablet responded to Shuhang and tried to rise from the abyss again.","Song Shuhang said, “Here it comes! Sixteen, get behind me!”","His wooden body was just large enough to completely cover Sixteen.","As the stone tablet was attracted over again, another boom came from behind the gate.","Since there was no immortal boat to obliterate this time, the loud booms did not stop.","After three full minutes, something finally happened to the gate that refused to give anyone face.","With an ear-piercing and teeth-grinding sound, the gate slowly opened.","The gate did not open inwards or outwards, but like a lifting door, it slowly rose up with a loud squeaking sound...","Song Shuhang: “...”","Sixteen: “...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","They all thought of the same thing.","No matter how much they pushed or pulled the gate before, the gate would not budge. Perhaps it was because they had been opening the gate the wrong way, as it was meant to be pushed or pulled upwards.","“Which bastard designed this gate? Since it’s supposed to go up, why did they add those two doors? Was it to mislead people?” Song Shuhang gnashed his teeth.","The gate moved up fully, revealing something behind it.","A gigantic vertical pupil appeared in front of everyone’s eyes.","Song Shuhang could not help but look toward Sixteen as the vertical pupil reminded him of a dragon’s pupil.","After the dragon pupil opened, it stared at Song Shuhang.","Everyone could sense the “dissatisfaction” of the owner of the huge eye.","From the looks of it, it had been woken up abruptly while asleep.","A terrifying draconic power spread from the eye.","At the same time, a spiral-shaped magical technique seemed to materialize around the dragon pupil, shrouding Song Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “An eye technique?”","The tired Fairy Creation emerged from the top of Song Shuhang’s head. Her little hand caressed Song Shuhang’s eye socket.","Song Shuhang’s right eye also began to flash with a bright light."]},{"number":2093,"title":"Chapter 2093 Look, we are fated now","paragraphs":["2093 Look, we are fated now","The two eyes stared at each other silently.","At this moment, the silence spoke louder than any words.","Although the owner of the dragon eye did not speak, the draconic might emanating from it and the spiraling technique that was taking shape posed an undisguised threat to Song Shuhang—Junior, you disturbed my dreams. Do you want to die?","The Scholarly Sage’s eye in Song Shuhang’s right eye socket flashed with an even more terrifying light—Look directly at my eye, I will allow you to correct your words!","!!","The two eyes, which belonged to existences at the pinnacle of the universe, did not back down as neither wanted to be outdone by the other.","As the vortex around the dragon eye grew larger and larger, the strange light in the Sage’s eye seemed to distort more and more, becoming increasingly terrifying.","This pressure from the two eyes staring at each other was enough to crush ordinary cultivators.","The spiritual energy between heaven and earth started swirling around the two eyes, causing white mist to appear.","Every breath taken in this area consisted of pure spiritual energy, making breathing here extremely enjoyable.","If a young cultivator who had just established their foundation could somehow withstand the pressure, breathing the air here would allow them to experience the same effect that a high-quality body-tempering liquid would provide them.","It would have been amazing if I had access to my Inner World right now, Song Shuhang thought to himself. If he could open his Inner World at this moment, he would be able to bring a large amount of spiritual energy into his world!","While he was in thought, a large number of branches on his wooden body began to grow wildly under the influence of the rich spiritual energy.","Coincidentally, a branch grew in front of the dragon eye.","A bright little flower, which was especially beautiful, bloomed on the branch.","The originally tense atmosphere was shattered by this small bud that had bloomed into a flower.","The dragon eye found itself unable to stare with the same intensity as before.","The strange light in the Sage’s eye in Song Shuhang’s right eye socket also began to dim.","The atmosphere had become rather awkward.","?????","After a while...","“Are you guys the trial takers who have come to comprehend the General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique??” A thunderous voice sounded.","The sentence was in the language of the dragon race, and it was the owner of the dragon eye who had spoken.","It could not just let the atmosphere continue to remain awkward as it was, so it decided to break the silence first.","Now that it had spoken in the language of the dragons, it was time for Sister White Dragon, the translator, to appear.","“Exactly.” Song Shuhang nodded.","“Then, you can leave,” the thunderous voice said.","“Why?” Song Shuhang stared at the dragon eye without showing any sign of weakness. How could he give up so easily after reaching this point?","“Because we do not have fate with one another.” A playful expression flashed in the dragon eye.","“Our meeting is because of fate,” Song Shuhang retorted. “We’ve already met, so how can we say that there is no fate between us?”","Whether there was fate or not, it did not matter to him. He would not willingly leave until he entered the General Principles Inheritance Land!","“That’s what I said back then.” the owner of the dragon eye stared into Song Shuhang’s eyes and said suddenly. “That eye truly makes me reminisce.”","Hearing the sentence translated by Sister White Dragon, Song Shuhang felt a chill in his heart for some reason.","“Even if we have met, we still lack fate with one another. This is something you cannot force.” The dragon eye stared at Song Shuhang. “This is how the Sage responded to me back then. I did not have fate with him my entire life. So, how can you have the face to say that you have fate with me?”","“Are you the Immortal from the Beast Realm who got reduced to tears by the Scholarly Sage?” Song Shuhang blurted out.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","She was reluctant to translate this line.","Song Shuhang had been focusing on rending the hearts of all kinds of big shots, and she could not bring herself to cooperate with him in seeking death.","“Oh? You even know about that?” The owner of the dragon eye chuckled. The language it spoke was still that of the dragon race, but with the effects of a magical technique added to it this time. Even without the translation of Sister White Dragon, everyone could understand what it was saying.","Sister White Dragon was so tired and wanted to leave with Sixteen.","The dragon eye said, “Leave. I won’t hold you accountable for the destruction of the immortal boat, but don’t bother me anymore. We are destined to not have fate with one another throughout our lifetimes.”","After saying that, its eye slowly closed again.","“Senior, wait a moment!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand.","Thoughts raced through his mind.","Before the dragon eye fully closed, Song Shuhang moved his hands in the air, and a huge projection of the QR code Golden Core Composition appeared above his head.","The golden light was very dazzling.","While closing, the dragon eye happened to see this QR code projection.","What’s this? the owner of the dragon eye thought to itself.","Then, out of habit, it used its mental energy to scan the QR code projection.","[Beep~ You have added “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song” as a friend.]","This prompt sounded directly in its mind.","The dragon eye opened wide, staring at Song Shuhang.","What?","I added Profound Sage Tyrannical Song as a friend?","Isn’t Profound Sage Tyrannical Song this annoying little insect before my eyes?","How did I become his friend?","What a joke!","Back then, the Scholarly Sage ruthlessly rejected me, saying that I had no fate with him. Now, this guy who inherited the Scholarly Sage’s eye somehow became my friend?","What has the world come to?","[Beep~ Tyrannical Song has moved you into the “VIP Big Shot Group.” Beep~ Tyrannical Song has changed your nickname to “Fated To Meet No Matter How Far Away.”]","The dragon eye: “...”","“Look, now we are fated,” said Song Shuhang as he moved backward.","A set of tables and chairs automatically jumped out of his magical bracelet.","Song Shuhang took a seat, propped up his chin with both hands, and stared at the dragon eye in an oppressive manner. “We are fated to meet regardless of distance.”","Although my face is not particularly big, it’s very tough, and even the Heavenly Punishment cannot destroy it! When faced with such a tough face, your words are of no use!","The owner of the dragon eye was speechless.","What the hell is with this type of fate?!","Just as it was about to refute Song Shuhang, a long list of information on the friend group appeared in its mind.","Group name: [Cultivation].","There was an especially complex network of friend lists in this group.","And in the “VIP Big Shot Group” that it was in, there were only two people for the time being.","The other one was the divine dragon, the trial officer of the Golden Moon World who was nicknamed “Seven Dragon Balls.”","“Hehehe.” The dragon eye glanced at Song Shuhang. “Since there is a function to add friends, there should also be a function to delete friends.”","“Unfortunately, the function of deleting friends is not enabled for the time being,” Song Shuhang replied calmly.","Then, he thought to himself. At most, there is the blacklist function.","The dragon eye stared at Song Shuhang firmly.","Song Shuhang stared back at it without showing any sign of weakness.","The situation seemed to have returned to its original state.","“Fine, you win.” The dragon eye sighed and added, “You’re lucky that I’m the one presiding over the last round of this trial. If it were another trial officer, you would have long been thrown out of Garre Holy Mountain’s trial.”","“Well, we are fated, Senior.” Song Shuhang showed a bright smile. He wanted to take as much advantage as possible of this opportunity.","“Bah.” The dragon eye said coldly, “When you leave, remember to settle the bill for destroying the immortal boat.”"]},{"number":2094,"title":"Chapter 2094 I’m not Slow-Witted Song","paragraphs":["2094 I’m not Slow-Witted Song","Song Shuhang was taken aback. “Senior, didn’t you say that you wouldn’t hold me accountable for that?”","“Yes, but only if you had gotten lost.” The voice of the dragon eye’s owner resounded like thunder. You want to enter the General Principles Inheritance Land, yet you still want to be forgiven for what you did? How can there be such a good deal in this world?","Song Shuhang subconsciously said, “Then, what if I were to leave now?”","“Oh, so now you want to leave? Hah, it’s too late for that!” There was a hint of joy in its voice.","When I told you to get lost, you did not leave.","Heh, no way I’m letting you go now!","“Aren’t you curious to see me roll away? I can do so very handsomely,” said Song Shuhang. He could roll fancifully all the way to the General Principles Inheritance Land if there was a need.","The dragon eye blinked slightly. From Song Shuhang and the others’ perspective, the two “doors” of the gate moved up and down swiftly.","“Just stop talking and get in already.” The thunderous voice sounded again.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang and Sixteen were sucked into the vortex that had originated from the dragon eye.","The vortex was the passage that led to the General Principles Inheritance Land.","When he was sucked into the vortex, the new branch that had grown on Song Shuhang’s body broke apart. The small flower on the branches swayed in the air, looking very beautiful.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","“I’m finally in.” Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief.","After reaching Garre Holy Mountain, he experienced numerous twists and turns, and even ended up owing a huge debt. However, in the end, he finally entered the General Principles Inheritance Land of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","Sister White Dragon said slowly, “As long as you can comprehend the technique, this trip would’ve been worth it.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather added, “But if Senior Song fails to comprehend it, he will not only have wasted time, but also ended up owing a huge debt of Ninth Stage spirit stones.”","“I know, Soft Feather... You don’t have to say it. Don’t mention it anymore.” Song Shuhang felt the illusory pain grip his heart again.","It was only at times like this that he remembered that the black-skinned Soft Feather was an inner demon. She was very efficient when it came to rend other people’s hearts.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair asked, “How do you plan to comprehend this General Principles Inheritance Chapter? Are you certain you’ll be able to?”","The General Principles Inheritance Land looked like a world made of crystals.","The ground was covered in clusters of large crystals, and crystals of various colors grew all over the walls and the ceiling. The scenery was very beautiful, and the place looked like it could definitely sell as a tourist attraction.","“I do have some confidence in this regard,” Song Shuhang said with a nod. With a cheat-like ability like the secret appraisal technique, the chances of him being able to comprehend the General Principles Chapter was much higher than ordinary trial takers.","“The secret of the inheritance should be in these crystals, right?” said Sister White Dragon. She had prepared a similar inheritance in the past.","“I’ll take a look.” Song Shuhang’s long hair gathered to form a palm.","He did not waste any more time and immediately activated the secret appraisal technique to collect clues.","The palm pressed against the crystals, and the secret appraisal technique was activated. The price he paid was very small, merely costing him a small cut on his face.","Just as the wound appeared, it was quickly healed by Song Shuhang’s powerful self-healing ability.","Soon, the result of the appraisal emerged in Song Shuhang’s mind.","[Inheritance crystals of the Beast Realm’s Garre Holy Mountain. Arrange the crystals in the correct order to reap a satisfactory harvest.]","“It seems I need to arrange these crystals in the correct order...” Song Shuhang stared at the large number of crystals before him, cold sweat emerging all over his body.","How am I supposed to arrange them?","What’s the correct order?","“The number of crystals here is probably close to a hundred thousand, no?” Sister White Dragon’s mental energy scanned the area and made a rough estimate of the number of crystals present.","If these crystals were to be arranged piece by piece, it would undoubtedly take a long time.","Song Shuhang said, “There must be some trick to it.”","Sixteen squatted down and started studying the crystals.","After some thought, Shuhang tried to project his QR Code Golden Core Composition.","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “What are you doing? Are you addicted to adding people as friends?”","Song Shuhang said, “I want to see if these inheritance crystals have a mind of their own. If they’re conscious, maybe they can add me as a friend.”","After adding someone as a friend, everything became negotiable.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “The problem is, how do you determine if they have a mind of their own? They are crystals, and if they don’t want to speak, they simply need to keep still and nobody would be able to see through them.”","At this time, Sixteen said, “Shuhang, how about you try using the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique??”","If these crystals had a consciousness, maybe they would appreciate the massage of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.","“Sixteen, our minds are truly alike.” Song Shuhang smiled slightly.","His hair spread out and formed 20 arms, with each arm pressing on a crystal cluster nearby.","The light of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? shone brightly in the inheritance land.","“Buzz~”","The crystal clusters touched by the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? began to sparkle, and they made a sound similar to the cry of a saber.","At the same time, the sparkling seemed to be contagious. With Song Shuhang at the center, the sparkling light began to spread in all directions.","Soon, the near one hundred thousand crystals were all shining.","It was a beautiful scene.","Sister White Dragon said, “The ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? is simply unfathomable.”","Song Shuhang suddenly said, “No, Sister White Dragon, this isn’t the doing of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?.”","As he was speaking, 108 holy ape projections appeared above his head.","After the holy ape projections appeared, the crystals became even brighter.","“In fact, all that’s needed to activate these clusters of crystals is a trial taker who practices the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? to pour spiritual energy into them.” In the meantime, his 20 arms continued to move around, unceasingly using the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? on the crystals.","This made his explanation a little unbelievable.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “Then Senior Song, why are you still using the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique??”","“Good question,” said Song Shuhang. I was waiting for you to ask this question so as to set a stage for my next line.","“The reason I’m still using the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? is that it’s more efficient than a direct injection of spiritual energy. Moreover, the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? can also strengthen the bond between me and these clusters.” Song Shuhang’s hair-arms were still rubbing the crystals as he spoke.","In the blink of an eye, all the crystals began shining brightly.","Moreover, perhaps because the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? had left the crystals very satisfied, the crystals began to change their order on their own.","In each crystal, there was a rune.","When combined, these runes formed the complete version of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? without the General Principles Chapter.","Song Shuhang’s eyes glanced at the chapters of the cultivation technique and compared them with his own version of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, checking if there were any mistakes in the version he practiced.","As he compared the two techniques, his eyes gradually blurred.","“He’s entered a state of enlightenment.” Sister White Dragon carefully reminded everyone, signaling them not to disturb Song Shuhang.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Song Shuhang, whose eyes were blurred, had entered a trance.","He discovered that his consciousness had entered a crystal room.","There was a rocking chair in this crystal room, and there was a figure sitting on it, swaying along with the rocking chair.","As if sensing Song Shuhang’s arrival, the figure turned its head, smiled slightly at Song Shuhang, and said softly, “You’re here.”","The figure’s voice was magnetic and sounded very pleasant to the ear.","In addition, the owner of this voice spoke as if they were greeting an old friend. The figure’s voice made one feel like they were not being treated as an outsider.","Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback.","Does the owner of this crystal room know me?","Yet, I’m certain that I’ve never been to this crystal room, let alone been in contact with its owner.","The other party must have mistaken me for someone else!","When his thoughts reached this point, many images immediately appeared in Song Shuhang’s mind.","A bamboo that pierced the sky, a small white dragon, Pavilion Master Chu, the Immortal with arms covered in eyes...","When these big shots saw him for the first time, they had all mistaken him for someone else.","In addition, the first reaction of these big shots after mistaking him for someone else was to beat him up.","“It’s not me!” Song Shuhang waved his hands repeatedly. “Senior, you must have mistaken me for someone else. Don’t attack me!”","The owner of the crystal room was taken aback.","Song Shuhang hurriedly said, “Senior, as long as you carefully take a look, you’ll see that I’m just a little cultivator who has just stepped into the world of cultivation.”"]},{"number":2095,"title":"Chapter 2095 Senior, please let me live","paragraphs":["2095 Senior, please let me live","He spoke without thinking too much and accidentally used his usual line, “little cultivator who has just stepped into the world of cultivation.”","He had been using this line a lot and stopped only in the past two or three months.","After all, ever since he condensed his golden core and became a Fifth Stage Spirit Emperor, it no longer made sense for him to say this line.","The two fairies, the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation, loved to use the updated version of this line to troll him every now and then.","The owner of the crystal room stared at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was on guard. He stared back at the other party, fearing that they would attack him violently.","Finally, the owner of the crystal room spoke. “Fellow Daoist, have we... met before?”","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","This line was so unexpected that he could not react for some time.","“If I remember correctly, Fellow Daoist... Isn’t this the first time we’ve met? Have you been here before?” The owner of the crystal room stood up. He was very tall, and when he stood up, the top of his head nearly touched the ceiling of the crystal room.","If he were to go play basketball, he would not even have to jump to dunk the ball into the hoop. He was so tall that he would simply need to raise his arm. His opponents would have no chance of winning against him!","“Ah? Hahaha!” Song Shuhang laughed awkwardly and then nodded vigorously. “Right, right, right. Of course, this is our first time meeting. I’ll be in your care then!”","It turned out to be a misunderstanding.","Still, since this is our first meeting, please don’t greet me in such a familiar tone! I got so scared that my heart skipped a beat. I thought I met another creditor of Slow-Witted Song!","Song Shuhang scratched his head and said, “Sorry, Senior. I’ve been rather antsy recently.”","“Mm-hm, I can see that your foundation is rather unstable. It should be because of a recent encounter. Your blood must have rushed to your head, causing you to be muddle-headed.” The owner of the crystal room smiled slightly. Then, using that slightly hoarse but very magnetic voice, he said, “However, it doesn’t matter as the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? is very effective in this regard. As long as you practice it diligently, it will only take one year for this level of cultivation deviation to be cured and eliminated completely.”","“One year?” Song Shuhang pinched his chin. He then gave the owner of the crystal room a thumbs up and said, “Senior has a keen eye. It is indeed because of a little encounter that my realm is unstable.”","The owner of the crystal room nodded slightly, seeming to enjoy Song Shuhang’s flattery. “Anyway, you’re quite lucky. Your current state made it easier for you to communicate with the crystal runes and enter this place.”","Generally speaking, the more simple-minded a creature was, the easier it was for them to be influenced by the crystal runes and get to the inheritance room.","“It seems that my luck isn’t that bad, huh?” Song Shuhang murmured.","He did not know how to describe his luck today.","Although he successfully entered the Inheritance Land, he now owed a huge debt.","Fortune and misfortune were intertwined in his case; they were inseparable from each other.","Right, it must be because I got separated from my human-shaped amulet! Song Shuhang guessed the reason behind what happened.","When misfortune befell him, it was because he was separated from his amulet.","If his “amulet” was still there, it would definitely not have been so complicated to open the eyelids of the dragon eye. His amulet would simply need to go forward, and the eyelid door would definitely open on its own.","This huge loss could have been avoided!","“Anyhow, I don’t have much time. Little Fellow Daoist, let’s get to business,” said the owner of the crystal room. He then sat back on his seat and motioned for Song Shuhang to sit on the seat opposite him.","Song Shuhang sat down solemnly. He knew that he would obtain the General Principles Chapter next.","He was very curious as to how the owner of the crystal room was going to teach him this chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","“Since you’ve come here, then you should know that the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? is a technique that touches upon the power of laws. It’s too much for the main world, and it cannot be recorded with mere letters. Even if you use special characters of the language of the ancient era or of the dragons, you would still not be able to write it down. Even if you do forcefully record it down, the written characters would be erased by the power of heaven and earth. Even Technique Transmitting Jade Slips cannot record this content,” the owner of the crystal room said slowly.","Song Shuhang nodded. “Yes, I know.”","It was precisely because the General Principles Inheritance Chapter was so special that Garre Holy Mountain’s trial was created.","The owner of the crystal room smiled slightly and continued, “Even when compared with other techniques that touch upon the power of laws, the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? is very special, and even a treasure like the ‘Flower of the Great Way’ is unable to accommodate its content. Therefore, the method by which it is inherited is very special. You have to be mentally prepared.”","“What is the Flower of the Great Way?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","“It’s a special divine item used to record cultivation techniques that touch upon the power of laws. The flower blooms for a thousand years and withers for a thousand years. Then, after withering, it blooms for another thousand years. Every Flower of the Great Way can be used to record a law-level cultivation technique. However, it can only be used once, so it is extremely precious,” the owner of the crystal room explained.","“I’ve learned a lot today.” Song Shuhang nodded.","“The General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? cannot be recorded even with such an item, so we used a very special method to make it accessible to the inheritors.” The owner of the crystal room raised both of his hands, and a blue ball of energy the size of a basketball appeared in his palms.","This senior really does play basketball!","Senior, please give your opponents a chance, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","“What?” The owner of the crystal room looked at Song Shuhang in puzzlement.","Song Shuhang asked back, “What?”","“What did you mean by ‘give your opponents a chance’ just now?” The owner of the crystal room looked puzzled.","F*ck... It’s the long-lost mind reading technique.","“It’s not mind reading. It’s more like telepathy. I can sense when you talk to me in your mind. Mind reading is too intrusive to one’s privacy. We generally do not use it,” the owner of the crystal room explained.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Actually, when facing you, Fellow Daoist, I don’t need to use any mind reading techniques,” the owner of the crystal room added. “Your facial expressions are too easy to read, and I can guess what you are thinking at a glance.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior, please let me live!","“Hehe.” The owner of the crystal room smiled cheerfully. He then raised the blue basketball in his hand. “This is the last step. Don’t resist. Accept its power.”","He pushed the basketball toward Song Shuhang and said, “Little Fellow Daoist, rejoice, you’re about to come in contact with the power of time!”"]},{"number":2096,"title":"Chapter 2096 Peeking into the past!","paragraphs":["2096 Peeking into the past!","The path of time was among the most wondrous amidst the various paths of the Great Way.","By taking control of time, one could take control of the world.","Compared with the spatial abilities grasped by Tribulation Transcenders, the power of time was much more mysterious and rare, to the point that most of the cultivators in the universe would not be able to come in contact with this kind of power throughout their entire lives.","An opportunity to come in contact with the great power of time when a cultivator was only at the Sixth or Seventh Stage Realm was like a heaven-sent gift. When exposed to the power of time, as long as one seized the opportunity, the spirit and soul of that cultivator could sublimate.","It was like a person who had always lived on the second or third floor getting taken to the top of a hundred-story building. Their view of the world would change.","The owner of the crystal room had met several geniuses from the Beast Realm in the past.","Before Song Shuhang’s batch, occasionally, there would be talented cultivators from the Beast Realm who would manage to pass through one trial after the other and arrive at this same crystal room.","Every time, when the owner of the crystal room offered this blue ball of energy infused with the power of time to those geniuses, they would show looks of shock on their faces.","The power of time was filled with wonders, and it was normal that people were moved by it.","However, the owner of the crystal room found the reaction of this little cultivator who had gone through a case of cultivation deviation to be rather strange.","He noticed it because the other party’s face was particularly easy to read.","He noticed that the little fellow daoist before him had a look of anticipation on his face when he heard the word “rejoice.”","And when he heard the phrase “you will come in contact with...,” his eyes shone even brighter.","But when he heard the most crucial part, “power of time,” the little fellow daoist was clearly taken aback.","Then, a disappointed look appeared on his face.","Is this little fellow daoist looking down on the power of time?","Or could it be that he has already come in contact with the power of time before, and perhaps even more than once?","The owner of the crystal room stretched out his hand. Then, after a short pause, he opted to paste the blue ball onto Shuhang’s face!","His actions should not be mistaken for that of a petty person.","The main reason he changed his mind was that he noticed the strange state Song Shuhang was in. His head was the only real part of his body.","Could it be that this little friend is a brain spirit? Or perhaps he’s from a special race like brain demons?","The owner of the crystal room was a knowledgeable man, so he would not be surprised if this was indeed the case.","Anyway, he raised his hand and pasted the energy ball containing the power of time onto Shuhang’s face.","For some reason, after doing this, the owner of the crystal room felt very refreshed.","Is it because I’m hitting someone’s face with a ball that I feel so refreshed?","The owner of the crystal room fell into deep thought.","Hmm, I’ll take note of this.","If there are other trial takers who enter this place, and the time comes for me to present them with the energy ball containing the power of time, I’ll try placing it against their face again.","Anyway, the effect of placing it against their face or against their chest is the same, unless the other party is some headless horseman.","The owner of the crystal room decided that it would use different methods to give the energy ball containing the power of time to the trial takers that reached him.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Song Shuhang’s face hurt.","The time ball had been heading toward his chest before it suddenly changed direction and headed for his face. He was caught off-guard, and his face was now burning with pain.","This fact proved that no matter how steely one’s skin was, it could not defend against the power of time.","The power of time is indeed terrifying.","After being hit in the face by the power of time, Song Shuhang once again felt as if he was ascending to the sky.","His entire figure—or to be more precise, his head—felt as if it had been unshackled.","His consciousness separated from the “present,” breaking free from the constraints of time.","However, instead of looking into the future, his consciousness peeked into the past!","His consciousness moved upstream.","During this process, he became more and more confused, and a wave of drowsiness attacked his mind.","Song Shuhang hastily tried to regain focus and keep his soul lucid.","It might be due to this not being his first time coming in contact with the power of time, or due to his secret appraisal technique having some connection with time, but during the process of peeping into the past, he did not faint and managed to remain awake.","He could clearly sense his consciousness, which was wrapped by the power of time.","During this process, he felt that his understanding of the secret appraisal technique was getting deeper and deeper.","“Reading ten thousand books is not as good as traveling thousands of miles. Wriggling in the long river of time has allowed me to increase my knowledge.” Song Shuhang nodded to himself.","“Boom!!!”","Finally, the blue basketball that had enveloped his head dissipated.","Song Shuhang’s consciousness had reached the destination.","However, he could feel that he was restricted in his current state, as he could neither move nor speak.","In addition, he could only see objects within 10 meters of his line of sight, beyond was a thick fog.","His body seemed to have no definite form. It seemed as if he were floating in the air like a ghost.","So there are restrictions, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Although the energy ball from the owner of the crystal room was related to the path of time, it had huge restrictions. His consciousness could only be sent to a specific point in time in the past and a specific location.","Moreover, he could only watch like a bystander and was unable to affect the past.","Why does it feel so similar to my ‘entering the dreamland’ ability? This thought suddenly emerged in Song Shuhang’s mind.","While he was in thought, his body started to move involuntarily.","Finally, he arrived at a paradisiacal bamboo forest.","In the bamboo forest, dragons and phoenixes danced about, and various other mythical beasts were playing around happily.","Among the many divine beasts, the most striking were the two divine beasts that were by a well in the bamboo forest.","One was a dragon, and the other was an ape.","Between the dragon and the ape sat a muscular old man.","On the old man’s arms, there were patterns of dragons and apes. He sat cross-legged, with a giant blade lying flat atop his knees.","His style created a stark contrast with the rest of the paradisiacal bamboo forest.","After Song Shuhang approached, he saw seven beast cultivators sitting in the bamboo forest, all with serious expressions on their faces.","“Is everyone here?” The old man glanced at the seven beast cultivators, and then directly at where Song Shuhang was.","“Today, I’m going to teach you a body-tempering technique. It ranks third among the cultivation techniques that I have created in recent years,” the old man said. “Its name is the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.”","Then, the old man began with his explanation.","He started with the foundational chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, which was widely known even outside the Beast Realm.","Despite being the basis, it sounded very high-level when the old man explained it.","It was similar to when Cheng Lin narrated the ?Daoist Canon?.","Song Shuhang was fascinated by it.","He felt his understanding and comprehension of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? becoming deeper and deeper.","He was certain that after he left this place, the number of Holy Apes he had would increase once again!"]},{"number":2097,"title":"Chapter 2097 People live to innovate","paragraphs":["2097 People live to innovate","Unfortunately, Shuhang had no way to access his QR code Golden Core Composition in his current state and log into his Cultivation group.","Otherwise, he would’ve recorded the old man’s lecture on the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and posted it on the group’s stories to show off.","He had even thought about what to write on the post: “Today, I traveled through time, went back to the past, and watched an old senior give a lecture. The senior’s lecture was truly exquisite, and I was fascinated by it.”","However, it wasn’t much of a problem as he could make a post after he went back.","Mm-hm, before posting this story, I have to check if I can select who can see the stories in the Cultivation group. I don’t want to let Demon Emperor Hezhi and the Indestructible Lord see my post.","After all, he was still planning to surprise Demon Emperor Hezhi when he held his real Profound Sage Speech in the future.","Surprises are surprises because they are filled with surprise.","If Demon Emperor Hezhi found out in advance that Shuhang was still alive, there would be no surprise at all.","Anyway, this was just a random thought that flashed through his mind.","Song Shuhang quickly shifted his attention to the old man’s lecture.","For the first part of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, the old man gave a quick but thorough explanation.","There was truly a wonderful, lasting aftertaste that came with the old man’s lecture.","After listening to it, Song Shuhang felt a little bloated.","He was feeling a sense of satiety, the type that came after allaying one’s hunger.","“This lecture is really awesome.” Song Shuhang was very impressed.","This was the first time he had come into contact with a way of speaking that made him feel so full just from listening to it. If he were to use this method during his Profound Sage Speech, would he be able to make all the practitioners in the universe feel a sense of satiety?","I should study this type of speech with the seniors and see if I can emulate it or not.","One is never too old to learn.","As long as a person is alive, he needs to learn every day!","Song Shuhang kind of looked forward to his next Profound Sage Speech.","I hope that my fourth “Profound Sage Speech” can bring a different feeling and experience to the fellow daoists all over the universe.","People live to innovate!","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Beside the well in the bamboo forest, the old man paused for a moment.","The holy ape next to him handed him a cup of tea.","The old man took a sip of the fragrant tea, moistened his throat, and then continued, “Next is the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, which is also the essence of this technique. It’s like the final piece of a puzzle.”","This is it!","Song Shuhang concentrated. He had been waiting for this moment the entire time.","Moreover, he knew that the old man’s speech would be completely different for the upcoming portion of the technique.","The General Principles Inheritance Chapter had a portion that required the full comprehension of the trial taker, and simply listening to the old man’s lecture was not enough.","How much a practitioner could comprehend, and whether or not they could comprehend the most suitable version of the General Principles Inheritance Chapter for them depended on one’s fortune and talent.","The seven beast cultivators, who looked like the disciples of the old man, also held their breaths and focused.","After a moment of silence, the old man spoke.","When he opened his mouth, Song Shuhang felt his head explode. There was a wave of terrifying buzzing sounds, similar to tinnitus, and his vision became filled with nothing but white.","This was a technique that could not be recorded in words, expressed verbally, or seen with one’s eyes.","Song Shuhang could not sense anything except the humming sound.","His eyes could not see, his ears could not hear, and even his mental energy was blocked.","How am I supposed to comprehend the General Principles Inheritance Chapter?","Could it be that I really have no fate with it?","Am I just going to miss this opportunity?","Not only am I going to fail to obtain the General Principles Inheritance, but I’m also going to owe a huge debt because of that gigantic immortal boat!","Just as Song Shuhang was immersed in his thoughts, the explosion in his head subsided, and his vision gradually recovered.","He discovered that he had become a 2D character, and his body had been shrunk down to the size of a palm.","It was not only him, because the seven beast cultivators had also turned into 2D stickers.","Why does this sight feel so familiar?","The old man was still delivering his lecture, but Song Shuhang could not hear his voice. The words could not reach his ears.","The old man stretched out his hand, and the eight stickers, including Song Shuhang, were summoned to the past.","The divine dragon and holy ape took action and pasted the “stickers” on the old man’s arms.","As for the transparent 2D sticker that Song Shuhang had transformed into, the divine dragon and the holy ape could not see it.","However, under the attraction coming from the old man, the sticker that Song Shuhang had transformed into also latched onto the old man’s arm.","It was a strange feeling.","Song Shuhang did not know how to describe it, but he didn’t like it too much.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","The old man said, “The seven of you, get ready. You only have one chance.”","It was only then that Song Shuhang noticed that the old man had been using the language of the ancient era to deliver the lecture. What was strange was that he could understand all of it.","In the next moment, light flashed between the old man’s eyebrows.","He was opening up a part of his memory.","The seven beast cultivators and Song Shuhang were wrapped in the light, and their consciousnesses were sent to a certain memory of the old man.","The General Principles Inheritance Chapter could not be described, recorded, or observed, so the only opportunity to learn it was to witness the moment the old man created it.","To be precise, what they would witness was the phase before the technique was completed.","The consciousnesses of Song Shuhang and the others reached their destination.","They were like stickers, attached to the old man’s arms as he created the General Principles Inheritance Chapter.","From the beginning to the end, they observed the process of creation.","From the initial drafting to the detailing, to the repeated experiments and revisions that brought out the best results.","The technique was modified and improved again and again.","Even for someone as powerful as the old man, it was not easy to create a cultivation technique infused with the power of laws.","This process reminded Song Shuhang of a scientist’s experiments.","The process took very long, and there were thousands of revisions.","The seven beast cultivators and Song Shuhang experienced this process in detail.","It’s a bit like my dreamland ability, except that it doesn’t feel that real, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","When entering the dreamland, Shuhang would live as the target, but the old man’s 2D sticker technique only allowed people to enter his memory from a viewer’s perspective and watch from the sidelines.","The old man, who was in the process of creation, said, “It’s almost there.”","He began to formally write the General Principles Inheritance Chapter.","As the writing began, the consciousnesses of the seven beast cultivators and Song Shuhang began to blur.","Even through the memories of the old man, the General Principles Inheritance Chapter was impossible to extract.","However, the purpose of the old man’s lesson had already been achieved.","What was important was the whole process of creating the general outline, the revisions, and the experience of that repeated scrutiny.","From this experience, theoretically speaking, one would have the tools and knowledge to comprehend the ?General Principles Inheritance Chapter?.","It was an indirect way to reach the end goal.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Song Shuhang’s consciousness returned to the crystal room.","The owner of the crystal room looked at him and smiled. “Little friend, did you gain anything?”","Song Shuhang raised his head, a troubled expression on his face.","In the end, he was only a newbie who had been in the world of cultivation for half a year!"]},{"number":2098,"title":"Chapter 2098 Collision of knowledge","paragraphs":["2098 Collision of knowledge","Seeing Song Shuhang’s troubled expression, the owner of the crystal room thought for a while before trying to guess, “Did you fail to comprehend it?”","Song Shuhang did not respond, the expression on his face still odd.","The owner of the crystal room smiled lightly. He then stretched out his hand and patted Shuhang’s wooden shoulder. “Don’t be discouraged. It is normal to fail to comprehend it. You are still young, and you’ll have another chance in the future. When you become a Seventh Stage Venerable, you can participate in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial again. After going through the experience a second time, perhaps you can comprehend it.”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “Thank you, Senior.”","“Additionally, there are many ways to comprehend the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?. Some people would have a realization while following the steps of the creation process, and when their consciousness returned from the past, they would be able to immediately understand the General Principles Inheritance Chapter. Other people take longer; they would remember most of the details of the creation process, and only after leaving Garre Holy Mountain would they slowly piece them together. In the end, these people also managed to comprehend their own version of the General Principles Inheritance Chapter.” The owner of the crystal room asked again, “So, little fellow daoist, how much of the creation process do you remember?”","Generally speaking, the second method had a very low success rate. Due to the influence of the path of time and the influence that the universe had on the creation of such a technique, most cultivators could only remember bits and parts of the creation process.","With these incomplete memories, while it was possible to comprehend a unique version of the General Principles Inheritance Chapter, it would be far from being as good as directly comprehending it after peeking into the past.","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “If I try it, I think I can recall most of the process.”","His current state was very strange because he, himself, did not know whether he had comprehended it or not.","By witnessing the old man’s creation process, he seemed to have comprehended something very important.","...","However, he could not tell what was this thing that he had come to realize.","If I told you that I don’t understand what I’ve understood, would you believe me?","In fact, Song Shuhang didn’t really understand all the experiments the old man carried out.","During the creation process of the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, the old man used levels of knowledge ranging from shallow to deep, from the Seventh Stage to the Immortal level.","There were many key parts that involved the principles of the Great Way.","This was another reason why Song Shuhang’s heart felt stifled. His knowledge in this field was too limited.","While watching the old man, Song Shuhang felt like an elementary school student that had just learned multiplication and division, yet was forced to study formulas used in the manufacturing of a nuclear bomb. He was honestly bewildered by the entire process.","He felt a great sense of despair at this moment. After all, Song Shuhang was someone who worked hard.","Whenever he was free, he would take the initiative to supplement his lack of knowledge in cultivation... The problem was that he had very little free time.","The time he had spent cultivating was his greatest limitation.","About half of all the knowledge he had relating to cultivation came from the dreamlands he visited.","...","Another portion was obtained through some special encounters such as witnessing Cheng Lin’s lecture, directly staring at the principles of that galaxy, coming in contact with information related to eternity, getting possessed by the Indestructible Lord’s obsession or the Scholarly Sage’s obsession, and so on. After going through these experiences, Shuhang gained a sizable amount of information.","This incidental knowledge was of a very high level. Most of it was forcefully stuffed into Song Shuhang’s mind, and with his current level, he could not understand it.","It was precisely because his mind was filled with high-level knowledge that he kept on getting a familiar feeling while watching the old man create the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","The high-level knowledge in his mind started resonating when he witnessed the creation process.","During this collision of knowledge, Song Shuhang learned a lot, but it was a pity that he couldn’t understand at all what he learned.","This was why Song Shuhang had such a troubled expression at the moment.","“You can remember most of it, huh?” The owner of the crystal room looked at Song Shuhang thoughtfully.","Right, this little friend seems to have rather frequently come in contact with the path of time, so his body should have adapted to its influence. For this reason, compared to other trial takers, he can remember more of the creation process.","The owner of the crystal room said, “Since this is the case, you should hurry up and reinforce the memory in your mind. It is best to remember every detail. After you go back, you can slowly ponder over it. Perhaps you can even comprehend a unique version of the General Principles Inheritance that belongs only to you.”","“Thank you for your comforting words, Senior,” Song Shuhang cupped his fists politely and replied.","The owner of the crystal room smiled slightly. “Then, let us say our goodbyes here. I hope that we can meet again in the future.”","...","It was really refreshing to smear your face. The next time we meet, I shall smear your face once more!","“I hope to have the chance to see you again in the future,” Song Shuhang nodded and said. However, he knew in his heart that he probably would not have another chance to come here. He was not a member of the Beast Realm, and Fairy Blue Phoenix had been the one to give him a quota for the trial this time.","“Now, relax. I shall send you off.” The owner of the crystal room stood up.","Song Shuhang nodded.","Before leaving, he suddenly thought of something and said, “By the way, Senior, how about adding me as a friend?”","“What?” The owner of the crystal room asked doubtfully.","“Can you add me as a friend? That would make it more convenient for us to contact each other in the future. I feel that I have a rather good affinity with you, Senior,” Song Shuhang said with a serious face.","The owner of the crystal room seemed to be quite talkative and had a good personality.","Therefore, he decided to seize this opportunity to add him as a friend.","“How does it work?” the owner of the crystal room asked curiously.","Song Shuhang skillfully summoned his QR Code Golden Core Composition.","...","As soon as he summoned it out, the owner of the crystal room scanned it with his mental energy out of habit.","[Beep~]","The prompt sounded in the minds of Song Shuhang and the owner of the crystal room.","However, the owner of the crystal room seemed to have failed to join his friend list.","“There was a beep in my mind. Did it work?” the owner of the crystal room asked.","“It seems like it didn’t work.” Song Shuhang raised his head doubtfully, looking at the owner of the crystal room.","Even Fairy Cheng Lin, who was supposedly dead and could not die again, could add him as a friend.","Even rulers of the Netherworld such as Senior White Two and Little Stripey had no problem adding him as a friend.","Yet, the owner of the crystal room, despite being alive and kicking, was unable to add him.","“It seems that the problem is on my side.” The owner of the crystal room smiled slightly and said, “Forget it. If it is fated, we’ll meet again. If it’s not, then there is no need to force it.”","He then clapped his hands lightly.","...","Song Shuhang’s figure disappeared. He had left the crystal room."]},{"number":2099,"title":"Chapter 2099 Is there a copy and paste function?","paragraphs":["2099 Is there a copy and paste function?","“Let me try again. Sometimes, fate requires some insistence!” Song Shuhang could not help but say aloud.","But when he opened his eyes, he discovered that he had returned to the space filled with crystal clusters.","Sixteen, who currently looked like White Dragon, was lying beside him. She looked at him curiously and asked, “What are you talking about?”","The black-skinned Soft Feather was studying the shining crystals at the moment.","!!","As for Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, it was still swaying in the wind. “What happened that made you insist on forcing fate?”","Sister White Dragon poked her head out and asked, “Did you meet a beautiful fairy maiden?”","If it really was a beautiful fairy, just how beautiful was she to make Song Shuhang talk about forcing fate?","After all, the fairies hanging around Song Shuhang were already very pretty.","Unless Song Shuhang was blind, that fairy must’ve been a peerless beauty.","“It wasn’t a fairy maiden, but a tall and mighty male senior,” said Song Shuhang regretfully. He probably would not have another chance to enter that crystal room and add him as a friend.","Sometimes, if you miss an opportunity, you won’t have another chance to come across it for the rest of your life.","Pavilion Master Chu asked curiously, “Was it such an attractive Senior? How are they compared to Sage White?”","Song Shuhang did not know whether to laugh or cry. “Senior Chu, what’s going on in your mind? Why are you so focused on looks? I just wanted to add him as a friend, but I was not able to. My intuition tells me that the other party was someone extraordinary, so I wanted to see if there was a way for me to exchange contact information with him. But in the end, I was forced out of the room before I could do it.”","“You weren’t able to add him as a friend through your QR code?” The black-skinned Soft Feather pondered and said, “Could it be that they aren’t a real person? For example, they could be a robot that can only execute a fixed set of actions.”","“I don’t know.” Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “I was planning to use the secret appraisal technique on him, but I did not get a chance. What a pity.”","Sixteen asked, “Then Shuhang, have you obtained the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique??”","This was the most important matter.","Song Shuhang sat up, scratched his head, and said, “That’s a mystery.”","Sister White Dragon asked, “Did you fail to comprehend it?”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair comforted him, “You don’t need to hide it if you failed to comprehend it. We can understand that it’s not easy.”","“Am I that bad at studies in your eyes?” Song Shuhang sighed.","He was a student at Jiangnan University. Although he was not a top student, as long as he was serious, his learning ability was actually quite strong!","Song Shuhang said, “Actually, I did comprehend something.”","Pavilion Master Chu said with a smile, “Then, does that mean you inherited it?”","Song Shuhang said embarrassingly, “Well, how should I put it... I can’t really understand what I comprehended. That’s why I said that it’s a mystery.”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","You don’t understand what you comprehended?","Do you hear yourself?","How did you comprehend something without understanding it?","“Tell us about it,” Pavilion Master Chu said. “Fairy White Dragon and I will help you analyze it.”","One was the owner of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion and an Immortal.","The other was the Ancestral Golden Dragon and also an Immortal.","As long as Song Shuhang could roughly describe the process, with their realm and vision, it would be very easy for them to explain and analyze the content.","If it happened to be knowledge that was more related to other paths to immortality that they were unfamiliar with, then Song Shuhang’s [Cultivation] group had several fellow daoists who could provide him assistance remotely.","“Here’s another issue.” Song Shuhang looked up at the sky and said, “The General Principles Inheritance Chapter can only be comprehended, and it cannot be expressed with mere words. I have no way to tell you about it.”","He simply did not know how to describe what he had understood.","“How are we supposed to help you then?” Pavilion Master Chu sighed.","You cannot blame us in this case. If you want to blame anyone, you can only blame yourself for not living up to expectations!","Sixteen asked, “Then Shuhang, what kind of knowledge do you need? How about you sort things out and then ask Senior Chu and Sister White Dragon to help you make up for what you’re lacking?”","This was indeed a good suggestion.","Song Shuhang said, “The problem is that I don’t even know what knowledge I’m lacking.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather reminded him, “Senior Song, according to your description, your current self can be described as a bad student.”","He did not even know what homework he had to make up for, and he had no idea what studies he was lacking in. This was the king of bad students.","Song Shuhang: “...”","You’re really good at rending hearts, Soft Feather!","“However, I do have something I can work with.” Song Shuhang sat upright and said, “I recorded the entire process of that old man creating the General Principles Inheritance Chapter. Every detail that led to the creation of the technique is firmly recorded in my mind, and I can describe the entire process to Senior Chu.”","“Well, that does have some value to it.” Sister White Dragon nodded and said, “Alright then, start your speech.”","Song Shuhang closed his eyes and organized his thoughts.","Then, he began to describe in as much detail as possible the process of the creation of the cultivation technique from the experience he had from going back in time.","As Song Shuhang spoke, behind him, the virtuous lamia appeared to steal the show.","She raised her hands high up, and a 3D projection appeared on top of her head.","Whenever Song Shuhang spoke, the 3D projection moved forward.","The projection even came with sound.","...","Sister White Dragon nodded slightly to Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, and they did not disturb Song Shuhang.","The creation process was very long, and Song Shuhang described it in great detail.","This one lecture... took two days and nights!","Song Shuhang spoke, while Sixteen and the black-skinned Soft Feather listened silently.","Pavilion Master Chu and Sister White Dragon, while watching, were using the secret sound transmission technique to communicate with each other.","“In the end, it showed the process of the old man officially compiling the final chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?. The memory of this process was affected by the power between heaven and earth, and I can’t remember things clearly.” Song Shuhang paused.","Then, he looked at Sixteen, the black-skinned Soft Feather, and Sister White Dragon and said, “By the way, do you feel full?”","“Huh?” Pavilion Master Chu froze in bewilderment.","Sixteen asked, “Shuhang, are you hungry?”","Song Shuhang shook his head and regretfully said, “It seems that my experiment failed.”","When he was speaking just now, he deliberately tried to imitate the mannerisms of the old man when he had been lecturing. He wanted to see if he could imitate the old man’s ability to make others feel “full”.","...","Sure enough, such a technique is not so easy to imitate.","He looked at White Dragon and asked, “Sister White Dragon, do you have any ideas?”","Sister White Dragon said slowly, “Mm-hm, I have acquired a rough understanding of the situation. If you want to understand the experimental process, you need to acquire a lot of knowledge about cultivation.”","Song Shuhang asked cautiously, “How much do I need to learn?”","Pavilion Master Chu guessed, “If you study day and night, completely focused on learning, you should be able to have a basic framework after one to two years.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Um, Fairies, is there a “copy and paste” function? The kind that can directly copy and paste the required knowledge into my brain?"]},{"number":2100,"title":"Chapter 2100 Eat the fruit of your own making","paragraphs":["2100 Eat the fruit of your own making","Sister White Dragon asked, “What do you mean?”","This time, the expression on Song Shuhang’s face was too complicated, so she could not read his thoughts as easily.","Song Shuhang said, “I’m thinking, why is there no magical technique to ‘copy and paste’ knowledge into one’s brain? Isn’t there anything similar to strength transmission, but for knowledge?”","If it’ll take one to two years just to acquire a basic framework, how long will it take to learn everything I need?","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair swayed around while saying, “What do you consider knowledge? Do you also consider something you haven’t learned as knowledge?”","“Actually, I have heard of magical techniques that do what Shuhang described. They allow you to store knowledge in precious divine items with the goal of passing it on to others,” Sister White Dragon said. “Unfortunately, I’ve never seen such means with my own eyes.”","Whether she had seen it or not... As long as it was something that Pavilion Master Chu deemed impossible, she would definitely seize the opportunity to refute it.","It was very refreshing to undermine others!","“We should stop wasting time. After so long, the other trial takers should be about to arrive,” Pavilion Master Chu said. “Should we go out first, or should we stay here and watch what happens?”","“Hmm, let’s stay here,” Song Shuhang said. “If other trial takers arrive here and successfully grasp the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? while peeking into the past, we can ask their help to confirm some of our theories. Additionally... If Senior White decides to come, he will head here.”","Pavilion Master Chu nodded and said, “Alright.”","Sister White Dragon said, “Then, before the other trial takers get here, let me give you some basic knowledge.”","“I will fill you in on anything that Fairy White Dragon leaves out or gets wrong,” said Pavilion Master Chu. As long as there was even the slightest mistake in what Fairy White Dragon said, she would rush to correct it.","“Don’t worry. With my level, it is impossible to make mistakes when explaining such basic stuff,” Sister White Dragon said confidently. “You will never have the chance to correct me.”","Pavilion Master Chu said slowly, “Hoh~ Not necessarily.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Sixteen: “...”","Sister White Dragon began with her lecture.","The value of an Immortal’s lecture, even if they were talking about relatively basic knowledge of magical technique, would not change.","Song Shuhang listened carefully. Sixteen, who was on his left, also listened.","The black-skinned Soft Feather, who had her hands wrapped around her knees, sat to his right and was listening as well.","As Sister White Dragon’s lecture began, it resonated with the Great Way. The sound of bells ringing could be heard, and various phenomena unceasingly appeared one after the other.","Song Shuhang really wanted to bring out Lady Onion and the others who were in the Inner World to listen to Sister White Dragon’s lecture. Unfortunately, the Inner World was still unavailable.","While listening to Sister White Dragon’s lecture, they seemed to enter a wonderful world.","Pavilion Master Chu was not able to find any loopholes in her lecture, and her single strand of hair became rather listless.","The over one hundred thousand crystals around them became active and began shimmering nonstop.","The spiritual energy in the air resonated with the lecture, gathering around them like a whirlpool.","Moisturized by the spiritual energy, Song Shuhang’s wooden body became restless once again.","Fresh shoots and branches emerged from his body.","The vitality of the wooden body was incredible, and one branch after the other was harvested. In just a little over ten days, Song Shuhang had acquired enough raw materials for the disposable flying swords to fill half a room.","“Eh? Something smells good.” The black-skinned Soft Feather could not help but start sniffing around as she smelled a pleasant scent.","The aroma was something that even the Immortal lecture could not suppress, so she was unable to simply ignore it.","It was not only her, as even Sixteen noticed the strange fragrance.","The two sniffed with their little noses, and their eyes finally fell on the source of the strange fragrance—the waist of Song Shuhang’s wooden body.","At his waist, there was a fruit exuding colorful rays of light. The fruit had just matured.","This strange fruit was different from the other fruits on Song Shuhang’s wooden body. The other fruits matured very quickly, and a small wave of spiritual energy could cause a whole batch of them to mature.","Yet, this specific fruit needed Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy, the Heavenly Emperor’s path of time, the nourishment of Shuhang’s spiritual energy several times a day, and the spiritual energy from Sister White Dragon’s lecture plus the various phenomena before fully maturing.","Anyway, the fragrance was just too strong.","Sister White Dragon had no choice but to stop the lecture as she could not continue to teach with such a situation having come up.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “Shuhang, you should deal with this fruit first. Otherwise, how can the lecture continue?”","Song Shuhang smiled bashfully. He stretched out his hand to pinch the colorful fruit, plucking it off.","“Hss~” When he plucked the fruit, he suddenly gasped.","Unlike the other fruits, when he plucked this seven-colored fruit, a searing pain akin to having his flesh torn off assaulted his senses.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “It looks delicious.”","Pavilion Master Chu said reminded them, “Fruits that are too vibrant in color are often poisonous.”","“Let me appraise it.” Song Shuhang’s long hair turned into a small hand and lightly touched the fruit.","The secret appraisal technique was activated.","[Unnamed strange fruit: A fruit produced from the combination of the wooden body and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. Due to having been germinated on his waist, it has come to possess a seven-colored light.]","[Knowledge and wisdom are contained within this miraculous fruit. The incomprehensible knowledge in Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s mind was processed by the wooden body and took the shape of this fruit when combined with the wooden body’s wisdom and other fortuitous encounters.]","[How to take: Orally.]","Song Shuhang held the fruit, unable to speak for a long time.","“Senior Song, is this fruit edible?” the eyes of the black-skinned Soft Feather shone as she asked.","“It’s edible. However, I can’t give you this one for the time being.” Song Shuhang rubbed the fruit lightly. “It’s called the fruit of wisdom. I know how to grow it. I can give you guys the next one.”","“Fruit of wisdom?” Sixteen blinked.","...","“It imparts wisdom and knowledge.” Song Shuhang opened his mouth and bit on the fruit.","Delicious.","As expected of a fruit grown from his body, its taste was not much worse than the lotus flowers created through the Lotus Blossoming Tongue.","Sister White Dragon was stunned. “It imparts wisdom and knowledge?”","Isn’t this exactly like one of those divine items I mentioned earlier that could pass on knowledge?","The black-skinned Soft Feather gulped and said, “For some reason, watching Senior Song eat a fruit feels like cannibalism to me.”","“It’s a little inappropriate to use the word cannibalism,” Pavilion Master Chu said. “I feel that the phrase ‘eat the fruit of your own making’ is more appropriate.”","“Fairy Chu’s take is excellent.” Sister White Dragon nodded. She also thought of that phrase.","Sixteen asks, “Is it effective?”","“I don’t know. It hasn’t done anything yet.” Song Shuhang rubbed his hands.","“I have a question,” the black-skinned Soft Feather mused. “Senior Song, you only have your head left, so can you even digest the ‘wisdom fruit’ you just ate?”","..."]}]);
